text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Arisen Gorgon has deathtouch as long as you control a Liliana planeswalker. (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'As Alpine Moon enters the battlefield, choose a nonbasic land card name.\\nLands your opponents control with the chosen name lose all land types and abilities, and they gain "{T}: Add one mana of any color."', 'As Diamond Mare enters the battlefield, choose a color.\\nWhenever you cast a spell of the chosen color, you gain 1 life.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, discard a card.\\nDraw two cards.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nDraw three cards.', 'As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nFlying, trample', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, sacrifice a creature.\\nThud deals damage equal to the sacrificed creature's power to any target.", "As long as you control a Dragon, Kargan Dragonrider has flying. (It can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "As long as you control a Tezzeret planeswalker, Tezzeret's Strider has menace. (It can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", 'As long as you control an artifact, Aerial Engineer gets +2/+0 and has flying.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control three or more creatures, Leonin Vanguard gets +1/+1 until end of turn and you gain 1 life.', 'At the beginning of combat on your turn, target artifact creature you control gets +2/+2 and gains indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy it.)', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if you control a creature with power 4 or greater, draw a card.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, target opponent mills three cards, then you draw a card for each land card put into their graveyard this way.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, you gain 1 life.\\n{3}, Sacrifice Fountain of Renewal: Draw a card.', 'Attacking creatures get +2/+0 until end of turn.', "Banefire deals X damage to any target.\\nIf X is 5 or more, this spell can't be countered and the damage can't be prevented.", "Bristling Boar can't be blocked by more than one creature.", 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy all creatures.\\n• Destroy all artifacts and enchantments.', 'Cinder Barrens enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}.', 'Counter target creature spell.', 'Counter target creature spell.\\nDraw a card.', 'Counter target spell.', 'Create two 1/1 white Soldier creature tokens. Until end of turn, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain haste. (They can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Creature spells you cast with power 4 or greater cost {2} less to cast.\\nWhenever Goreclaw, Terror of Qal Sisma attacks, each creature you control with power 4 or greater gets +1/+1 and gains trample until end of turn.', "Creatures you control gain trample until end of turn. (A creature with trample can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nDraw a card.", 'Creatures you control get +1/+0 and gain indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Creatures you control get +2/+1 until end of turn.', 'Creatures your opponents control get -2/-0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', 'Deathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever Isareth the Awakener attacks, you may pay {X}. When you do, return target creature card with mana value X from your graveyard to the battlefield with a corpse counter on it. If that creature would leave the battlefield, exile it instead of putting it anywhere else.', 'Defender', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nAs long as Novice Knight is enchanted or equipped, it can attack as though it didn't have defender.", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\nReach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)", "Defender (This creature can't attack.)\\n{3}: Until end of turn, Gargoyle Sentinel loses defender and gains flying.", 'Defender\\nWhen Dragon Egg dies, create a 2/2 red Dragon creature token with flying and "{R}: This creature gets +1/+0 until end of turn."', "Defender\\n{3}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment. You gain 4 life.', 'Destroy target artifact.', 'Destroy target creature with flying.', 'Destroy target creature.', 'Destroy target creature. You gain 3 life.', "Destroy target land. Creatures without flying can't block this turn.", 'Destroy target tapped creature.', 'Diregraf Ghoul enters the battlefield tapped.', 'Draw cards equal to the highest mana value among artifacts you control.', 'Draw three cards, then discard a card.', 'Draw two cards.', 'Each player loses half their life, then discards half the cards in their hand, then sacrifices half the creatures they control. Round up each time.', 'Electrify deals 4 damage to target creature.', 'Enchant creature\\nAs Metamorphic Alteration enters the battlefield, choose a creature.\\nEnchanted creature is a copy of the chosen creature.', "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+0 and can't be blocked.", "Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 and has trample. (It can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\n{2}{G}: Return Talons of Wildwood from your graveyard to your hand.", 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+1 for each Forest you control.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+0 and has "When this creature dies, draw a card."', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +3/+3.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets +7/+7 and has trample.', 'Enchant creature\\nEnchanted creature gets -6/-0.\\nWhen enchanted creature blocks, destroy it. (The attacking creature remains blocked.)', "Enchant creature\\nWhen Knightly Valor enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance. (Attacking doesn't cause it to tap.)\\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and has vigilance.", "Enchant creature\\nWhen Waterknot enters the battlefield, tap enchanted creature.\\nEnchanted creature doesn't untap during its controller's untap step.", 'Enchant land\\nWhen Gift of Paradise enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\nEnchanted land has "{T}: Add two mana of any one color."', "Equipped creature gets +2/+0, has vigilance, and is a Knight in addition to its other types.\\nWhenever equipped creature attacks, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance that's attacking.\\nEquip {3}", 'Equipped creature gets +2/+0.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Exchange control of two target creatures.', 'Exile target colorless creature. You gain life equal to its power.', 'Exile target permanent with mana value 1.', 'Exile the top seven cards of your library. Until end of turn, you may cast spells from among them.\\nIf this spell was cast from your hand, add ten mana of any one color.', 'Fiery Finish deals 7 damage to target creature.', 'Flash (You may cast this spell any time you could cast an instant.)', "Flash\\nThis spell can't be countered.\\nFlying\\nDiscard a card: Until end of turn, Chromium, the Mutable becomes a Human with base power and toughness 1/1, loses all abilities, and gains hexproof. It can't be blocked this turn.", 'Flying', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nVigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nOther creatures you control have vigilance.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhen Riddlemaster Sphinx enters the battlefield, you may return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\nWhenever you activate an ability of a Sarkhan planeswalker, Sarkhan's Whelp deals 1 damage to any target.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{5}{B}{B}: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.", "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\\n{R}: Shivan Dragon gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Flying, haste', "Flying, vigilance, trample\\nPalladia-Mors, the Ruiner has hexproof if it hasn't dealt damage yet.", "Flying, vigilance\\nWhenever a creature with defender enters the battlefield under your control, draw a card.\\nEach creature you control with defender assigns combat damage equal to its toughness rather than its power and can attack as though it didn't have defender.", 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of combat on your turn, you may pay {G}{U}. When you do, put a +1/+1 counter on another target creature you control, and that creature gains flying until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you gained 5 or more life this turn, create a 4/4 white Angel creature token with flying and vigilance.\\n{3}{W}{W}{W}: Until end of turn, Resplendent Angel gets +2/+2 and gains lifelink.', 'Flying\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if you gained life this turn, create a 1/1 black Bat creature token with flying.', "Flying\\nDjinn of Wishes enters the battlefield with three wish counters on it.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Remove a wish counter from Djinn of Wishes: Reveal the top card of your library. You may play that card without paying its mana cost. If you don't, exile it.", "Flying\\nEnigma Drake's power is equal to the number of instant and sorcery cards in your graveyard.", 'Flying\\nOther Spirits you control get +1/+1.', "Flying\\nSacrifice Remorseful Cleric: Exile target player's graveyard.", 'Flying\\nWhen Angel of the Dawn enters the battlefield, creatures you control get +1/+1 and gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhen Demanding Dragon enters the battlefield, it deals 5 damage to target opponent unless that player sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\\nWhen Fell Specter enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card.\\nWhenever an opponent discards a card, that player loses 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Horizon Scholar enters the battlefield, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', "Flying\\nWhen Nicol Bolas, the Ravager enters the battlefield, each opponent discards a card.\\n{4}{U}{B}{R}: Exile Nicol Bolas, the Ravager, then return him to the battlefield transformed under his owner's control. Activate only as a sorcery.", 'Flying\\nWhen Psychic Symbiont enters the battlefield, target opponent discards a card and you draw a card.', 'Flying\\nWhen Skymarch Bloodletter enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', 'Flying\\nWhen Skyscanner enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'Flying\\nWhen Sparktongue Dragon enters the battlefield, you may pay {2}{R}. When you do, it deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Flying\\nWhen Vampire Sovereign enters the battlefield, target opponent loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Herald of Faith attacks, you gain 2 life.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Pegasus Courser attacks, another target attacking creature gains flying until end of turn.', "Flying\\nWhenever Vaevictis Asmadi, the Dire attacks, for each player, choose target permanent that player controls. Those players sacrifice those permanents. Each player who sacrificed a permanent this way reveals the top card of their library, then puts it onto the battlefield if it's a permanent card.", 'Flying\\nWhenever a creature with flying attacks, you may draw a card.', 'Flying\\nWhenever another nontoken Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.\\n{1}{R}: Dragons you control get +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Aven Wind Mage gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', 'Flying\\n{1}, Sacrifice another creature: Put a +1/+1 counter on Ravenous Harpy.', 'Flying\\n{3}{B}{B}, Exile seven other cards from your graveyard: Return Bone Dragon from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', 'Forsaken Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {B}.', 'Foul Orchard enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B} or {G}.', 'Gain control of target creature until end of turn. Untap that creature. It gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)', 'Gearsmith Guardian gets +2/+0 as long as you control a blue creature.', 'Gearsmith Prodigy gets +1/+0 as long as you control an artifact.', "Grasping Scoundrel gets +1/+0 as long as it's attacking.", 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', "Hexproof (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nVine Mare can't be blocked by black creatures.", 'Highland Lake enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {R}.', "Hungering Hydra enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\nHungering Hydra can't be blocked by more than one creature.\\nWhenever Hungering Hydra is dealt damage, put that many +1/+1 counters on it. (It must survive the damage to get the counters.)", 'Indestructible\\nAs Phylactery Lich enters the battlefield, put a phylactery counter on an artifact you control.\\nWhen you control no permanents with phylactery counters on them, sacrifice Phylactery Lich.', 'Lava Axe deals 5 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'Lifelink', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)', 'Lifelink (Damage dealt by this creature also causes you to gain that much life.)\\nCourt Cleric gets +1/+1 as long as you control an Ajani planeswalker.', 'Lightning Strike deals 3 damage to any target.', 'Look at the top seven cards of your library. You may put a creature card from among them onto the battlefield. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order. When a creature is put onto the battlefield this way, it deals damage equal to its power to target creature an opponent controls.', 'Look at the top three cards of your library. Put one of them into your hand and the rest on the bottom of your library in any order.', 'Meandering River enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}.', "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)", "Menace (This creature can't be blocked except by two or more creatures.)\\nWhenever Brawl-Bash Ogre attacks, you may sacrifice another creature. If you do, Brawl-Bash Ogre gets +2/+2 until end of turn.", "Mist-Cloaked Herald can't be blocked.", 'Other Elves you control get +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: Search your library for a card named Elvish Clancaller, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Other Goblins you control get +1/+1.\\nSacrifice a Goblin: Destroy target artifact.', 'Other Knights you control get +1/+1.\\n{3}{W}{W}: Knights you control gain double strike until end of turn.', "Plague Mare can't be blocked by white creatures.\\nWhen Plague Mare enters the battlefield, creatures your opponents control get -1/-1 until end of turn.", 'Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.', "Put target nonland permanent on top of its owner's library.", 'Put two +1/+1 counters on target creature.\\nLook at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a white card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Radiating Lightning deals 3 damage to target player and 1 damage to each creature that player controls.', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)', 'Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\nDeathtouch (Any amount of damage this deals to a creature is enough to destroy it.)\\nWhenever another creature dies, each opponent loses 1 life.', "Reach (This creature can block creatures with flying.)\\n{2}{G}: Return Vivien's Jaguar from your graveyard to your hand. Activate only if you control a Vivien planeswalker.", 'Return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', "Return target nonland permanent to its owner's hand.", 'Return up to two target creature cards from your graveyard to your hand, then discard a card.', 'Rupture Spire enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Rupture Spire enters the battlefield, sacrifice it unless you pay {1}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.', 'Sacrifice Catalyst Elemental: Add {R}{R}.', "Sacrifice Mistcaller: Until end of turn, if a nontoken creature would enter the battlefield and it wasn't cast, exile it instead.", 'Sacrifice any number of lands. Search your library for up to that many land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Sarkhan's Dragonfire deals 3 damage to any target.\\nLook at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a red card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", "Shield Mare can't be blocked by red creatures.\\nWhen Shield Mare enters the battlefield or becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, you gain 3 life.", 'Shock deals 2 damage to any target.', 'Skeletons you control and other Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have deathtouch.', 'Spit Flame deals 4 damage to target creature.\\nWhenever a Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {R}. If you do, return Spit Flame from your graveyard to your hand.', 'Stone Quarry enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {W}.', 'Submerged Boneyard enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', "Surge Mare can't be blocked by green creatures.\\nWhenever Surge Mare deals damage to an opponent, you may draw a card. If you do, discard a card.\\n{1}{U}: Surge Mare gets +2/-2 until end of turn.", "Take an extra turn after this one.\\nIf Nexus of Fate would be put into a graveyard from anywhere, reveal Nexus of Fate and shuffle it into its owner's library instead.", "Tap all creatures target player controls. Those creatures don't untap during that player's next untap step.", 'Target creature gets +1/+7 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +2/+2 and gains flying until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn. All creatures able to block it this turn do so.', 'Target creature gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -3/-3 until end of turn.', 'Target creature gets -4/-0 until end of turn.\\nDraw a card.', "Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.", 'Target opponent discards a card.\\nLook at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a black card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Target opponent reveals their hand. You choose a noncreature, nonland card from it. That player discards that card.', 'Target player discards two cards.', 'Target player loses 3 life and you gain 3 life.', "This spell can't be countered.\\nLightning Mare can't be blocked by blue creatures.\\n{1}{R}: Lightning Mare gets +1/+0 until end of turn.", 'Timber Gorge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}.', "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nAt the beginning of each end step, if Inferno Hellion attacked or blocked this turn, its owner shuffles it into their library.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nGhastbark Twins can block an additional creature each combat.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\nOther creatures you control have trample.", "Trample (This creature can deal excess combat damage to the player or planeswalker it's attacking.)\\n{3}{R}: Target creature can't block this turn.", 'Trample\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm enters the battlefield, you gain 7 life.\\nWhen Pelakka Wurm dies, draw a card.', 'Tranquil Expanse enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Transmogrifying Wand enters the battlefield with three charge counters on it.\\n{1}, {T}, Remove a charge counter from Transmogrifying Wand: Destroy target creature. Its controller creates a 2/4 white Ox creature token. Activate only as a sorcery.', 'Until end of turn, target creature gets +2/+0 and gains "When this creature dies, return it to the battlefield tapped under its owner\'s control."', "Up to two target creatures can't be blocked this turn.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nWhen Gallant Cavalry enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance.", "Vigilance (Attacking doesn't cause this creature to tap.)\\nWhen Militia Bugler enters the battlefield, look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature card with power 2 or less from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.", 'When Aviation Pioneer enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.', 'When Cavalry Drillmaster enters the battlefield, target creature gets +2/+0 and gains first strike until end of turn. (It deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)', "When Departed Deckhand becomes the target of a spell, sacrifice it.\\nDeparted Deckhand can't be blocked except by Spirits.\\n{3}{U}: Another target creature you control can't be blocked this turn except by Spirits.", 'When Doomed Dissenter dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'When Dwarven Priest enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life for each creature you control.', 'When Elvish Rejuvenator enters the battlefield, look at the top five cards of your library. You may put a land card from among them onto the battlefield tapped. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', "When Exclusion Mage enters the battlefield, return target creature an opponent controls to its owner's hand.", 'When Goblin Instigator enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 red Goblin creature token.', 'When Gravedigger enters the battlefield, you may return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.', "When Hieromancer's Cage enters the battlefield, exile target nonland permanent an opponent controls until Hieromancer's Cage leaves the battlefield.", 'When Highland Game dies, you gain 2 life.', "When Lena, Selfless Champion enters the battlefield, create a 1/1 white Soldier creature token for each nontoken creature you control.\\nSacrifice Lena: Creatures you control with power less than Lena's power gain indestructible until end of turn.", "When Liliana's Contract enters the battlefield, you draw four cards and you lose 4 life.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, if you control four or more Demons with different names, you win the game.", 'When Meteor Golem enters the battlefield, destroy target nonland permanent an opponent controls.', 'When Omenspeaker enters the battlefield, scry 2. (Look at the top two cards of your library, then put any number of them on the bottom of your library and the rest on top in any order.)', 'When Pendulum of Patterns enters the battlefield, you gain 3 life.\\n{5}, {T}, Sacrifice Pendulum of Patterns: Draw a card.', 'When Reclamation Sage enters the battlefield, you may destroy target artifact or enchantment.', 'When Rhox Oracle enters the battlefield, draw a card.', 'When Salvager of Secrets enters the battlefield, return target instant or sorcery card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Scholar of Stars enters the battlefield, if you control an artifact, draw a card.', 'When Skalla Wolf enters the battlefield, look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a green card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'When Skeleton Archer enters the battlefield, it deals 1 damage to any target.', 'When Skilled Animator enters the battlefield, target artifact you control becomes an artifact creature with base power and toughness 5/5 for as long as Skilled Animator remains on the battlefield.', "When Stitcher's Supplier enters the battlefield or dies, mill three cards.", "When Suncleanser enters the battlefield, choose one —\\n• Remove all counters from target creature. It can't have counters put on it for as long as Suncleanser remains on the battlefield.\\n• Target opponent loses all counters. That player can't get counters for as long as Suncleanser remains on the battlefield.", 'When Tattered Mummy dies, each opponent loses 2 life.', "When Tezzeret's Gatebreaker enters the battlefield, look at the top five cards of your library. You may reveal a blue or artifact card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n{5}{U}, {T}, Sacrifice Tezzeret's Gatebreaker: Creatures you control can't be blocked this turn.", 'When Trusty Packbeast enters the battlefield, return target artifact card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Viashino Pyromancer enters the battlefield, it deals 2 damage to target player or planeswalker.', 'When Volley Veteran enters the battlefield, it deals damage to target creature an opponent controls equal to the number of Goblins you control.', 'When you next cast an instant or sorcery spell this turn, copy that spell. You may choose new targets for the copy.', 'Whenever Infectious Horror attacks, each opponent loses 2 life.', 'Whenever Leonin Warleader attacks, create two 1/1 white Cat creature tokens with lifelink that are tapped and attacking.', 'Whenever Star-Crowned Stag attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.', 'Whenever Thorn Lieutenant becomes the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, create a 1/1 green Elf Warrior creature token.\\n{5}{G}: Thorn Lieutenant gets +4/+4 until end of turn.', "Whenever a Dragon enters the battlefield under your control, put a gold counter on Dragon's Hoard.\\n{T}, Remove a gold counter from Dragon's Hoard: Draw a card.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color.", 'Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, you gain 1 life.', "Whenever a creature or planeswalker you control dies, you may sacrifice Ajani's Last Stand. If you do, create a 4/4 white Avatar creature token with flying.\\nWhen a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to discard this card, if you control a Plains, create a 4/4 white Avatar creature token with flying.", 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Whenever an opponent activates an ability of a creature or land that isn't a mana ability, you may draw a card.", 'Whenever another creature with power 2 or less enters the battlefield under your control, you may pay {1}. If you do, draw a card.', 'Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, you may draw a card.\\nEquip {2} ({2}: Attach to target creature you control. Equip only as a sorcery.)', 'Whenever one or more creature cards leave your graveyard, create a 1/1 black Bat creature token with flying.', 'Whenever you become the target of a spell or ability an opponent controls, counter that spell or ability unless its controller pays {1}.\\nCreature tokens get -1/-0.', "Whenever you cast a creature spell with power 4, 5, or 6, Sarkhan's Unsealing deals 4 damage to any target.\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell with power 7 or greater, Sarkhan's Unsealing deals 4 damage to each opponent and each creature and planeswalker they control.", 'Whenever you cast an Aura spell that targets Druid of Horns, create a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', 'Whenever you cast an artifact spell, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\n{1}{U}, Sacrifice two artifacts: Draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an enchantment spell, draw a card.', 'Whenever you cast an instant or sorcery spell, Guttersnipe deals 2 damage to each opponent.', 'Whenever you draw a card, each opponent mills two cards.', 'Whenever you gain life, each opponent loses 1 life.', "Whenever you gain life, put a +1/+1 counter on Ajani's Pridemate.", 'Woodland Stream enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {U}.', 'You gain 1 life. Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the amount of life you gained this turn.', 'You gain 3 life.\\nDraw a card.', 'You have no maximum hand size.\\n{T}: Add {C}.', 'You may cast spells from your hand without paying their mana costs.', 'You may have Mirror Image enter the battlefield as a copy of a creature you control.', 'You may play lands from your graveyard.', '[+1]: Create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with flying.\\n[0]: Draw a card. If you control three or more artifacts, draw two cards instead.\\n[−9]: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of your end step, search your library for a permanent card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle."', "[+1]: Draw a card.\\n[0]: Until your next turn, target artifact you control becomes a 5/5 creature in addition to its other types.\\n[−7]: Put any number of cards from your hand onto the battlefield face down. They're 5/5 artifact creatures.", '[+1]: Look at the top four cards of your library. You may reveal a creature or land card from among them and put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.\\n[−3]: Destroy target artifact, enchantment, or creature with flying.\\n[−8]: You get an emblem with "Creatures you control get +2/+2 and have vigilance, trample, and indestructible."', '[+1]: Mill three cards. If at least one Zombie card is milled this way, each opponent loses 2 life and you gain 2 life.\\n[−2]: Target creature gets -X/-X until end of turn, where X is the number of Zombies you control.\\n[−3]: You may cast Zombie spells from your graveyard this turn.', '[+1]: Put a +1/+1 counter on each of up to two target creatures.\\n[−2]: Return target creature card with mana value 2 or less from your graveyard to the battlefield.\\n[−7]: You get an emblem with "At the beginning of your end step, create three 1/1 white Cat creature tokens with lifelink."', '[+1]: Target player loses 2 life.\\n[−1]: Return target creature card from your graveyard to your hand.\\n[−7]: Destroy up to two target creatures. Put up to two creature cards from graveyards onto the battlefield under your control.', '[+1]: You may discard a card. If you do, draw a card.\\n[+1]: Add two mana in any combination of colors. Spend this mana only to cast Dragon spells.\\n[−7]: Create four 5/5 red Dragon creature tokens with flying.', "[+2]: Draw two cards.\\n[−3]: Nicol Bolas, the Arisen deals 10 damage to target creature or planeswalker.\\n[−4]: Put target creature or planeswalker card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.\\n[−12]: Exile all but the bottom card of target player's library.", "[+2]: Put two +1/+1 counters on up to one target creature.\\n[−3]: Target creature you control deals damage equal to its power to target creature you don't control.\\n[−9]: Creatures you control get +4/+4 and gain trample until end of turn.", '[+2]: Sarkhan, Dragonsoul deals 1 damage to each opponent and each creature your opponents control.\\n[−3]: Sarkhan, Dragonsoul deals 4 damage to target player or planeswalker.\\n[−9]: Search your library for any number of Dragon creature cards, put them onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', '[+2]: You gain 1 life for each creature you control.\\n[−3]: Creatures you control get +2/+2 until end of turn.\\n[−9]: Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature, where X is your life total.', '{1}, Sacrifice a creature: Exile the top card of your library. You may play that card this turn. (You still pay its costs. You can play a land this way only if you have an available land play remaining.)', '{1}{B}: Return Reassembling Skeleton from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped.', '{2}, {T}: Each opponent loses 1 life and you gain 1 life.', '{2}, {T}: Target player mills two cards.', '{2}{B}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "{2}{G}: Target creature you control can't be blocked by creatures with power 2 or less this turn.", '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice Explosive Apparatus: It deals 2 damage to any target.', '{3}, {T}: Draw a card.', '{3}{U}{U}: Draw two cards.', "{4}, {T}: Put a charge counter on Magistrate's Scepter.\\n{T}, Remove three charge counters from Magistrate's Scepter: Take an extra turn after this one.", "{4}, {T}: Target opponent exiles cards from the top of their library until they exile an instant or sorcery card. You may cast that card without paying its mana cost. Then put the exiled cards that weren't cast this way on the bottom of that library in a random order.", '{5}{G}: Ursine Champion gets +3/+3 and becomes a Bear Berserker until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', "{5}{U}{U}: Frilled Sea Serpent can't be blocked this turn.", '{R}, {T}, Discard a card: Draw a card.\\n{2}{R}, {T}, Sacrifice Dismissive Pyromancer: It deals 4 damage to target creature.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.', '{T}: Add one mana of any color.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifice Draconic Disciple: Create a 5/5 red Dragon creature token with flying.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{1}, {T}: Until end of turn, your opponents and creatures your opponents control with hexproof can be the targets of spells and abilities you control as though they didn't have hexproof.", '{T}: Add {G}.', "{T}: Look at the top card of your library. If it's a land card, you may reveal it and put it into your hand.", '{T}: Target creature gains haste until end of turn. (It can attack and {T} this turn.)']
flavor: ['"A place like this makes me wonder if there\'s more to life than blood and treasure . . . Nah."\\n—Boyl Bucksalt, Storm Fleet swab', '"A potion is no substitute for a skilled surgeon, but it will hold your bits in."\\n—Torricks, battlefield medic', '"A rare and fascinating phenomenon."\\n—Tamiyo', '"After everything I\'ve survived, it\'s hard to be frightened by anything anymore."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"And if you threaten me again, your shiny steel trousers will be sprouting daggerthorn vines."\\n—Iveta, rooftop runner', '"Approach from behind. That way, if it does charge, at least you aren\'t in front of it."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"As I desire, so it shall be."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"As long as my faith persists, so shall I."', '"At least this one still has arms and legs. Well, most of its legs."\\n—Enslow, ghoulcaller of Nephalia', '"Bring down a stag and fix its horns upon Arel\'s head. She hears the wisdom of our ancestors."\\n—Chianul, Who Whispers Twice', '"Burn. Burn. Keep. Burn."', '"Catch!"', '"Death is no excuse for disobedience."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Defeat is no reason for retreat. It is a sign we must redouble our efforts to win this fight."', '"Do not mistake a quiet rampart for one that is unguarded. Some things stir only when they need to."\\n—Bonovar, siege commander', '"Each tooth is the length of a horse, and new ones grow in every sixteen days. Let\'s get a closer look!"\\n—Vivien Reid', '"Feeding a normal army is a problem of logistics. With zombies, it is an asset. Feeding is why they fight. Feeding is why they are feared."\\n—Jadar, ghoulcaller of Nephalia', '"Fill the sky with stuff!"', '"Fleshy, with just a hint of leather. A fine vintage."', '"Folks \'round here are too in love with their contraptions. Does them some good if we smash one every so often."', '"Give \'em a push."\\n—Mogwin, goblin delinquent', '"Halana grew brambles to create a barricade around our camp, hoping that it would keep the wolves out. That was a mistake for which we almost paid dearly."\\n—Alena, trapper of Kessig', '"Horse? Who needs a horse?"', '"I am most myself when I am least human."', '"I can hear the plunder calling. It asks for me by name."', '"I can think of worse ways to go. On second thought, maybe not."\\n—Ludevic, necro-alchemist', '"I decide what stands in my way."', '"I do as I choose with what is mine. And it is all mine."\\n—Nicol Bolas', '"I feel the presence of the God-Pharaoh in the Second Sun, and I rise upon its rays."', '"I found a new toy. Wanna play?"', '"I give them dreams so wondrous that they hesitate to return to the world of the conscious."\\n—Garild, merfolk mage', '"I trained with the Ghitu, and I respect the fire as they do."', '"I turn around and see nothing, yet I know it is behind me. Its fingers rummage in my mind, crafting new ideas."', '"I\'m not picky about what comes up, but the less decay, the better."\\n—Liliana Vess', '"If I am to die, I will die in the embrace of immeasurable flame."', '"If you think yourself a chief, then prove your might."\\n—Gar-Tun, Mistvalley silverback', '"If you want them dead, buy some poison. If you want them to have the worst day of their life before dying, then let\'s talk price."', '"Impossible! How could they overwhelm us? We had barricades, war elephants,... and they were barely a tenth of our number!"\\n—General Avitora', '"In these halls there is no pass or fail. Your true test comes with the first full moon."', '"Industry without artistry is just a fancy way to fill the junkyard."', '"It hurts more if you think about it."\\n—Hooks, Cabal torturer', '"It\'s not work if you enjoy it."', '"Let go of all that harms you. Cast your burdens into the darkness, and build for the faithful a house of light."\\n—*Song of All*, canto 1008', '"Let nothing own the skies but the wind."\\n—Dejara, Giltwood druid', '"Long after the land has given up the last of its secrets, there will still be mysteries in the depths of the sea."\\n—Kiora', '"Look how cute it is now!"\\n—Vivien Reid', '"Margaret has traveled with me to the end of the world and back."\\n—Hewen Frit, merchant', '"May the light shine through me to guide the lost."', '"Might doesn\'t just build empires. It protects them."\\n—Inti, Sun Empire knight', '"More obedient than any dog."\\n—Tezzeret', '"My skill sharpens with each beat of my wings."', '"Nicol Bolas destroyed my world. I owe it to Skalla to celebrate all life, no matter how dangerous."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"Only those who give the dragons the respect they deserve may bear our title."', '"Our duty does not stop at our borders."', '"Picking locks is for beginners."', '"Prayers will curdle on the tongue and be heard by rotting ears."\\n—Minaldra, the Vizag Atum', '"Reel it in. No, wait! Throw it back!"\\n—Gertrude, deep-sea angler', '"Rise and shine, my dears. We have work to do."\\n—Isareth the Awakener', '"Safe passage requires only a simple answer to a simple question, traveler."', '"Some hid from the storm. I embraced it and learned its name."', '"Souls are volatile things. When compressed and loaded into a handheld device, their destructive potential is quite impressive."\\n—Dierk, geistmage', '"The bones of the past will tell their tales—if you know how to speak their language."', '"The centaurs are truly free. Never will they be tamed by temptation or controlled by fear. They live in total harmony, a feat not yet achieved by our kind."\\n—Ramal, sage of Westgate', '"The further into the future I look, the less certain my vision. Even now, the middle distance is obscured by fire."', '"The healers of Bant are second to none. I owe then a great deal for their tutelage."\\n—Ajani Goldmane', '"The land already knows its destiny. I simply ask it to share the tale with me."', '"The path of the stars is as reliable as the instruments that measure them."', '"The stars mark your destiny. May you accept the fate thus divulged."', '"The things I once imagined would be my greatest achievements were only the first steps toward a future I can only begin to fathom."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"The threads of magic that protect this place were woven by my will."', '"The trick to talking sense into Keldons is getting them to hold still."', '"The wild tangle of the Cowl provides sanctuary to life that watched the first buildings rise."', '"These storied halls are under my protection."', '"They are gentle herbivores, despite their size. Approach cautiously, and hum a tune to let them know you mean no harm."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"They may show up with the wrong thigh bone or mandible, but they always show up."\\n—Zul Ashur, lich lord', '"They say perfection is unattainable, but they said that about flight too."', '"This imprint was the familiar of a friend."\\n—Vivien Reid', '"Those who do evil and those who do nothing are equally worthy of contempt."', '"Thread the torsos together with angel hair to ensure they will cooperate in battle."\\n—*The Stitcher\'s Tome*', '"To break another\'s mind is to deliver a fate worse than death. It is a terrifying power."\\n—Jace Beleren', '"Unwelcome thoughts crowd my mind. Are they my own madness, or the whispers of another?"\\n—Sarkhan Vol', '"We can take \'em. You go first!"', '"What was once formed by masons, shaped by smiths, or given life by mages, I will return to the embrace of the earth."', '"When I grafted the Planar Bridge into myself, I felt my Planeswalker spark flare beyond my body. The Multiverse was my plaything. It felt . . . incredible."\\n—Tezzeret', '"When it comes to killing with precision, a soul is but a hindrance."\\n—Isareth the Awakener', '"When one of us prospers, the pride prospers."\\n—Jazal Goldmane', '"When the beast cloaks itself in the mighty oak, what good is a bow? When the oak wraps itself around the snarling beast, what good is a hatchet?"\\n—Dionus, elvish archdruid', '"When these intruders are gone, Zendikar will be my throne, my palace, my playground."', '"Whether we like it or not, our arrival has altered the landscape."\\n—Malcolm, navigator of the *Belligerent*', '"Would you rather feel the edge of blade or the sharpness of my fangs?"', '"You cannot defend others if your own well-being is neglected."', '"You have given all to your kingdom, dear knight. Serenity shall be your prize."\\n—Queen Lian', '"You should have seen the look on *both* their faces."\\n—Morkamp, Lambholt innkeeper', '"You will kneel before me, even if I have to split the earth under your feet!"\\n—Ash Kronor, Keldon warlord', '"Your death will be a balm, your passing a welcome revision, and all will sigh with peace to know of your demise."', '"Your mind is too filled with foolish concerns to hear the subtle whispers that the breeze brings."', '"Your part in this fight is done, vampire. Get used to your thirst."', '"Your service shall be rewarded."\\n—Queen Lian', 'A full coffin is like a full coffer—both are attractive to thieves.', "A harpy's hoard is a filthy, bloodstained pile of trinkets and corpses.", "A king's knowledge does not vanish when the heart stops beating.", "A knight's devotion to their steed goes only so far.", 'A lich must consume mortal souls to feed its eternal life.', 'A lifetime of keeping up appearances is not enough to earn an eternity of rest.', 'A pair of domesticated griffins escaped from captivity a century ago. Now the skies are filled with the songs of their descendants.', 'A pegasus chooses its rider, bearing the worthy into the clouds and tossing all others to the ground.', 'A pit yawned open, a column of oily smoke arose, and a towering form hissed, "I accept this offering."', 'A sharp axe solves most problems.', 'All the books were dusty with disuse, save the one titled *Camouflage and Its Practical Applications*.', 'Amidst the darkest ashes grow the strongest seeds.', 'As it walks across the fallow field, its awkward, loping gait matches the rattling in its head to create a haunting rhythm that chills the bones.', 'As patient and generous as life, as harsh and merciless as nature.', 'As the Cabal legions pushed into Shiv, they learned not to stand so close together.', 'As the hyperstormic generator crept past redline, a being emerged from the arc.', 'As the ship approached, the jade totem rose high overhead. Power rippled. Eyes of stone glowed and crackled. Out hissed a breath of the world, and a windstorm came alive.', 'Beyond the chaos of Ghirapur lies a vibrant world where aether flows through nature.', 'Cries of anguish quickly spurred cries of action.', "Dependence on luck is anathema to Kefnet's rigorous studies. Those who hope to escape his maze by chance never succeed.", 'Divining the future is easy when you hold the power to sway it.', 'Dragon birth lairs are littered with treasure to entice the young from their eggs.', 'Dwell longest on the thoughts that shine brightest.', "Each of Vivien's arrows is an invocation of a species.", 'Entrepreneurs have attempted to sell the water, but to no avail. Whatever magic it contains disappears upon bottling.', 'Even the greatest hero begins with nothing.', 'Eyes are unnecessary for seeing the future.', 'Fairgoers were delighted to find that even outside the fairgrounds, Ghirapur was a city of wonders.', 'Fblthp had always hated crowds.', 'First the insult, then the encore.', "Fools believe that Kolaghan's brood follows lightning storms. The wise know that it is the other way around.", "For Sarkhan Vol, the dragon is the purest expression of life's savage splendor.", 'For a moment they stood tall, all fear forgotten.', 'For devils, burning things is the highest form of comedy, diversion, and artistic expression.', 'For the necromancer barons, killing and recruitment are one and the same.', "Foul-tempered, poorly trained, and mule-stubborn, the drake is the perfect test of the master's will.", 'From the perpetual shadowsmoke that hung above the ship, a silent form emerged, lips curled with malice and anticipation.', "He has the biggest bashing stick, so it's a safe bet he's the leader.", 'Her prophecies amaze her even as she speaks them.', 'Hospitality is of little concern to those who do not wish to be disturbed.', "If you can't find a doorway, make one.", "If you feel the ground quake, run. If you hear its bellow, flee. If you see its teeth, it's too late.", 'Imagine a thousand tiny mushrooms cropping up within your lungs.', 'Immortality is worth any price.', 'In their final moments, the demons gazed upon grace in its purest form.', 'Inner strength is never seen until it makes all the difference.', 'It eats what it wants to eat—which is anything that moves.', 'It treads on feet of coals and strikes with the force of a volcano.', 'It was a night like any other. It would soon become a night no one would ever forget.', "It's pointless to hold on when you have nothing to hold on with.", "Its elaborate designs reveal secrets of aether's flow.", 'Its light exposes enemies and lays secrets bare.', 'Its roar is the clatter of a thousand bones.', 'Its ventricles weep venom, and it consumes only poison.', 'Just as the sun rises at dawn and the days lengthen in the summer, the Sun Empire has awakened after long years of quiet.', 'Knowledge itself is neither good nor evil. Just as the wrong book in the wrong hands could doom all existence, the same book in the right hands could save it.', 'Law protects but also contains.', 'Like all jungle plants, the vines must fight and claw for sunlight. Once their place is secured, they grow strong, sharp, and impenetrable.', "Liliana is never one to follow someone else's lead.", 'Loxodons are firm in stature and spirit. No matter the odds, they are always first into battle.', "Made in its creator's image, though slightly more clangy.", 'Many an inventor has collapsed under the pressure to create a flawless design.', 'Many initiates believe it possesses secrets beyond imagining. Many have become meals trying to learn them.', "Minds, like mountains, are never so grand and mighty that they can't be reduced to dust.", 'Most smiths shape metal, but some prefer more delicate materials.', 'Native to wide prairies and scrublands, falcons occasionally roost in dragon skeletons.', 'Negotiations reached an abrupt conclusion.', 'Nicol Bolas would not rest until he was restored to his former glory.', 'No part goes to waste.', 'No rampart can withstand the fury of a giant.', 'No single root feeds the forest.', 'No welcome for those who trespass. Only fang and horn and claw.', 'Not once in the history of Grixis has anyone died of old age.', 'Once every seven years it flies on spectral wings over the moors of ancient battlefields.', 'One day, they may be paragons of deadly elegance. For the moment, they possess nothing but thirst.', 'One who is marked by a demon in life is sure to be remembered as one in death.', 'Planeswalkers seek out great monuments throughout the Multiverse, knowing that their builders were unwittingly drawn by the convergence of mana in the area.', 'Predicting the future is a messy business.', 'Sarkhan wandered into a tomb and back in time.', 'Say hello to your new friend.', "She learned a tragic lesson that day: even the purest can be corrupted when the heart's emotions are twisted.", 'She sings for all those who have been silenced.', 'She watches over the city just as Serra watches over all.', 'Sins that would be too gruesome in the light of day are made more pleasing in the dark of night.', 'Sister of Nicol Bolas. Survivor of the Elder Dragon War. The most vicious of her kin.', 'Small words stoke large flames.', 'Sometimes an eruption in Shiv produces something more dangerous than a mere river of molten rock.', "Successful battles start with knowing who's worth fighting.", "Tazeem's embrace is harsh, but for those that call it home, nothing else will do.", 'Tenacity prevails when hopes die.', "That feeling of something on your chest is usually sleep paralysis. Occasionally, it's something else.", "The Great Mending that healed the Multiverse also unraveled the threads of Nicol Bolas's power.", "The Sun Empire's most sacred sites are protected by more than prayers.", 'The Tolarian Academies embrace a tradition of study and research while discouraging the kinds of experiments that ruined the original island of Tolaria.', 'The bedrock has many gifts to give.', 'The bellow of a minotaur always translates to "charge."', 'The best fighters are skilled in both harming and healing.', 'The best of their trade know every bolt of their rigs, stem to stern.', 'The clerics prayed for salvation. The soldiers prayed for victory. Both prayers were answered.', 'The cold slowed their movements until only their panicked eyeballs swiveled beneath the ice.', "The collection didn't have room to expand, so the wizard improvised a solution.", 'The creation of new weapons demands the destruction of others.', 'The dead who wander beyond the safety of the city of Naktamun crave only to spread their curse.', 'The delight of discovery drives the pursuit of knowledge.', 'The grave robbers were startled, for the door to the mausoleum was already open.', 'The greatest treasure of the deep is an echo from above.', 'The impact sent the soldiers scattering—then something came out of the crater.', 'The leonin of Oreskos are quick to take offense—not because they are thin-skinned but because they are always ready for a fight.', 'The life of a shapeshifter is one of constant change.', 'The massive dominate through might. The tiny survive with guile. Beware the tiny who become massive.', 'The most holy treasures are kept far from unclean soil.', 'The municipal senate makes extensive use of the thopters, mostly to gather dirt on rival senators.', 'The ogres you know are nothing like the Onakke. Possessing both intellect and industry, they had brute strength without being brutish.', 'The only casualties were a snapped spear, a lost helmet, and some bruised egos.', 'The river split into many channels as it flowed to the Halimar Sea. Few travelers could follow the same one twice.', 'The seafloor is flecked with the bones of fools who dared to sail into the mist.', 'The sound of the trumpets lights a fire in the hearts of the bold and snuffs the courage of the cowardly.', 'The stench of rotting meat lures flies, goblins, and young raptors.', 'The tools of invention became the weapons of revolution.', 'The undisputed master of the mountains of Shiv.', "There is only one fate left to those banished from the God-Pharaoh's city.", 'They grow closer with every passing season.', 'Thievery requires subtlety, from the beginning of the heist to the end.', 'Those of esteemed birth earn a most esteemed death.', 'Threefold were his crimes, doubled were his pleas, singular was his fate.', 'To survive imminent doom, it sometimes takes a foolhardy soul who acts first and fears later.', 'To wield lightning is to tame chaos.', 'Villagers employ watchdogs as guardians and companions. Druids prefer something a little bigger.', 'Waterways carve their routes through the land to reflect the paths the aether streams cut through the clouds.', 'When it passes, order defeats chaos.', 'When it passes, rainbows follow.', 'When it passes, storm clouds bolt across the land.', 'When it passes, the dead are displaced by flourishing life.', 'When it passes, those who sleep dream of sickness and death.', 'When it passes, waves touch the sky.', 'When one leonin hunts, many more are surely nearby.', 'Whether it is magical, lucky, or merely old, it is cherished, and that gives it power.', 'White as starlight on snow, it appears only on the eve of the winter solstice.', 'With matchless stealth, the River Heralds fought a running battle against the three enemy forces.', 'Within a mile of the woodland, you will feel her eyes upon you. Within its borders, you will feel her blade.', "You don't want to know how she got that name.", 'Young artificers on Kaladesh let their imaginations run wild.']
artist: ['Aaron Miller', 'Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alex Konstad', 'Anastasia Ovchinnikova', 'Andreas Rocha', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Anthony Palumbo', 'Ash Wood', 'Austin Hsu', 'Bastien L. Deharme', 'Bram Sels', 'Brian Snõddy', 'Chase Stone', 'Chippy', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Seaman', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Craig J Spearing', 'Cyril Van Der Haegen', 'Daarken', 'Dallas Williams', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Dave Kendall', 'David Gaillet', 'David Palumbo', 'Dermot Power', 'Deruchenko Alexander', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Donato Giancola', 'Drew Baker', 'Efflam Mercier', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Even Amundsen', 'Filip Burburan', 'G-host Lee', 'Greg Opalinski', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Igor Kieryluk', 'Izzy', 'Jack Wang', 'Jaime Jones', 'Jakub Kasper', 'James Ryman', 'Jana Schirmer & Johannes Voss', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jason Rainville', 'Jeremy Jarvis', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Joe Slucher', 'Johann Bodin', 'Johannes Voss', 'John Avon', 'John Severin Brassell', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Jonathan Kuo', 'Josh Hass', 'Kari Christensen', 'Karl Kopinski', 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lake Hurwitz', 'Lars Grant-West', 'Lindsey Look', 'Lius Lasahido', 'Livia Prima', 'Lucas Graciano', 'Magali Villeneuve', 'Mark Behm', 'Mark Poole', 'Mark Zug', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Min Yum', 'Mitchell Malloy', 'Nic Klein', 'Nils Hamm', 'Noah Bradley', 'Paolo Parente', 'Paul Scott Canavan', 'Pete Venters', 'Randy Gallegos', 'Randy Vargas', 'Raoul Vitale', 'Raymond Swanland', 'Robbie Trevino', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Burley', 'Sam Rowan', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott Chou', 'Scott Murphy', 'Seb McKinnon', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Simon Dominic', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Suzanne Helmigh', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Titus Lunter', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tommy Arnold', 'Tony Foti', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Uriah Voth', 'Vance Kovacs', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Viktor Titov', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Willian Murai', 'Winona Nelson', 'Yeong-Hao Han', 'Yongjae Choi', 'Zack Stella', 'Zoltan Boros', 'Zoltan Boros & Gabor Szikszai']
