rulings: ["[{'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Can be used on a player with less than 2 cards in their library. It will remove 0 or 1 cards if that is all that is available.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'It is not a draw effect so it will not cause a player with less than 2 cards in their library to lose.'}, {'date': '2004-10-04', 'text': 'Since you are putting more than one card in the graveyard at one time, the affected player can choose the order the 2 cards go in.'}]", "[{'date': '2008-04-01', 'text': 'This card now uses the Reach keyword ability to enable the blocking of flying creatures. This works because a creature with flying can only be blocked by creatures with flying or reach.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-02-01\', \'text\': "If multiple effects modify your hand size, apply them in timestamp order. For example, if you put Null Profusion (an enchantment that says your maximum hand size is two) onto the battlefield and then put Reliquary Tower onto the battlefield, you\'ll have no maximum hand size. However, if those permanents enter the battlefield in the opposite order, your maximum hand size would be two."}]', "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature card” is any card with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact, enchantment, or land. Older cards of type summon are also creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2009-10-01', 'text': 'A “creature spell” is any spell with the type creature, even if it has other types such as artifact or enchantment. Older cards of type summon are also creature spells.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'An "attacking creature" is one that has been declared as an attacker this combat, or one that was put onto the battlefield attacking this combat. Unless that creature leaves combat, it continues to be an attacking creature through the end of combat step, even if the player it was attacking has left the game, or the planeswalker it was attacking has left combat.\'}, {\'date\': \'2009-10-01\', \'text\': \'Even though Trumpet Blast affects only attacking creatures, the bonus will remain for the rest of the turn.\'}, {\'date\': \'2014-09-20\', \'text\': "Only creatures that are attacking as Trumpet Blast resolves will receive the bonus. In other words, casting it before you\'ve declared attackers usually won\'t do anything."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "Scry appears on some spells and abilities with one or more targets. If all of the spell or ability\'s targets are illegal when it tries to resolve, it won\'t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won\'t scry."}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'When you scry, you may put all the cards you look at back on top of your library, you may put all of those cards on the bottom of your library, or you may put some of those cards on top and the rest of them on the bottom.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': \'You choose how to order cards returned to your library after scrying no matter where you put them.\'}, {\'date\': \'2013-09-15\', \'text\': "You perform the actions stated on a card in sequence. For some spells and abilities, that means you\'ll scry last. For others, that means you\'ll scry and then perform other actions."}]', "[{'date': '2015-06-22', 'text': 'Once an attacking creature with menace is legally blocked by two or more creatures, removing one or more of those blockers from combat won’t change or undo that block.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2016-09-20\', \'text\': "The set of creatures affected by Inspired Charge is determined as the spell resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn and noncreature permanents that become creatures later in the turn won\'t get +2/+1."}]', "[{'date': '2018-04-27', 'text': 'Radiating Lightning targets only the player. Creatures that player controls with hexproof will be dealt damage.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "A creature that\'s both a Skeleton and a Zombie will get the bonus only once."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Skeleton or Zombie you control may become lethal if Death Baron leaves the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Death Baron doesn\'t normally affect itself. If you manage to turn it into a Skeleton, however, then it will give itself +1/+1 and deathtouch."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Abnormal Endurance\'s effect works only once. If the targeted creature dies and is then returned to the battlefield, it\'s considered to be a new creature. If that new creature dies, it won\'t come back."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Activating Departed Deckhand\'s last ability after a creature has become blocked by a non-Spirit creature won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If the spell that targets Departed Deckhand has no other targets, it won\'t resolve (because it no longer has a legal target after Departed Deckhand is sacrificed)."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You\'ll sacrifice Departed Deckhand even if you counter the spell that targets it."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Activating Suspicious Bookcase\'s ability after a creature has become blocked won\'t cause that creature to become unblocked."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apply power bonuses from counters the creature enters the battlefield with and continuous effects such as that of Valiant Knight before checking to see if Mentor of the Meek\'s ability will trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Mentor of the Meek\'s ability checks the power of the other creature only as it enters the battlefield. If that creature\'s power is 2 or less, the ability will trigger. Once the ability triggers, raising that creature\'s power above 2 won\'t affect that ability. Similarly, reducing the creature\'s power to 2 or less after it enters the battlefield won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Mentor of the Meek, you can\'t pay {1} multiple times to draw more than one card."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Knight you control may become lethal if Valiant Knight leaves the battlefield during that turn."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Multiple instances of double strike on the same creature are redundant.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Because damage remains marked on a creature until it\'s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Spirit you control may become lethal if Supreme Phantom leaves the battlefield during that turn."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Dark-Dweller Oracle doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled card. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty. If you exile a land card, you can play it only during your main phase and only if you have an available land play remaining."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the exiled card, it remains in exile."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You can sacrifice Dark-Dweller Oracle to pay the cost for its own ability.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Crucible of Worlds doesn\'t allow you to activate abilities (such as cycling) of land cards in your graveyard."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Crucible of Worlds doesn\'t change the times when you can play those land cards. You can still play only one land per turn, and only during your main phase when you have priority and the stack is empty."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Goreclaw\'s last ability affects only creatures you control with the appropriate power at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get either bonus, and a creature you control whose power decreases later in the turn won\'t lose either bonus."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If another creature has an ability that changes its power when it attacks, such as Brawl-Bash Ogre, you may have that ability resolve before Goreclaw\'s last ability."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you cast a creature spell that will enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters, such as Hungering Hydra, those counters aren\'t considered when determining whether Goreclaw reduces that spell\'s cost. Similarly, effects that will raise the creature\'s power once it has entered the battlefield won\'t apply."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Guttersnipe\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, Guttersnipe\'s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If another creature you control dies at the same time that Open the Graves leaves the battlefield, you\'ll get a Zombie token."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you didn\'t gain life during the turn before the end step begins, Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability won\'t trigger at all. Gaining life during the end step won\'t cause the ability to trigger."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won\'t satisfy Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability, even though it caused your team\'s life total to increase."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability checks if you gained 5 or more life total during the turn. It doesn\'t matter if you also lost life or whether your life total is greater than it was at the beginning of the turn. It also doesn\'t matter whether Resplendent Angel was on the battlefield when any of the life gain happened."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You create only one Angel token, no matter how many times you gained 5 or more life.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You don\'t need to have gained 5 life all at once to satisfy Resplendent Angel\'s triggered ability."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as Colossal Majesty\'s ability resolves, you won\'t draw a card."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t control a creature with power 4 or greater as your upkeep begins, Colossal Majesty\'s ability won\'t trigger. You can\'t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The creature with power 4 or greater that you control as Colossal Majesty\'s ability resolves doesn\'t have to be the same creature with power 4 or greater that was under your control as the ability triggered."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'You draw only one card, no matter how many creatures with power 4 or greater you control.\'}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 2 or less has blocked a creature, activating Ghirapur Guide\'s ability won\'t change or undo that block."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Once a creature with power 3 or greater has blocked the target creature, changing the power of the blocking creature won\'t change or undo that block."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Sai\'s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The second part of Heroic Reinforcements\'s effect affects only creatures you control at the time it\'s applied, including the tokens created by the first part of its effect. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +1/+1 or gain haste."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A copy is created even if the spell that caused Doublecast’s ability to trigger has been countered by the time that ability resolves. The copy resolves before the original spell.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Doublecast’s ability will copy any instant or sorcery spell, not just one with targets.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied has an X whose value was determined as it was cast, the copy has the same value of X.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the spell that’s copied is modal (that is, it says “Choose one —” or the like), the copy will have the same mode or modes. You can’t choose different ones.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast one Doublecast after another, you’ll copy the second Doublecast. Each resolves, creating two delayed triggered abilities. The next spell you cast after that will be copied twice. If that spell is also a Doublecast, the following spell will be copied three times, and so on.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copy that Doublecast’s ability creates is created on the stack, so it’s not “cast.” Abilities that trigger when a player casts a spell won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copy will have the same targets as the spell it’s copying unless you choose new ones. You may change any number of the targets, including all of them or none of them. The new targets must be legal.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can’t choose to pay any additional costs for the copy. However, effects based on any additional costs that were paid for the original spell are copied as though those same costs were paid for the copy too.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A double-faced card enters the battlefield with its front face up by default, unless a spell or ability instructs you to put it onto the battlefield transformed, in which case it enters with its back face up. The back face of a double-faced card can’t be played.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each face of a double-faced card has its own set of characteristics: name, types, subtypes, abilities, and so on. While a double-faced card is on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of the face that’s currently up. The other set of characteristics is ignored.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Nicol Bolas leaves the battlefield after his creature face’s activated ability has been activated but before it resolves, the card remains in whichever zone it moves to. It won’t be exiled or return transformed.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If another permanent that isn’t a double-faced card (such as Mirror Image) becomes a copy of Nicol Bolas, the Ravager, activating the ability to exile it and return it transformed will only exile it. It won’t return to the battlefield at all.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any permanents you control from Nicol Bolas’s third loyalty ability that came from other players’ graveyards are exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In some rare cases, a spell or ability may cause Nicol Bolas to transform while it’s a creature on the battlefield. If this happens, the resulting planeswalker won’t have any loyalty counters on it and will subsequently be put into its owner’s graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Nicol Bolas, the Arisen has a color indicator on its typeline. This color indicator means that it’s a blue, black, and red permanent.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The converted mana cost of a double-faced card is the converted mana cost of its front face, even while it’s on the battlefield with its back face up. For example, the converted mana cost of Nicol Bolas, the Arisen is 4.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When Nicol Bolas’s enters-the-battlefield triggered ability resolves, first the next opponent in turn order (or, if it’s an opponent’s turn, that opponent) chooses a card in their hand without revealing it, then each other opponent in turn order does the same. Then all the chosen cards are discarded at the same time.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'While a double-faced card isn’t on the battlefield, consider only the characteristics of its front face. For example, Nicol Bolas has the characteristics of its creature face in the graveyard, even if it was a planeswalker on the battlefield before it was put into the graveyard.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can activate one of the planeswalker’s loyalty abilities the turn it enters the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A later effect that changes the affected creature’s colors will overwrite that part of Rise from the Grave’s effect; the creature will be only the new color. The same is true about an effect that changes the affected creature’s types or subtypes.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature is normally colorless, it will simply become black. It can’t be both black and colorless.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Rise from the Grave doesn’t overwrite any previous colors or types. Rather, it adds another color and another subtype.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A split card (such as those featured in the Amonkhet block) only counts once for Enigma Drake’s ability, even if it’s both an instant and a sorcery.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The ability that defines Enigma Drake’s power works in all zones.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'A “Dragon spell” refers only to a spell that has the Dragon subtype, regardless of its name. For example, Dragon’s Hoard isn’t a Dragon spell.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because it’s a loyalty ability, Sarkhan’s second ability isn’t a mana ability. It can be activated only any time you could cast a sorcery. It uses the stack and can be responded to.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Activated abilities contain a colon. They\\\'re generally written "[Cost]: [Effect]." Some keyword abilities are activated abilities and will have colons in their reminder text. An activated mana ability is one that produces mana as it resolves, not one that costs mana to activate.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Runic Armasaur\'s ability doesn\'t trigger when an opponent activates an ability of a card in hand (such as a cycling ability from the Amonkhet block) or a card in a graveyard (such as that of Bone Dragon), even if that causes a card to be put onto the battlefield."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Runic Armasaur\'s ability doesn\'t trigger when an opponent activates an ability of a noncreature, nonland permanent that causes it to become a creature (such as a crew ability of a Vehicle)."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Runic Armasaur\'s ability resolves before the ability that caused it to trigger. Players can cast spells and activate abilities after the triggered ability resolves but before the activated ability that caused it to trigger does."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Activating Chromium’s last ability after it has become blocked won’t cause Chromium to become unblocked.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Chromium stops being an Elder Dragon for the turn once its last ability has resolved. It’s still a legendary creature named Chromium, the Mutable.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Chromium’s activated ability overwrites all previous effects that set its base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after that ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Effects that raise or lower a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the effect of Titanic Growth, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch its power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Chromium gains an ability after its activated ability resolves, it will keep that ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Activating Siegebreaker Giant’s last ability after a creature has blocked won’t remove the blocking creature from combat or cause the creature it blocked to become unblocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Ajani’s second ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Ajani’s third ability resolves. If your life total changes later, the creature won’t gain or lose +1/+1 counters.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Alpine Moon’s effect doesn’t affect supertypes or other card types. It won’t remove the artifact card type from an artifact land or remove the legendary supertype from a legendary land.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an affected land has an ability that causes it to enter the battlefield tapped, it will lose that ability before it applies. The same is also true of any other abilities that modify how a land enters the battlefield or apply “as” a land enters the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an affected land has an ability that triggers “when” it enters the battlefield, it will lose that ability before it triggers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Although the token is attacking, it was never declared as an attacking creature (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "You choose which player or planeswalker the token is attacking. It doesn\'t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that the equipped creature is attacking."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Although the tokens are attacking, they were never declared as attacking creatures (for the purposes of abilities that trigger whenever a creature attacks, for example).'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You choose which players or planeswalkers the two tokens are attacking. They don’t have to be attacking the same player or planeswalker that Leonin Warleader is attacking, and they can each be attacking different players and/or planeswalkers.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'Any cards not cast, including land cards, remain in exile.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Apex of Power doesn\'t change when you can cast the exiled cards. For example, if you exile a sorcery card, you can cast it only during your main phase when the stack is empty."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "Casting an exiled card causes it to leave exile. You can\'t cast it multiple times."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If an effect copies Apex of Power, the copy wasn\'t cast at all, so you won\'t add ten mana."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Any enters-the-battlefield abilities of the copied creature will trigger when Mirror Image enters the battlefield. Any “as [this creature] enters the battlefield” or “[this creature] enters the battlefield with” abilities of the chosen creature will also work.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Mirror Image somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can’t become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Mirror Image copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. Mirror Image doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is another Mirror Image), then Mirror Image enters the battlefield as whatever the chosen creature copied.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the copied creature has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Mirror Image copies exactly what was printed on the original creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it as any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Auras attached to the exiled permanent will be put into their owners’ graveyards. Any Equipment will become unattached and remain on the battlefield. Any counters on the exiled permanent will cease to exist.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Hieromancer’s Cage leaves the battlefield before its triggered ability resolves, the target permanent won’t be exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a token is exiled this way, it will cease to exist and won’t return to the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Aven Wind Mage’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Banefire can be targeted by spells that try to counter it regardless of what the value of X is. If X is 5 or more, those spells will still resolve, but the part of their effect that would counter Banefire won’t do anything. Any other effects those spells have will work as normal.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If its target is illegal by the time Banefire tries to resolve, the spell isn’t countered, but it doesn’t resolve. The target won’t be dealt damage.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine whether it can be countered and its damage can be prevented, Banefire checks the number you chose for X, not the amount of mana you actually spent or the amount of damage it will actually deal.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because Detection Tower’s last ability doesn’t change the characteristics of any permanents, the set of creatures affected by it is constantly updated. Creatures that come under your opponents’ control later in the turn can be targeted as though they didn’t have hexproof.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Creatures your opponents control with “hexproof from [quality]” abilities can be targeted as though they didn’t have those abilities as well.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Your opponents and creatures your opponents control don’t actually lose hexproof, although you will ignore hexproof for purposes of choosing targets of spells and abilities you control.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because all attacking creatures are chosen at once, a creature returned this way can’t attack during the same combat as it returns, even if it has haste.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because to die means to be put into a graveyard from the battlefield, a creature that is exiled instead doesn’t “die.” Abilities that would trigger when it dies won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Isareth leaves the battlefield, the replacement effect continues to apply. If one of the creatures it returned would leave the battlefield, it’ll be exiled instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you somehow remove a corpse counter from a creature Isareth has returned to the battlefield, the replacement effect that will exile it continues to apply. The counter is only to help remind you which creatures will be exiled if they would leave the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Isareth’s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may pay {X}. When you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target creature card to return. This is different from abilities that say “If you do . . .” in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after mana is paid and the target creature card is chosen, but before that card is returned.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to Court Cleric may become lethal if you cease to control an Ajani planeswalker during that turn.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because damage remains marked on a creature until it’s removed as the turn ends, nonlethal damage dealt to a Goblin you control may become lethal if Goblin Trashmaster leaves the battlefield during that turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can sacrifice Goblin Trashmaster to pay the cost for its own ability.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because the instructions are followed in order, abilities of the creatures a player will sacrifice may modify or trigger on losing life, discarding cards, and/or sacrificing creatures. Abilities that trigger this way will resolve after Fraying Omnipotence is done resolving.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Fraying Omnipotence causes each player to lose half of their team’s life, rounded up. This means that teams at an even life total will have 0 life, and teams at an odd life total will have -1 life. The game then ends in a draw.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The amounts that are lost are rounded up, not the amounts kept. For example, a player with 5 life, five cards in hand, and five creatures would lose 3 life, discard three cards, and sacrifice three creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'When Fraying Omnipotence resolves, first each player loses the appropriate amount of life at once. Next, the player whose turn it is chooses an appropriate number of cards in hand without revealing them, then each other player in turn order does the same, and then those cards are all discarded simultaneously. Then, the player whose turn it is chooses an appropriate number of creatures they control. Each other player in turn order does the same, knowing choices made by previous players. Finally, all of the chosen creatures are sacrificed simultaneously.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Because the last ability of Tezzeret’s Gatebreaker doesn’t change the characteristics of any permanents, the set of creatures affected by it is constantly updated. Creatures that come under your control later in the turn can’t be blocked.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Cards put onto the battlefield using Tezzeret’s third ability enter the battlefield as 5/5 artifact creatures. They don’t enter the battlefield with their own characteristics and then become 5/5.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Effects that modify a creature’s power and/or toughness, such as the ones created by Titanic Growth or a +/1+1 counter, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature enters the battlefield as a copy of a face-down creature or if a token is created that’s a copy of one, that copy has the same characteristics as the face-down creature (in this case, a 5/5 artifact creature with no other characteristics), even though the copy is face up.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a double-faced card (such as Nicol Bolas, the Ravager) is put onto the battlefield face down, you don’t reveal it as you do so. The characteristics of its back face don’t apply.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a face-down permanent you control leaves the battlefield, you must reveal it to all players.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If an effect tries to return a face-down creature to the battlefield after it leaves (such as Oath of Teferi from the Dominaria set or Abnormal Endurance from this set), that effect returns the card face up. If it tries to put an instant or sorcery card onto the battlefield this way, that card remains in its current zone instead.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the artifact was already a creature, its base power and toughness will each become 5. This overwrites any previous effects that set the creature’s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Tezzeret’s ability resolves will overwrite this effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Tezzeret’s second ability doesn’t remove any abilities the target artifact has.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The Core Set 2019 set includes no way to turn these cards face up. If an effect from cards outside of this set does turn one face up, the effect causing it to be a 5/5 artifact creature ends. If such an effect tries to turn an instant or sorcery card face up, reveal that card and it stays face down. In that case, it remains a 5/5 artifact creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The artifact retains any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has. Notably, if an Equipment becomes an artifact creature, it can’t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The artifact stops being a creature immediately before your turn begins. It will be a noncreature artifact during your untap step.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The resulting artifact creature will be able to attack on your turn if it’s been under your control continuously since the turn began. That is, it doesn’t matter how long it’s been a creature, just how long it’s been on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may look at face-down permanents you control at any time.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Casting a Zombie card from your graveyard once Liliana’s third ability has resolved follows the normal rules for casting that card. You must pay its costs, and you must follow all applicable timing rules.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Liliana’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life and you gain 2 life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once Liliana’s third ability has resolved, any Zombie cards in your graveyard may be cast this turn, including Zombie cards that enter your graveyard later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The value of X is determined only as Liliana’s second ability resolves. If the number of Zombies you control changes later, the target creature’s power and toughness won’t change.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Damage from a source with infect has no effect on an affected creature or player. No -1/-1 counters are put on creatures, and no damage is marked on them. Players don’t get poison counters and they don’t lose life. The damage is still dealt for purposes of effects that care about damage, such as lifelink.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Damage from a source with wither has no effect on an affected creature. No -1/-1 counters are put on them, and no damage is marked on them. The damage is still dealt for purposes of effects that care about damage, such as lifelink.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a replacement effect allows a player to modify or replace an event by putting counters on a creature or player affected by Suncleanser, that player may apply that replacement effect, but they won’t get counters. If the original event is entirely replaced (such as by applying Soul-Scar Mage’s replacement effect), the original event won’t happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the cost of an ability or an additional cost of a spell requires putting counters on a creature or player affected by Suncleanser, that cost can’t be paid. If a resolving spell or ability says that a player may give counters to that creature or player, that player can’t choose to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'While resolving a cumulative upkeep trigger of an affected creature, you’ll fail to put a counter on that permanent, then you may pay for the age counters already on it. If it has no age counters on it, you may pay {0}.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Druid of Horns’s ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. The ability resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each of the triggered abilities of Sarkhan’s Unsealing resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature card’s power is written as * and an ability defines its power, that ability applies while the creature spell is on the stack. Sarkhan’s unsealing checks its power only as you finish paying costs; it doesn’t matter what the spell’s power is as you begin to cast it or when the triggered ability resolves.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a creature spell that will enter the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters, such as Hungering Hydra, those counters aren’t considered when determining whether either ability of Sarkhan’s Unsealing triggers. Similarly, effects that will raise the creature’s power once it has entered the battlefield won’t apply.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the last ability of Sarkhan’s Unsealing causes the opposing team to lose 8 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Each time Patient Rebuilding’s triggered ability resolves, it counts only the land cards put into that graveyard during that ability’s resolution. For example, if your opponent puts two land cards into their graveyard during one upkeep and three land cards the next, you’ll draw two and three cards, respectively, not two and five.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your opponent moves cards from their library but they aren’t put into their graveyard (perhaps because you control Rest in Peace), you won’t draw any cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'For Liliana’s last ability, the creatures you’ll return to the battlefield are chosen after the target creatures are destroyed. No player may take actions between the time you choose two creature cards to return and the time they’re returned. The destroyed cards can be among those returned to the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If any abilities trigger on the target creatures being destroyed, those abilities won’t be put onto the stack until after you’ve put creature cards onto the battlefield from graveyards.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a multiplayer game, if a player leaves the game, all cards that player owns leave as well. If you leave the game, any permanents you control from Liliana’s third ability that came from other players’ graveyards are exiled.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may activate Liliana’s last ability without choosing any target creatures. You’ll just put up to two creature cards onto the battlefield from graveyards. However, if you choose any targets and all of those targets become illegal before the ability tries to resolve, the ability won’t resolve and you won’t put any cards onto the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Gaining control of a creature doesn’t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If one of the target creatures is an illegal target when Switcheroo resolves, the exchange won’t happen.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the same player controls both creatures when Switcheroo resolves, nothing happens.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t have to control either target.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Giving a creature flying after it’s already been blocked won’t change or undo that block. If you want to affect what can block the creature, you must cast Mighty Leap during the declare attackers step at the latest.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Metamorphic Alteration somehow enters the battlefield at the same time as another creature, it can’t have the enchanted creature become a copy of that creature. You may choose only a creature that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is a token, Metamorphic Alteration copies the original characteristics of that token as stated by the effect that put the token onto the battlefield. The enchanted creature doesn’t become a token in this case.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature is copying something else (for example, if the chosen creature is enchanted by another Metamorphic Alteration), then the enchanted creature becomes a copy of whatever the chosen creature copied.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen creature isn’t normally a creature (for example, if the chosen creature is an animated Treetop Village), the enchanted creature becomes a copy of that noncreature permanent. This causes Metamorphic Alteration to be illegally attached, and it’s put into its owner’s graveyard. The previously enchanted creature returns to being itself.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Metamorphic Alteration can cause a creature to become a copy of itself. This generally has no effect, but if that creature has a pair of linked abilities, the new abilities it has from the copy effect aren’t linked to the abilities it had before.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Metamorphic Alteration copies exactly what is printed on the chosen creature (unless that creature is copying something else or is a token; see below). It doesn’t copy whether that creature is tapped or untapped, whether it as any counters on it or any Auras and Equipment attached to it, or any non-copy effects that have changed its power, toughness, types, color, or so on.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The characteristics that will be copied are determined as Metamorphic Alteration’s effect first begins to apply. If the copiable values of the chosen creature change later, or if that creature leaves the battlefield, the enchanted creature’s characteristics are unaffected.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The copiable values granted by Metamorphic Alteration are locked in as the creature is chosen. The enchanted creature won’t change if the chosen creature’s copiable values change.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The enchanted creature will be a copy of the chosen creature as it dies, so any “when this creature dies” abilities it gains from the copy effect will trigger. Any “when this creature dies” abilities it normally has will not trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can choose only a creature on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Mistcaller enters the battlefield at the same time as other creatures, its ability can’t be activated in time to affect those creatures.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Mistcaller’s ability doesn’t stop creature tokens from entering the battlefield. It also doesn’t affect creatures that are already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Mistcaller’s ability won’t affect any nontoken creatures that were cast, including ones cast from unusual zones such as your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Palladia-Mors leaves the battlefield and returns, it’s considered a new object, even if it’s represented by the same card. It has hexproof again until it deals damage.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a triggered ability triggers at the same time that Paladia-Mors deals damage for the first time, targets are chosen for that ability after Palladia-Mors no longer has hexproof.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If Phylactery Lich and an artifact are entering the battlefield under your control at the same time, you can’t put a phylactery counter on that artifact. You must choose an artifact you control that’s already on the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you control no artifacts as Phylactery Lich enters the battlefield, its first ability won’t do anything. As soon as it enters the battlefield, its last ability will trigger (unless you control some other permanent with a phylactery counter on it) and you’ll have to sacrifice it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Phylactery Lich’s first ability doesn’t target the artifact. No player may take actions between the time you choose an artifact and the time you put a phylactery counter on it.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Phylactery Lich’s last ability checks your permanents for any phylactery counters, not just the specific one that it caused you to put on an artifact. For example, if you control two Phylactery Liches and two different artifacts with phylactery counters, neither Phylactery Lich will be sacrificed if one of those artifacts leaves the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Phylactery Lich’s last ability is a “state trigger.” Once a state trigger triggers, it won’t trigger again as long as the ability is on the stack. If the ability is countered and the trigger condition is still true, it will immediately trigger again.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a Vivien planeswalker and Vivien’s Jaguar are both dealt lethal damage at the same time (most likely in combat), they’ll be put into their owner’s graveyard at the same time. You won’t be able to activate the last ability of Vivien’s Jaguar before Vivien leaves the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a card in your graveyard has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a creature the defending player controls can’t block the target creature for any reason (such as being tapped), then it doesn’t block that creature. If there’s a cost associated with having a creature block the attacking creature, the defending player isn’t forced to pay that cost, so it doesn’t have to block in that case either.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a permanent has {X} in its mana cost, X is considered to be 0.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the revealed card is a land, you can play it only if it’s your turn and you haven’t yet played a land this turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you wish to play the exiled card, you must play it while the last ability of Djinn of Wishes is resolving. You can’t play it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn’t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as “Cast this spell only during combat”) are enforced.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs, such as kicker costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once you cast Omniscience, if it’s your turn, you’ll have priority immediately after it resolves. You can cast another spell before any player can attempt to remove Omniscience with spells or abilities.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must follow the normal timing permissions and restrictions of each spell you cast.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability an opponent controls causes you to make a choice and you choose to discard Ajani’s Last Stand, its last ability will trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If multiple creatures and/or planeswalkers you control die at the same time, the first ability of Ajani’s Last Stand triggers that many times. However, you can sacrifice it only once, so you’ll get only one token.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Magic game, cards are discarded only from a player’s hand. Effects that put cards from a player’s library into that player’s graveyard do not cause those cards to be discarded.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If a spell or ability causes you to put cards into your hand without specifically using the word “draw,” Psychic Corrosion’s ability won’t trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If another creature dies at the same time as Poison-Tip Archer does, each opponent loses 1 life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Poison-tip Archer’s last ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If any of the target permanents aren’t sacrificed (most likely because one of them became an illegal target, such as by gaining hexproof), that permanent’s controller won’t reveal the top card of their library or put it onto the battlefield.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If any player controls no permanents, Vaevictis’s ability won’t have sufficient legal targets, so it’s removed from the stack without any effect.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Vaevictis’s triggered ability resolves during the declare attackers step, before blockers are chosen. A creature targeted by its ability won’t be around to block, and creatures put onto the battlefield with its ability may be able to do so.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must target one of your permanents to sacrifice as well.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If either creature is an illegal target as Vivien’s second ability tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Vivien’s last ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t get +4/+4 or gain trample.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If multiple extra turns would be taken after this one, perhaps because more than one player has activated the last ability of their Magistrate’s Scepter, the most recently created one is taken first.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the chosen target is an illegal target when Sarkhan’s Dragonfire tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t look at the top five cards of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature this Aura would enchant is an illegal target by the time Knightly Valor tries to resolve, the Aura spell doesn’t resolve. It won’t enter the battlefield, so its ability won’t trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You need a creature for Knightly Valor to target as you cast it. There’s no way to have it enter the battlefield attached to the Knight token it’ll create.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature you put onto the battlefield leaves the battlefield before damage is dealt, its last known existence on the battlefield is used to determine how much damage it deals to the target creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You don’t choose any targets as you cast Vivien’s Invocation. While that spell is resolving, you may put a creature card from among the cards you look at onto the battlefield. If you do, a separate ability triggers and you pick a target creature an opponent controls to be dealt damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the creature’s power is negative, you don’t lose or gain life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The amount of life gained is equal to the power of the creature as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the exiled card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If the opponent exiles their entire library without exiling an instant or sorcery card, that player stops exiling cards, and the exiled cards are put into their library in a random order.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you cast a card "without paying its mana cost," you can\\\'t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the card has any mandatory additional costs, such as that of Tormenting Voice, those must be paid to cast the card.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "If you don\'t cast the exiled instant or sorcery card, it\'s put on the bottom of that library with the other cards."}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': \'If you wish to cast the exiled card, you must cast it while Chaos Wand\\\'s ability is resolving. You can\\\'t cast it later in the turn. A spell cast this way may be cast at a time you normally wouldn\\\'t be able to cast a spell of that type, but other restrictions (such as "Cast this spell only during combat") are enforced.\'}, {\'date\': \'2018-07-13\', \'text\': "The opponent stops exiling cards as soon as they exile any instant or sorcery card. You don\'t choose which card type to look for."}]', "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the second ability does trigger, but you no longer control four Demons with different names as the ability resolves, you won’t win the game.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control four Demons with different names as your upkeep begins, the second ability of Liliana’s Contract won’t trigger. You can’t take any actions during your turn before your upkeep begins.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target by the time Invoke the Divine tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}, {'date': '2021-02-05', 'text': 'If the target artifact or enchantment is an illegal target as Invoke the Divine tries to resolve, it won’t resolve and none of its effects will happen. You won’t gain 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target creature is a legal target but can’t be destroyed, most likely because it has indestructible, its controller gets an Ox token and gets to keep that creature.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Transmogrifying Wand’s ability tries to resolve, the ability doesn’t resolve. No player creates an Ox token.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Lich’s Caress tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain any life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target when Nightmare’s Thirst tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t gain 1 life.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Nightmare’s Thirst counts how much life you’ve gained this turn, not how much your life total changed. For example, if you’ve gained 5 life and lost 8 before Nightmare’s Thirst resolves, Nightmare’s Thirst has you gain 1 more life, then it gives the target creature -6/-6.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If the top card of your library isn’t a land card, or if you choose not to reveal it, it remains on top of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you didn’t gain life during the turn before the end step begins, Regal Bloodlord’s last ability won’t trigger at all. Gaining life during the end step won’t cause the ability to trigger.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t satisfy Regal Bloodlord’s last ability, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Regal Bloodlord’s last ability checks if you gained life at any point during the turn. It doesn’t matter if you also lost life or whether your life total is greater than it was at the beginning of the turn. It also doesn’t matter whether Regal Bloodlord was on the battlefield when the life gain happened.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You create only one Bat token, no matter how much life you gained.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control three or more creatures as Leonin Vanguard’s ability resolves, the ability does nothing. However, if you do control three or more creatures as it resolves, the +1/+1 bonus doesn’t stop applying if you no longer control three creatures later in the turn.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you don’t control three or more creatures as your combat phase begins, Leonin Vanguard’s ability won’t trigger at all. Causing a permanent to become a creature during the beginning of combat step won’t cause Leonin Vanguard’s ability to trigger.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you have no other cards in hand, you’ll have to discard one of the creature cards you return to your hand.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may cast Macabre Waltz targeting one or zero creature cards. You’ll still discard a card, even if you target no creature cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If you put a permanent onto the battlefield with Tezzeret’s emblem’s ability, any triggered abilities of that permanent that trigger during your end step won’t trigger during that same end step.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'If your life total is brought to 0 or less at the same time that Tattered Mummy is dealt lethal damage, you lose the game before its triggered ability goes on the stack.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, the triggered ability of Tattered Mummy causes the opposing team to lose 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Infectious Horror’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 4 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Sarkhan’s first ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Vampire Neonate’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 2 life and you to gain 1 life.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Inferno Hellion’s owner shuffles it into their library only if it’s on the battlefield as its last ability resolves.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'It doesn’t matter who controls the creature with flying or which player or planeswalker that creature is attacking. Windreader Sphinx’s controller is the player who may draw a card.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The creature must have flying immediately after being declared as an attacking creature in order for Windreader Sphinx’s ability to trigger. For example, attacking with Kitesail Corsair will cause the ability to trigger, and attacking with Pegasus Courser and a creature without flying will cause the ability to trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Windreader Sphinx’s ability will trigger when it itself attacks.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Lena’s last ability affects only creatures you control with the appropriate power at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won’t gain indestructible, and a creature you control whose power increases later in the turn won’t lose indestructible.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The number of nontoken creatures you control is counted only as Lena’s first ability resolves. If Lena is still on the battlefield (and not somehow a token), it will count itself.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'To determine which creatures gain indestructible while resolving Lena’s last ability, use Lena’s power as it last existed on the battlefield.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Nexus of Fate’s last ability applies if it would be put into a graveyard in any way, including while it’s resolving.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once Brawl-Bash Ogre’s triggered ability begins to resolve, no player may take actions until it’s done. Notably, players can’t try to deal damage to Brawl-Bash Ogre after you’ve sacrificed a creature but before it gets +2/+2.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'While resolving the triggered ability of Brawl-Bash Ogre, you can’t sacrifice multiple creatures to give it +2/+2 more than once.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once Novice Knight has attacked, it will remain in combat even if it’s no longer enchanted or equipped.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Once the enchanted creature is destroyed, the attacking creature won’t assign or deal combat damage unless it has trample or is being blocked by another creature.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Plague Mare’s second ability affects only creatures your opponents control at the time it resolves. Creatures they begin to control later in the turn won’t get -1/-1.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Players can respond only after Blood Divination has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast Blood Divination; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Players can respond only after Demon of Catastrophes has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast Demon of Catastrophes; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Players can respond only once Thud has been cast and all its costs have been paid. No one can try to destroy the creature you sacrificed to prevent you from casting this spell.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The sacrificed creature’s last known existence on the battlefield is checked to determine its power.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must sacrifice exactly one creature to cast Thud; you can’t cast it without sacrificing a creature, and you can’t sacrifice additional creatures.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Psychic Symbiont’s last ability can target an opponent with no cards in hand. You’ll draw a card even if no opponent discards a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Satyr Enchanter’s triggered ability resolves before the spell that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Skyrider Patrol’s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may pay {G}{U}. If you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target creature. This is different from abilities that say “If you do . . .” in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after mana is paid but before the target receives a counter and flying.'}, {'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'While resolving the triggered ability of Skyrider Patrol, you can’t pay {G}{U} multiple times to give more than one +1/+1 counter.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The number of Goblins you control is counted only as Volley Veteran’s ability resolves. If Volley Veteran is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The number of creatures you control is counted only as Dwarven Priest’s ability resolves. If Dwarven Priest is still on the battlefield, it will count itself.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'The second part of Sleep’s ability affects all creatures the targeted player controls as Sleep resolves, not only the ones that Sleep actually caused to become tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'Thorn Lieutenant’s triggered ability resolves before the spell or ability that caused it to trigger. It resolves even if that spell or ability is countered.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You can’t cast Ajani’s Influence without a target creature. If the target creature is an illegal target when Ajani’s Influence tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t look at the top five cards of your library.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You create one Bat token each time Desecrated Tomb’s ability triggers, no matter how many cards left your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You may cast Liliana’s Spoils targeting any opponent, even one who has no cards in hand. You’ll perform the actions of its second ability even if the target opponent can’t discard a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You must discard exactly one card to cast Tormenting Voice; you can’t cast it without discarding a card, and you can’t discard additional cards.'}]", "[{'date': '2018-07-13', 'text': 'You sacrifice the lands as part of the resolution of Scapeshift. It isn’t an additional cost. If Scapeshift is countered, you won’t sacrifice any lands.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Act of Treason can target any creature, even one that\'s untapped or one you already control."}, {\'date\': \'2019-07-12\', \'text\': "Gaining control of a creature doesn\'t cause you to gain control of any Auras or Equipment attached to it."}]', "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A creature losing vigilance after it has attacked (most likely because Serra’s Guardian leaves the battlefield) won’t cause it to become tapped.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'A creature spell that can’t be countered is a legal target for Bone to Ash. The creature spell won’t be countered when Bone to Ash resolves, but you’ll still draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Because it doesn’t modify the characteristics of creatures, Tectonic Rift can affect creatures that enter the battlefield or lose flying after the spell resolves, and it will stop affecting creatures that gain flying.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target land is an illegal target by the time Tectonic Rift tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. Creatures without flying will be able to block as normal. If the target is legal but not destroyed (most likely because it has indestructible), creatures without flying will be unable to block.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Epicure of Blood’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, Epicure of Blood’s ability causes the opposing team to lose 1 life twice.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'The ability of Epicure of Blood triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Impassioned Orator or 4 life from Dawning Angel. If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something or “equal to the number” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Epicure of Blood triggers only once.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Gravewaker’s ability can be activated only while it’s on the battlefield. It can’t return itself from your graveyard.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If either creature is an illegal target as Rabid Bite tries to resolve, the creature you control won’t deal damage.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'If the target creature is an illegal target by the time Befuddle tries to resolve, the spell doesn’t resolve. You won’t draw a card.'}]", "[{'date': '2019-07-12', 'text': 'Once Frilled Sea Serpent has been blocked, activating its ability won’t change or undo that block.'}]", "[{'date': '2020-04-17', 'text': 'If Bristling Boar gains menace, it can’t be blocked at all.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "Crash Through affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t gain trample."}, {\'date\': \'2020-06-23\', \'text\': "You may cast Crash Through even if you control no creatures. If you control no creatures as the spell resolves, you\'ll just draw a card."}]', "[{'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'If Infernal Scarring and the enchanted creature are destroyed at the same time, the player will draw a card.'}, {'date': '2020-06-23', 'text': 'The player who controlled the creature when it died is the one who will draw a card.'}]", '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Angel of the Dawn\'s triggered ability affects only creatures you control at the time it resolves. Creatures you begin to control later in the turn won\'t get +1/+1 or gain vigilance."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Effects that modify a creature\'s power and/or toughness, such as the ones created by Titanic Growth or a +/1+1 counter, will apply to the creature no matter when they started to take effect. The same is true for any counters that change its power and/or toughness and effects that switch power and toughness."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If an Equipment becomes an artifact creature, it usually can\'t be attached to another creature. If it was attached to a creature, it becomes unattached."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the artifact was already a creature, its base power and toughness will each become 5. This overwrites any previous effects that set the creature\'s base power and toughness to specific values. Any power- or toughness-setting effects that start to apply after Skilled Animator\'s ability resolves will overwrite this effect."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "Skilled Animator doesn\'t remove any abilities the target artifact has."}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'The artifact retains any types, subtypes, or supertypes it has.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "The resulting artifact creature will be able to attack on your turn if it\'s been under your control continuously since the turn began. That is, it doesn\'t matter how long it\'s been a creature, just how long it\'s been on the battlefield."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "If the target land is an illegal target by the time Gift of Paradise tries to resolve, it doesn\'t resolve. It won\'t enter the battlefield, so its enters-the-battlefield ability won\'t trigger."}]', '[{\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': \'Sparktongue Dragon\\\'s triggered ability goes on the stack without a target. While that ability is resolving, you may pay {2}{R}. If you do, a second ability triggers and you pick a target that will be dealt damage. This is different from abilities that say "If you do . . ." in that players may cast spells and activate abilities after mana is paid but before damage is dealt.\'}, {\'date\': \'2020-11-10\', \'text\': "While resolving the triggered ability of Sparktongue Dragon, you can\'t pay {2}{R} multiple times to have it deal more than 3 damage."}]', "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Arcades’s last ability doesn’t actually change any creature’s power. It changes only the amount of combat damage it assigns. All other rules and effects that check power or toughness use the real values. For example, Rabid Bite won’t cause a creature with defender to deal damage equal to its toughness.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Arcades leaves the battlefield after a creature with defender has attacked, that creature remains an attacking creature, although it will assign damage equal to its power.'}]", "[{'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'Each creature with lifelink dealing combat damage causes a separate life-gaining event. For example, if two creatures you control with lifelink deal combat damage at the same time, Ajani’s Pridemate’s ability will trigger twice. However, if a single creature you control with lifelink deals combat damage to multiple creatures, players, and/or planeswalkers at the same time (perhaps because it has trample or was blocked by more than one creature), the ability will trigger only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If Ajani’s Pridemate is dealt lethal damage at the same time that you gain life, it won’t receive a counter from its ability in time to save it.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'If you gain an amount of life “for each” of something, that life is gained as one event and the ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers only once.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'In a Two-Headed Giant game, life gained by your teammate won’t cause the ability to trigger, even though it caused your team’s life total to increase.'}, {'date': '2021-03-19', 'text': 'The ability of Ajani’s Pridemate triggers just once for each life-gaining event, whether it’s 1 life from Paradise Plume or 2 life from Mycologist.'}]"]
foreign_names: ['[{\'name\': \'Abbrechen\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Zauberspruch deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich entscheide, was mir im Wege steht."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447465&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98124ab7-29e6-46c4-b65c-21b179f15fbb\', \'multiverseId\': 447465}, \'multiverseid\': 447465}, {\'name\': \'Deshacer\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Yo decido lo que me detiene".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447746&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'aabad0c0-305a-4a06-b942-bb9b84863162\', \'multiverseId\': 447746}, \'multiverseid\': 447746}, {\'name\': \'Révocation\', \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Je décide de ce qui me barre la route. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448027&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ecab09f8-d5cb-4642-9db9-c175b4c7e8fe\', \'multiverseId\': 448027}, \'multiverseid\': 448027}, {\'name\': \'Eliminare\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Sono io a decidere gli ostacoli sul mio percorso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448308&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a31f7eb5-595f-4088-bc52-280b9bc23bdc\', \'multiverseId\': 448308}, \'multiverseid\': 448308}, {\'name\': \'取り消し\', \'text\': \'呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「私を阻むものは、私が決める。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44b9ffdc-17fe-4be7-891b-ad612aaae689\', \'multiverseId\': 448589}, \'multiverseid\': 448589}, {\'name\': \'주문 취소\', \'text\': \'주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"뭐가 나를 방해하는지는 내가 정해."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448870&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0837bda-d662-4269-9a9a-1ed19d8b8664\', \'multiverseId\': 448870}, \'multiverseid\': 448870}, {\'name\': \'Cancelar\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Eu decido o que fica em meu caminho."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449151&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2e15878-4690-4a5f-9c1a-d5a03c31a0fe\', \'multiverseId\': 449151}, \'multiverseid\': 449151}, {\'name\': \'Отмена\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Я сама решаю, чему стоять у меня на пути».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f792442-81f4-4d50-b7b0-16bfb34e1e03\', \'multiverseId\': 449432}, \'multiverseid\': 449432}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反击目标咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「谁能阻挠由我来定。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449713&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b27e642-c647-49db-9d6c-cdf971dde416\', \'multiverseId\': 449713}, \'multiverseid\': 449713}, {\'name\': \'取消\', \'text\': \'反擊目標咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「誰能阻撓由我來定。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449994&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2e9c629-d8c3-491d-8870-a16b00dce2a2\', \'multiverseId\': 449994}, \'multiverseid\': 449994}]', '[{\'name\': \'Abnorme Zähigkeit\', \'text\': \'Bis zum Ende des Zuges erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+0 und „Wenn diese Kreatur stirbt, bringe sie unter der Kontrolle ihres Besitzers getappt ins Spiel zurück."\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Hoffnung stirbt zuletzt, die Beharrlichkeit überdauert.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447502&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ddd6057-331e-441a-938b-207df11d6997\', \'multiverseId\': 447502}, \'multiverseid\': 447502}, {\'name\': \'Resistencia anormal\', \'text\': \'Hasta el final del turno, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana "Cuando esta criatura muera, regrésala al campo de batalla girada bajo el control de su propietario".\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La tenacidad se impone, incluso cuando ya murió toda esperanza.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447783&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'54c4ed82-363b-40c9-8483-79b23275ebbf\', \'multiverseId\': 447783}, \'multiverseid\': 447783}, {\'name\': \'Endurance anormale\', \'text\': "Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, la créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert « Quand cette créature meurt, renvoyez-la sur le champ de bataille, engagée, sous le contrôle de son propriétaire. »", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "La ténacité prédomine quand l\'espoir s\'envole.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448064&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866ee0ae-e6f4-4c3b-9605-febfff449965\', \'multiverseId\': 448064}, \'multiverseid\': 448064}, {\'name\': \'Resistenza Anomala\', \'text\': \'Fino alla fine del turno, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha "Quando questa creatura muore, rimettila sul campo di battaglia TAPpata sotto il controllo del suo proprietario".\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando la speranza viene meno, la tenacia prende il sopravvento.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448345&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1352a649-d983-4cbc-98f6-a7148f372751\', \'multiverseId\': 448345}, \'multiverseid\': 448345}, {\'name\': \'異様な忍耐\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、「このクリーチャーが死亡したとき、これをオーナーのコントロール下でタップ状態で戦場に戻す。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'希望が息絶えても執念は残る。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448626&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e38e8c8-8f29-4c54-af60-1b635c9b1a60\', \'multiverseId\': 448626}, \'multiverseid\': 448626}, {\'name\': \'초월적인 인내력\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 턴종료까지, 그 생물은 +2/+0을 받고 "이 생물이 죽을 때, 이 생물을 소유자의 조종하에 탭된 채로 전장으로 되돌린다."를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'희망이 사라지면 고집이 남는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448907&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a003b6ef-68ed-42db-b850-79df690b4867\', \'multiverseId\': 448907}, \'multiverseid\': 448907}, {\'name\': \'Resistência Anormal\', \'text\': \'Até o final do turno, a criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha "Quando esta criatura morrer, devolva-a ao campo de batalha virada sob o controle de seu dono.".\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'A tenacidade prevalece quando a esperança morre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449188&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'651f6538-af29-47af-917c-3942a40cd5b1\', \'multiverseId\': 449188}, \'multiverseid\': 449188}, {\'name\': \'Невероятная Выносливость\', \'text\': \'До конца хода целевое существо получает +2/+0 и способность «Когда это существо умирает, верните его на поле битвы повернутым под контролем его владельца».\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Упорство торжествует там, где умирают надежды.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449469&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e046b893-a184-4f0c-bb6d-16de38dfb5fc\', \'multiverseId\': 449469}, \'multiverseid\': 449469}, {\'name\': \'异常耐力\', \'text\': \'直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得「当此生物死去时，将它在其拥有者的操控下横置移回战场。」\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'希望逝去之后，便靠不屈求存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449750&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ed725df-275a-4b73-950d-193c1a8386a9\', \'multiverseId\': 449750}, \'multiverseid\': 449750}, {\'name\': \'異常耐力\', \'text\': \'直到回合結束，目標生物得+2/+0且獲得「當此生物死去時，將它在其擁有者的操控下橫置移回戰場。」\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'希望逝去之後，便靠不屈求存。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450031&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'15150704-a6b6-4cd3-a17c-6699b30452de\', \'multiverseId\': 450031}, \'multiverseid\': 450031}]', '[{\'name\': \'Absturz\', \'text\': \'Zerstöre eine fliegende Kreatur deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Nur der Wind soll die Luft beherrschen."\\n—Dejara, Druide aus dem Güldenwald\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447610&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6142ea3a-7bb9-43e1-9f5a-a36a39280042\', \'multiverseId\': 447610}, \'multiverseid\': 447610}, {\'name\': \'En picado\', \'text\': \'Destruye la criatura objetivo con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Que no haya nada en los cielos, salvo el viento".\\n—Dejara, druida de Madera Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447891&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'011446ca-5854-4320-8b3b-85a2e50cd969\', \'multiverseId\': 447891}, \'multiverseid\': 447891}, {\'name\': \'Tomber à pic\', \'text\': \'Détruisez une créature avec le vol ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': \'« Seul le vent doit contrôler les cieux. »\\n—Dejara, druide de Boisdoré\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448172&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69fc6397-9d2a-41b7-bbbc-6ca79d1b5e34\', \'multiverseId\': 448172}, \'multiverseid\': 448172}, {\'name\': \'Cadere a Picco\', \'text\': \'Distruggi una creatura bersaglio con volare.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non lasciare che nulla possieda i cieli se non il vento."\\n—Dejara, druida di Boscodorato\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b63ef8-222e-4cd5-85e9-78224a220913\', \'multiverseId\': 448453}, \'multiverseid\': 448453}, {\'name\': \'垂直落下\', \'text\': \'飛行を持つクリーチャー１体を対象とし、それを破壊する。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「空にあるべきは風のみとしよう。」\\n――黄金森のドルイド、デジャーラ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448734&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'278a1b9b-15bf-48ee-95a3-d84f44d74257\', \'multiverseId\': 448734}, \'multiverseid\': 448734}, {\'name\': \'급추락\', \'text\': \'비행을 가진 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물을 파괴한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"바람 외에는 그 무엇도 하늘을 날지 못하게 하라."\\n—금박숲 드루이드 데자라\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449015&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c9bd3ceb-e88b-4fe3-bde0-e09ccd355c1c\', \'multiverseId\': 449015}, \'multiverseid\': 449015}, {\'name\': \'Tombar\', \'text\': \'Destrua a criatura alvo com voar.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Que nada além do vento domine o céu."\\n— Dejara, druida de Tronco Dourado\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'683fdf5e-c1ac-4f40-b681-7f5cc7db5372\', \'multiverseId\': 449296}, \'multiverseid\': 449296}, {\'name\': \'Стремительное Падение\', \'text\': \'Уничтожьте целевое существо с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Пусть ничто не владеет небесами, кроме ветра».\\n— Дежара, друид Золоченого Леса\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449577&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3561233-5c92-472f-8ee9-a8b1a4fd3e4c\', \'multiverseId\': 449577}, \'multiverseid\': 449577}, {\'name\': \'铅直落下\', \'text\': \'消灭目标具飞行异能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「风该是天空唯一的主人。」\\n～金林德鲁伊笛贾拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'941f322c-d660-47db-837b-53013ec4ac41\', \'multiverseId\': 449858}, \'multiverseid\': 449858}, {\'name\': \'鉛直落下\', \'text\': \'消滅目標具飛行異能的生物。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「風該是天空唯一的主人。」\\n～金林德魯伊笛賈拉\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450139&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'755e4fc2-35ee-4d27-b483-2dffc4de968d\', \'multiverseId\': 450139}, \'multiverseid\': 450139}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aderlassender Wolkenläufer\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Aderlassende Wolkenläufer ins Spiel kommt, verliert ein Gegner deiner Wahl 1 Lebenspunkt und du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'Aus den Rauchschwaden über dem Schiff trat eine Gestalt hervor, deren Blick nichts Gutes erahnen ließ.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447536&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa559fac-55b9-4127-88de-51dc4372c820\', \'multiverseId\': 447536}, \'multiverseid\': 447536}, {\'name\': \'Huesteceleste derramasangre\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Huesteceleste derramasangre entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo pierde 1 vida y tú ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Del humo perpetuo que acompañaba al barco surgió una forma silenciosa, con los labios curvados en una mueca de malignidad y expectación.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91da0b78-84b1-4d16-b280-45409d1d9e80\', \'multiverseId\': 447817}, \'multiverseid\': 447817}, {\'name\': \'Gravesang marcheciel\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Gravesang marcheciel arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'adversaire ciblé perd 1 point de vie et vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : vampire et soldat\', \'flavor\': "Une figure aux lèvres grimaçant de malveillance et d\'impatience émergea silencieusement de la brume noire flottant au-dessus du navire.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448098&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0475ac4c-1ff6-48a8-9823-433a8385a34c\', \'multiverseId\': 448098}, \'multiverseid\': 448098}, {\'name\': \'Aerofante Dissanguatore\', \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Aerofante Dissanguatore entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio perde 1 punto vita e tu guadagni 1 punto vita.", \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'Dal perenne vapore di oscurità che aleggiava sulla nave emerse una figura silenziosa, con le labbra arricciate in un ghigno di crudele esaltazione.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448379&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdac0861-c472-47a6-8af2-12d8e562abda\', \'multiverseId\': 448379}, \'multiverseid\': 448379}, {\'name\': \'流血の空渡り\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n流血の空渡りが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは１点のライフを失い、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'その船に常に漂う影煙から物言わぬ姿が現れ、口元に悪意と期待の表情を浮かべた。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448660&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19213c06-02d6-487d-93b1-4ed72d425f88\', \'multiverseId\': 448660}, \'multiverseid\': 448660}, {\'name\': \'하늘진군 방혈자\', \'text\': \'비행\\n하늘진군 방혈자가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 상대는 생명 1점을 잃고 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀 병사\', \'flavor\': \'배 위를 끊임없이 맴도는 암흑의 연무 속에서, 악의와 기대감으로 입술을 비죽거리는 말 없는 형체가 모습을 드러냈다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448941&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5f6a0c1-1356-4655-a45f-6f6d9637090d\', \'multiverseId\': 448941}, \'multiverseid\': 448941}, {\'name\': \'Flebotomista da Marcha Celeste\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Flebotomista da Marcha Celeste entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo perde 1 ponto de vida e você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'Da perpétua fumaça sombria que pairava sobre o navio emergiu uma forma silenciosa, com um sorriso maligno e cheio de expectativa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449222&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e50b6272-46fa-4f86-8065-8c4be8bc19ff\', \'multiverseId\': 449222}, \'multiverseid\': 449222}, {\'name\': \'Кровопускатель Небесного Марша\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Кровопускатель Небесного Марша выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент теряет 1 жизнь, а вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'Из непроницаемого тумана теней, нависшего над кораблем, появилась безмолвная фигура с гримасой злобы и предвкушения на лице.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449503&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7da293cb-8a61-4225-be81-7e09e46ee829\', \'multiverseId\': 449503}, \'multiverseid\': 449503}, {\'name\': \'血文天行客\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当血文天行客进战场时，目标对手失去1点生命且你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'船顶经久不散的影雾之中突然浮现出一个沉默身影。他嘴角轻微上扬，似不怀好意，又带有期许。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5ab4d93-ea9e-49e7-b412-f7857cab4d93\', \'multiverseId\': 449784}, \'multiverseid\': 449784}, {\'name\': \'血文天行客\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當血文天行客進戰場時，目標對手失去1點生命且你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'船頂經久不散的影霧之中突然浮現出一個沉默身影。他嘴角輕微上揚，似不懷好意，又帶有期許。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450065&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9278d845-c20b-49ba-9091-1a6d0d6f1968\', \'multiverseId\': 450065}, \'multiverseid\': 450065}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aggressives Mammut\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden (Diese Kreatur kann überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)\\nAndere Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elefant\', \'flavor\': \'„Nähere dich von hinten. So bist du wenigstens nicht im Weg, falls es losrennt."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450283&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'341ebf75-f253-4d11-bda7-8970bb550ebb\', \'multiverseId\': 450283}, \'multiverseid\': 450283}, {\'name\': \'Mamut agresivo\', \'text\': \'Arrolla. (Esta criatura puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker al que ataca.)\\nLas otras criaturas que controlas tienen la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Es mejor acercarse desde atrás. Así, si embiste, al menos no estarás frente a él".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'71ccdca2-fd1c-4c6f-853c-ff9edd60bd50\', \'multiverseId\': 450317}, \'multiverseid\': 450317}, {\'name\': \'Mammouth agressif\', \'text\': "Piétinement (Cette créature peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.)\\nLes autres créatures que vous contrôlez ont le piétinement.", \'type\': \'Créature : éléphant\', \'flavor\': "« Approchez par l\'arrière. Comme ça, s\'il charge, vous ne serez pas en première ligne. »\\n—Vivien Reid", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450351&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2dbce2a0-c606-4190-acc1-cc299c1f8b8e\', \'multiverseId\': 450351}, \'multiverseid\': 450351}, {\'name\': \'Mammut Aggressivo\', \'text\': \'Travolgere (Questa creatura può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.)\\nLe altre creature che controlli hanno travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Avvicinati da dietro. Così, se carica, non ti ritroverai davanti alla sua furia."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450385&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b98b9307-e35a-4888-8320-193331ca7782\', \'multiverseId\': 450385}, \'multiverseid\': 450385}, {\'name\': \'攻撃的なマンモス\', \'text\': \'トランプル（攻撃しているこのクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージを、これが攻撃しているプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）\\nあなたがコントロールしている他のクリーチャーはトランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 象\', \'flavor\': \'「後ろから近付くのよ。そうすれば、あれが突然動いても、真正面にいることだけは避けられるから。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'806fa0ce-4a07-4c88-8989-e162f6227949\', \'multiverseId\': 450419}, \'multiverseid\': 450419}, {\'name\': \'공격적인 매머드\', \'text\': \'돌진 (이 생물은 여분의 전투피해를 공격 중인 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 입힐 수 있다.)\\n당신이 조종하는 다른 생물들은 돌진을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 코끼리\', \'flavor\': \'"뒤에서 접근해. 그러면, 녀석이 달려들어도 최소한 앞에 있지는 않을 테니까."\\n—비비안 레이드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450453&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9b6f3efb-dbec-4fe8-8e21-cfc33de42dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 450453}, \'multiverseid\': 450453}, {\'name\': \'Mamute Agressivo\', \'text\': \'Atropelar (Esta criatura pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.)\\nAs outras criaturas que você controla têm atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elefante\', \'flavor\': \'"Aproxime-se por trás. Assim, se ele disparar, pelo menos você não está na frente dele."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea8d8c58-7cc1-4c0c-9249-ed8d285f30ea\', \'multiverseId\': 450487}, \'multiverseid\': 450487}, {\'name\': \'Агрессивный Мамонт\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар (Это существо может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker-у, которого атакует.)\\nДругие существа под вашим контролем имеют Пробивной удар.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Слон\', \'flavor\': \'«Подходи к нему сзади. Тогда, если он рванет, ты хотя бы не окажешься у него на пути».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'508effa8-affc-4d73-94a8-4940dd841b00\', \'multiverseId\': 450521}, \'multiverseid\': 450521}, {\'name\': \'猛袭长毛象\', \'text\': \'践踏（此生物造成之过量战斗伤害能对所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）\\n由你操控的其他生物具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': \'「从后方靠近。这样就算它暴冲，你也不会立刻遭殃。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450555&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9e10570a-af14-48f5-901f-7d8f20a80a19\', \'multiverseId\': 450555}, \'multiverseid\': 450555}, {\'name\': \'猛襲長毛象\', \'text\': \'踐踏（此生物造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對所攻擊的玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）\\n由你操控的其他生物具有踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～象\', \'flavor\': \'「從後方靠近。這樣就算牠暴衝，你也不會立刻遭殃。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450589&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'39676cda-5378-4ec2-a803-c443bd24c0f2\', \'multiverseId\': 450589}, \'multiverseid\': 450589}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani, Widersacher der Tyrannen\', \'text\': \'+1: Lege je eine +1/+1-Marke auf bis zu zwei Kreaturen deiner Wahl.\\n−2: Bringe eine Kreaturenkarte deiner Wahl mit umgewandelten Manakosten von 2 oder weniger aus deinem Friedhof ins Spiel zurück.\\n−7: Du erhältst ein Emblem mit „Erzeuge zu Beginn deines Endsegments drei 1/1 weiße Katze-Kreaturenspielsteine mit Lebensverknüpfung."\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447420&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d7c799e2-6ce8-41db-9be1-340ba6c5bf79\', \'multiverseId\': 447420}, \'multiverseid\': 447420}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, antagonista de tiranos\', \'text\': \'+1: Elige hasta dos criaturas objetivo y pon un contador +1/+1 sobre cada una.\\n−2: Regresa la carta de criatura objetivo con coste de maná convertido de 2 o menos de tu cementerio al campo de batalla.\\n−7: Obtienes un emblema con "Al comienzo de tu paso final, crea tres fichas de criatura Felino blancas 1/1 con la habilidad de vínculo vital".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'38a82eab-e071-4ce2-b6a2-bd05e852b583\', \'multiverseId\': 447701}, \'multiverseid\': 447701}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, adversaire des tyrans\', \'text\': "+1 : Ciblez jusqu\'à deux créatures. Mettez un marqueur +1/+1 sur chacune d\'elles.\\n-2 : Renvoyez sur le champ de bataille depuis votre cimetière une carte de créature ciblée avec un coût converti de mana inférieur ou égal à 2.\\n-7 : Vous gagnez un emblème avec « Au début de votre étape de fin, créez trois jetons de créature 1/1 blanche Chat avec le lien de vie. »", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447982&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30f58e9a-06c8-4f46-9707-a22004f04cff\', \'multiverseId\': 447982}, \'multiverseid\': 447982}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Avversario dei Tiranni\', \'text\': \'+1: Scegli fino a due creature bersaglio. Metti un segnalino +1/+1 su ciascuna di esse.\\n-2: Rimetti sul campo di battaglia una carta creatura bersaglio con costo di mana convertito pari o inferiore a 2 dal tuo cimitero.\\n-7: Ottieni un emblema con "All\\\'inizio della tua sottofase finale, crea tre pedine creatura Felino 1/1 bianche con legame vitale".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f53f2277-fdb5-4b22-bb47-0c94609d5cda\', \'multiverseId\': 448263}, \'multiverseid\': 448263}, {\'name\': \'暴君への敵対者、アジャニ\', \'text\': \'+1：クリーチャー最大２体を対象とし、それらの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをそれぞれ１個置く。\\n-2：あなたの墓地から点数で見たマナ・コストが２以下のクリーチャー・カード１枚を対象とし、それを戦場に戻す。\\n-7：あなたは「あなたの終了ステップの開始時に、絆魂を持つ白の１/１の猫・クリーチャー・トークンを３体生成する。」を持つ紋章を得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'983b19a2-befe-4aa3-b7d7-fa99907e02a4\', \'multiverseId\': 448544}, \'multiverseid\': 448544}, {\'name\': \'폭군의 적, 아자니\', \'text\': \'+1: 생물을 최대 두 개까지 목표로 정한다. 그 생물들에 각각 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓는다.\\n−2: 당신의 무덤에 있는 전환마나비용이 2 이하인 생물 카드를 목표로 정한다. 그 카드를 전장으로 되돌린다.\\n−7: 당신은 "당신의 종료단 시작에, 생명연결을 가진 1/1 백색 고양이 생물 토큰 세 개를 만든다."를 가진 휘장을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f4250ef-32cc-417b-b164-bbb9e2ea8be3\', \'multiverseId\': 448825}, \'multiverseid\': 448825}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Adversário dos Tiranos\', \'text\': \'+1: Coloque um marcador +1/+1 em cada uma de até duas criaturas alvo.\\n−2: Devolva o card de criatura alvo com custo de mana convertido igual ou inferior a 2 de seu cemitério para o campo de batalha.\\n−7: Você recebe um emblema com "No início de sua etapa final, crie três fichas de criatura branca 1/1 do tipo Felino com vínculo com a vida.".\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f5dde87-b12f-479e-9be9-4d90b0e7d013\', \'multiverseId\': 449106}, \'multiverseid\': 449106}, {\'name\': \'Аджани, Противник Тиранов\', \'text\': \'+1: положите один жетон +1/+1 на каждое из не более двух целевых существ.\\n−2: верните целевую карту существа с конвертированной мана-стоимостью не более 2 из вашего кладбища на поле битвы.\\n−7: вы получаете эмблему со способностью «В начале вашего заключительного шага создайте три фишки существа 1/1 белая Кошка с Цепью жизни».\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cdeb000-8648-4361-aa16-0a8d6e4e49a8\', \'multiverseId\': 449387}, \'multiverseid\': 449387}, {\'name\': \'抗暴阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多两个目标生物上各放置一个+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：将目标总法术力费用等于或小于2的生物牌从你的坟墓场移回战场。\\n−7：你获得具有「在你的结束步骤开始时，派出三个1/1白色，具系命异能的猫衍生生物」的徽记。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449668&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0a01ce7-ebb6-4457-9b10-2a6d54660dc8\', \'multiverseId\': 449668}, \'multiverseid\': 449668}, {\'name\': \'抗暴阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+1：在至多兩個目標生物上各放置一個+1/+1指示物。\\n−2：將目標總魔法力費用等於或小於2的生物牌從你的墳墓場移回戰場。\\n−7：你獲得具有「在你的結束步驟開始時，派出三個1/1白色，具繫命異能的貓衍生生物」的徽記。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449949&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8f44aa4-d546-403c-88c1-71f35b0048ca\', \'multiverseId\': 449949}, \'multiverseid\': 449949}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajani, weiser Berater\', \'text\': \'+2: Du erhältst für jede Kreatur, die du kontrollierst, 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n−3: Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +2/+2 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\n−9: Lege X +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl, wobei X gleich deinem Lebenspunktestand ist.\', \'type\': \'Legendärer Planeswalker — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450262&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11e433f9-f747-4a31-b16e-c00af087fc9a\', \'multiverseId\': 450262}, \'multiverseid\': 450262}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, consejero sabio\', \'text\': \'+2: Ganas 1 vida por cada criatura que controlas.\\n−3: Las criaturas que controlas obtienen +2/+2 hasta el final del turno.\\n−9: Pon X contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo, donde X es tu total de vidas.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker legendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450296&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f2ffbcc-c347-479e-b899-1f24c2667eca\', \'multiverseId\': 450296}, \'multiverseid\': 450296}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, sage conseiller\', \'text\': "+2 : Vous gagnez 1 point de vie pour chaque créature que vous contrôlez.\\n-3 : Les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +2/+2 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\n-9 : Mettez X marqueurs +1/+1 sur une créature ciblée, X étant votre total de points de vie.", \'type\': \'Planeswalker légendaire : Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450330&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'929dff31-a161-48f6-a524-f81986c175dc\', \'multiverseId\': 450330}, \'multiverseid\': 450330}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Saggio Consigliere\', \'text\': \'+2: Guadagni 1 punto vita per ogni creatura che controlli.\\n-3: Le creature che controlli prendono +2/+2 fino alla fine del turno.\\n-9: Metti X segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio, dove X è pari ai tuoi punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Leggendario — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450364&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c529cd35-028c-4b61-991c-babbf515c80c\', \'multiverseId\': 450364}, \'multiverseid\': 450364}, {\'name\': \'賢明な助言者、アジャニ\', \'text\': \'+2：あなたは、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体につき１点のライフを得る。\\n-3：ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋２/＋２の修整を受ける。\\n-9：クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターをＸ個置く。Ｘはあなたのライフ総量に等しい。\', \'type\': \'伝説のプレインズウォーカー — アジャニ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01a47f7c-7d64-499d-bd07-dce965bc21b8\', \'multiverseId\': 450398}, \'multiverseid\': 450398}, {\'name\': \'현명한 상담자, 아자니\', \'text\': \'+2: 당신은 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개당 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n−3: 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +2/+2를 받는다.\\n−9: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 올려놓는다. X는 당신의 생명 총점이다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 플레인즈워커 — 아자니\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450432&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2a59a76d-8933-495d-ab48-9526e85dc530\', \'multiverseId\': 450432}, \'multiverseid\': 450432}, {\'name\': \'Ajani, Conselheiro Sábio\', \'text\': \'+2: Você ganha 1 ponto de vida para cada criatura que você controla.\\n−3: As criaturas que você controla recebem +2/+2 até o final do turno.\\n−9: Coloque X marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo, sendo X seu total de pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Planeswalker Lendário — Ajani\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'28485dc3-3040-4932-bc1a-4d82180332b2\', \'multiverseId\': 450466}, \'multiverseid\': 450466}, {\'name\': \'Аджани, Мудрый Советник\', \'text\': \'+2: вы получаете 1 жизнь за каждое существо под вашим контролем.\\n—3: существа под вашим контролем получают +2/+2 до конца хода.\\n—9: положите X жетонов +1/+1 на целевое существо, где X — количество ваших жизней.\', \'type\': \'Легендарный Planeswalker — Аджани\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450500&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9937507f-3944-4d7e-a012-0f7309837b89\', \'multiverseId\': 450500}, \'multiverseid\': 450500}, {\'name\': \'睿智参谋阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+2：你每操控一个生物，便获得1点生命。\\n−3：由你操控的生物得+2/+2直到回合结束。\\n−9：在目标生物上放置X个+1/+1指示物，X为你的总生命。\', \'type\': \'传奇鹏洛客 ～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450534&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'817738b1-a3d1-49d0-abc3-97dbd57271b0\', \'multiverseId\': 450534}, \'multiverseid\': 450534}, {\'name\': \'睿智參謀阿耶尼\', \'text\': \'+2：你每操控一個生物，便獲得1點生命。\\n−3：由你操控的生物得+2/+2直到回合結束。\\n−9：在目標生物上放置X個+1/+1指示物，X為你的總生命。\', \'type\': \'傳奇鵬洛客 ～阿耶尼\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450568&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'620eab68-6bc0-4fc5-9ebb-d59948d0b182\', \'multiverseId\': 450568}, \'multiverseid\': 450568}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Begrüßung\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Du kannst andere nicht beschützen, wenn du dein eigenes Wohlergehen ignorierst."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447423&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a9ca96a-91b4-45a0-9d6b-a9d27471e261\', \'multiverseId\': 447423}, \'multiverseid\': 447423}, {\'name\': \'Recibimiento de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"No puedes defender a otros si desprecias tu propia vida".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e338eaf7-dc74-458e-895e-dcc38fe9e2d6\', \'multiverseId\': 447704}, \'multiverseid\': 447704}, {\'name\': "Accueil d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous ne pouvez pas défendre les autres si vous négligez votre propre bien-être. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447985&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df42fe0d-32e9-47db-942b-5c5f1ea5f31a\', \'multiverseId\': 447985}, \'multiverseid\': 447985}, {\'name\': \'Benvenuto di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una creatura entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Non puoi difendere gli altri se non ti prendi cura di te stesso."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bef002f-9329-4379-a5a8-97741a37a69b\', \'multiverseId\': 448266}, \'multiverseid\': 448266}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの歓迎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「自身のことをおろそかにするようでは、他者を守ることなどできない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bc7047e-44d6-4fad-ac12-1e9972099f3a\', \'multiverseId\': 448547}, \'multiverseid\': 448547}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 환대\', \'text\': \'생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자신을 잘 돌보지 못한다면 다른 이를 지키는 것도 잘 할 수 없다네."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a837c2e2-098c-44cd-bec9-fe30693a2cb2\', \'multiverseId\': 448828}, \'multiverseid\': 448828}, {\'name\': \'Boas-vindas de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura entra no campo de batalha sob seu controle, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"É impossível defender os outros se seu próprio bem-estar é negligenciado."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fa2b970a-52b7-41dd-a8da-36b033814e44\', \'multiverseId\': 449109}, \'multiverseid\': 449109}, {\'name\': \'Радушие Аджани\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты не сможешь защитить других, если не позаботишься о собственном благополучии».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a2f7d4-2881-4556-b0a9-5e5474405005\', \'multiverseId\': 449390}, \'multiverseid\': 449390}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼相迎\', \'text\': \'每当一个生物在你的操控下进战场时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「罔顾自身福祉，便无暇保护他人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee997256-90bd-4047-af56-fe3993026f32\', \'multiverseId\': 449671}, \'multiverseid\': 449671}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼相迎\', \'text\': \'每當一個生物在你的操控下進戰場時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「罔顧自身福祉，便無暇保護他人。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a05cd878-9b52-4640-ae52-7d1b101106d0\', \'multiverseId\': 449952}, \'multiverseid\': 449952}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Einfluss\', \'text\': \'Lege zwei +1/+1-Marken auf eine Kreatur deiner Wahl.\\nSchaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine weiße Karte offen vorzeigen und auf deine Hand nehmen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450263&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'215acede-acdb-4a21-9c10-ca2b8d26e8a0\', \'multiverseId\': 450263}, \'multiverseid\': 450263}, {\'name\': \'Influencia de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Pon dos contadores +1/+1 sobre la criatura objetivo.\\nMira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes mostrar una carta blanca que se encuentre entre ellas y ponerla en tu mano. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fbf8f309-2f71-4490-93c9-e58de1c1ac44\', \'multiverseId\': 450297}, \'multiverseid\': 450297}, {\'name\': "Influence d\'Ajani", \'text\': \'Mettez deux marqueurs +1/+1 sur la créature ciblée.\\nRegardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez révéler une carte blanche parmi elles et la mettre dans votre main. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450331&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0590c91-04b4-4787-9bd8-68393e9a503c\', \'multiverseId\': 450331}, \'multiverseid\': 450331}, {\'name\': \'Influenza di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Metti due segnalini +1/+1 su una creatura bersaglio.\\nGuarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi rivelare una carta bianca scelta tra esse e aggiungerla alla tua mano. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450365&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f1bba0a-8d85-4f06-888b-06001d86cfa9\', \'multiverseId\': 450365}, \'multiverseid\': 450365}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの影響\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とし、それの上に＋１/＋１カウンターを２個置く。\\nあなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中から白のカード１枚を公開してあなたの手札に加えてもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a314945-de20-466e-872c-b91b242fec40\', \'multiverseId\': 450399}, \'multiverseid\': 450399}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 영향력\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 +1/+1 카운터 두 개를 올려놓는다.\\n당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 백색 카드 한 장을 공개하고 당신의 손으로 가져갈 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450433&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'69ffe59d-686a-4508-b74a-6b65c9da25b4\', \'multiverseId\': 450433}, \'multiverseid\': 450433}, {\'name\': \'Influência de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Coloque dois marcadores +1/+1 na criatura alvo.\\nOlhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode revelar um card branco dentre eles e colocá-lo em sua mão. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450467&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e38bbe9-5ca1-49c3-90d8-d9583deb2f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 450467}, \'multiverseid\': 450467}, {\'name\': \'Влияние Аджани\', \'text\': \'Положите два жетона +1/+1 на целевое существо.\\nПосмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете показать находящуюся среди них белую карту и положить ее в вашу руку. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b929960a-70b1-4572-962c-6c7bc8a67636\', \'multiverseId\': 450501}, \'multiverseid\': 450501}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的威能\', \'text\': \'在目标生物上放置两个+1/+1指示物。\\n检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以展示其中的一张白色牌，并将它置于你手上。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4632269c-c2a4-4632-9dee-887617957c5b\', \'multiverseId\': 450535}, \'multiverseid\': 450535}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的威能\', \'text\': \'在目標生物上放置兩個+1/+1指示物。\\n檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以展示其中的一張白色牌，並將它置於你手上。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450569&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1698a887-e329-41ee-a05c-05d6f82bd476\', \'multiverseId\': 450569}, \'multiverseid\': 450569}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis Rudelmitglied\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, kannst du eine +1/+1-Marke auf Ajanis Rudelmitglied legen.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Katze, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn einer von uns Erfolg hat, gilt dies für das gesamte Rudel."\\n—Jazal Goldmähne\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447422&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57ec1de6-9150-4e64-83bf-512583b88302\', \'multiverseId\': 447422}, \'multiverseid\': 447422}, {\'name\': \'Compañero de manada de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, puedes poner un contador +1/+1 sobre el Compañero de manada de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando uno de nosotros mejora, la manada mejora".\\n—Jazal Melena Dorada\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447703&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50c687fa-bbec-4db4-81d0-46d1100c0342\', \'multiverseId\': 447703}, \'multiverseid\': 447703}, {\'name\': "Frère de bande d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, vous pouvez mettre un marqueur +1/+1 sur le Frère de bande d\'Ajani.", \'type\': \'Créature : chat et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Quand l\'un de nous prospère, c\'est toute la bande qui prospère. »\\n—Jazal Crinièredor", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447984&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'430a416b-703e-4f14-9ccd-a641612766da\', \'multiverseId\': 447984}, \'multiverseid\': 447984}, {\'name\': \'Compagno di Ajani\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, puoi mettere un segnalino +1/+1 sul Compagno di Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Felino\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando uno di noi ha successo, l\\\'intero branco ha successo."\\n—Jazal Criniera D\\\'Oro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448265&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c97f3cbc-08a3-4f43-8710-edd82ce18a06\', \'multiverseId\': 448265}, \'multiverseid\': 448265}, {\'name\': \'アジャニの群れ仲間\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、あなたはアジャニの群れ仲間の上に＋１/＋１カウンターを１個置いてもよい。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猫・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「我らのうちいずれかが繁栄する時、群れも繁栄する。」\\n――黄金のたてがみのジャザル\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448546&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'444bd100-1959-4577-9165-fb1235c2e992\', \'multiverseId\': 448546}, \'multiverseid\': 448546}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 형제\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 당신은 아자니의 형제에 +1/+1 카운터 한 개를 올려놓을 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고양이 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"하나의 번영이 곧 동족의 번영이다."\\n—자잘 골드메인\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448827&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a11546cc-25d4-48d7-b92d-11c7154efb94\', \'multiverseId\': 448827}, \'multiverseid\': 448827}, {\'name\': \'Companheiro de Bando de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, você pode colocar um marcador +1/+1 em Companheiro de Bando de Ajani.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Felino Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando um de nós prospera, o bando prospera."\\n— Jazal Juba D\\\'ouro\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449108&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'02a1bef6-2f56-4123-aff3-06c60f678469\', \'multiverseId\': 449108}, \'multiverseid\': 449108}, {\'name\': \'Соплеменник Аджани\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизнь(-и), вы можете положить один жетон +1/+1 на Соплеменника Аджани.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Кошка Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда один из нас процветает, процветает весь прайд».\\n— Златогривый Джазаль\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449389&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'162238b9-94ac-438a-a6bf-982a1a13e5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 449389}, \'multiverseid\': 449389}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，你可以在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一个+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～猫／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一个享福，整群都能享福。」\\n～金鬃贾佐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449670&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'658174b3-4b36-43a1-8faf-f16214c68145\', \'multiverseId\': 449670}, \'multiverseid\': 449670}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼的群伴\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，你可以在阿耶尼的群伴上放置一個+1/+1指示物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～貓／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「只要一個享福，整群都能享福。」\\n～金鬃賈佐\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449951&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ca82f191-6bdf-49d0-bc08-735e94e1acd4\', \'multiverseId\': 449951}, \'multiverseid\': 449951}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ajanis letztes Gefecht\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine Kreatur oder ein Planeswalker, die bzw. den du kontrollierst, stirbt, kannst du Ajanis letztes Gefecht opfern. Falls du dies tust, erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Avatar-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\\nWenn ein Zauberspruch oder eine Fähigkeit, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, dazu führt, dass du diese Karte abwirfst, und falls du eine Ebene kontrollierst, erzeuge einen 4/4 weißen Avatar-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447421&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'832903db-6ed0-4101-a64c-8cb67e99a6fe\', \'multiverseId\': 447421}, \'multiverseid\': 447421}, {\'name\': \'Último esfuerzo de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una criatura o planeswalker que controlas muera, puedes sacrificar el Último esfuerzo de Ajani. Si lo haces, crea una ficha de criatura Avatar blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\\nCuando un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente haga que descartes esta carta, si controlas una Llanura, crea una ficha de criatura Avatar blanca 4/4 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447702&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3a62361-482e-4bc2-9605-26fa5d1a2943\', \'multiverseId\': 447702}, \'multiverseid\': 447702}, {\'name\': "La dernière bataille d\'Ajani", \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'une créature ou qu\'un planeswalker que vous contrôlez meurt, vous pouvez sacrifier La dernière bataille d\'Ajani. Si vous faites ainsi, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Avatar avec le vol.\\nQuand un sort ou une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle vous fait vous défausser de cette carte, si vous contrôlez une plaine, créez un jeton de créature 4/4 blanche Avatar avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447983&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'250b701a-d75f-4c6a-b7b5-a927a68e8c68\', \'multiverseId\': 447983}, \'multiverseid\': 447983}, {\'name\': \'Ultima Resistenza di Ajani\', \'text\': "Ogniqualvolta una creatura o un planeswalker che controlli muore, puoi sacrificare l\'Ultima Resistenza di Ajani. Se lo fai, crea una pedina creatura Avatar 4/4 bianca con volare.\\nQuando una magia o un\'abilità controllata da un avversario ti fa scartare questa carta, se controlli una Pianura, crea una pedina creatura Avatar 4/4 bianca con volare.", \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448264&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'221ab1b8-2de6-4074-8f6e-c28dddefd07a\', \'multiverseId\': 448264}, \'multiverseid\': 448264}, {\'name\': \'アジャニ最後の抵抗\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーかプレインズウォーカーが１体死亡するたび、あなたはアジャニ最後の抵抗を生け贄に捧げてもよい。そうしたなら、飛行を持つ白の４/４のアバター・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文か能力によってあなたがこのカードを捨てるとき、あなたが平地をコントロールしている場合、飛行を持つ白の４/４のアバター・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'13108be9-6162-446f-8f47-4ed776f4d958\', \'multiverseId\': 448545}, \'multiverseid\': 448545}, {\'name\': \'아자니의 최후의 저항\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물이나 플레인즈워커가 죽을 때마다, 당신은 아자니의 최후의 저항을 희생할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 비행을 가진 4/4 백색 화신 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력이 당신이 이 카드를 버리게 할 때, 당신이 들을 조종한다면, 비행을 가진 4/4 백색 화신 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d158c496-7bc9-43f5-a3b4-b60ec4abe147\', \'multiverseId\': 448826}, \'multiverseid\': 448826}, {\'name\': \'Resistência Final de Ajani\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que uma criatura ou planeswalker que você controla morre, você pode sacrificar Resistência Final de Ajani. Se fizer isso, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Avatar com voar.\\nQuando uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla fizer com que você descarte este card, se você controlar uma Planície, crie uma ficha de criatura branca 4/4 do tipo Avatar com voar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449107&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c35cc5bd-a2bf-403f-b159-847937c81801\', \'multiverseId\': 449107}, \'multiverseid\': 449107}, {\'name\': \'Последний Бой Аджани\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда существо или planeswalker под вашим контролем умирает, вы можете пожертвовать Последний Бой Аджани. Если вы это делаете, создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 белая Аватара с Полетом.\\nКогда заклинание или способность под контролем оппонента заставляет вас сбросить эту карту, если вы контролируете Равнину, создайте одну фишку существа 4/4 белая Аватара с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22bca16b-35ff-4576-ba47-a9141e77f7d5\', \'multiverseId\': 449388}, \'multiverseid\': 449388}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼奋绝抗击\', \'text\': \'每当一个由你操控的生物或鹏洛客死去时，你可以牺牲阿耶尼奋绝抗击。若你如此作，则派出一个4/4白色，具飞行异能的圣者衍生生物。\\n当由对手操控的咒语或异能使得你弃掉此牌时，若你操控平原，则派出一个4/4白色，具飞行异能的圣者衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6704f151-efc3-4d75-b088-45d57097cdf9\', \'multiverseId\': 449669}, \'multiverseid\': 449669}, {\'name\': \'阿耶尼奮絕抗擊\', \'text\': \'每當一個由你操控的生物或鵬洛客死去時，你可以犧牲阿耶尼奮絕抗擊。若你如此作，則派出一個4/4白色，具飛行異能的聖者衍生生物。\\n當由對手操控的咒語或異能使得你棄掉此牌時，若你操控平原，則派出一個4/4白色，具飛行異能的聖者衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'606f5fc7-c60d-446a-a6e3-e5be02f2dbd6\', \'multiverseId\': 449950}, \'multiverseid\': 449950}]', '[{\'name\': \'Albtraumhaftes Verlangen\', \'text\': \'Du erhältst 1 Lebenspunkt dazu. Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -X/-X bis zum Ende des Zuges, wobei X gleich der Anzahl an Lebenspunkten ist, die du in diesem Zug dazuerhalten hast.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Bei dem schweren Gefühl auf der Brust handelt es sich meist um Schlafparalyse. Aber manchmal ist es etwas anderes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447528&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7a83b3ed-a72e-41b4-853b-5e49f875dbba\', \'multiverseId\': 447528}, \'multiverseid\': 447528}, {\'name\': \'Sed de la pesadilla\', \'text\': \'Ganas 1 vida. La criatura objetivo obtiene -X/-X hasta el final del turno, donde X es la cantidad de vidas que ganaste este turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'La sensación de que algo te aplasta el pecho suele ser consecuencia de la parálisis del sueño. Otras veces es algo más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447809&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c1e14f1f-f9ba-422c-a7f8-ec5b5517d194\', \'multiverseId\': 447809}, \'multiverseid\': 447809}, {\'name\': \'Soif du cauchemar\', \'text\': "Vous gagnez 1 point de vie. La créature ciblée gagne -X/-X jusqu\'à la fin du tour, X étant le nombre de points de vie que vous avez gagné ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Ce sentiment qui vous écrase la poitrine est généralement une paralysie du sommeil. Parfois, c\'est autre chose.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448090&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'568a34ac-8977-48d2-bf69-61d24afbd883\', \'multiverseId\': 448090}, \'multiverseid\': 448090}, {\'name\': "Sete dell\'Incubo", \'text\': \'Guadagni 1 punto vita. Una creatura bersaglio prende -X/-X fino alla fine del turno, dove X è pari ai punti vita che hai guadagnato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': "La sensazione di avere un peso sul petto in genere è causata dalla paralisi nel sonno. A volte, però, è dovuta a qualcos\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448371&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edb31f72-11d2-43d3-b339-0cce0ad35d97\', \'multiverseId\': 448371}, \'multiverseid\': 448371}, {\'name\': \'悪夢の渇望\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。あなたは１点のライフを得る。ターン終了時まで、それは－Ｘ/－Ｘの修整を受ける。Ｘはあなたがこのターンに得たライフの点数の合計に等しい。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'胸に何かが乗っているような感覚はたいてい金縛りだが、そうでない場合もある。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448652&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6551fe36-94a3-456c-9f68-184609942dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 448652}, \'multiverseid\': 448652}, {\'name\': \'나이트메어의 갈증\', \'text\': \'당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다. 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -X/-X를 받는다. X는 당신이 이 턴에 얻은 생명점이다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'가슴을 무엇인가가 짓누르고 있는 감각은 보통 가위가 맞다. 가끔은, 가위가 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b3639f8-b18e-45a7-9ba7-b7d198dc5a74\', \'multiverseId\': 448933}, \'multiverseid\': 448933}, {\'name\': \'Sede do Pesadelo\', \'text\': \'Você ganha 1 pontos de vida. A criatura alvo recebe -X/-X até o final do turno, sendo X a quantidade de pontos de vida que você ganhou neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Aquela sensação de que há alguma coisa sobre seu peito costuma ser paralisia noturna. Ás vezes, porém, é outra coisa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449214&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5255e946-4486-4c01-858c-ad17641b91c1\', \'multiverseId\': 449214}, \'multiverseid\': 449214}, {\'name\': \'Жажда Кошмара\', \'text\': \'Вы получаете 1 жизнь. Целевое существо получает -X/-X до конца хода, где X — количество жизней, полученных вами в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Если ночью вы чувствуете тяжесть на груди, то чаще всего это сонный паралич. Но иногда это кое-что другое.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7b37e4f-d08f-4d47-9d7b-e8ad2f59ab0e\', \'multiverseId\': 449495}, \'multiverseid\': 449495}, {\'name\': \'梦魇饥渴\', \'text\': \'你获得1点生命。目标生物得-X/-X直到回合结束，X为你于本回合中所获得的生命数量。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'睡时感觉有异物压胸通常只是睡瘫症，但有时真是鬼压身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2d7bcdad-9778-497a-a10d-f3c733d55d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 449776}, \'multiverseid\': 449776}, {\'name\': \'夢魘飢渴\', \'text\': \'你獲得1點生命。目標生物得-X/-X直到回合結束，X為你於本回合中所獲得的生命數量。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'睡時感覺有異物壓胸通常只是睡癱症，但有時真是鬼壓身。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc4f5946-f187-41db-98da-787753a20112\', \'multiverseId\': 450057}, \'multiverseid\': 450057}]', '[{\'name\': \'Allwissenheit\', \'text\': \'Du kannst Zaubersprüche aus deiner Hand wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Die Errungenschaften, auf die ich einst so stolz war, waren nur erste Schritte auf dem Weg in eine Zukunft, die ich erst beginne zu erahnen."\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447482&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1244744-36e5-4598-b27b-459765637c38\', \'multiverseId\': 447482}, \'multiverseid\': 447482}, {\'name\': \'Omnisciencia\', \'text\': \'Puedes lanzar hechizos de tu mano sin pagar sus costes de maná.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Las cosas que en otro tiempo imaginé que serían mis mayores logros no eran más que los primeros pasos hacia un futuro que solo puedo empezar a vislumbrar".\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447763&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b06c8453-81b2-45bf-840a-228f2f19e742\', \'multiverseId\': 447763}, \'multiverseid\': 447763}, {\'name\': \'Omniscience\', \'text\': \'Vous pouvez lancer des sorts depuis votre main sans payer leur coût de mana.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': "« Mes rêves les plus fous d\'hier ne sont aujourd\'hui qu\'un premier pas vers un avenir que je commence à peine à entrevoir. »\\n—Jace Beleren", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448044&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57857921-5df0-4170-9f8c-c6cc54783d3b\', \'multiverseId\': 448044}, \'multiverseid\': 448044}, {\'name\': \'Onniscienza\', \'text\': \'Puoi lanciare magie dalla tua mano senza pagare il loro costo di mana.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Le cose che sognavo un tempo sarebbero le mie conquiste più grandi, se non fossero solo i primi passi verso un futuro che riesco appena a intravedere."\\n—Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448325&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a3d4f04b-e362-4ec0-a3ff-3df6903a1648\', \'multiverseId\': 448325}, \'multiverseid\': 448325}, {\'name\': \'全知\', \'text\': \'あなたは、あなたの手札から呪文を、それらのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「かつては最大の目標として想い描いていた事も、まだその片鱗しか窺い知ることのできない未来への第一歩に過ぎなかった。」\\n――ジェイス・ベレレン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448606&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc6c2636-1743-4449-b43a-aef5b09a6da2\', \'multiverseId\': 448606}, \'multiverseid\': 448606}, {\'name\': \'전지전능함\', \'text\': \'당신은 당신의 손에 있는 주문을 마나비용을 지불하지 않고 발동할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"한때 내 일생일대의 업적이 되리라 상상했던 것들은 실은 헤아릴 수 없을 만큼 엄청난 미래의 첫걸음에 불과했다."\\n—제이스 벨레렌\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae495ee4-c5ea-4bee-9653-8cabac328981\', \'multiverseId\': 448887}, \'multiverseid\': 448887}, {\'name\': \'Onisciência\', \'text\': \'Você pode conjurar mágicas de sua mão sem pagar seus custos de mana.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"As coisas que já imaginei que seriam minhas maiores conquistas foram só os primeiros passos rumo a um futuro que começo, meramente, a vislumbrar."\\n— Jace Beleren\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449168&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db941ddb-928a-457b-88e3-b13454fd6099\', \'multiverseId\': 449168}, \'multiverseid\': 449168}, {\'name\': \'Всеведение\', \'text\': \'Вы можете разыгрывать заклинания из вашей руки без уплаты их мана-стоимости.\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«То, что я некогда мнил своим величайшим достижением, было лишь первыми шагами в будущее, которое я только начинаю постигать».\\n— Джейс Белерен\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82738981-08b5-4cea-8be0-a4dea4d50d9a\', \'multiverseId\': 449449}, \'multiverseid\': 449449}, {\'name\': \'全知全能\', \'text\': \'你可以从你手上施放咒语，且不需支付其法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾以为某些事情是能力所及的最高成就，殊不知那只是向无尽未来探出的最初几步。」\\n～杰斯贝连\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f806a1d-11ca-4485-a00b-f4b5f15e370b\', \'multiverseId\': 449730}, \'multiverseid\': 449730}, {\'name\': \'全知全能\', \'text\': \'你可以從你手上施放咒語，且不需支付其魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「我曾以為某些事情是能力所及的最高成就，殊不知那只是向無盡未來探出的最初幾步。」\\n～傑斯貝連\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'863f48a8-7952-49cb-a887-d81073d2fa33\', \'multiverseId\': 450011}, \'multiverseid\': 450011}]', '[{\'name\': \'Alpiner Mond\', \'text\': \'Sowie der Alpine Mond ins Spiel kommt, bestimme den Namen einer Nichtstandardland-Karte.\\nLänder mit dem bestimmten Namen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, verlieren alle Ländertypen und Fähigkeiten und sie erhalten „{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe."\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung\', \'flavor\': \'„Ein seltenes und faszinierendes Phänomen."\\n—Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447545&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dafa7e52-549f-41d6-877f-6f667635103d\', \'multiverseId\': 447545}, \'multiverseid\': 447545}, {\'name\': \'Luna alpina\', \'text\': \'En cuanto la Luna alpina entre al campo de batalla, elige el nombre de una carta de tierra no básica.\\nLas tierras que tus oponentes controlen con el nombre elegido pierden todos los tipos de tierra y habilidades y ganan "{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color".\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento\', \'flavor\': \'"Un fenómeno extraño y fascinante".\\n—Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447826&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'630406b4-4701-47c0-88d5-6212ab7e183f\', \'multiverseId\': 447826}, \'multiverseid\': 447826}, {\'name\': \'Lune alpine\', \'text\': \'Au moment où la Lune alpine arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez un nom de carte de terrain non-base.\\nLes terrains du nom choisi que vos adversaires contrôlent perdent tous leurs types de terrain et leurs capacités, et ils acquièrent « {T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix. »\', \'type\': \'Enchantement\', \'flavor\': \'« Un phénomène rare et fascinant. »\\n—Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448107&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3334eb2-4435-4a9d-9f92-26d3f1598267\', \'multiverseId\': 448107}, \'multiverseid\': 448107}, {\'name\': \'Luna Alpina\', \'text\': \'Mentre la Luna Alpina entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli il nome di una carta terra non base.\\nLe terre controllate dai tuoi avversari con il nome scelto perdono tutti i tipi di terra e le abilità, e hanno "{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore".\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo\', \'flavor\': \'"Un fenomeno raro e affascinante."\\n—Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448388&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e09b810d-aad6-495c-86c7-f6a42c771f1a\', \'multiverseId\': 448388}, \'multiverseid\': 448388}, {\'name\': \'高山の月\', \'text\': \'高山の月が戦場に出るに際し、基本でない土地・カードのカード名１つを選ぶ。\\n対戦相手がコントロールしていてその選ばれた名前を持つ土地はすべての土地タイプと能力を失い、「{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。」を得る。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント\', \'flavor\': \'「珍しく、大変美しい現象です。」\\n――タミヨウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448669&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e19dc542-48a9-4583-bc0f-859c554be568\', \'multiverseId\': 448669}, \'multiverseid\': 448669}, {\'name\': \'고산지대 달\', \'text\': \'고산지대 달이 전장에 들어오면서, 기본이 아닌 대지 카드 이름 한 개를 고른다.\\n당신의 상대들이 조종하는 선택된 이름의 대지는 모든 대지 유형과 능력을 잃고, "{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다."를 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법\', \'flavor\': \'"진귀하고 환상적인 현상이야."\\n—타미요\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448950&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b732491-8dac-4b91-809c-f50c584fac12\', \'multiverseId\': 448950}, \'multiverseid\': 448950}, {\'name\': \'Lua Alpina\', \'text\': \'Conforme Lua Alpina entrar no campo de batalha, escolha o nome de um card de terreno não básico.\\nOs terrenos que seus oponentes controlam com o nome escolhido perdem todos os tipos de terreno e habilidades e ganham "{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor."\', \'type\': \'Encantamento\', \'flavor\': \'"Um fenômeno raro e fascinante."\\n— Tamiyo\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449231&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb4f4eaa-5d2f-43ee-8ef7-b7bbc75c8572\', \'multiverseId\': 449231}, \'multiverseid\': 449231}, {\'name\': \'Горная Луна\', \'text\': \'При выходе Горной Луны на поле битвы выберите имя карты небазовой земли.\\nЗемли с выбранным именем под контролем ваших оппонентов теряют все типы земли и способности и получают способность «{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета».\', \'type\': \'Чары\', \'flavor\': \'«Редкий и захватывающий феномен».\\n— Тамиё\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449512&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b70f8c37-7db1-4647-8c29-9789082cd7c2\', \'multiverseId\': 449512}, \'multiverseid\': 449512}, {\'name\': \'月轮山影\', \'text\': \'于月轮山影进战场时，选择一个非基本地牌的名称。\\n由对手操控且具有该名称的地失去所有地类别和异能，且获得「{T}：加一点任一颜色的法术力。」\', \'type\': \'结界\', \'flavor\': \'「少见而迷人的现象。」\\n～多美代\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6dad8ac5-17fa-4714-8ec7-22e2d5fc050a\', \'multiverseId\': 449793}, \'multiverseid\': 449793}, {\'name\': \'月輪山影\', \'text\': \'於月輪山影進戰場時，選擇一個非基本地牌的名稱。\\n由對手操控且具有該名稱的地失去所有地類別和異能，且獲得「{T}：加一點任一顏色的魔法力。」\', \'type\': \'結界\', \'flavor\': \'「少見而迷人的現象。」\\n～多美代\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450074&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3052fda7-ca39-4cd0-89d8-dfc9624b8702\', \'multiverseId\': 450074}, \'multiverseid\': 450074}]', '[{\'name\': \'Amulett des Schutzes\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wirst, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, neutralisiere jenen Zauberspruch bzw. jene Fähigkeit, es sei denn, sein bzw. ihr Beherrscher bezahlt {1}.\\nKreaturenspielsteine erhalten -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Magisch, glückbringend oder einfach nur alt ist — es wird geschätzt und genau dies verleiht ihm Kraft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447644&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a6fe8b5-d0aa-4774-b185-e90e73ffa28f\', \'multiverseId\': 447644}, \'multiverseid\': 447644}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de custodia\', \'text\': \'Siempre que seas objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, contrarresta ese hechizo o habilidad a menos que su controlador pague {1}.\\nLas fichas de criatura obtienen -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'No se sabe si es mágico, si da suerte o si solo es viejo, pero la gente lo considera valioso y eso le da poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447925&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7a6c5e5-ca6c-4842-95ef-350e07b5442d\', \'multiverseId\': 447925}, \'multiverseid\': 447925}, {\'name\': \'Amulette de sauvegarde\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous devenez la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, contrecarrez ce sort ou cette capacité à moins que son contrôleur ne paie {1}.\\nLes jetons de créature gagnent -1/-0.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Qu\'elle soit magique, porte-bonheur ou simplement antique, elle est précieuse et cela lui donne du pouvoir.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448206&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03d2ebd8-c10e-4b03-85e3-8501d6113db0\', \'multiverseId\': 448206}, \'multiverseid\': 448206}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto della Salvaguardia\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta diventi bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, neutralizza quella magia o abilità a meno che il suo controllore non paghi {1}.\\nLe pedine creatura prendono -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'Che sia magico, benedetto dalla fortuna o semplicemente antico, è venerato e ciò gli conferisce potere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448487&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2df70820-7fc6-4398-8222-16cc0389b7a5\', \'multiverseId\': 448487}, \'multiverseid\': 448487}, {\'name\': \'安全の護符\', \'text\': \'あなたが、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、それのコントローラーが{1}を支払わないかぎり、その呪文や能力を打ち消す。\\nクリーチャー・トークンは－１/－０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'魔法だろうと運だろうと、ただ古いだけであろうと、それを大事にしていることがそれに力を与えるのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448768&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'46ee7927-b3f8-4b73-bdfa-1aa0c75dd7a6\', \'multiverseId\': 448768}, \'multiverseid\': 448768}, {\'name\': \'보호의 부적\', \'text\': \'당신이 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표가 될 때마다, 그 상대가 {1}을 지불하지 않는다면 그 주문이나 능력을 무효화한다.\\n생물 토큰들은 -1/-0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'그것에 마법이 깃든 것이든, 운을 불러들이든, 그냥 낡은 것이든, 그것은 소중히 여겨졌고 그로 인해 힘을 얻었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449049&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f06bbec0-6cea-4767-ae33-1ddc73cc42c1\', \'multiverseId\': 449049}, \'multiverseid\': 449049}, {\'name\': \'Amuleto de Segurança\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, anule aquela mágica ou habilidade, a menos que seu controlador pague {1}.\\nAs fichas de criatura recebem -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Seja mágico, afortunado ou meramente antigo, ele é muito prezado, e isso lhe dá poder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449330&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'131e015d-b3e6-45e9-a5ef-02334620db4c\', \'multiverseId\': 449330}, \'multiverseid\': 449330}, {\'name\': \'Амулет Сохранения\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы становитесь целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, отмените то заклинание или способность, если только контролирующий его (ее) игрок не заплатит {1}.\\nФишки существ получают -1/-0.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Может, он волшебный, может, счастливый, а может, просто старый. Как бы то ни было, он ценный, и это наделяет его могуществом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449611&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'266052d2-9cf2-4706-b409-4ce3e740d2b8\', \'multiverseId\': 449611}, \'multiverseid\': 449611}, {\'name\': \'庇佑护身符\', \'text\': \'每当你成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，除非该咒语或异能的操控者支付{1}，否则反击之。\\n衍生生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'无论这个护身符是附有魔法，能带来好运，还只是祖传之物，它都备受珍惜，而这正是其魔力之源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be10f888-07e0-45a5-9862-222827ef381d\', \'multiverseId\': 449892}, \'multiverseid\': 449892}, {\'name\': \'庇佑護身符\', \'text\': \'每當你成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，除非該咒語或異能的操控者支付{1}，否則反擊之。\\n衍生生物得-1/-0。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'無論這個護身符是附有魔法，能帶來好運，還只是祖傳之物，它都備受珍惜，而這正是其魔力之源。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450173&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c1da6d-4b7c-47a7-ac1f-9fb11ef47960\', \'multiverseId\': 450173}, \'multiverseid\': 450173}]', '[{\'name\': \'Antizipieren\', \'text\': \'Schaue dir die obersten drei Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Nimm eine davon auf deine Hand und lege den Rest in beliebiger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Zukunft vorauszuahnen ist einfach, wenn man die Macht besitzt, sie zu beeinflussen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447461&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f5deb8b-1ea6-483b-b033-0795f2bfe0c5\', \'multiverseId\': 447461}, \'multiverseid\': 447461}, {\'name\': \'Anticipar\', \'text\': \'Mira las tres primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Pon una de ellas en tu mano y el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en cualquier orden.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Adivinar el futuro no tiene misterio cuando posees el poder para sojuzgarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447742&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ddc5cff-18e7-4c65-8d61-e08c9f4264ee\', \'multiverseId\': 447742}, \'multiverseid\': 447742}, {\'name\': \'Anticipation\', \'text\': "Regardez les trois cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Mettez l\'une d\'elles dans votre main et le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque, dans l\'ordre de votre choix.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Prédire l\'avenir est une chose aisée quand on a le pouvoir de l\'influencer.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448023&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4f61f40-db1b-4e0c-a91c-42da87569042\', \'multiverseId\': 448023}, \'multiverseid\': 448023}, {\'name\': \'Anticipare\', \'text\': \'Guarda le prime tre carte del tuo grimorio. Aggiungine una alla tua mano e metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in qualsiasi ordine.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Prevedere il futuro è facile quando possiedi il potere di influenzarlo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448304&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4809d544-ae27-41e7-babf-f7692c519f24\', \'multiverseId\': 448304}, \'multiverseid\': 448304}, {\'name\': \'予期\', \'text\': \'あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを３枚見る。そのうち１枚をあなたの手札に加え、残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に望む順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'影響力を持つ者にとって、未来の予測は簡単である。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448585&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'061a12ad-20ca-4ce2-ab9c-7c81e6e6b249\', \'multiverseId\': 448585}, \'multiverseid\': 448585}, {\'name\': \'예측\', \'text\': \'당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 세 장을 본다. 그중 한 장을 당신의 손으로 가져가고 나머지 카드들은 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 원하는 순서로 놓는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'미래를 지배할 힘이 있다면 미래를 점치는 일은 어렵지 않다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448866&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92585930-0b75-46d4-87db-73bb25e79774\', \'multiverseId\': 448866}, \'multiverseid\': 448866}, {\'name\': \'Antecipar\', \'text\': \'Olhe os três cards do topo de seu grimório. Coloque um deles na sua mão e os restantes no fundo do seu grimório em qualquer ordem.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Prever o futuro é fácil quando se tem o poder de alterá-lo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449147&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c201d73-2d76-44c4-abc8-9a958cc1b3c6\', \'multiverseId\': 449147}, \'multiverseid\': 449147}, {\'name\': \'Предвосхищение\', \'text\': \'Посмотрите три верхние карты вашей библиотеки. Положите одну из них в вашу руку, а остальные — в низ вашей библиотеки в любом порядке.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Предсказывать будущее легко, если в твоих силах изменить его.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449428&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79aeeb54-0e5f-4476-a50f-15d6eab81b84\', \'multiverseId\': 449428}, \'multiverseid\': 449428}, {\'name\': \'预先考虑\', \'text\': \'检视你牌库顶的三张牌。将其中一张置于你手上，其余的牌则以任意顺序置于你的牌库底。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'当你握有支配未来的能力时，预测便信手拈来。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449709&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31a6ddfc-1ad8-4ab2-b40a-ffaa9bc302f4\', \'multiverseId\': 449709}, \'multiverseid\': 449709}, {\'name\': \'預先考慮\', \'text\': \'檢視你牌庫頂的三張牌。將其中一張置於你手上，其餘的牌則以任意順序置於你的牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'當你握有支配未來的能力時，預測便信手拈來。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449990&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3c2468f2-5a96-48dc-bca5-b56571b6c448\', \'multiverseId\': 449990}, \'multiverseid\': 449990}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arcades der Stratege\', \'text\': \'Fliegend, Wachsamkeit\\nImmer wenn eine Kreatur mit Verteidiger unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, ziehe eine Karte.\\nJede Kreatur mit Verteidiger, die du kontrollierst, weist Kampfschaden in Höhe ihrer Widerstandskraft anstatt ihrer Stärke zu und kann angreifen, als ob sie nicht Verteidiger hätte.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447629&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c4d0a164-9f6e-4bc1-8387-a14b68bf5c69\', \'multiverseId\': 447629}, \'multiverseid\': 447629}, {\'name\': \'Arcades, el Estratega\', \'text\': \'Vuela, vigilancia.\\nSiempre que una criatura con la habilidad de defensor entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, roba una carta.\\nCada criatura que controlas con la habilidad de defensor asigna una cantidad de daño de combate igual a su resistencia, en vez de su fuerza, y puede atacar como si no tuviera la habilidad de defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón anciano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447910&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f0ee11-be66-47af-bf4b-e0e76602ab5a\', \'multiverseId\': 447910}, \'multiverseid\': 447910}, {\'name\': \'Arcades, le stratège\', \'text\': "Vol, vigilance\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'une créature avec le défenseur arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, piochez une carte.\\nChaque créature avec le défenseur que vous contrôlez attribue un nombre de blessures de combat égal à son endurance à la place de sa force et peut attaquer comme si elle n\'avait pas le défenseur.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448191&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8f3fb26a-5abf-47d9-9f55-208db87370b1\', \'multiverseId\': 448191}, \'multiverseid\': 448191}, {\'name\': \'Arcades, lo Stratega\', \'text\': \'Volare, cautela\\nOgniqualvolta una creatura con difensore entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, pesca una carta.\\nOgni creatura con difensore che controlli assegna danno da combattimento pari alla propria costituzione invece che alla propria forza e può attaccare come se non avesse difensore.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448472&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'75f094c5-b429-4ca3-8792-fc5b72efa0a1\', \'multiverseId\': 448472}, \'multiverseid\': 448472}, {\'name\': \'策略の龍、アルカデス\', \'text\': \'飛行、警戒\\n防衛を持つクリーチャーが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、カードを１枚引く。\\nあなたがコントロールしていて防衛を持つ各クリーチャーはそれぞれ、パワーではなくタフネスに等しい点数の戦闘ダメージを割り振り、防衛を持たないかのように攻撃できる。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448753&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4af6d4a2-9eda-41c5-a55a-d0fbb51183b6\', \'multiverseId\': 448753}, \'multiverseid\': 448753}, {\'name\': \'전략가, 아르카데스\', \'text\': \'비행, 경계\\n수비태세를 가진 생물이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\\n당신이 조종하는 수비태세를 가진 각 생물은 공격력 대신 방어력만큼 전투피해를 입히며 수비태세가 없는 것처럼 공격할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 장로 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449034&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9caaf8-cf69-47bb-857c-95ed9f23d986\', \'multiverseId\': 449034}, \'multiverseid\': 449034}, {\'name\': \'Arcades, o Estrategista\', \'text\': \'Voar, vigilância\\nToda vez que uma criatura com defensor entrar no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, compre um card.\\nCada criatura que você controla com defensor atribui dano de combate igual à própria resistência, em vez do próprio poder, e pode atacar como se não tivesse defensor.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão Ancião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449315&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92b0056e-1677-4ad7-8c5c-68db28532303\', \'multiverseId\': 449315}, \'multiverseid\': 449315}, {\'name\': \'Аркадес, Стратег\', \'text\': \'Полет, Бдительность\\nКаждый раз, когда существо с Защитником выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, возьмите карту.\\nКаждое существо с Защитником под вашим контролем распределяет боевые повреждения, равные своей выносливости, а не силе, и может атаковать, как если бы у него не было способности Защитника.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed204aed-7d35-4ff7-80ca-1153143a2a87\', \'multiverseId\': 449596}, \'multiverseid\': 449596}, {\'name\': \'智龙阿卡迪\', \'text\': \'飞行，警戒\\n每当一个具守军异能的生物在你的操控下进战场时，抓一张牌。\\n每个由你操控且具守军异能的生物皆依照其防御力来分配战斗伤害，而不是依照力量；且能视同不具守军异能地进行攻击。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f217cef-9694-452a-aaf2-1c1b4aff361d\', \'multiverseId\': 449877}, \'multiverseid\': 449877}, {\'name\': \'智龍阿卡迪\', \'text\': \'飛行，警戒\\n每當一個具守軍異能的生物在你的操控下進戰場時，抽一張牌。\\n每個由你操控且具守軍異能的生物皆依照其防禦力來分配戰鬥傷害，而不是依照力量；且能視同不具守軍異能地進行攻擊。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450158&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d55ee34-a694-47df-b0a8-8e89662c0b68\', \'multiverseId\': 450158}, \'multiverseid\': 450158}]', '[{\'name\': \'Arkane Enzyklopädie\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Wissen an sich ist weder gut noch böse. So, wie ein Buch in den falschen Händen alles vernichten kann, vermag es in den richtigen Händen alles zu retten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447645&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc45f60-970d-4e20-9fae-b7f7fc61153d\', \'multiverseId\': 447645}, \'multiverseid\': 447645}, {\'name\': \'Enciclopedia arcana\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'El conocimiento en sí no es ni bueno ni malo. Cierto libro en las manos equivocadas podría acabar con la existencia, pero el mismo libro en las manos adecuadas podría salvarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447926&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5329c27-a3f4-4320-9b9e-a858d19b58af\', \'multiverseId\': 447926}, \'multiverseid\': 447926}, {\'name\': \'Encyclopédie ésotérique\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T} : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "La connaissance n\'est en soi ni bonne ni mauvaise. Un mauvais livre entre de mauvaises mains pourrait condamner l\'existence, mais le même livre entre de bonnes mains pourrait la sauver.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448207&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c94c14a6-303f-496a-bdc9-25849938bc62\', \'multiverseId\': 448207}, \'multiverseid\': 448207}, {\'name\': \'Enciclopedia Arcana\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Pesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "La conoscenza in sé non è buona né cattiva. Così come il libro sbagliato nelle mani sbagliate potrebbe condannare l\'intera esistenza, lo stesso libro nelle mani giuste potrebbe salvarla.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448488&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23399916-28ac-406c-bbea-ae769a3a65e8\', \'multiverseId\': 448488}, \'multiverseid\': 448488}, {\'name\': \'秘儀大全\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'知識そのものは善でも悪でもない。不適切な本が悪意の手に渡ればすべての存在を滅ぼしかねないが、同じ本が善意の手に渡れば救済につながる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448769&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef7d9aaf-68cf-43c8-80c4-3aa625974567\', \'multiverseId\': 448769}, \'multiverseid\': 448769}, {\'name\': \'신비한 백과사전\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'지식 그 자체는 선하지도 악하지도 않다. 나쁜 책이 나쁜 자의 손에 들어가면 모든 존재의 파멸을 초래할 수도 있는 것만큼이나, 같은 책이라도 올바른 자의 손에 들리면 파멸을 막을 수도 있다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449050&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b66bee66-589e-43d3-99aa-3d86ad2923a4\', \'multiverseId\': 449050}, \'multiverseid\': 449050}, {\'name\': \'Enciclopédia Arcana\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'O conhecimento em si não é bom nem mau. Assim como o livro errado nas mãos erradas pode condenar toda a existência, o mesmo livro nas mãos certas pode salvá-la.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449331&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7c46ef2-99a9-4899-9c5c-948fabe7e485\', \'multiverseId\': 449331}, \'multiverseid\': 449331}, {\'name\': \'Волшебная Энциклопедия\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Знание само по себе нельзя отнести к категории добра или зла. Одна и та же книга, попав в неправильные руки, может обречь на гибель все мироздание, а в правильные — спасти его.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449612&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6fffda33-ba7b-4179-ab2a-0340654e6084\', \'multiverseId\': 449612}, \'multiverseid\': 449612}, {\'name\': \'秘法全书\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'知识本身无正邪之分。不法之徒手持善典也能毁灭世界，而正义之士手持恶籍也能拯救众生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449893&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4b8f9569-a014-418d-b7eb-2fa3137b800d\', \'multiverseId\': 449893}, \'multiverseid\': 449893}, {\'name\': \'秘法全書\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'知識本身無正邪之分。不法之徒手持善典也能毀滅世界，而正義之士手持惡籍也能拯救眾生。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450174&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'326e69b5-572f-4221-a4b1-110e02e52620\', \'multiverseId\': 450174}, \'multiverseid\': 450174}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auferstandene Gorgo\', \'text\': \'Die Auferstandene Gorgo hat Todesberührung, solange du einen Liliana-Planeswalker kontrollierst. (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die sie einer Kreatur zufügt, ist ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Gorgo\', \'flavor\': \'„Ich nehme, was kommt. Aber je weniger Verwesung, desto besser."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450273&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'866bedb7-6be2-48c6-876b-caaec3c26aa4\', \'multiverseId\': 450273}, \'multiverseid\': 450273}, {\'name\': \'Gorgona retornada\', \'text\': \'La Gorgona retornada tiene la habilidad de toque mortal mientras controles un planeswalker Liliana. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gorgona zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"No soy exigente con lo que retorna, pero cuanta menos putrefacción, mejor".\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'44bb9662-e8e0-4bf9-bc7e-cfe35b38f6c8\', \'multiverseId\': 450307}, \'multiverseid\': 450307}, {\'name\': \'Gorgone revivifiée\', \'text\': "La Gorgone revivifiée a le contact mortel tant que vous contrôlez un planeswalker Liliana. (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et gorgonoïde\', \'flavor\': "« Je ne suis pas très regardante sur ce qui se présente, mais moins c\'est décomposé, mieux c\'est. »\\n—Liliana Vess", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450341&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'868b38b8-bb0d-4f7c-b7a6-687cc4801f71\', \'multiverseId\': 450341}, \'multiverseid\': 450341}, {\'name\': \'Gorgone Risvegliata\', \'text\': \'La Gorgone Risvegliata ha tocco letale fintanto che controlli un planeswalker Liliana. (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Gorgone Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Non sono esigente con le creature che ritornano, ma meno sono putrefatte, meglio è."\\n—Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450375&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10b087ae-86e9-4f18-8f3d-59256dee4a5e\', \'multiverseId\': 450375}, \'multiverseid\': 450375}, {\'name\': \'甦ったゴルゴン\', \'text\': \'あなたがリリアナ・プレインズウォーカーをコントロールしているかぎり、甦ったゴルゴンは接死を持つ。（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・ゴルゴン\', \'flavor\': \'「何が生まれようと構わないけど、保ちは良いに越したことはないわね。」\\n――リリアナ・ヴェス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450409&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaadf9b4-eb4f-4f18-9057-30762264f6d7\', \'multiverseId\': 450409}, \'multiverseid\': 450409}, {\'name\': \'되살려진 고르곤\', \'text\': \'되살려진 고르곤은 당신이 릴리아나 플레인즈워커를 조종하는 한 치명타를 가진다. (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 고르곤\', \'flavor\': \'"결과에 대해 별로 신경쓰지는 않지만, 덜 썩은 것일수록 좋아."\\n—릴리아나 베스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450443&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0594115d-e6bf-45c3-90f1-0da2a64848ea\', \'multiverseId\': 450443}, \'multiverseid\': 450443}, {\'name\': \'Górgona Ressurgida\', \'text\': \'Górgona Ressurgida terá toque mortífero enquanto você controlar uma planeswalker Liliana. (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Górgona\', \'flavor\': \'"Não sou tão exigente em relação a quem retorna, mas quanto menos decomposto, melhor."\\n— Liliana Vess\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450477&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1e046aa5-27df-425e-b2c2-64123daf1d8c\', \'multiverseId\': 450477}, \'multiverseid\': 450477}, {\'name\': \'Восставшая Горгона\', \'text\': \'Восставшая Горгона имеет Смертельное касание, пока вы контролируете planeswalker-а Лилиану. (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Горгона\', \'flavor\': \'«Я не придирчива к тому, что поднимается из-под земли, но чем меньше гнили, тем лучше».\\n— Лилиана Весс\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450511&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b2e6f0e-72a6-430b-9b9f-a9fffe2c508a\', \'multiverseId\': 450511}, \'multiverseid\': 450511}, {\'name\': \'复生蛇发妖\', \'text\': \'只要你操控莉莲娜鹏洛客，复生蛇发妖便具有死触异能。（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／蛇发妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我对唤起的东西并不挑剔，不过腐烂程度越低越好。」\\n～莉莲娜维斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450545&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f9375bcb-e2c9-4e92-979d-e9cb103044db\', \'multiverseId\': 450545}, \'multiverseid\': 450545}, {\'name\': \'復生蛇髮妖\', \'text\': \'只要你操控莉蓮娜鵬洛客，復生蛇髮妖便具有死觸異能。（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／蛇髮妖\', \'flavor\': \'「我對喚起的東西並不挑剔，不過腐爛程度越低越好。」\\n～莉蓮娜維斯\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450579&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12d5b654-5753-4d02-b41b-dd7fd4d523ae\', \'multiverseId\': 450579}, \'multiverseid\': 450579}]', '[{\'name\': \'Aufprallen\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nAufprallen fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl Schadenspunkte in Höhe der Stärke der geopferten Kreatur zu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wirf das da!"\\n—Mogwin, Goblin-Delinquent\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447580&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'888da8ca-194b-442a-b4f6-f83fa41fe248\', \'multiverseId\': 447580}, \'multiverseid\': 447580}, {\'name\': \'Batacazo\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nEl Batacazo hace una cantidad de daño a cualquier objetivo igual a la fuerza de la criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Dales un empujoncito".\\n—Mogwin, trasgo delincuente\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447861&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3a919285-dad5-485f-a50b-79439aa78770\', \'multiverseId\': 447861}, \'multiverseid\': 447861}, {\'name\': \'Splaf !\', \'text\': "En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nSplaf inflige un nombre de blessures égal à la force de la créature sacrifiée à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Donnez-leur un coup de main. »\\n—Mogwin, délinquant gobelin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448142&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'faf317f0-eb86-4e97-88b3-a3ad068d9463\', \'multiverseId\': 448142}, \'multiverseid\': 448142}, {\'name\': \'Tonfo\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nIl Tonfo infligge danno pari alla forza della creatura sacrificata a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Dagli una spintarella."\\n—Mogwin, malvivente goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448423&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4ddd40e7-d55c-4f8d-a311-28e87148b717\', \'multiverseId\': 448423}, \'multiverseid\': 448423}, {\'name\': \'ドスン\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nクリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。ドスンはそれに、その生け贄に捧げたクリーチャーのパワーに等しい点数のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「ぶっ潰せ。」\\n――不良ゴブリン、モグウィン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448704&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97a9864a-0721-4e3d-9083-50fe30a0885f\', \'multiverseId\': 448704}, \'multiverseid\': 448704}, {\'name\': \'쿵\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n원하는 목표를 정한다. 쿵은 그 목표에게 희생된 생물의 공격력만큼 피해를 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"한 번 밀어 줘."\\n—고블린 범죄자, 모그윈\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448985&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ed98e3ad-62dc-4bde-97b8-f631d4508166\', \'multiverseId\': 448985}, \'multiverseid\': 448985}, {\'name\': \'Baque\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nBaque causa a qualquer alvo uma quantidade de dano igual ao poder da criatura sacrificada.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Dá um empurrãozinho."\\n— Mogwin, delinquente goblin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449266&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b26f8d37-1326-41e9-bc2d-0adf1198a590\', \'multiverseId\': 449266}, \'multiverseid\': 449266}, {\'name\': \'Шмяк\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо.\\nШмяк наносит любой цели количество повреждений, равное силе пожертвованного существа.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Подтолкни-ка их».\\n— Могвин, гоблинский хулиган\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449547&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db7d3e2a-0bb4-48ee-9ac5-9f9f64770dbc\', \'multiverseId\': 449547}, \'multiverseid\': 449547}, {\'name\': \'掷物有声\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n掷物有声对任意一个目标造成伤害，其数量等同于所牺牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「推它一把。」\\n～恶行鬼怪莫古温\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'79d0455d-22b8-4d56-9ad9-56d6e64da5f7\', \'multiverseId\': 449828}, \'multiverseid\': 449828}, {\'name\': \'擲物有聲\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n擲物有聲對任意一個目標造成傷害，其數量等同於所犧牲生物的力量。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「推他一把。」\\n～惡行鬼怪莫古溫\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450109&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7f15cf0-20ee-4925-a581-5bd5953043e5\', \'multiverseId\': 450109}, \'multiverseid\': 450109}]', '[{\'name\': \'Auftragsmörder\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen (Du kannst diesen Zauberspruch zu jedem Zeitpunkt wirken, zu dem du einen Spontanzauber wirken könntest.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Assassine\', \'flavor\': \'„Sollen sie sterben, dann kauft Gift. Sollen sie sterben und vorher noch entsetzlich leiden, so können wir was aushandeln."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447517&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23eb966b-9811-4802-84fe-c6e84c636855\', \'multiverseId\': 447517}, \'multiverseid\': 447517}, {\'name\': \'Asesino a sueldo\', \'text\': \'Destello. (Puedes lanzar este hechizo en cualquier momento en que pudieras lanzar un instantáneo.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Asesino humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si los quieres ver muertos, compra veneno. Si quieres que tengan el peor día de su vida antes de morir... acordemos un precio".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c925f19e-4645-4279-9d85-dbc8a61bac0e\', \'multiverseId\': 447798}, \'multiverseid\': 447798}, {\'name\': \'Bretteur à gages\', \'text\': \'Flash (Vous pouvez lancer ce sort à tout moment où vous pourriez lancer un éphémère.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et assassin\', \'flavor\': "« Si vous les voulez morts, achetez du poison. Si vous voulez qu\'ils passent la pire journée de leur vie avant de mourir, parlons argent. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448079&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be9eae21-27a9-4ca0-bd91-7cfd80ab1d51\', \'multiverseId\': 448079}, \'multiverseid\': 448079}, {\'name\': \'Lama Assoldata\', \'text\': \'Lampo (Puoi lanciare questa magia in ogni momento in cui potresti lanciare un istantaneo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Assassino Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se li vuoi morti, procurati del veleno. Se vuoi che soffrano le pene dell\\\'inferno prima di morire, possiamo discutere un prezzo."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448360&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74302ef6-4c84-4b14-8545-e67e7074a360\', \'multiverseId\': 448360}, \'multiverseid\': 448360}, {\'name\': \'雇われ刺客\', \'text\': \'瞬速（あなたはこの呪文を、あなたがインスタントを唱えられるときならいつでも唱えてよい。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・暗殺者\', \'flavor\': \'「死んでほしけりゃ、毒でも買え。死ぬ前に人生最悪の日を味わわせたいって言うなら、交渉しようじゃないか。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448641&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c8bf5eda-830c-4f3c-a886-24566084326a\', \'multiverseId\': 448641}, \'multiverseid\': 448641}, {\'name\': \'고용된 칼잡이\', \'text\': \'섬광 (순간마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기라면 당신은 이 주문을 언제든지 발동할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 암살자\', \'flavor\': \'"그냥 죽이고 싶다면, 독약을 사시오. 죽이기 전에 인생 최악의 날을 선사하고 싶다면, 가격 이야기를 합시다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448922&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a747ee98-78e1-49a8-9bec-1017a47b85c6\', \'multiverseId\': 448922}, \'multiverseid\': 448922}, {\'name\': \'Lâmina de Aluguel\', \'text\': \'Lampejo (Você poderá conjurar esta mágica a qualquer momento em que puder conjurar uma mágica instantânea.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Assassino\', \'flavor\': \'"Se você quiser que eles morram, compre veneno. Se você quiser que tenham o pior dia da vida deles antes de morrer, então vamos discutir valores."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449203&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'692198de-8e06-4ec4-80ab-2a3c02792b5c\', \'multiverseId\': 449203}, \'multiverseid\': 449203}, {\'name\': \'Наемный Головорез\', \'text\': \'Миг (Вы можете разыграть это заклинание при любой возможности разыгрывать мгновенные заклинания.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Убийца\', \'flavor\': \'«Если ты хочешь, чтобы они умерли, пойди и купи яду. Если хочешь, чтобы перед смертью у них был худший день в жизни, давай обсудим цену».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449484&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2beca216-2572-4cce-8884-5c83a08c4a53\', \'multiverseId\': 449484}, \'multiverseid\': 449484}, {\'name\': \'雇剑打手\', \'text\': \'闪现（你可以于你能够施放瞬间的时机下施放此咒语。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／杀手\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你想要他们的命，自己买药去下毒就好。如果你想让他们在丧命前『好好』过上最后一天，那我们来谈谈价格吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449765&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7389525-6ff4-41a3-b56c-710cfa75f8c5\', \'multiverseId\': 449765}, \'multiverseid\': 449765}, {\'name\': \'雇劍打手\', \'text\': \'閃現（你可以於你能夠施放瞬間的時機下施放此咒語。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／ 殺手\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你想要他們的命，自己買藥去下毒就好。如果你想讓他們在喪命前『好好』過上最後一天，那我們來談談價格吧。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450046&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a80a810-b6de-4333-ad33-b254232ca1b5\', \'multiverseId\': 450046}, \'multiverseid\': 450046}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausbilder der Kavallerie\', \'text\': \'Wenn der Ausbilder der Kavallerie ins Spiel kommt, erhält eine Kreatur deiner Wahl +2/+0 und Erstschlag bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie fügt Kampfschaden vor Kreaturen ohne Erstschlag zu.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447425&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24998f1a-2731-4d33-8dd5-2efe8453e741\', \'multiverseId\': 447425}, \'multiverseid\': 447425}, {\'name\': \'Instructor de caballería\', \'text\': \'Cuando el Instructor de caballería entre al campo de batalla, la criatura objetivo obtiene +2/+0 y gana la habilidad de dañar primero hasta el final del turno. (Hace daño de combate antes que las criaturas sin la habilidad de dañar primero.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447706&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52b79603-9fb4-4fc8-a96d-b65f5e040e56\', \'multiverseId\': 447706}, \'multiverseid\': 447706}, {\'name\': \'Maître-recruteur de cavalerie\', \'text\': "Quand le Maître-recruteur de cavalerie arrive sur le champ de bataille, une créature ciblée gagne +2/+0 et acquiert l\'initiative jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Elle inflige des blessures de combat avant les créatures sans l\'initiative.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447987&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'93436933-6038-4e70-9102-f3a36c46dfc7\', \'multiverseId\': 447987}, \'multiverseid\': 447987}, {\'name\': \'Addestratore della Cavalleria\', \'text\': "Quando l\'Addestratore della Cavalleria entra nel campo di battaglia, una creatura bersaglio prende +2/+0 e ha attacco improvviso fino alla fine del turno. (Infligge danno da combattimento prima delle creature senza attacco improvviso.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448268&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'486c0fd7-6d40-4fd0-b4e6-90bea942ea74\', \'multiverseId\': 448268}, \'multiverseid\': 448268}, {\'name\': \'騎兵隊の教練官\', \'text\': \'騎兵隊の教練官が戦場に出たとき、クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋２/＋０の修整を受け、先制攻撃を得る。（それは先制攻撃を持たないクリーチャーよりも先に戦闘ダメージを与える。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448549&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'edc92f47-a172-4036-a737-cba2d35db530\', \'multiverseId\': 448549}, \'multiverseid\': 448549}, {\'name\': \'기병대 교관\', \'text\': \'기병대 교관이 전장에 들어올 때, 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +2/+0을 받고 선제공격을 얻는다. (그 생물은 선제공격이 없는 생물보다 먼저 전투피해를 입힌다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448830&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb6c552-09bf-446a-b698-d4ef241e4c5c\', \'multiverseId\': 448830}, \'multiverseid\': 448830}, {\'name\': \'Mestre de Exercícios da Cavalaria\', \'text\': \'Quando Mestre de Exercícios da Cavalaria entra no campo de batalha, a criatura alvo recebe +2/+0 e ganha iniciativa até o final do turno. (Ela causa dano de combate antes das criaturas sem iniciativa.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449111&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc3f66fd-514e-4541-a514-f46dd200b6aa\', \'multiverseId\': 449111}, \'multiverseid\': 449111}, {\'name\': \'Наставник Кавалеристов\', \'text\': \'Когда Наставник Кавалеристов выходит на поле битвы, целевое существо получает +2/+0 и Первый удар до конца хода. (Оно наносит боевые повреждения раньше существ без Первого удара.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c3f478af-9ecb-4f36-b450-1ac970f2d180\', \'multiverseId\': 449392}, \'multiverseid\': 449392}, {\'name\': \'骑兵教官\', \'text\': \'当骑兵教官进战场时，直到回合结束，目标生物得+2/+0且获得先攻异能。（它会比不具先攻异能的生物提前造成战斗伤害。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449673&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'461db1af-d341-4840-b777-07b7dd7a9b28\', \'multiverseId\': 449673}, \'multiverseid\': 449673}, {\'name\': \'騎兵教官\', \'text\': \'當騎兵教官進戰場時，直到回合結束，目標生物得+2/+0且獲得先攻異能。（它會比不具先攻異能的生物提前造成戰鬥傷害。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449954&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'455f1c28-e97b-45a1-af3d-87de85d4bb93\', \'multiverseId\': 449954}, \'multiverseid\': 449954}]', '[{\'name\': \'Ausgehungerte Hydra\', \'text\': \'Die Ausgehungerte Hydra kommt mit X +1/+1-Marken ins Spiel.\\nDie Ausgehungerte Hydra kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\\nImmer wenn der Ausgehungerten Hydra Schaden zugefügt wird, lege entsprechend viele +1/+1-Marke auf sie. (Sie muss den Schaden überleben, um die Marken zu erhalten.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Hydra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447606&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64f88c5b-b73b-4e10-9f47-f888a577bb3d\', \'multiverseId\': 447606}, \'multiverseid\': 447606}, {\'name\': \'Hidra hambrienta\', \'text\': \'La Hidra hambrienta entra al campo de batalla con X contadores +1/+1 sobre ella.\\nLa Hidra hambrienta no puede ser bloqueada por más de una criatura.\\nSiempre que la Hidra hambrienta reciba daño, pon esa misma cantidad de contadores +1/+1 sobre ella. (Debe sobrevivir al daño para recibir los contadores.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447887&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cda140e9-54d5-440d-948d-da75d640e356\', \'multiverseId\': 447887}, \'multiverseid\': 447887}, {\'name\': \'Hydre affamée\', \'text\': "L\'Hydre affamée arrive sur le champ de bataille avec X marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle.\\nL\'Hydre affamée ne peut pas être bloquée par plus d\'une créature.\\nÀ chaque fois que l\'Hydre affamée subit des blessures, mettez autant de marqueurs +1/+1 sur elle. (Elle doit survivre aux blessures pour gagner les marqueurs.)", \'type\': \'Créature : hydre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448168&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22bc8133-fb50-4207-9e02-aa373819a462\', \'multiverseId\': 448168}, \'multiverseid\': 448168}, {\'name\': \'Idra Affamata\', \'text\': "L\'Idra Affamata entra nel campo di battaglia con X segnalini +1/+1.\\nL\'Idra Affamata non può essere bloccata da più di una creatura.\\nOgniqualvolta viene inflitto danno all\'Idra Affamata, metti altrettanti segnalini +1/+1 su di essa. (Deve sopravvivere al danno per ottenere i segnalini.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Idra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448449&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e2983c6-9d5d-4d12-b7e1-79baba381946\', \'multiverseId\': 448449}, \'multiverseid\': 448449}, {\'name\': \'飢餓ハイドラ\', \'text\': \'飢餓ハイドラは、＋１/＋１カウンターがＸ個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n飢餓ハイドラは、２体以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n飢餓ハイドラにダメージが与えられるたび、その点数に等しい数の＋１/＋１カウンターをこれの上に置く。（カウンターを得るには、そのダメージを受けた後でこれが戦場に残っている必要がある。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ハイドラ\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448730&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfdff697-8388-4354-bc99-1d35bd8bb215\', \'multiverseId\': 448730}, \'multiverseid\': 448730}, {\'name\': \'굶주린 히드라\', \'text\': \'굶주린 히드라는 +1/+1 카운터 X개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n굶주린 히드라는 생물 하나에게만 방어될 수 있다.\\n굶주린 히드라가 피해를 입을 때마다, 굶주린 히드라에 +1/+1 카운터를 그만큼 올려놓는다. (카운터를 얻으려면 피해를 입고 살아남아야 한다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 히드라\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449011&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'97939c27-1114-4646-add8-61f68eaabfc0\', \'multiverseId\': 449011}, \'multiverseid\': 449011}, {\'name\': \'Hidra Faminta\', \'text\': \'Hidra Faminta entra no campo de batalha com X marcadores +1/+1.\\nHidra Faminta não pode ser bloqueada por mais de uma criatura.\\nToda vez que Hidra Faminta sofrer dano, coloque aquela quantidade de marcadores +1/+1 nela. (Ela precisa sobreviver ao dano para receber os marcadores.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hidra\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449292&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'921cc58b-a7f9-408a-ac3c-29dcffd04a44\', \'multiverseId\': 449292}, \'multiverseid\': 449292}, {\'name\': \'Изголодавшаяся Гидра\', \'text\': \'Изголодавшаяся Гидра выходит на поле битвы с X жетонами +1/+1 на ней.\\nИзголодавшаяся Гидра не может быть заблокирована более чем одним существом.\\nКаждый раз, когда Изголодавшейся Гидре наносятся повреждения, положите на нее такое же количество жетонов +1/+1. (Она должна пережить повреждения, чтобы получить жетоны.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гидра\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449573&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1562aec9-c32e-484a-83e5-5d66d2b99f33\', \'multiverseId\': 449573}, \'multiverseid\': 449573}, {\'name\': \'饥渴多头龙\', \'text\': \'饥渴多头龙进战场时上面有X个+1/+1指示物。\\n饥渴多头龙不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\\n每当饥渴多头龙受到伤害时，在其上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。（受伤害后要活下来才能得到指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多头龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449854&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52e01d8b-a1cb-4217-8734-39b15699d4ff\', \'multiverseId\': 449854}, \'multiverseid\': 449854}, {\'name\': \'飢渴多頭龍\', \'text\': \'飢渴多頭龍進戰場時上面有X個+1/+1指示物。\\n飢渴多頭龍不能被多於一個生物阻擋。\\n每當飢渴多頭龍受到傷害時，在其上放置等量的+1/+1指示物。（受傷害後要活下來才能得到指示物。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～多頭龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450135&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c49decb5-0388-4def-a999-3663ed13b768\', \'multiverseId\': 450135}, \'multiverseid\': 450135}]', '[{\'name\': \'Außerordentliches Wachstum\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +7/+7 und verursacht Trampelschaden.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Schau nur, wie süß sie jetzt aussieht!"\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447611&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5f52fb8-0363-4df4-a982-3c63c56971ed\', \'multiverseId\': 447611}, \'multiverseid\': 447611}, {\'name\': \'Crecimiento prodigioso\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +7/+7 y tiene la habilidad de arrollar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"¡Mira lo adorable que es ahora!".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447892&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567f4d23-289f-4dce-a68e-d9d1399f1781\', \'multiverseId\': 447892}, \'multiverseid\': 447892}, {\'name\': \'Croissance prodigieuse\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +7/+7 et a le piétinement.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': \'« Regardez comme elle est mignonne maintenant ! »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448173&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b635df5a-f8ea-4769-9c2e-08058e0a2922\', \'multiverseId\': 448173}, \'multiverseid\': 448173}, {\'name\': \'Crescita Prodigiosa\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +7/+7 e ha travolgere.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Guarda com\\\'è diventato carino!"\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448454&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04519224-8496-425e-b67f-fbebe4a100b2\', \'multiverseId\': 448454}, \'multiverseid\': 448454}, {\'name\': \'驚異的成長\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋７/＋７の修整を受け、トランプルを持つ。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「とっても可愛くなったわ！」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448735&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b2845f1c-496c-4dae-b2de-71fa5a368d9e\', \'multiverseId\': 448735}, \'multiverseid\': 448735}, {\'name\': \'엄청난 성장\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +7/+7을 받고 돌진을 가진다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"지금은 얼마나 귀여운지 봐!"\\n—비비안 레이드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449016&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d3a07b8-618c-48c3-9f23-8925fc4baa60\', \'multiverseId\': 449016}, \'multiverseid\': 449016}, {\'name\': \'Crescimento Prodigioso\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +7/+7 e tem atropelar.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Olha como ficou fofo!"\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449297&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5d6f0f11-deca-4c1f-92ba-30bdd2442398\', \'multiverseId\': 449297}, \'multiverseid\': 449297}, {\'name\': \'Непомерный Рост\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +7/+7 и имеет Пробивной удар.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Посмотри, какой он теперь милый!»\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449578&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b96df982-87ce-45fc-9d0d-9801cd8650dd\', \'multiverseId\': 449578}, \'multiverseid\': 449578}, {\'name\': \'异常成长\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+7/+7且具有践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「瞧瞧它现在多可爱呀！」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449859&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eccfce9-677c-49aa-9e43-309cd7c2b04f\', \'multiverseId\': 449859}, \'multiverseid\': 449859}, {\'name\': \'異常成長\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+7/+7且具有踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「瞧瞧牠現在多可愛呀！」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450140&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2920b676-0e7a-41a3-808d-cd7130bb9c80\', \'multiverseId\': 450140}, \'multiverseid\': 450140}]', '[{\'name\': \'Avior-Windmagierin\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nImmer wenn du einen Spontanzauber oder eine Hexerei wirkst, erhält die Avior-Windmagierin +1/+1 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vogel, Zauberer\', \'flavor\': \'„Meine Fähigkeiten werden mit jedem Flügelschlag präziser."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447462&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ba3af5d7-4deb-4082-b44f-c3c495594244\', \'multiverseId\': 447462}, \'multiverseid\': 447462}, {\'name\': \'Maga del viento aven\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro, la Maga del viento aven obtiene +1/+1 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Hechicero ave\', \'flavor\': \'"Mi destreza se agudiza cada vez que bato las alas".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447743&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f794af05-d86a-4e26-8ec8-a097b1b43753\', \'multiverseId\': 447743}, \'multiverseid\': 447743}, {\'name\': \'Magevent avemain\', \'text\': "Vol\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel, la Magevent avemain gagne +1/+1 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : oiseau et sorcier\', \'flavor\': "« Chacun de mes battements d\'ailes améliore mes compétences. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448024&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2ee6cf1-3ad4-4cbd-b7cc-651bad7970cf\', \'multiverseId\': 448024}, \'multiverseid\': 448024}, {\'name\': \'Maga del Vento Aviana\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia istantaneo o stregoneria, la Maga del Vento Aviana prende +1/+1 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Mago Uccello\', \'flavor\': \'"Le mie abilità si affinano con ogni battito delle mie ali."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448305&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8007e41-d1c5-4b61-814f-9120a87fd94f\', \'multiverseId\': 448305}, \'multiverseid\': 448305}, {\'name\': \'エイヴンの風魔道士\', \'text\': \'飛行\\nあなたがインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えるたび、ターン終了時まで、エイヴンの風魔道士は＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 鳥・ウィザード\', \'flavor\': \'「羽ばたくたびに、私の技は研ぎ澄まされる。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448586&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2e0bf175-5c00-431c-bf07-fcb585d1fbc6\', \'multiverseId\': 448586}, \'multiverseid\': 448586}, {\'name\': \'에이븐 바람 마도사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n당신이 순간마법 또는 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때마다, 에이븐 바람 마도사는 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 조류 마법사\', \'flavor\': \'"내 기술은 내가 날개를 펄럭일 때마다 더 예리해진다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f98cd6d-c0a4-4e64-8a89-091a7103aaa6\', \'multiverseId\': 448867}, \'multiverseid\': 448867}, {\'name\': \'Maga Eólica Aviana\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica instantânea ou um feitiço, Maga Eólica Aviana recebe +1/+1 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ave Mago\', \'flavor\': \'"Minha habilidade se aprimora a cada batida de minhas asas."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449148&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1cd16f3a-0cf1-4bef-b00c-541adb88640d\', \'multiverseId\': 449148}, \'multiverseid\': 449148}, {\'name\': \'Авен, Маг Ветра\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства, Авен, Маг Ветра получает +1/+1 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Птица Чародей\', \'flavor\': \'«Мое мастерство растет с каждым взмахом крыльев».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'125c23a5-2e04-464e-988f-2acf043b628c\', \'multiverseId\': 449429}, \'multiverseid\': 449429}, {\'name\': \'艾文风法师\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n每当你施放瞬间或法术咒语时，艾文风法师得+1/+1直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鸟／法术师\', \'flavor\': \'「我的双翼扑扇一次，技艺便精湛一分。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'053d2de6-840b-4318-bdb2-04f8c4d2bf3f\', \'multiverseId\': 449710}, \'multiverseid\': 449710}, {\'name\': \'艾文風法師\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n每當你施放瞬間或巫術咒語時，艾文風法師得+1/+1直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鳥／魔法師\', \'flavor\': \'「我的雙翼撲扇一次，技藝便精湛一分。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70d6bdc1-5dcd-456d-b137-abfb4bfd9551\', \'multiverseId\': 449991}, \'multiverseid\': 449991}]', '[{\'name\': \'Axt des Marodeurs\', \'text\': \'Die ausgerüstete Kreatur erhält +2/+0.\\nAusrüsten {2} ({2}: Lege diese Karte an eine Kreatur deiner Wahl an, die du kontrollierst. Spiele Ausrüsten wie eine Hexerei.)\', \'type\': \'Artefakt — Ausrüstung\', \'flavor\': \'Eine scharfe Axt löst die meisten Probleme.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447658&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47dd7294-4fc0-449d-b10f-e75565517f18\', \'multiverseId\': 447658}, \'multiverseid\': 447658}, {\'name\': \'Hacha de saqueador\', \'text\': \'La criatura equipada obtiene +2/+0.\\nEquipar {2}. ({2}: Anexa este Equipo a la criatura objetivo que controlas. Activa la habilidad de equipar como un conjuro.)\', \'type\': \'Artefacto — Equipo\', \'flavor\': \'Un hacha bien afilada resuelve casi todos los problemas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447939&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b5851dde-1995-4c30-a427-68fefe035f35\', \'multiverseId\': 447939}, \'multiverseid\': 447939}, {\'name\': \'Hache de maraudeur\', \'text\': "La créature équipée gagne +2/+0.\\nÉquipement {2} ({2} : Attachez à la créature ciblée que vous contrôlez. N\'attachez l\'équipement que lorsque vous pourriez lancer un rituel.)", \'type\': \'Artefact : équipement\', \'flavor\': \'Une hache bien aiguisée résout la plupart des problèmes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448220&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dabcfffa-eef1-4c65-972e-224e90a40da0\', \'multiverseId\': 448220}, \'multiverseid\': 448220}, {\'name\': \'Ascia del Predone\', \'text\': \'La creatura equipaggiata prende +2/+0.\\nEquipaggiare {2} ({2}: Assegna a una creatura bersaglio che controlli. Equipaggia solo quando potresti lanciare una stregoneria.)\', \'type\': \'Artefatto — Equipaggiamento\', \'flavor\': "Un\'ascia affilata può risolvere quasi tutti i problemi.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448501&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80f34bac-60aa-4c15-bef7-a4f472e91a66\', \'multiverseId\': 448501}, \'multiverseid\': 448501}, {\'name\': \'匪賊の斧\', \'text\': \'装備しているクリーチャーは＋２/＋０の修整を受ける。\\n装備{2}（{2}：あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャー１体を対象とし、これをそれにつける。装備はソーサリーとしてのみ行う。）\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト — 装備品\', \'flavor\': \'鋭利な斧はたいていの問題を解決する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448782&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c11bcb16-34b1-457e-86a4-988c2dc770d2\', \'multiverseId\': 448782}, \'multiverseid\': 448782}, {\'name\': \'약탈자의 도끼\', \'text\': \'장착된 생물은 +2/+0을 받는다.\\n장착 {2} ({2}: 당신이 조종하는 생물 한 개를 목표로 정한다. 그 생물에 이 장비를 부착한다. 당신이 집중마법을 발동할 수 있는 시기에만 장착할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'마법물체 — 장비\', \'flavor\': \'날카로운 도끼는 대부분의 문제를 해결한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449063&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'079d9e51-d0e3-4e4f-905b-819c6e751519\', \'multiverseId\': 449063}, \'multiverseid\': 449063}, {\'name\': \'Machado do Saqueador\', \'text\': \'A criatura equipada recebe +2/+0.\\nEquipar {2} ({2}: Anexe à criatura alvo que você controla. Equipe somente como um feitiço.)\', \'type\': \'Artefato — Equipamento\', \'flavor\': \'Um machado afiado resolve a maioria dos problemas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449344&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07a8c9e0-5760-4625-9eb5-3484ffb85462\', \'multiverseId\': 449344}, \'multiverseid\': 449344}, {\'name\': \'Топор Мародера\', \'text\': \'Снаряженное существо получает +2/+0.\\nСнарядить {2} ({2}: прикрепите к целевому существу под вашим контролем. Снаряжайте только как волшебство.)\', \'type\': \'Артефакт — Снаряжение\', \'flavor\': \'Острый топор может решить почти любую проблему.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449625&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'739d2b28-bd37-42bc-a6e6-4e0b104dbe78\', \'multiverseId\': 449625}, \'multiverseid\': 449625}, {\'name\': \'劫掠者战斧\', \'text\': \'佩带此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩带{2}（{2}：装备在目标由你操控的生物上。佩带的时机视同法术。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'利斧在手，能解决大多数问题。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449906&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d1da3d7-b80a-4596-b2ce-e52f0bb5e6ef\', \'multiverseId\': 449906}, \'multiverseid\': 449906}, {\'name\': \'劫掠者戰斧\', \'text\': \'佩帶此武具的生物得+2/+0。\\n佩帶{2}（{2}：裝備在目標由你操控的生物上。佩帶的時機視同巫術。）\', \'type\': \'神器 ～武具\', \'flavor\': \'利斧在手，能解決大多數問題。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450187&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de5dc41-b55a-4b08-a25f-4abe30e69d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 450187}, \'multiverseid\': 450187}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bannfeuer\', \'text\': \'Das Bannfeuer fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl X Schadenspunkte zu.\\nFalls X 5 oder mehr beträgt, kann dieser Zauberspruch nicht neutralisiert werden und der Schaden kann nicht verhindert werden.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Für Sarkhan Vol ist ein Drache der reinste Ausdruck der Herrlichkeit des wilden Lebens.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447547&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4b8c584-034c-4258-8c74-3b99c5a55e76\', \'multiverseId\': 447547}, \'multiverseid\': 447547}, {\'name\': \'Fuego devastador\', \'text\': \'El Fuego devastador hace X puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\\nSi X es 5 o más, este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado y el daño no puede ser prevenido.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Para Sarkhan Vol, el dragón es la expresión más pura del esplendor de la vida salvaje.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447828&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'66f78e19-43f5-4022-9446-790937b102ae\', \'multiverseId\': 447828}, \'multiverseid\': 447828}, {\'name\': \'Pestefeu\', \'text\': "Le Pestefeu inflige X blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.\\nSi X est supérieur ou égal à 5, ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré et les blessures ne peuvent pas être prévenues.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Pour Sarkhan Vol, le dragon est l\'expression la plus pure de la splendeur sauvage de la vie.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448109&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'53dd73b8-196a-42d1-b768-419c57ba331d\', \'multiverseId\': 448109}, \'multiverseid\': 448109}, {\'name\': \'Fuoco di Sventura\', \'text\': \'Il Fuoco di Sventura infligge X danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\\nSe X è pari o superiore a 5, questa magia non può essere neutralizzata e il danno non può essere prevenuto.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Per Sarkhan Vol, il drago è la manifestazione più pura dello splendore selvaggio insito in ogni essenza vitale.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448390&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29648913-3226-412d-aec0-bda615fdf057\', \'multiverseId\': 448390}, \'multiverseid\': 448390}, {\'name\': \'苦悩火\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。苦悩火はそれにＸ点のダメージを与える。\\nＸが５以上であるなら、この呪文は打ち消されず、そのダメージは軽減できない。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'サルカン・ヴォルにとっては、ドラゴンは生命の野蛮な輝きの純然たる発現だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448671&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c3a9cf7-6fd4-4579-bc58-5c4650eca51b\', \'multiverseId\': 448671}, \'multiverseid\': 448671}, {\'name\': \'재앙의 화염\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표를 정한다. 재앙의 화염은 그 목표에게 피해 X점을 입힌다.\\nX가 5 이상이라면, 이 주문은 무효화될 수 없으며 그 피해는 방지될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'사르칸 볼에게 있어, 용이란 생명의 야만적인 화려함을 가장 순수하게 표현하는 존재이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448952&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f20ed73-b584-47be-b7ca-727661462f13\', \'multiverseId\': 448952}, \'multiverseid\': 448952}, {\'name\': \'Fogo Devastador\', \'text\': \'Fogo Devastador causa X pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\\nSe X for 5 ou mais, esta mágica não poderá ser anulada e o dano não poderá ser prevenido.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Para Sarkhan Vol, o dragão é a expressão mais pura do esplendor selvagem da vida.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449233&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec3054ec-4e9f-4075-ba45-d9ee752fccdd\', \'multiverseId\': 449233}, \'multiverseid\': 449233}, {\'name\': \'Губительное Пламя\', \'text\': \'Губительное Пламя наносит X повреждений любой цели.\\nЕсли X равен или превышает 5, это заклинание не может быть отменено и повреждения не могут быть предотвращены.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Для Сархана Воля дракон — это чистейшее выражение дикого великолепия жизни.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449514&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ecfaced-285f-42dd-b65f-499fcf0fe2a4\', \'multiverseId\': 449514}, \'multiverseid\': 449514}, {\'name\': \'禁咒焰\', \'text\': \'禁咒焰对任意一个目标造成X点伤害。\\n如果X等于或大于5，则此咒语不能被反击，且其伤害不能被防止。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'对萨坎沃来说，巨龙是蛮勇生命的极致具现。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449795&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cfe249dc-89c5-437e-a139-807bf1bec045\', \'multiverseId\': 449795}, \'multiverseid\': 449795}, {\'name\': \'禁咒焰\', \'text\': \'禁咒焰對任意一個目標造成X點傷害。\\n如果X等於或大於5，則此咒語不能被反擊，且其傷害不能被防止。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'對薩坎沃來說，巨龍是蠻勇生命的極致具現。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450076&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0483c3b5-7665-40c5-a87c-524f407499fd\', \'multiverseId\': 450076}, \'multiverseid\': 450076}]', '[{\'name\': \'Belagerungsbrecher-Riesin\', \'text\': \'Verursacht Trampelschaden (Diese Kreatur kann beim Angreifen überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)\\n{3}{R}: Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl kann in diesem Zug nicht blocken.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Riese, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Keine Blockade kann der Wut eines Riesen standhalten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447574&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af6fa7cd-8210-496b-83cc-940d49ec4ffa\', \'multiverseId\': 447574}, \'multiverseid\': 447574}, {\'name\': \'Gigante rompeasedios\', \'text\': \'Arrolla. (Esta criatura puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker al que ataca.)\\n{3}{R}: La criatura objetivo no puede bloquear este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante guerrero\', \'flavor\': \'Ninguna muralla se resiste a la furia de un gigante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447855&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10e77f4d-a31d-4fae-8e0c-d04ae060e49c\', \'multiverseId\': 447855}, \'multiverseid\': 447855}, {\'name\': \'Géante brise-siège\', \'text\': "Piétinement (Cette créature peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.)\\n{3}{R} : La créature ciblée ne peut pas bloquer ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature : géant et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Aucun rempart ne peut résister à la fureur d\'un géant.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448136&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9c606f1b-3863-442d-95f6-9bab8fe0fef0\', \'multiverseId\': 448136}, \'multiverseid\': 448136}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Sfondatrice\', \'text\': \'Travolgere (Questa creatura può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.)\\n{3}{R}: Una creatura bersaglio non può bloccare in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Gigante\', \'flavor\': \'Nessuna barricata può resistere alla furia di un gigante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448417&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cbde5974-4314-4422-95f9-275d7398a025\', \'multiverseId\': 448417}, \'multiverseid\': 448417}, {\'name\': \'包囲破りの巨人\', \'text\': \'トランプル（このクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージをこれが攻撃しているプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）\\n{3}{R}：クリーチャー１体を対象とする。このターン、それではブロックできない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 巨人・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'巨人の怒りに耐える城壁などない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448698&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'acb2578d-2d46-43a8-9885-a98301bc17c1\', \'multiverseId\': 448698}, \'multiverseid\': 448698}, {\'name\': \'공성파괴자 거인\', \'text\': \'돌진 (이 생물은 여분의 전투피해를 공격 중인 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 입힐 수 있다.)\\n{3}{R}: 생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 이 턴에 방어할 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 거인 전사\', \'flavor\': \'어떤 맹렬함도 거인의 분노에는 견줄 수 없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448979&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c975819b-4f88-4763-9315-3808464abc86\', \'multiverseId\': 448979}, \'multiverseid\': 448979}, {\'name\': \'Gigante Rompedora de Cercos\', \'text\': \'Atropelar (Esta criatura pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.)\\n{3}{R}: A criatura alvo não pode bloquear neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Gigante Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhum antemuro resiste à fúria de um gigante.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449260&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'249d1dc5-03fb-4fad-97dc-5236f4854f4d\', \'multiverseId\': 449260}, \'multiverseid\': 449260}, {\'name\': \'Осадный Гигант\', \'text\': \'Пробивной удар (Это существо может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker-у, которого атакует.)\\n{3}{R}: целевое существо не может блокировать в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гигант Воин\', \'flavor\': \'Ни один бастион не выстоит перед яростью гиганта.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449541&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc84b2da-e86f-40d4-9f91-88b0f123fbda\', \'multiverseId\': 449541}, \'multiverseid\': 449541}, {\'name\': \'破围巨人\', \'text\': \'践踏（此生物造成之过量战斗伤害能对所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）\\n{3}{R}：目标生物本回合不能进行阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人／战士\', \'flavor\': \'没有壁垒能挡得住巨人的怒火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449822&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2c97797e-f6f8-4a2b-bd3e-2d487c6ff630\', \'multiverseId\': 449822}, \'multiverseid\': 449822}, {\'name\': \'破圍巨人\', \'text\': \'踐踏（此生物造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對所攻擊的玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）\\n{3}{R}：目標生物本回合不能進行阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～巨人／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'沒有壁壘能擋得住巨人的怒火。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450103&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c0fa434-5a01-4c83-be15-f22e9bf5ab71\', \'multiverseId\': 450103}, \'multiverseid\': 450103}]', '[{\'name\': \'Benebeln\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -4/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Keldonen muss man erst einmal zur Ruhe bringen, bevor man ihnen Vernunft einbläuen kann.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450290&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ba615c-8757-420d-ac3d-2604573a2c21\', \'multiverseId\': 450290}, \'multiverseid\': 450290}, {\'name\': \'Confundir\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -4/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Para poder hablar de verdad con los keldon, el truco está en hacer que se estén quietos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450324&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'06a586d5-badd-4bb1-9b0f-66cb325b4bc9\', \'multiverseId\': 450324}, \'multiverseid\': 450324}, {\'name\': \'Stupéfier\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -4/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Pour raisonner des Keldes, il faut qu\'ils se tiennent tranquilles.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450358&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0cbe302-8b7b-4ab8-a1ec-820746acce18\', \'multiverseId\': 450358}, \'multiverseid\': 450358}, {\'name\': \'Frastornare\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -4/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il trucco per far ragionare gli abitanti di Keld è riuscire a immobilizzarli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450392&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'288b5ed7-a609-4d82-9bee-60183451f1cf\', \'multiverseId\': 450392}, \'multiverseid\': 450392}, {\'name\': \'混迷\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－４/－０の修整を受ける。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ケルド人を従わせるコツは、動けなくすることだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450426&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'415cbaab-ca2b-48a7-a8f6-b14468305339\', \'multiverseId\': 450426}, \'multiverseid\': 450426}, {\'name\': \'어리둥절\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -4/-0을 받는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'켈드인들이 말귀를 알아듣게 하는 방법은 가만히 있도록 붙잡아두는 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450460&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'172a0952-e122-4eaa-a5ac-8d76bc38dfa7\', \'multiverseId\': 450460}, \'multiverseid\': 450460}, {\'name\': \'Desconcertar\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -4/-0 até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O truque para chamar os keldonianos à razão é fazer com que eles parem quietos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2b21f9a5-c490-445d-8a2a-00d0a7ccbd81\', \'multiverseId\': 450494}, \'multiverseid\': 450494}, {\'name\': \'Сбить с Толку\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -4/-0 до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Чтобы келдонец внял голосу разума, его просто нужно заставить постоять спокойно.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450528&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'728bb978-4451-4b7c-8f12-62c8e50a4e37\', \'multiverseId\': 450528}, \'multiverseid\': 450528}, {\'name\': \'困惑不已\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-4/-0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'让凯尔顿人恢复理智的诀窍就是让他们动弹不得。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450562&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b67c2603-3e6f-4fd7-8d6f-a75e8d6c1d5a\', \'multiverseId\': 450562}, \'multiverseid\': 450562}, {\'name\': \'困惑不已\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-4/-0直到回合結束。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'讓凱爾頓人恢復理智的訣竅就是讓他們動彈不得。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450596&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1fb63a60-4c1b-49ae-a175-bc2b9ba708d4\', \'multiverseId\': 450596}, \'multiverseid\': 450596}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bestialisches Gespenst\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn das Bestialische Gespenst ins Spiel kommt, wirft ein Gegner deiner Wahl eine Karte ab.\\nImmer wenn ein Gegner eine Karte abwirft, verliert er 2 Lebenspunkte.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Specter\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447513&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2fd9a5a7-1467-4a17-ba0b-7dc6b8ac99a3\', \'multiverseId\': 447513}, \'multiverseid\': 447513}, {\'name\': \'Espectro maligno\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Espectro maligno entre al campo de batalla, el oponente objetivo descarta una carta.\\nSiempre que un oponente descarte una carta, ese jugador pierde 2 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espectro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447794&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5bff8ec-24b0-4a79-87f1-b8b616091c98\', \'multiverseId\': 447794}, \'multiverseid\': 447794}, {\'name\': \'Spectre sinistre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Spectre sinistre arrive sur le champ de bataille, l\'adversaire ciblé se défausse d\'une carte.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un adversaire se défausse d\'une carte, ce joueur perd 2 points de vie.", \'type\': \'Créature : spectre\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448075&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9dc15f50-39ca-4edc-8bf6-07df4cb30bec\', \'multiverseId\': 448075}, \'multiverseid\': 448075}, {\'name\': \'Spettro Sinistro\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando lo Spettro Sinistro entra nel campo di battaglia, un avversario bersaglio scarta una carta.\\nOgniqualvolta un avversario scarta una carta, quel giocatore perde 2 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Spettro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448356&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a74331e-ba80-4984-a82e-960a3fc9940c\', \'multiverseId\': 448356}, \'multiverseid\': 448356}, {\'name\': \'不吉な死霊\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n不吉な死霊が戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーはカード１枚を捨てる。\\n対戦相手がカードを１枚捨てるたび、そのプレイヤーは２点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — スペクター\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448637&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eeb22e3-af4b-45cb-b34f-fbe469d28433\', \'multiverseId\': 448637}, \'multiverseid\': 448637}, {\'name\': \'악랄한 스펙터\', \'text\': \'비행\\n악랄한 스펙터가 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 카드 한 장을 버린다.\\n상대가 손에서 카드를 버릴 때마다, 그 플레이어는 생명 2점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 스펙터\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448918&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1a0b7e0d-b330-486f-8399-f5a1eb2000bf\', \'multiverseId\': 448918}, \'multiverseid\': 448918}, {\'name\': \'Espectro Vil\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Espectro Vil entra no campo de batalha, o oponente alvo descarta um card.\\nToda vez que um oponente descarta um card, aquele jogador perde 2 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Espectro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449199&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8200ae80-d491-499f-842b-24a0e591d229\', \'multiverseId\': 449199}, \'multiverseid\': 449199}, {\'name\': \'Кошмарный Призрак\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Кошмарный Призрак выходит на поле битвы, целевой оппонент сбрасывает карту.\\nКаждый раз, когда оппонент сбрасывает карту, он теряет 2 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Призрак\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449480&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'22350f83-cb71-4b09-93dd-46209bbcd5e0\', \'multiverseId\': 449480}, \'multiverseid\': 449480}, {\'name\': \'骇人幽灵\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当骇人幽灵进战场时，目标对手弃一张牌。\\n每当一位对手弃一张牌时，该牌手失去2点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～幽灵\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449761&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ef99a0a-2e52-40c7-9cc2-1b7f71fac38e\', \'multiverseId\': 449761}, \'multiverseid\': 449761}, {\'name\': \'駭人幽靈\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當駭人幽靈進戰場時，目標對手棄一張牌。\\n每當一位對手棄一張牌時，該玩家失去2點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～幽靈\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450042&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d086b4-9a63-4da2-a626-5aa0864bfaa1\', \'multiverseId\': 450042}, \'multiverseid\': 450042}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bewaldete Schlucht\', \'text\': \'Die Bewaldete Schlucht kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {R} oder {G}.\', \'type\': \'Land\', \'flavor\': \'Tazeem ist rau zu seinen Bewohnern, doch diejenigen, die es Heimat nennen, würden nirgendwo anders leben wollen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447676&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2783034-17a4-4121-ae31-d6c33bb403de\', \'multiverseId\': 447676}, \'multiverseid\': 447676}, {\'name\': \'Desfiladero de madera\', \'text\': \'El Desfiladero de madera entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {R} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Tierra\', \'flavor\': \'El abrazo de Tazeem es rudo, pero no podría ser más acogedor para aquellos que lo llaman hogar.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e855fe10-6603-4377-bcb6-8a606d8d59f4\', \'multiverseId\': 447957}, \'multiverseid\': 447957}, {\'name\': \'Gorge du massif\', \'text\': \'La Gorge du massif arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {R} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terrain\', \'flavor\': "Tazeem est rude, mais pour ceux qui le considèrent comme leur foyer, ce continent n\'a pas son pareil.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448238&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8512f12-ff45-4b17-b76a-cf4a46fd02f5\', \'multiverseId\': 448238}, \'multiverseid\': 448238}, {\'name\': \'Gola Boscosa\', \'text\': \'La Gola Boscosa entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {R} o {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terra\', \'flavor\': "L\'abbraccio di Tazeem è duro, ma chi lo chiama patria non desidera nient\'altro.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'209f9d71-4db9-4550-832f-712dbf067096\', \'multiverseId\': 448519}, \'multiverseid\': 448519}, {\'name\': \'森林の地溝\', \'text\': \'森林の地溝はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{R}か{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'土地\', \'flavor\': \'タジームの自然環境は過酷だが、そこを故郷とする者には何にも代えがたい。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b734ee32-9b54-489d-9988-a169e1aa472f\', \'multiverseId\': 448800}, \'multiverseid\': 448800}, {\'name\': \'산림 협곡\', \'text\': \'산림 협곡은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {R} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'대지\', \'flavor\': \'타짐의 환경은 척박하지만, 이곳이 삶의 터전인 자들에게는 천국이나 다름없다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e1a3cf40-d3bb-4a1b-a24b-e361485cbce8\', \'multiverseId\': 449081}, \'multiverseid\': 449081}, {\'name\': \'Desfiladeiro da Mata\', \'text\': \'Desfiladeiro da Mata entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {R} ou {G}.\', \'type\': \'Terreno\', \'flavor\': \'O abraço de Tazeem é bruto, mas, para os que fazem dela seu lar, nada o substitui.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449362&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdd167f2-8525-487a-af03-af4e6c81deda\', \'multiverseId\': 449362}, \'multiverseid\': 449362}, {\'name\': \'Лесная Теснина\', \'text\': \'Лесная Теснина выходит на поле битвы повернутой.\\n{T}: добавьте {R} или {G}.\', \'type\': \'Земля\', \'flavor\': \'Объятья Тазима суровы, но для тех, кто называет это место домом, не подойдет ничто иное.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449643&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b50fea9a-8aec-41a2-a955-1e9320baab12\', \'multiverseId\': 449643}, \'multiverseid\': 449643}, {\'name\': \'林场峡谷\', \'text\': \'林场峡谷须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'虽然塔晋的环境严酷，但对以此为家乡者而言，却是无可替代的所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449924&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c51d90a2-5a3f-44f9-b616-ad8aa4e86083\', \'multiverseId\': 449924}, \'multiverseid\': 449924}, {\'name\': \'林場峽谷\', \'text\': \'林場峽谷須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{R}或{G}。\', \'type\': \'地\', \'flavor\': \'雖然塔晉的環境嚴酷，但對以此為家鄉者而言，卻是無可替代的所在。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450205&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fdf41e3b-13c5-4218-9fc2-0c745b8cff72\', \'multiverseId\': 450205}, \'multiverseid\': 450205}]', '[{\'name\': \'Biss der Monarchin\', \'text\': \'Ein Spieler deiner Wahl verliert 3 Lebenspunkte und du erhältst 3 Lebenspunkte dazu.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Du hast deinem Königreich alles gegeben, verehrter Ritter. Ruhe soll deine Belohnung sein."\\n—Königin Lian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447537&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bd7f6ff3-9586-48d4-aa04-8e2a5c874217\', \'multiverseId\': 447537}, \'multiverseid\': 447537}, {\'name\': \'Mordisco de la soberana\', \'text\': \'El jugador objetivo pierde 3 vidas y tú ganas 3 vidas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Lo diste todo por tu reino, gallardo caballero. La serenidad será tu recompensa".\\n—Reina Lian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447818&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7ea68358-5035-4a72-8d1b-2de1091d455a\', \'multiverseId\': 447818}, \'multiverseid\': 447818}, {\'name\': \'Morsure de la souveraine\', \'text\': \'Le joueur ciblé perd 3 points de vie et vous gagnez 3 points de vie.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Vous avez tout donné à votre royaume, preux chevalier. La sérénité sera votre récompense. »\\n—Reine Lian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448099&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07e81d14-585f-4726-bc27-72cd8fe851ea\', \'multiverseId\': 448099}, \'multiverseid\': 448099}, {\'name\': \'Morso della Sovrana\', \'text\': \'Un giocatore bersaglio perde 3 punti vita e tu guadagni 3 punti vita.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Hai dato tutto al tuo regno, devoto cavaliere. La serenità sarà il tuo premio."\\n—Regina Lian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448380&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27cbe266-dae1-41a7-beea-5a1b23f75fb6\', \'multiverseId\': 448380}, \'multiverseid\': 448380}, {\'name\': \'君主の一噛み\', \'text\': \'プレイヤー１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは３点のライフを失い、あなたは３点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「あなたは王国にすべてを捧げました。騎士よ。静穏があなたへの褒美となるでしょう。」\\n――リアン女王\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448661&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60daa2ec-77df-4ade-9341-5dc247f3ba25\', \'multiverseId\': 448661}, \'multiverseid\': 448661}, {\'name\': \'군주의 물어뜯기\', \'text\': \'플레이어를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 생명 3점을 잃고 당신은 생명 3점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"기사여, 너는 네 모든 것을 왕국에 바쳤노라. 안식이 네 보상이 되리라."\\n—리안 여왕\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448942&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83bb0618-a929-41fb-adc3-eee191864fba\', \'multiverseId\': 448942}, \'multiverseid\': 448942}, {\'name\': \'Mordida da Soberana\', \'text\': \'O jogador alvo perde 3 pontos de vida e você ganha 3 pontos de vida.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Você deu tudo a seu reino, querido cavaleiro. A serenidade será seu prêmio."\\n— Rainha Lian\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449223&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48b53ff3-eb91-4a17-bb98-b6d00f9d9e51\', \'multiverseId\': 449223}, \'multiverseid\': 449223}, {\'name\': \'Укус Владычицы\', \'text\': \'Целевой игрок теряет 3 жизни, а вы получаете 3 жизни.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Ты все отдал своему королевству, добрый рыцарь. Пусть покой станет твоей наградой».\\n— королева Лиэн\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449504&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'24d26c13-ce52-451f-b354-a297bea898f9\', \'multiverseId\': 449504}, \'multiverseid\': 449504}, {\'name\': \'君王啮咬\', \'text\': \'目标牌手失去3点生命且你获得3点生命。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「骑士，你已为国家奉献一切。安眠是你应得的嘉奖。」\\n～丽安女王\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449785&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de744d4d-9534-4b59-8ac7-4088658b4552\', \'multiverseId\': 449785}, \'multiverseid\': 449785}, {\'name\': \'君王嚙咬\', \'text\': \'目標玩家失去3點生命且你獲得3點生命。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「騎士，你已為國家奉獻一切。安眠是你應得的嘉獎。」\\n～麗安女王\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450066&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59286c36-cdf7-4bac-b37e-58fb700daa11\', \'multiverseId\': 450066}, \'multiverseid\': 450066}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bittere Kälte\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die deine Gegner kontrollieren, erhalten -2/-0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Die Kälte verlangsamte ihre Bewegungen bis nur noch ihre Augäpfel panisch unter dem Eis zuckten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447499&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b15acf22-ecf0-4e8f-a0c8-42646e5495a4\', \'multiverseId\': 447499}, \'multiverseid\': 447499}, {\'name\': \'Congelación molesta\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlan tus oponentes obtienen -2/-0 hasta el final del turno.\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'El frío paralizó sus movimientos hasta que lo único que podían mover eran sus globos oculares, que se agitaban con pánico bajo el hielo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447780&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e012a566-ccb0-4e82-aeca-df12894d8d91\', \'multiverseId\': 447780}, \'multiverseid\': 447780}, {\'name\': \'Refroidissement inconfortable\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vos adversaires contrôlent gagnent -2/-0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Le froid ralentit leurs mouvements jusqu\'à ce que seuls leurs yeux paniqués s\'écarquillent sous la glace.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448061&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4756559d-b52f-4759-a7eb-bb71177a80a1\', \'multiverseId\': 448061}, \'multiverseid\': 448061}, {\'name\': \'Gelo Disagevole\', \'text\': \'Le creature controllate dai tuoi avversari prendono -2/-0 fino alla fine del turno.\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il gelo ne rallentò i movimenti finché solo i loro occhi restarono a vorticare terrorizzati sotto lo strato di ghiaccio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448342&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d43073ef-37f4-450b-b70a-34192ec66c2d\', \'multiverseId\': 448342}, \'multiverseid\': 448342}, {\'name\': \'不快な冷気\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、対戦相手がコントロールしているクリーチャーは－２/－０の修整を受ける。\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'冷気で動きが遅くなり、ついには面食らった目玉が氷の下でぐるぐる回るのみとなった。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448623&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ead19510-08e3-4c36-98c7-ee5f94db860c\', \'multiverseId\': 448623}, \'multiverseid\': 448623}, {\'name\': \'불편한 냉기\', \'text\': \'당신의 상대들이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 -2/-0을 받는다.\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'냉기는 그들을 얼어붙게 했고, 그들은 얼음 아래에서 겁에 질린 채로 눈동자만 굴릴 수 있었다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448904&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1c85b7ee-27a6-44a7-9b19-633287e1791a\', \'multiverseId\': 448904}, \'multiverseid\': 448904}, {\'name\': \'Calafrio Desconfortável\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que seus oponentes controlam recebem -2/-0 até o final do turno.\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'O frio desacelerou seus movimentos até que somente seus globos oculares se revirassem sob o gelo em pânico.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449185&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f33629d-3600-42c7-a8ac-4ec73984eebb\', \'multiverseId\': 449185}, \'multiverseid\': 449185}, {\'name\': \'Пробирающий Холод\', \'text\': \'Существа под контролем ваших оппонентов получают -2/-0 до конца хода.\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'От холода движения становились все медленнее, и вот уже одни только глаза в панике вращались под ледяной коркой.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449466&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35c7fe47-51b7-4d28-a9e6-42555d937320\', \'multiverseId\': 449466}, \'multiverseid\': 449466}, {\'name\': \'不适冰寒\', \'text\': \'由对手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合结束。\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'他们的动作因严寒不断减慢，不久就只剩下惊恐的眼睛在寒冰底下乱转。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449747&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e93caf69-e0fc-4252-871c-c947d9d18c97\', \'multiverseId\': 449747}, \'multiverseid\': 449747}, {\'name\': \'不適冰寒\', \'text\': \'由對手操控的生物得-2/-0直到回合結束。\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'他們的動作因嚴寒不斷減慢，不久只剩下驚恐的眼睛在寒冰底下亂轉。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450028&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f8c1a64e-4afe-4349-a64a-dd0ee2ddee25\', \'multiverseId\': 450028}, \'multiverseid\': 450028}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bleichholzrüstung\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +1/+1 für jeden Wald, den du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Manche Einsicht wird durch Instinkte gewonnen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447586&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3357491-7b5c-45c8-833f-53b977b98186\', \'multiverseId\': 447586}, \'multiverseid\': 447586}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de maderapálida\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +1/+1 por cada Bosque que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'El instinto abre paso a la verdadera perspicacia.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447867&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a18155-987d-4d1a-8212-ee6ba6e7ea08\', \'multiverseId\': 447867}, \'multiverseid\': 447867}, {\'name\': \'Armure de boisblanc\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +1/+1 pour chaque forêt que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "L\'instinct révèle l\'intuition la plus juste.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448148&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9de5ffaa-694d-42f3-aef3-59e6c3d27372\', \'multiverseId\': 448148}, \'multiverseid\': 448148}, {\'name\': \'Armatura di Boscopallido\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +1/+1 per ogni Foresta che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': "La miglior percezione è quella dell\'istinto.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448429&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'684ef917-b3ae-485a-bfeb-b9b4eb0fdabc\', \'multiverseId\': 448429}, \'multiverseid\': 448429}, {\'name\': \'ブランチウッドの鎧\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは、あなたがコントロールしている森１つにつき＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'直感は真の洞察を生む。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448710&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a505b3f9-4ea6-46c1-a58f-2734cb9ef2fe\', \'multiverseId\': 448710}, \'multiverseid\': 448710}, {\'name\': \'블랑쉬우드 갑옷\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 당신이 조종하는 숲 한 개당 +1/+1을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'본능은 진정한 통찰력을 낳는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448991&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbc10a7f-f909-41fc-b5a0-26eacf76a5cc\', \'multiverseId\': 448991}, \'multiverseid\': 448991}, {\'name\': \'Armadura de Blanchwood\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +1/+1 para cada Floresta que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'Os instintos fornecem a visão mais verdadeira.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449272&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d0c12df-4448-4abd-ba92-64e5c512c406\', \'multiverseId\': 449272}, \'multiverseid\': 449272}, {\'name\': \'Доспехи Бланчвуда\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +1/+1 за каждый Лес под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'Инстинкты порождают самые надежные озарения.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449553&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3942672c-eb7e-44b4-8698-ebce2939b5ae\', \'multiverseId\': 449553}, \'multiverseid\': 449553}, {\'name\': \'白木甲\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n你每操控一个树林，所结附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'最真切的预示源自本能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449834&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4e41fa1f-dad3-44b3-b879-57299c569656\', \'multiverseId\': 449834}, \'multiverseid\': 449834}, {\'name\': \'白木甲\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n你每操控一個樹林，所結附的生物便得+1/+1。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'最真切的預示源自本能。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450115&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7597e8d-7537-4513-8d25-4497e593b5d9\', \'multiverseId\': 450115}, \'multiverseid\': 450115}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzeinschlag\', \'text\': \'Der Blitzeinschlag fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Blitze zu schleudern bedeutet, das Chaos zu zähmen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447569&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20d34b2e-c181-4fa6-b8f9-f70796f31298\', \'multiverseId\': 447569}, \'multiverseid\': 447569}, {\'name\': \'Descarga de rayos\', \'text\': \'La Descarga de rayos hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Blandir el rayo es domar el caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447850&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e270a3c1-1871-4ef7-a53d-df92e9656e1f\', \'multiverseId\': 447850}, \'multiverseid\': 447850}, {\'name\': \'Frappe foudroyante\', \'text\': "La Frappe foudroyante inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Manipuler la foudre, c\'est apprivoiser le chaos.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448131&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'db4c85d0-3d05-4019-a336-577178abf9a7\', \'multiverseId\': 448131}, \'multiverseid\': 448131}, {\'name\': \'Colpo di Fulmine\', \'text\': \'Il Colpo di Fulmine infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Controllare il fulmine significa domare il caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448412&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bdb5a407-ff26-4a66-9926-997581a9708c\', \'multiverseId\': 448412}, \'multiverseid\': 448412}, {\'name\': \'稲妻の一撃\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。稲妻の一撃はそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'稲妻を操るということは、混沌を制御することを意味する。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448693&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'145079af-5504-4a1c-b3f6-fa65cc8af8a8\', \'multiverseId\': 448693}, \'multiverseid\': 448693}, {\'name\': \'번개 강타\', \'text\': \'원하는 목표를 정한다. 번개 강타는 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'번개를 다루려면 혼돈을 길들여야 한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448974&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'33e6b701-937d-4b8c-ac4a-12f4e6dad9e1\', \'multiverseId\': 448974}, \'multiverseid\': 448974}, {\'name\': \'Golpe Relampejante\', \'text\': \'Golpe Relampejante causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Manipular um raio é domar o caos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449255&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a77ddb67-d441-4652-9985-2d15946b9c16\', \'multiverseId\': 449255}, \'multiverseid\': 449255}, {\'name\': \'Удар Грома\', \'text\': \'Удар Грома наносит 3 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Повелевающий молниями обуздал хаос.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449536&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8759a600-2836-4fcf-a336-28c17cbe7bde\', \'multiverseId\': 449536}, \'multiverseid\': 449536}, {\'name\': \'闪电炼击\', \'text\': \'闪电炼击对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'召使闪电就如同驾驭混乱。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449817&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bdfe2e7-ea43-403b-8525-b14736412e57\', \'multiverseId\': 449817}, \'multiverseid\': 449817}, {\'name\': \'閃電煉擊\', \'text\': \'閃電煉擊對任意一個目標造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'召使閃電就如同駕馭混亂。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450098&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73c6b22b-1f5a-4293-bb17-7787a940b649\', \'multiverseId\': 450098}, \'multiverseid\': 450098}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzmaul-Drache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Blitzmaul-Drache ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {2}{R} bezahlen. Wenn du dies tust, fügt er einem Ziel deiner Wahl 3 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Narren glauben, dass Kolaghans Brut den Blitzen folgt. Die Weisen wissen, dass es andersherum ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447576&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098378bf-4b36-4fac-ad99-5032662db1af\', \'multiverseId\': 447576}, \'multiverseid\': 447576}, {\'name\': \'Dragón lenguarrayos\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón lenguarrayos entre al campo de batalla, puedes pagar {2}{R}. Cuando lo hagas, hace 3 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Los necios creen que la estirpe de Kólagan acompaña a las tormentas eléctricas. Los sabios entienden que es al revés.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447857&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85538982-e2d3-43ea-8330-fcadee9b9c58\', \'multiverseId\': 447857}, \'multiverseid\': 447857}, {\'name\': \'Dragon languefoudre\', \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand le Dragon languefoudre arrive sur le champ de bataille, vous pouvez payer {2}{R}. Quand vous faites ainsi, il inflige 3 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "Les imbéciles pensent que la couvée de Kolaghan suit les orages. Les sages savent que c\'est l\'inverse.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448138&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e061beac-7f63-43cb-a227-f98f3d70f607\', \'multiverseId\': 448138}, \'multiverseid\': 448138}, {\'name\': \'Drago Sputafolgore\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Sputafolgore entra nel campo di battaglia, puoi pagare {2}{R}. Quando lo fai, infligge 3 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'Gli stolti sono convinti che la covata di Kolaghan segua le tempeste di fulmini. I saggi sanno che è piuttosto il contrario.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448419&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eaf0b06c-a646-431a-9a4b-e485c49580d6\', \'multiverseId\': 448419}, \'multiverseid\': 448419}, {\'name\': \'電光吠えのドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n電光吠えのドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、あなたは{2}{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたとき、クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。これはそれに３点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'愚か者はコラガンの血が嵐の後を追うと思い込んでいる。賢者はそれがまったくの逆だと知っている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448700&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'30b7dd75-f003-4f67-b2b3-5c5353ac0a72\', \'multiverseId\': 448700}, \'multiverseid\': 448700}, {\'name\': \'불꽃혓바닥 용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n불꽃혓바닥 용이 전장에 들어올 때, 당신은 {2}{R}를 지불할 수 있다. 당신이 그렇게 할 때, 원하는 목표를 정한다. 불꽃혓바닥 용은 그 목표에게 피해 3점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'어리석은 자들은 콜라간의 무리가 번개 폭풍을 따라간다고 믿는다. 현명한 자들은 그 반대라는 것을 안다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448981&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a2a26af-2550-4628-a547-f85e78795a4a\', \'multiverseId\': 448981}, \'multiverseid\': 448981}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Eletrolíngue\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Dragão Eletrolíngue entra no campo de batalha, você pode pagar {2}{R}. Quando você faz isso, ele causa 3 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Os tolos creem que o bando de Kolaghan siga as tempestades de raios. Os sábios sabem que na verdade é o contrário.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449262&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5ddd50a1-ce89-4f11-8be4-b34f3dc3e4be\', \'multiverseId\': 449262}, \'multiverseid\': 449262}, {\'name\': \'Искроязыкий Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Искроязыкий Дракон выходит на поле битвы, вы можете заплатить {2}{R}. Когда вы это делаете, он наносит 3 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'Глупцы считают, что выводок Колаган следует за грозовыми бурями. Мудрые понимают: на самом деле все наоборот.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449543&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e633b4d3-84b0-4617-a90e-08b60c1b7836\', \'multiverseId\': 449543}, \'multiverseid\': 449543}, {\'name\': \'啸电巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当啸电巨龙进战场时，你可以支付{2}{R}。当你如此作时，它对任意一个目标造成3点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'愚钝之人以为寇安甘一脉的龙群随闪电风暴而行。智者知道事实正相反。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449824&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c2f0bfd3-6f0f-46cd-b57e-147c504f226c\', \'multiverseId\': 449824}, \'multiverseid\': 449824}, {\'name\': \'嘯電巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當嘯電巨龍進戰場時，你可以支付{2}{R}。當你如此作時，它對任意一個目標造成3點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'愚鈍之人以為寇安甘一脈的龍群隨閃電風暴而行。智者知道事實正相反。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450105&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f97b449-b8de-4c2b-891b-a3295f574659\', \'multiverseId\': 450105}, \'multiverseid\': 450105}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blitzross\', \'text\': \'Dieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nDas Blitzross kann von blauen Kreaturen nicht geblockt werden.\\n{1}{R}: Das Blitzross erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elementarwesen, Pferd\', \'flavor\': \'Zieht es vorbei, bedecken Sturmwolken das Land.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447568&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d5fce3dd-5ea4-4f37-8fff-28f5012b5f4c\', \'multiverseId\': 447568}, \'multiverseid\': 447568}, {\'name\': \'Corcel del rayo\', \'text\': \'Este hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nEl Corcel del rayo no puede ser bloqueado por criaturas azules.\\n{1}{R}: El Corcel del rayo obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballo elemental\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando pasa, las nubes de tormenta se extienden por todo el territorio.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447849&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59ad8926-c40c-4b83-9d2b-199a5488f962\', \'multiverseId\': 447849}, \'multiverseid\': 447849}, {\'name\': \'Jument des éclairs\', \'text\': "Ce sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nLa Jument des éclairs ne peut pas être bloquée par des créatures bleues.\\n{1}{R} : La Jument des éclairs gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : élémental et cheval\', \'flavor\': "Quand elle passe, des nuages noirs s\'amassent sur le pays.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448130&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b59f6c49-93c6-490d-8ce7-5fddb3c728a0\', \'multiverseId\': 448130}, \'multiverseid\': 448130}, {\'name\': \'Destriero del Fulmine\', \'text\': \'Questa magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nIl Destriero del Fulmine non può essere bloccato dalle creature blu.\\n{1}{R}: Il Destriero del Fulmine prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavallo Elementale\', \'flavor\': \'Al suo passaggio, nubi tempestose solcano rapide il panorama.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448411&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7b570dd-87ad-48b5-83bb-7c7f085139cf\', \'multiverseId\': 448411}, \'multiverseid\': 448411}, {\'name\': \'稲妻牝馬\', \'text\': \'この呪文は打ち消されない。\\n稲妻牝馬は青のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\\n{1}{R}：ターン終了時まで、稲妻牝馬は＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エレメンタル・馬\', \'flavor\': \'それが走り去るとき、大地は嵐雲の雷に包まれる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448692&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eed9266-4a2c-4138-b8df-9acd10b40e6a\', \'multiverseId\': 448692}, \'multiverseid\': 448692}, {\'name\': \'번개 암말\', \'text\': \'이 주문은 무효화될 수 없다.\\n번개 암말은 청색 생물에게 방어될 수 없다.\\n{1}{R}: 번개 암말은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 정령 말\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 지나가면, 대지를 가로지르는 폭풍우가 생겨난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448973&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'778af87e-7e19-4f29-969d-36c9db896e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 448973}, \'multiverseid\': 448973}, {\'name\': \'Égua do Relâmpago\', \'text\': \'Esta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nÉgua do Relâmpago não pode ser bloqueada por criaturas azuis.\\n{1}{R}: Égua do Relâmpago recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elemental Cavalo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ela passa, nuvens tempestuosas relampejam por toda a terra.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449254&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'07168f17-14d6-4e00-a5a0-bdfa511b9b02\', \'multiverseId\': 449254}, \'multiverseid\': 449254}, {\'name\': \'Кобылица Молний\', \'text\': \'Это заклинание не может быть отменено.\\nКобылица Молний не может быть заблокирована синими существами.\\n{1}{R}: Кобылица Молний получает +1/+0 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Элементаль Лошадь\', \'flavor\': \'Когда она скачет, грозовые разряды сверкают в темных облаках.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449535&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'178b7747-745d-4e6b-be17-9208b93884ab\', \'multiverseId\': 449535}, \'multiverseid\': 449535}, {\'name\': \'霹雳牝马\', \'text\': \'此咒语不能被反击。\\n霹雳牝马不能被蓝色生物阻挡。\\n{1}{R}：霹雳牝马得+1/+0直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／马\', \'flavor\': \'所经之处，暴风雷云盖世间。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449816&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f6b6039-12da-4a00-bb62-706bbb939019\', \'multiverseId\': 449816}, \'multiverseid\': 449816}, {\'name\': \'霹靂牝馬\', \'text\': \'此咒語不能被反擊。\\n霹靂牝馬不能被藍色生物阻擋。\\n{1}{R}：霹靂牝馬得+1/+0直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～元素／馬\', \'flavor\': \'所經之處，暴風雷雲蓋世間。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450097&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3d80f628-ff9c-4f8b-a670-041f397afdd0\', \'multiverseId\': 450097}, \'multiverseid\': 450097}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutige Weissagung\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nZiehe drei Karten.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Weissagungen sind ein schmutziges Geschäft.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447503&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0d11eb6-243a-4a98-a625-3f4b54f02a27\', \'multiverseId\': 447503}, \'multiverseid\': 447503}, {\'name\': \'Sortilegio de sangre\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nRoba tres cartas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Predecir el futuro es una actividad que entraña riesgos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447784&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11f93251-ba75-40c0-9b6d-bab4c8964263\', \'multiverseId\': 447784}, \'multiverseid\': 447784}, {\'name\': \'Divination de sang\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nPiochez trois cartes.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "Prédire l\'avenir exige de se salir les mains.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448065&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b289de43-067d-41ed-b904-736e07335330\', \'multiverseId\': 448065}, \'multiverseid\': 448065}, {\'name\': \'Divinazione del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nPesca tre carte.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Predire il futuro è un lavoro sporco.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448346&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f374f12-a53a-4142-8cec-caeb97b4a507\', \'multiverseId\': 448346}, \'multiverseid\': 448346}, {\'name\': \'血占い\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\nカードを３枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'未来予測は散らかる仕事だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448627&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0f64840d-3c8e-4bc5-af25-101c3b9b2153\', \'multiverseId\': 448627}, \'multiverseid\': 448627}, {\'name\': \'피의 점\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n카드 세 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'미래를 예측하는 것은 지저분한 일이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448908&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bcae9061-2e2b-42f5-b414-55c0d97fc1dc\', \'multiverseId\': 448908}, \'multiverseid\': 448908}, {\'name\': \'Adivinhação de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nCompre três cards.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Prever o futuro é um trabalho sujo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449189&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'92caa1d7-8fa7-420f-945c-6a9fac141d15\', \'multiverseId\': 449189}, \'multiverseid\': 449189}, {\'name\': \'Предсказание по Крови\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо.\\nВозьмите три карты.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Предсказание будущего — грязное занятие.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449470&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5174d5f7-9640-40cc-b0d4-c7c57f7ba246\', \'multiverseId\': 449470}, \'multiverseid\': 449470}, {\'name\': \'鲜血占卦\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n抓三张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'预测未来是件脏活。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449751&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e71f7e-f073-4c1b-b2e2-e7888990ade0\', \'multiverseId\': 449751}, \'multiverseid\': 449751}, {\'name\': \'鮮血占卦\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n抽三張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'預測未來是件髒活。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450032&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6a6e5009-d90b-4b5b-a079-c39469aa55ea\', \'multiverseId\': 450032}, \'multiverseid\': 450032}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutpranke, Schrecken von Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'Kreaturenzauber mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du wirkst, kosten beim Wirken {2} weniger.\\nImmer wenn Blutpranke, Schrecken von Qal Sisma, angreift, erhält jede Kreatur mit Stärke 4 oder mehr, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und verursacht Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Bär\', \'flavor\': \'Du willst nicht wissen, wie sie zu ihrem Namen gekommen ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447603&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0afc5c39-4f89-4d7c-8e28-738d09edc40a\', \'multiverseId\': 447603}, \'multiverseid\': 447603}, {\'name\': \'Zarpasangrienta, Terror de Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'Te cuesta {2} menos lanzar los hechizos de criatura con fuerza de 4 o más.\\nSiempre que Zarpasangrienta, Terror de Qal Sisma ataque, cada criatura que controlas con fuerza de 4 o más obtiene +1/+1 y gana la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Oso\', \'flavor\': \'No quieres saber por qué le pusieron ese nombre.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447884&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ca1abf3-1a7a-4267-a7e7-758038404746\', \'multiverseId\': 447884}, \'multiverseid\': 447884}, {\'name\': \'Griffeboyaux, terreur de Qal Sisma\', \'text\': "Les sorts de créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4 que vous lancez coûtent {2} de moins à lancer.\\nÀ chaque fois que Griffeboyaux, terreur de Qal Sisma attaque, chaque créature de force supérieure ou égale à 4 que vous contrôlez gagne +1/+1 et acquiert le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ours\', \'flavor\': "Mieux vaut ne pas savoir d\'où lui vient ce surnom.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448165&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ac2870c3-3de8-4195-adec-be442c2f309f\', \'multiverseId\': 448165}, \'multiverseid\': 448165}, {\'name\': \'Squarciagrinfia, Terrore di Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'Le magie creatura che lanci con forza pari o superiore a 4 costano {2} in meno per essere lanciate.\\nOgniqualvolta Squarciagrinfia, Terrore di Qal Sisma attacca, ogni creatura che controlli con forza pari o superiore a 4 prende +1/+1 e ha travolgere fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Orso\', \'flavor\': \'Meglio non chiedere come abbia meritato un nome del genere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448446&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8bb389d2-a5b4-4f76-95bd-a1b3aa2ea66a\', \'multiverseId\': 448446}, \'multiverseid\': 448446}, {\'name\': \'カル・シスマの恐怖、殺し爪\', \'text\': \'あなたがパワーが４以上のクリーチャー・呪文を唱えるためのコストは{2}少なくなる。\\nカル・シスマの恐怖、殺し爪が攻撃するたび、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしていてパワーが４以上の各クリーチャーはそれぞれ＋１/＋１の修整を受け、トランプルを得る。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — 熊\', \'flavor\': \'彼女の名前の由来は知らない方がいいでしょう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448727&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19cfa904-9dfa-4973-9a1e-e3e3aec319d7\', \'multiverseId\': 448727}, \'multiverseid\': 448727}, {\'name\': \'칼 시스마의 공포, 고어클로\', \'text\': \'당신이 발동하는 공격력이 4 이상인 생물 주문들은 발동하는 데 {2}가 덜 든다.\\n칼 시스마의 공포, 고어클로가 공격할 때마다, 당신이 조종하는 공격력이 4 이상인 각 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 돌진을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 곰\', \'flavor\': \'그 곰이 어떻게 그 이름을 얻었는지는 알고 싶지 않을 것이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449008&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'87623e11-7128-4d83-ad98-110d31c84f9e\', \'multiverseId\': 449008}, \'multiverseid\': 449008}, {\'name\': \'Garra Cruenta, Terror de Qal Sisma\', \'text\': \'As mágicas de criatura com poder igual ou superior a 4 que você conjura custam {2} a menos para serem conjuradas.\\nToda vez que Garra Cruenta, Terror de Qal Sisma, ataca, cada criatura que você controla com poder igual ou superior a 4 recebe +1/+1 e ganha atropelar até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Urso\', \'flavor\': \'Você não quer saber como ela conseguiu esse nome.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449289&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'04dec3f4-4d87-42a1-be85-f35a707381d7\', \'multiverseId\': 449289}, \'multiverseid\': 449289}, {\'name\': \'Кровавая Лапа, Ужас Кэл-Сизма\', \'text\': \'Разыгрываемые вами заклинания существ с силой не менее 4 стоят на {2} меньше.\\nКаждый раз, когда Кровавая Лапа, Ужас Кэл-Сизма атакует, каждое существо под вашим контролем с силой не менее 4 получает +1/+1 и Пробивной удар до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Медведь\', \'flavor\': \'Не стоит интересоваться, откуда у нее такое прозвище.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449570&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'558cf004-c3fe-4428-97fb-16a7eefd959e\', \'multiverseId\': 449570}, \'multiverseid\': 449570}, {\'name\': \'黑山之威血爪\', \'text\': \'由你施放且力量等于或大于4的生物咒语减少{2}来施放。\\n每当黑山之威血爪攻击时，直到回合结束，每个由你操控且力量等于或大于4的生物各得+1/+1且获得践踏异能。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'你不会想知道她因何得名。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449851&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09bada8b-35b4-46b3-8c95-93c03e4db281\', \'multiverseId\': 449851}, \'multiverseid\': 449851}, {\'name\': \'黑山之威血爪\', \'text\': \'由你施放且力量等於或大於4的生物咒語減少{2}來施放。\\n每當黑山之威血爪攻擊時，直到回合結束，每個由你操控且力量等於或大於4的生物各得+1/+1且獲得踐踏異能。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～熊\', \'flavor\': \'你不會想知道她因何得名。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450132&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a74a367e-5f05-4cb1-8dcc-277a9284118e\', \'multiverseId\': 450132}, \'multiverseid\': 450132}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutschwelger\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du Lebenspunkte dazuerhältst, verliert jeder Gegner 1 Lebenspunkt.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Vampir\', \'flavor\': \'„Fleischig mit einem Hauch von Leder. Ein guter Jahrgang."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447512&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7eadc598-95bf-4722-a648-c99bcdda5fec\', \'multiverseId\': 447512}, \'multiverseid\': 447512}, {\'name\': \'Sibarita de la sangre\', \'text\': \'Siempre que ganes vidas, cada oponente pierde 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Sabor con cuerpo y suaves notas de piel. Cosecha añeja, sin duda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447793&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'054cd953-d845-4c29-b0fd-55dc88a7a6d2\', \'multiverseId\': 447793}, \'multiverseid\': 447793}, {\'name\': \'Épicurien du sang\', \'text\': \'À chaque fois que vous gagnez des points de vie, chaque adversaire perd 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : vampire\', \'flavor\': \'« Il a du corps, avec un léger bouquet de cuir. Un grand cru. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448074&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'575fbfd2-5869-4ca4-8f89-7f32b7d8056b\', \'multiverseId\': 448074}, \'multiverseid\': 448074}, {\'name\': \'Epicureo del Sangue\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta guadagni punti vita, ogni avversario perde 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carnoso, con una leggera nota di cuoio. Ottima annata."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448355&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'55fd3873-a75f-4cbf-9511-abedafa19ea0\', \'multiverseId\': 448355}, \'multiverseid\': 448355}, {\'name\': \'血の美食家\', \'text\': \'あなたがライフを得るたび、各対戦相手はそれぞれ１点のライフを失う。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「肉厚で、かすかな皮の香り。上物だ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448636&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6f6b878d-294c-40a5-9b30-0ef2563ba860\', \'multiverseId\': 448636}, \'multiverseid\': 448636}, {\'name\': \'피의 미식가\', \'text\': \'당신이 생명점을 얻을 때마다, 각 상대는 생명 1점을 잃는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 흡혈귀\', \'flavor\': \'"가죽 향이 약간 나는 싱싱한 살점이로군. 최고급이야."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448917&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bb9f47a6-6e78-4a86-ae25-f9499e8ad2eb\', \'multiverseId\': 448917}, \'multiverseid\': 448917}, {\'name\': \'Epicurista de Sangue\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você ganha pontos de vida, cada oponente perde 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Vampiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Carnoso, com um leve toque de couro. Um bom vintage."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449198&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc1e88b8-b527-4568-a570-b0065c451a27\', \'multiverseId\': 449198}, \'multiverseid\': 449198}, {\'name\': \'Кровавый Гурман\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы получаете жизни, каждый оппонент теряет 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вампир\', \'flavor\': \'«Мясистая, с тонкими нотками кожи. Чудесный сорт».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449479&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0fd761-2bba-4503-8f56-0e120d920fd8\', \'multiverseId\': 449479}, \'multiverseid\': 449479}, {\'name\': \'鲜血饕客\', \'text\': \'每当你获得生命时，每位对手各失去1点生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「肉香浓郁，稍带一丝皮味。实属佳酿。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449760&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'195c14cb-5704-4ac3-b9f1-43fde69aee50\', \'multiverseId\': 449760}, \'multiverseid\': 449760}, {\'name\': \'鮮血饕客\', \'text\': \'每當你獲得生命時，每位對手各失去1點生命。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～吸血鬼\', \'flavor\': \'「肉香濃郁，稍帶一絲皮味。實屬佳釀。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450041&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992167bc-091d-471b-ad58-2e0b81d4f9eb\', \'multiverseId\': 450041}, \'multiverseid\': 450041}]', '[{\'name\': \'Blutzolldrache\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Blutzolldrache ins Spiel kommt, fügt er einem Gegner deiner Wahl 5 Schadenspunkte zu, es sei denn, der Spieler opfert eine Kreatur.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache\', \'flavor\': \'Die Verbundenheit eines Ritters zu seinem Reittier hat seine Grenzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447552&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'67c50dc2-e575-4260-a5f4-92d42c007284\', \'multiverseId\': 447552}, \'multiverseid\': 447552}, {\'name\': \'Dragón exigente\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Dragón exigente entre al campo de batalla, hace 5 puntos de daño al oponente objetivo a menos que ese jugador sacrifique una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragón\', \'flavor\': \'El afecto de un caballero por su montura tiene sus límites.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447833&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'918f21e4-569a-4f54-8db2-ac13168eb303\', \'multiverseId\': 447833}, \'multiverseid\': 447833}, {\'name\': \'Dragon exigeant\', \'text\': \'Vol\\nQuand le Dragon exigeant arrive sur le champ de bataille, il inflige 5 blessures à un adversaire ciblé à moins que ce joueur ne sacrifie une créature.\', \'type\': \'Créature : dragon\', \'flavor\': "La dévotion d\'un chevalier envers sa monture a ses limites.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448114&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dc24f9ec-ec68-4402-a8da-68ea42bd129d\', \'multiverseId\': 448114}, \'multiverseid\': 448114}, {\'name\': \'Drago Rapace\', \'text\': \'Volare\\nQuando il Drago Rapace entra nel campo di battaglia, infligge 5 danni a un avversario bersaglio a meno che quel giocatore non sacrifichi una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Drago\', \'flavor\': \'La devozione di un cavaliere per il suo destriero ha i suoi limiti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448395&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1785c1c-ed26-4ac4-be7b-8dbf2ff242c0\', \'multiverseId\': 448395}, \'multiverseid\': 448395}, {\'name\': \'厄介なドラゴン\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n厄介なドラゴンが戦場に出たとき、対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーがクリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げないかぎり、これはそのプレイヤーに５点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': \'騎士の馬への愛情はその程度だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448676&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b51f5d7-8fcb-4e8b-98be-c05f00151b63\', \'multiverseId\': 448676}, \'multiverseid\': 448676}, {\'name\': \'까다로운 용\', \'text\': \'비행\\n까다로운 용이 전장에 들어올 때, 상대를 목표로 정한다. 까다로운 용은 그 플레이어가 생물 한 개를 희생하지 않는 한 그 플레이어에게 피해 5점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용\', \'flavor\': \'자신의 말에게 보내는 기사의 헌신은 그 정도 뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448957&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'014e8521-0e2f-4359-8132-9293f1b3ce61\', \'multiverseId\': 448957}, \'multiverseid\': 448957}, {\'name\': \'Dragão Reivindicativo\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Dragão Reivindicativo entra no campo de batalha, ele causa 5 pontos de dano ao oponente alvo, a menos que aquele jogador sacrifique uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Até mesmo a devoção de um cavaleiro a seu corcel tem um limite.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449238&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'81fe5821-ff08-43f2-a30a-45d1550d93aa\', \'multiverseId\': 449238}, \'multiverseid\': 449238}, {\'name\': \'Требовательный Дракон\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Требовательный Дракон выходит на поле битвы, он наносит 5 повреждений целевому оппоненту, если только тот игрок не пожертвует существо.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон\', \'flavor\': \'У привязанности рыцаря к своему скакуну есть границы.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449519&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6de50a98-286b-4d92-a289-0fb8e6c86803\', \'multiverseId\': 449519}, \'multiverseid\': 449519}, {\'name\': \'索祭巨龙\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当索祭巨龙进战场时，除非目标对手牺牲一个生物，否则它对该牌手造成5点伤害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙\', \'flavor\': \'骑士与爱马之间的不渝忠诚也只能到此为止。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449800&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'de197da3-9578-4180-bd12-8c12c87dbdd4\', \'multiverseId\': 449800}, \'multiverseid\': 449800}, {\'name\': \'索祭巨龍\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當索祭巨龍進戰場時，除非目標對手犧牲一個生物，否則它對該玩家造成5點傷害。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍\', \'flavor\': \'騎士與愛馬之間的不渝忠誠也只能到此為止。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450081&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'401b72e1-6696-4e57-bf2c-0e2a89972add\', \'multiverseId\': 450081}, \'multiverseid\': 450081}]', '[{\'name\': \'Boggart-Rohling\', \'text\': \'Bedrohlich (Diese Kreatur kann nicht geblockt werden, außer von zwei oder mehr Kreaturen.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Goblin, Krieger\', \'flavor\': \'Er hat den größten Knüppel, also kann man davon ausgehen, dass er der Anführer ist.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447548&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40872c43-2e25-4860-afc4-bbd4819fc193\', \'multiverseId\': 447548}, \'multiverseid\': 447548}, {\'name\': \'Bruto boggart\', \'text\': \'Amenaza. (Esta criatura no puede ser bloqueada excepto por dos o más criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero trasgo\', \'flavor\': \'Tiene el garrote más grande, así que es probable que sea el líder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78e2e331-e10f-40d0-b7ff-f95fa8c92c61\', \'multiverseId\': 447829}, \'multiverseid\': 447829}, {\'name\': \'Brute boggarte\', \'text\': \'Menace (Cette créature ne peut pas être bloquée excepté par deux créatures ou plus.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : gobelin et guerrier\', \'flavor\': "Il a le plus gros bâton ; il y a donc des chances qu\'il soit le chef.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448110&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a833ded9-13dd-4557-804b-89632709aef0\', \'multiverseId\': 448110}, \'multiverseid\': 448110}, {\'name\': \'Bruto Boggart\', \'text\': \'Minacciare (Questa creatura non può essere bloccata tranne che da due o più creature.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Goblin\', \'flavor\': \'Se impugna il randello più grande, è senza dubbio il capo.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80666f5e-b45e-4c41-bf82-5634453b42fb\', \'multiverseId\': 448391}, \'multiverseid\': 448391}, {\'name\': \'ボガートの粗暴者\', \'text\': \'威迫（このクリーチャーは２体以上のクリーチャーによってしかブロックされない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゴブリン・戦士\', \'flavor\': \'彼が一番大きな棍棒を持っているから、恐らく彼がリーダーなのだろう。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05962c55-7782-4aa7-9097-c01c60cd7da2\', \'multiverseId\': 448672}, \'multiverseid\': 448672}, {\'name\': \'보가트 싸움꾼\', \'text\': \'호전적 (이 생물은 두 개 이상의 생물에만 방어될 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 고블린 전사\', \'flavor\': \'무리에서 가장 큰 몽둥이를 든 고블린이 우두머리일 가능성이 높다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'670273e4-6c9f-4b30-b6a5-02de37504ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 448953}, \'multiverseid\': 448953}, {\'name\': \'Papão Brutamontes\', \'text\': \'Ameaçar (Esta criatura só pode ser bloqueada por duas ou mais criaturas.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Goblin Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': \'Ele tem o maior porrete, portanto deve ser o líder.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449234&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'323ff196-0e14-4610-88aa-e20f5b9b8aca\', \'multiverseId\': 449234}, \'multiverseid\': 449234}, {\'name\': \'Боггарт-Громила\', \'text\': \'Угроза (Это существо не может быть заблокировано менее чем двумя существами.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Гоблин Воин\', \'flavor\': \'У него самая большая палка-колотилка, так что можно смело предположить, что он тут главный.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449515&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'412c8faa-2a78-4854-950c-217b308d6b29\', \'multiverseId\': 449515}, \'multiverseid\': 449515}, {\'name\': \'波尬蛮汉\', \'text\': \'威慑（此生物只能被两个或更多生物阻挡。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／战士\', \'flavor\': \'他拿的棍子最大，由此看来他应该就是首领。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449796&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a8ab91fb-af70-41e3-b701-5905b8c899c1\', \'multiverseId\': 449796}, \'multiverseid\': 449796}, {\'name\': \'波尬蠻漢\', \'text\': \'威懾（此生物只能被兩個或更多生物阻擋。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～鬼怪／戰士\', \'flavor\': \'他拿的棍子最大，由此看來他應該就是首領。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450077&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb86347-a7c1-4300-9d7b-e79367191a14\', \'multiverseId\': 450077}, \'multiverseid\': 450077}]', '[{\'name\': \'Borstiges Wildschwein\', \'text\': \'Das Borstige Wildschwein kann nicht von mehr als einer Kreatur geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wildschwein\', \'flavor\': \'„Nicol Bolas hat meine Welt zerstört. Ich schulde es Skalla, alles Leben gleichsam zu schätzen, egal wie gefährlich es ist."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447587&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1dd21aa-dc61-4b7d-912e-998666828ab8\', \'multiverseId\': 447587}, \'multiverseid\': 447587}, {\'name\': \'Jabalí encrespado\', \'text\': \'El Jabalí encrespado no puede ser bloqueado por más de una criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Jabalí\', \'flavor\': \'"Nicol Bolas destruyó mi mundo. Por la memoria de Skalla, debo celebrar todos los tipos de vida, al margen de si son peligrosos o no".\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da2868cf-aed5-4ea5-bbd8-caa4adf19430\', \'multiverseId\': 447868}, \'multiverseid\': 447868}, {\'name\': \'Sanglier hérissé\', \'text\': "Le Sanglier hérissé ne peut pas être bloqué par plus d\'une créature.", \'type\': \'Créature : sanglier\', \'flavor\': \'« Nicol Bolas a détruit mon monde. Je remercie Skalla de célébrer toute forme de vie, aussi dangereuse soit elle. »\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448149&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'19cd63d4-fda6-4666-b9d4-e9cdd5126946\', \'multiverseId\': 448149}, \'multiverseid\': 448149}, {\'name\': \'Cinghiale Irsuto\', \'text\': \'Il Cinghiale Irsuto non può essere bloccato da più di una creatura.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cinghiale\', \'flavor\': \'"Nicol Bolas ha distrutto il mio mondo. Skalla mi ha insegnato a onorare tutte le forme di vita, anche le più pericolose."\\n—Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448430&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'05c3eafd-c30b-439a-aba5-73295253ff17\', \'multiverseId\': 448430}, \'multiverseid\': 448430}, {\'name\': \'逆毛の猪\', \'text\': \'逆毛の猪は、２体以上のクリーチャーによってはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 猪\', \'flavor\': \'「ニコル・ボーラスは私の世界を破壊した。スカラのためにもすべての生命を讃えなければ。それがいくら危険であっても。」\\n――ビビアン・リード\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448711&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'36525163-2846-4884-99cf-5d7f8d6a76cd\', \'multiverseId\': 448711}, \'multiverseid\': 448711}, {\'name\': \'성난 멧돼지\', \'text\': \'성난 멧돼지는 생물 하나에게만 방어될 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 멧돼지\', \'flavor\': \'"니콜 볼라스는 내 세계를 파괴했다. 나는 스칼라에 모든 생명을 기려야만 하는 빚을 지고 있다, 그 생명이 얼마나 위험한지는 상관없이."\\n—비비안 레이드\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448992&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d87b9b0-4043-47bb-8ec1-ca0757a4a5ea\', \'multiverseId\': 448992}, \'multiverseid\': 448992}, {\'name\': \'Javali Eriçado\', \'text\': \'Javali Eriçado não pode ser bloqueado por mais de uma criatura.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Javali\', \'flavor\': \'"Nicol Bolas destruiu meu mundo. Skalla ensinou-me a honrar toda forma de vida, não importa quão perigosa."\\n— Vivien Reid\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449273&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'40c2f010-ee3d-4550-93d1-1990fc72f279\', \'multiverseId\': 449273}, \'multiverseid\': 449273}, {\'name\': \'Щетинистый Вепрь\', \'text\': \'Щетинистый Вепрь не может быть заблокирован более чем одним существом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Вепрь\', \'flavor\': \'«Никол Болас разрушил мой мир. Я в долгу пред Скаллой и буду чтить любую жизнь, какой бы опасной она ни была».\\n— Вивьен Рейд\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449554&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f5331e71-1956-468a-b8af-16ec7ef268b0\', \'multiverseId\': 449554}, \'multiverseid\': 449554}, {\'name\': \'鬃毛野猪\', \'text\': \'鬃毛野猪不能被多于一个生物阻挡。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野猪\', \'flavor\': \'「尼可波拉斯毁灭了我的世界。为了斯凯拉，我要赞颂所有生命，无论他们有多危险。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70ae49a4-5f5f-4014-8be2-ffab6ec37e6e\', \'multiverseId\': 449835}, \'multiverseid\': 449835}, {\'name\': \'鬃毛野豬\', \'text\': \'鬃毛野豬不能被多於一個生物阻擋。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～野豬\', \'flavor\': \'「尼可波拉斯毀滅了我的世界。為了斯凱拉，我要讚頌所有生命，無論他們有多危險。」\\n～薇薇安瑞德\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450116&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c5424c01-953c-42d6-9797-ecdbb9f2d1ff\', \'multiverseId\': 450116}, \'multiverseid\': 450116}]', '[{\'name\': \'Brunnen der Erneuerung\', \'text\': \'Zu Beginn deines Versorgungssegments erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\\n{3}, opfere den Brunnen der Erneuerung: Ziehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Geschäftemacher haben versucht, das Wasser zu verkaufen, doch ohne Erfolg. Welche Magie es auch durchdringt, sie verschwindet, sobald man es abfüllt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447653&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e419fa37-59b1-403b-a960-8ff374262373\', \'multiverseId\': 447653}, \'multiverseid\': 447653}, {\'name\': \'Fuente de la renovación\', \'text\': \'Al comienzo de tu mantenimiento, ganas 1 vida.\\n{3}, sacrificar la Fuente de la renovación: Roba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Algunos empresarios intentaron vender este agua sin éxito. La magia que pudiera contener se desvanece al embotellarla.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447934&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7e8bed61-72c0-405d-adb2-2d2dd2e7d8c4\', \'multiverseId\': 447934}, \'multiverseid\': 447934}, {\'name\': \'Fontaine du renouveau\', \'text\': \'Au début de votre entretien, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\\n{3}, sacrifiez la Fontaine du renouveau : Piochez une carte.\', \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': "Les entrepreneurs ont essayé d\'en vendre l\'eau, mais sans succès. La magie qu\'elle contient disparaît à la mise en bouteille.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448215&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd8be916-0a82-48ef-a1f2-52cf523f9770\', \'multiverseId\': 448215}, \'multiverseid\': 448215}, {\'name\': \'Fonte del Rinnovamento\', \'text\': "All\'inizio del tuo mantenimento, guadagni 1 punto vita.\\n{3}, Sacrifica la Fonte del Rinnovamento: Pesca una carta.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': "C\'è chi ha cercato di venderne l\'acqua con scarsi risultati. La magia che contiene svanisce non appena viene imbottigliata.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448496&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6c64c85-5b04-40bc-a03b-fcfc393aa9c1\', \'multiverseId\': 448496}, \'multiverseid\': 448496}, {\'name\': \'更生の泉\', \'text\': \'あなたのアップキープの開始時に、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\\n{3}, 更生の泉を生け贄に捧げる：カードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'事業家たちはその水を売ろうとしたが、無駄な試みであった。それが含む何らかの魔法は、瓶に入れると消えてしまうのだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448777&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2983801-3770-4b9c-b8b2-1c0211977052\', \'multiverseId\': 448777}, \'multiverseid\': 448777}, {\'name\': \'회복의 분수\', \'text\': \'당신의 유지단 시작에, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\\n{3}, 회복의 분수를 희생한다: 카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'많은 이들이 그 물을 팔아 보려고 시도했지만, 모두 허사였다. 물에 깃든 마법은 병에 물을 담는 순간에 사라졌다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449058&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b754c93d-d9cd-421d-a0fc-6c28ba4f334d\', \'multiverseId\': 449058}, \'multiverseid\': 449058}, {\'name\': \'Fonte da Renovação\', \'text\': \'No início de sua manutenção, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\\n{3}, sacrifique Fonte da Renovação: Compre um card.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Empreendedores já tentaram vender a água, mas não funcionou. Qualquer magia que ela contenha desaparece quando engarrafada.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449339&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea0267d8-c488-4248-babf-2d5f1e2bf460\', \'multiverseId\': 449339}, \'multiverseid\': 449339}, {\'name\': \'Фонтан Обновления\', \'text\': \'В начале вашего шага поддержки вы получаете 1 жизнь.\\n{3}, пожертвуйте Фонтан Обновления: возьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Предприимчивые дельцы попытались открыть торговлю водой, но потерпели крах. Какая бы магия в ней ни содержалась, она исчезала при розливе в бутылки.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449620&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4330c6c-09c4-4165-9bd7-44732e90543a\', \'multiverseId\': 449620}, \'multiverseid\': 449620}, {\'name\': \'新机喷泉\', \'text\': \'在你的维持开始时，你获得1点生命。\\n{3}，牺牲新机喷泉：抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'不少商人打过出售泉水的念头，但却没人成功。无论水中蕴含何种魔法，一经装瓶便都消失无踪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7adb92f-173d-4032-9768-17ac828f8a02\', \'multiverseId\': 449901}, \'multiverseid\': 449901}, {\'name\': \'新機噴泉\', \'text\': \'在你的維持開始時，你獲得1點生命。\\n{3}，犧牲新機噴泉：抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'不少商人打過出售泉水的念頭，但卻沒人成功。無論水中蘊含何種魔法，一經裝瓶便都消失無蹤。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450182&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'90f623fd-737f-4eb4-8384-e6b2c3b7278d\', \'multiverseId\': 450182}, \'multiverseid\': 450182}]', '[{\'name\': \'Bärenkraft-Champion\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Der Bärenkraft-Champion erhält +3/+3 und wird bis zum Ende des Zuges ein Bär-Berserker. Aktiviere diese Fähigkeit nur einmal pro Zug.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Berserker\', \'flavor\': \'„Würdest du lieber mein Schwert oder meine Reißzähne zu spüren bekommen?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450285&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d4a6ee6f-7e56-4899-9242-849d611db1e0\', \'multiverseId\': 450285}, \'multiverseid\': 450285}, {\'name\': \'Campeona úrsida\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: La Campeona úrsida obtiene +3/+3 y se convierte en un Berserker Oso hasta el final del turno. Activa esta habilidad solo una vez por turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Berserker humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Qué prefieres sentir? ¿El filo de mi hacha o mis afilados colmillos?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450319&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e341b6f4-eb3a-4c43-9d10-633caa5117f5\', \'multiverseId\': 450319}, \'multiverseid\': 450319}, {\'name\': \'Championne ursidée\', \'text\': "{5}{G} : La Championne ursidée gagne +3/+3 et devient un ours et berserker jusqu\'à la fin du tour. N\'activez cette capacité qu\'une seule fois par tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et berserker\', \'flavor\': \'« Préférez-vous sentir le tranchant de ma lame ou celui de mes crocs ? »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450353&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b496fe17-4454-4f13-90b7-e9406387143a\', \'multiverseId\': 450353}, \'multiverseid\': 450353}, {\'name\': \'Campionessa degli Orsi\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: La Campionessa degli Orsi prende +3/+3 e diventa un Berserker Orso fino alla fine del turno. Attiva questa abilità solo una volta per turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Berserker Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Preferisci provare la mia lama affilata o le mie zanne appuntite?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450387&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a03ddbe-50dd-4ca1-8112-d92f8cdd685c\', \'multiverseId\': 450387}, \'multiverseid\': 450387}, {\'name\': \'熊のチャンピオン\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：ターン終了時まで、熊のチャンピオンは＋３/＋３の修整を受けるとともに熊・狂戦士になる。この能力は、毎ターン１回のみ起動できる。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・狂戦士\', \'flavor\': \'「この刃と鋭い牙と、どちらを味わいたい？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450421&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500c9c98-436f-44fe-8329-d5ed135c842f\', \'multiverseId\': 450421}, \'multiverseid\': 450421}, {\'name\': \'곰 투사\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: 곰 투사는 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받고 곰 광전사가 된다. 이 능력은 한 턴에 한 번씩만 활성화할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 광전사\', \'flavor\': \'"칼날의 날카로움과 송곳니의 뾰족함 중에 어떤 걸 더 느껴 보고 싶지?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450455&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a747248-1d02-405b-a2e0-714c6048aa44\', \'multiverseId\': 450455}, \'multiverseid\': 450455}, {\'name\': \'Campeã Ursina\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Campeã Ursina recebe +3/+3 e torna-se um Urso Amoque até o final do turno. Ative esta habilidade apenas uma vez a cada turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Amoque\', \'flavor\': \'"Você prefere sentir o fio de minha lâmina ou a ponta de minhas presas?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e3e2366b-e2a8-4d48-ad4d-158e5e4f102f\', \'multiverseId\': 450489}, \'multiverseid\': 450489}, {\'name\': \'Медвежья Воительница\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}: Медвежья Воительница получает +3/+3 и становится Медведем Берсерком до конца хода. Активируйте эту способность только один раз за ход.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Берсерк\', \'flavor\': \'«Что ты предпочитаешь — лезвие моего клинка или остроту моих клыков?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d3d93604-d1d0-40da-923f-d41a477c4a71\', \'multiverseId\': 450523}, \'multiverseid\': 450523}, {\'name\': \'熊身斗士\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：直到回合结束，熊身斗士得+3/+3且成为熊／狂战士。此异能每回合只能起动一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类 ／狂战士\', \'flavor\': \'「你是想尝尝我的利刃还是我的尖牙？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450557&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57a929c7-cfb9-4b4a-810f-8910efff087e\', \'multiverseId\': 450557}, \'multiverseid\': 450557}, {\'name\': \'熊身鬥士\', \'text\': \'{5}{G}：直到回合結束，熊身鬥士得+3/+3且成為熊／狂戰士。此異能每回合只能起動一次。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／狂戰士\', \'flavor\': \'「你是想嘗嘗我的利刃還是我的尖牙？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450591&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7976f2f-15cb-4d32-9746-96854860eb01\', \'multiverseId\': 450591}, \'multiverseid\': 450591}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chaosstab\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Ein Gegner deiner Wahl schickt Karten oben von seiner Bibliothek ins Exil, bis er eine Spontanzauber- oder Hexereikarte ins Exil schickt. Du kannst die Karte wirken, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Lege dann alle Karten, die auf diese Weise ins Exil geschickt und die nicht gewirkt wurden, in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter seine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447646&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea967c64-9e2f-48c9-873f-202d8e5ba6ba\', \'multiverseId\': 447646}, \'multiverseid\': 447646}, {\'name\': \'Varita del caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: El oponente objetivo exilia cartas de la parte superior de su biblioteca hasta que exilie una carta de instantáneo o de conjuro. Puedes lanzar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Luego, pon las cartas exiliadas que no fueron lanzadas de esta manera en el fondo de esa biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447927&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57749675-bd6f-4ac3-b86f-a8279cdd29dc\', \'multiverseId\': 447927}, \'multiverseid\': 447927}, {\'name\': \'Baguette du chaos\', \'text\': "{4}, {T} : L\'adversaire ciblé exile les cartes du dessus de sa bibliothèque jusqu\'à ce qu\'il exile une carte d\'éphémère ou de rituel. Vous pouvez lancer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Mettez ensuite les cartes exilées qui n\'ont pas été lancées de cette manière au-dessous de cette bibliothèque, dans un ordre aléatoire.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448208&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d99f7d2-565a-400c-bc67-59f8faf2190e\', \'multiverseId\': 448208}, \'multiverseid\': 448208}, {\'name\': \'Bacchetta del Caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: Un avversario bersaglio esilia carte dalla cima del suo grimorio fino a che non esilia una carta istantaneo o stregoneria. Puoi lanciare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Poi metti in fondo a quel grimorio in ordine casuale le carte esiliate che non sono state lanciate in questo modo.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448489&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'900e9159-f565-4a2c-a0c0-27d7444ec973\', \'multiverseId\': 448489}, \'multiverseid\': 448489}, {\'name\': \'混沌のワンド\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}：対戦相手１人を対象とする。そのプレイヤーは、インスタントかソーサリーであるカードが追放されるまで、自分のライブラリーの一番上からカードを１枚ずつ追放する。あなたはそのカードをそのマナ・コストを支払うことなく唱えてもよい。その後これにより追放されて唱えられなかったカードをそのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6e352ca8-0db0-4dcd-ba13-b2273c3c580f\', \'multiverseId\': 448770}, \'multiverseid\': 448770}, {\'name\': \'혼돈의 지팡이\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: 상대를 목표로 정한다. 그 플레이어는 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드를 추방할 때까지 자신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 추방한다. 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 추방된 순간마법이나 집중마법 카드를 발동할 수 있다. 그 후 이렇게 추방되고 발동되지 않은 카드들을 그 플레이어의 서고 맨 밑에 무작위로 넣는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449051&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ee98beb5-178f-4ef0-b6a2-330f0fee878c\', \'multiverseId\': 449051}, \'multiverseid\': 449051}, {\'name\': \'Varinha do Caos\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: O oponente alvo exila cards do topo do próprio grimório até exilar um card de mágica instantânea ou de feitiço. Você pode conjurar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Depois, coloque os cards exilados que não foram conjurados desta forma no fundo daquele grimório em ordem aleatória.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'703a0f92-0d07-4614-84ac-efa822b2aefc\', \'multiverseId\': 449332}, \'multiverseid\': 449332}, {\'name\': \'Магический Жезл Хаоса\', \'text\': \'{4}, {T}: целевой оппонент изгоняет карты с верха своей библиотеки до тех пор, пока не изгонит карту мгновенного заклинания или волшебства. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Затем положите изгнанные карты, не разыгранные таким образом, в низ той библиотеки в случайном порядке.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56899518-e47b-46e5-bbfa-e6ca29a9c4bf\', \'multiverseId\': 449613}, \'multiverseid\': 449613}, {\'name\': \'混沌法杖\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：目标对手从其牌库顶开始放逐牌，直到放逐一张瞬间或法术牌为止。你可以施放该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。然后将所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以随机顺序置于该牌库底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a6b79ee-4788-4290-9598-8e63bb5b03c0\', \'multiverseId\': 449894}, \'multiverseid\': 449894}, {\'name\': \'混沌法杖\', \'text\': \'{4}，{T}：目標對手從其牌庫頂開始放逐牌，直到放逐一張瞬間或巫術牌為止。你可以施放該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。然後將所有以此法放逐且未施放的牌以隨機順序置於該牌庫底。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6937752b-15c1-4ec7-8ff1-7bd15aa0085c\', \'multiverseId\': 450175}, \'multiverseid\': 450175}]', '[{\'name\': \'Chromium der Wandler\', \'text\': \'Aufblitzen\\nDieser Zauberspruch kann nicht neutralisiert werden.\\nFliegend\\nWirf eine Karte ab: Bis zum Ende des Zuges wird Chromium der Wandler zu einem Menschen mit Basis-Stärke und -Widerstandskraft 1/1, verliert alle Fähigkeiten und erhält Fluchsicherheit. Er kann in diesem Zug nicht geblockt werden.\', \'type\': \'Legendäre Kreatur — Ältester, Drache\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447631&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0299e812-73c0-4ac9-9cd5-aea76e450913\', \'multiverseId\': 447631}, \'multiverseid\': 447631}, {\'name\': \'Chromium, el Mutable\', \'text\': \'Destello.\\nEste hechizo no puede ser contrarrestado.\\nVuela.\\nDescartar una carta: Hasta el final del turno, Chromium, el Mutable se convierte en un Humano con fuerza y resistencia base de 1/1, pierde todas las habilidades y gana la habilidad de antimaleficio. No puede ser bloqueado este turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura legendaria — Dragón anciano\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447912&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c23668a-fc7e-48f1-b688-39a684121583\', \'multiverseId\': 447912}, \'multiverseid\': 447912}, {\'name\': "Chromium, l\'altérable", \'text\': "Flash\\nCe sort ne peut pas être contrecarré.\\nVol\\nDéfaussez-vous d\'une carte : Jusqu\'à la fin du tour, Chromium, l\'altérable devient un humain avec une force et une endurance de base de 1/1, perd toutes ses capacités et acquiert la défense talismanique. Il ne peut pas être bloqué ce tour-ci.", \'type\': \'Créature légendaire : ancêtre et dragon\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448193&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4f403ba5-3546-486e-9e4c-6cce7f6c74f5\', \'multiverseId\': 448193}, \'multiverseid\': 448193}, {\'name\': \'Chromium, il Mutevole\', \'text\': \'Lampo\\nQuesta magia non può essere neutralizzata.\\nVolare\\nScarta una carta: Fino alla fine del turno, Chromium, il Mutevole diventa un Umano con forza e costituzione base 1/1, perde tutte le abilità e ha anti-malocchio. Non può essere bloccato in questo turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Leggendaria — Antico Drago\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448474&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'abfdf4b1-f185-4b84-a383-3e3b484073f7\', \'multiverseId\': 448474}, \'multiverseid\': 448474}, {\'name\': \'変遷の龍、クロミウム\', \'text\': \'瞬速\\nこの呪文は打ち消されない。\\n飛行\\nカード１枚を捨てる：ターン終了時まで、変遷の龍、クロミウムは基本のパワーとタフネスが１/１の人間になり、すべての能力を失い、呪禁を得る。このターン、これはブロックされない。\', \'type\': \'伝説のクリーチャー — エルダー・ドラゴン\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448755&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'726d45fd-44c3-4d49-b594-6d7bd2050dc0\', \'multiverseId\': 448755}, \'multiverseid\': 448755}, {\'name\': \'변화하는 자, 크로뮴\', \'text\': \'섬광\\n이 주문은 무효화될 수 없다.\\n비행\\n카드 한 장을 버린다: 턴종료까지, 변화하는 자, 크로뮴은 기본 공격력과 방어력이 1/1인 인간이 되고, 모든 능력을 잃으며, 방호를 얻는다. 크로뮴은 이 턴에 방어될 수 없다.\', \'type\': \'전설적 생물 — 장로 용\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449036&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f9be194-eb9a-466c-a407-e3d27ca08f64\', \'multiverseId\': 449036}, \'multiverseid\': 449036}, {\'name\': \'Chromium, o Mutável\', \'text\': \'Lampejo\\nEsta mágica não pode ser anulada.\\nVoar\\nDescarte um card: Até o final do turno, Chromium, o Mutável, torna-se um Humano com poder e resistência básicos 1/1, perde todas as habilidades e ganha resistência a magia. Ele não pode ser bloqueado neste turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Lendária — Dragão Ancião\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449317&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af3cb855-711f-41e7-8027-0c8d3394cf93\', \'multiverseId\': 449317}, \'multiverseid\': 449317}, {\'name\': \'Хромиум, Переменчивый\', \'text\': \'Миг\\nЭто заклинание не может быть отменено.\\nПолет\\nСбросьте карту: до конца хода Хромиум, Переменчивый становится Человеком с базовыми силой и выносливостью 1/1, теряет все способности и получает Порчеустойчивость. Он не может быть заблокирован в этом ходу.\', \'type\': \'Легендарное Существо — Старейшина Дракон\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449598&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'388ce1e4-acc3-4101-b640-6c74665b530b\', \'multiverseId\': 449598}, \'multiverseid\': 449598}, {\'name\': \'化龙铬米恩\', \'text\': \'闪现\\n此咒语不能被反击。\\n飞行\\n弃一张牌：直到回合结束，化龙铬米恩成为基础力量与防御力为1/1的人类，失去所有异能，并获得辟邪异能。它本回合不能被阻挡。\', \'type\': \'传奇生物 ～长老／龙\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449879&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8ccf99a8-a982-49b8-ac8b-ba105e4a78cd\', \'multiverseId\': 449879}, \'multiverseid\': 449879}, {\'name\': \'化龍鉻米恩\', \'text\': \'閃現\\n此咒語不能被反擊。\\n飛行\\n棄一張牌：直到回合結束，化龍鉻米恩成為基礎力量與防禦力為1/1的人類，失去所有異能，並獲得辟邪異能。它本回合不能被阻擋。\', \'type\': \'傳奇生物 ～長老／龍\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450160&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5beefd21-af70-41ce-9bdf-d5e5b89621f8\', \'multiverseId\': 450160}, \'multiverseid\': 450160}]', '[{\'name\': \'Diamantross\', \'text\': \'Sowie das Diamantross ins Spiel kommt, bestimme eine Farbe.\\nImmer wenn du einen Zauberspruch der bestimmten Farbe wirkst, erhältst du 1 Lebenspunkt dazu.\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Pferd\', \'flavor\': \'Zieht es vorbei, folgen Regenbogen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447649&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fe22f8ee-b207-4e4b-8576-16c829bb853f\', \'multiverseId\': 447649}, \'multiverseid\': 447649}, {\'name\': \'Corcel del diamante\', \'text\': \'En cuanto el Corcel del diamante entre al campo de batalla, elige un color.\\nSiempre que lances un hechizo del color elegido, ganas 1 vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Caballo\', \'flavor\': \'Cuando pasa, le siguen los arcoíris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447930&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d9294e44-5f0f-445e-a7e9-0d2e3b8fde9c\', \'multiverseId\': 447930}, \'multiverseid\': 447930}, {\'name\': \'Jument du diamant\', \'text\': \'Au moment où la Jument du diamant arrive sur le champ de bataille, choisissez une couleur.\\nÀ chaque fois que vous lancez un sort de la couleur choisie, vous gagnez 1 point de vie.\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : cheval\', \'flavor\': \'Quand elle passe, un arc-en-ciel la suit.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448211&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'57c56053-1a2e-4632-af51-4e1891b2f2e8\', \'multiverseId\': 448211}, \'multiverseid\': 448211}, {\'name\': \'Destriero di Diamante\', \'text\': \'Mentre il Destriero di Diamante entra nel campo di battaglia, scegli un colore.\\nOgniqualvolta lanci una magia del colore scelto, guadagni 1 punto vita.\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Cavallo\', \'flavor\': "Al suo passaggio, compare l\'arcobaleno.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448492&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8a2b9b00-6884-41fb-b24d-28df11b790d5\', \'multiverseId\': 448492}, \'multiverseid\': 448492}, {\'name\': \'金剛牝馬\', \'text\': \'金剛牝馬が戦場に出るに際し、色１色を選ぶ。\\nあなたがその選ばれた色の呪文を唱えるたび、あなたは１点のライフを得る。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — 馬\', \'flavor\': \'それが走り去るとき、後に虹が続く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448773&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cde4e15c-1c4f-470c-880e-b44954c3e2e4\', \'multiverseId\': 448773}, \'multiverseid\': 448773}, {\'name\': \'다이아몬드 암말\', \'text\': \'다이아몬드 암말이 전장에 들어오면서 색 하나를 선택한다.\\n당신이 선택한 색의 주문을 발동할 때마다, 당신은 생명 1점을 얻는다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 말\', \'flavor\': \'그것이 지나가면, 무지개가 뒤따른다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449054&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'753fa75d-aef5-4e77-be93-f373f2c887b0\', \'multiverseId\': 449054}, \'multiverseid\': 449054}, {\'name\': \'Égua de Diamante\', \'text\': \'Conforme Égua de Diamante entrar no campo de batalha, escolha uma cor.\\nToda vez que você conjura uma mágica da cor escolhida, você ganha 1 ponto de vida.\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Cavalo\', \'flavor\': \'Quando ela passa, surgem arcos-íris.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449335&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'20e28ce8-8f80-421a-bd84-ce0a4cc80521\', \'multiverseId\': 449335}, \'multiverseid\': 449335}, {\'name\': \'Кобылица Сияния\', \'text\': \'При выходе Кобылицы Сияния на поле битвы выберите цвет.\\nКаждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание выбранного цвета, вы получаете 1 жизнь.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Лошадь\', \'flavor\': \'Когда она скачет, радуги следуют за ней.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449616&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'841dad6c-b4bc-449d-b26a-9b611561d716\', \'multiverseId\': 449616}, \'multiverseid\': 449616}, {\'name\': \'晶钻牝马\', \'text\': \'于晶钻牝马进战场时，选择一种颜色。\\n每当你施放该色的咒语时，你获得1点生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～马\', \'flavor\': \'所经之处，七彩虹霓紧相随。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449897&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2269c0ac-9aca-448a-a1ba-79888e08ec98\', \'multiverseId\': 449897}, \'multiverseid\': 449897}, {\'name\': \'晶鑽牝馬\', \'text\': \'於晶鑽牝馬進戰場時，選擇一種顏色。\\n每當你施放該色的咒語時，你獲得1點生命。\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～馬\', \'flavor\': \'所經之處，七彩虹霓緊相隨。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450178&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7dda63d0-f9d4-4585-954b-0ea6f46e3ef6\', \'multiverseId\': 450178}, \'multiverseid\': 450178}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dolchrücken-Basilisk\', \'text\': \'Todesberührung (Eine beliebige Menge Schadenspunkte, die er einer Kreatur zufügt, sind ausreichend, um diese zu zerstören.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Basilisk\', \'flavor\': \'Aus seinen Drüsen rinnt Gift und er ernährt sich auch nur von Gift.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447591&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43bf69bc-a9f7-44bb-b840-33305cb16655\', \'multiverseId\': 447591}, \'multiverseid\': 447591}, {\'name\': \'Basilisco lomo de dagas\', \'text\': \'Toque mortal. (Cualquier cantidad de daño que esto haga a una criatura es suficiente para destruirla.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Basilisco\', \'flavor\': \'Sus ventrículos rezuman veneno y solo se alimenta de ponzoña.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447872&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a331f581-f59f-4f18-a6dc-2333e3b851f4\', \'multiverseId\': 447872}, \'multiverseid\': 447872}, {\'name\': \'Basilic daguéchine\', \'text\': "Contact mortel (Le nombre de blessures que cette créature inflige à une créature, quel qu\'il soit, est suffisant pour la détruire.)", \'type\': \'Créature : basilic\', \'flavor\': \'Du venin suinte de ses ventricules, et il ne se nourrit que de poison.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448153&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'83c8a86c-8102-42f0-9e13-4e3ce507053f\', \'multiverseId\': 448153}, \'multiverseid\': 448153}, {\'name\': \'Basilisco dal Dorso Appuntito\', \'text\': \'Tocco letale (Qualsiasi danno che questa creatura infligge a una creatura è sufficiente a distruggerla.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Basilisco\', \'flavor\': \'I suoi ventricoli trasudano tossine e si nutre di solo veleno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448434&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50a0c2a9-25d3-408c-a22d-8cf3133e7f5b\', \'multiverseId\': 448434}, \'multiverseid\': 448434}, {\'name\': \'短刀背のバジリスク\', \'text\': \'接死（これが何らかのダメージをクリーチャーに与えたら、それだけで破壊する。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — バジリスク\', \'flavor\': \'その心臓は毒液を送り出し、それが貪るのは毒物のみ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448715&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1d6ceee-65e6-4ad4-8726-08e62dd56068\', \'multiverseId\': 448715}, \'multiverseid\': 448715}, {\'name\': \'단검등짝 바실리스크\', \'text\': \'치명타 (이 생물에게 피해를 입은 생물은 입은 피해의 양에 상관없이 파괴된다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 바실리스크\', \'flavor\': \'심실에서는 독을 내뿜고, 먹이는 오로지 독뿐이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448996&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'483d400a-db4d-4a98-b5be-5fb6ec7ce421\', \'multiverseId\': 448996}, \'multiverseid\': 448996}, {\'name\': \'Basilisco Dorso-de-adaga\', \'text\': \'Toque mortífero (Qualquer quantidade de dano que esta criatura cause a uma criatura é suficiente para destruí-la.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Basilisco\', \'flavor\': \'Seus ventrículos gotejam peçonha e ele consome apenas veneno.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449277&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4efd2932-7097-466e-8622-6a2df5c49cb4\', \'multiverseId\': 449277}, \'multiverseid\': 449277}, {\'name\': \'Василиск-Спинокол\', \'text\': \'Смертельное касание (Любое количество повреждений, которое этот объект наносит существу, достаточно, чтобы его уничтожить.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Василиск\', \'flavor\': \'По его жилам течет отрава, и питается он только ядом.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449558&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3954bd30-ff6e-4b40-bfa7-37ac96013e6f\', \'multiverseId\': 449558}, \'multiverseid\': 449558}, {\'name\': \'匕背蜥怪\', \'text\': \'死触（它对生物造成的任何数量伤害都足以消灭后者。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜥怪\', \'flavor\': \'它的心房内流淌着毒液，平日只食毒物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449839&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e58f4663-013c-4f91-bc2f-29e90162cbc4\', \'multiverseId\': 449839}, \'multiverseid\': 449839}, {\'name\': \'匕背蜥怪\', \'text\': \'死觸（它對生物造成的任何數量傷害都足以消滅後者。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～蜥怪\', \'flavor\': \'它的心房內流淌著毒液，平日只食毒物。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450120&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'098360f1-6993-49d5-9deb-2df44e2ba025\', \'multiverseId\': 450120}, \'multiverseid\': 450120}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dominanzgehabe\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält +3/+3 bis zum Ende des Zuges. Alle Kreaturen, die sie in diesem Zug blocken können, tun dies.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn du dich für einen Anführer hältst, musst du auch deine Dominanz beweisen."\\n—Gar-Tun, Nebeltal-Silberrücken\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447592&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f661ab0b-7255-4531-a313-53ca3f25aed2\', \'multiverseId\': 447592}, \'multiverseid\': 447592}, {\'name\': \'Declarar autoridad\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene +3/+3 hasta el final del turno. Todas las criaturas que puedan bloquearla este turno lo hacen.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Si crees que eres un líder, demuestra tu poder".\\n—Gar-Tun, lomo plateado de Valleniebla\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447873&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7b560c57-edd1-4345-aba7-4c264428822b\', \'multiverseId\': 447873}, \'multiverseid\': 447873}, {\'name\': \'Déclarer sa domination\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne +3/+3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. Toutes les créatures capables de la bloquer ce tour-ci le font.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'« Si tu penses être un chef, alors prouve ta puissance. »\\n—Gar-Tun, gorille à dos argenté de la vallée des brumes\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448154&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2641c654-2d61-45b5-968b-5ab414a14494\', \'multiverseId\': 448154}, \'multiverseid\': 448154}, {\'name\': \'Dichiarare il Predominio\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende +3/+3 fino alla fine del turno. Tutte le creature in grado di bloccarla in questo turno lo fanno.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Se ti consideri un capo, dai prova del tuo valore."\\n—Gar-Tun, schienargento della Valnebbiosa\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448435&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'01e5eb97-1afb-4fb5-94e0-d7f79361abec\', \'multiverseId\': 448435}, \'multiverseid\': 448435}, {\'name\': \'優位宣言\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。このターン、それをブロックできるクリーチャーはすべて、それをブロックする。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「自分が長だと思うのなら、その力を証明しろ。」\\n――霧谷の銀背、ガル＝トゥン\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'085fb20a-ce20-4550-8f95-c931223ecc99\', \'multiverseId\': 448716}, \'multiverseid\': 448716}, {\'name\': \'지배 선언\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 +3/+3을 받는다. 이 턴에 그 생물을 방어할 수 있는 모든 생물은 그 생물을 방어한다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"자신이 대장이라고 생각한다면, 네 힘을 증명해라."\\n—안개골짜기의 은등짝 고릴라, 가르-툰\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448997&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2ba0b855-a4c5-47e7-9b13-719c5a521238\', \'multiverseId\': 448997}, \'multiverseid\': 448997}, {\'name\': \'Declarar Dominância\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe +3/+3 até o final do turno. Todas as criaturas aptas a bloqueá-la neste turno o fazem.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Se acredita ser um líder, demonstre seu valor."\\n— Gar-Tun, dorso-de-prata do Vale das Brumas\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'73908430-55f0-48e8-9390-b34ec1d8fe00\', \'multiverseId\': 449278}, \'multiverseid\': 449278}, {\'name\': \'Выражение Превосходства\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает +3/+3 до конца хода. Все существа, способные блокировать его в этом ходу, делают это.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Если зовешь себя вождем, так докажи свою силу!»\\n— Гар-Тун, старый вожак из Долины Туманов\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32fb3d5f-9e35-4acd-b793-595f9eae06db\', \'multiverseId\': 449559}, \'multiverseid\': 449559}, {\'name\': \'宣示威权\', \'text\': \'目标生物得+3/+3直到回合结束。本回合中，所有能够阻挡它的生物皆须阻挡之。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你自诩族长，那就证明你的力量。」\\n～雾谷银背葛顿\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f2f79170-f7a6-47fd-bfcc-cece5b73047d\', \'multiverseId\': 449840}, \'multiverseid\': 449840}, {\'name\': \'宣示威權\', \'text\': \'目標生物得+3/+3直到回合結束。本回合中，所有能夠阻擋它的生物皆須阻擋之。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「如果你自詡族長，那就證明你的力量。」\\n～霧谷銀背葛頓\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ffea9935-9ee9-4f59-9196-cd39844edab8\', \'multiverseId\': 450121}, \'multiverseid\': 450121}]', '[{\'name\': \'Doppelzauber\', \'text\': \'Wenn du in diesem Zug deinen nächsten Spontanzauber oder deine nächste Hexerei wirkst, kopiere jenen Zauberspruch. Du kannst neue Ziele für die Kopie bestimmen.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Erst die Wunde, dann das Salz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447554&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'885a4593-392e-42c8-bdc2-1f47ba2b63b7\', \'multiverseId\': 447554}, \'multiverseid\': 447554}, {\'name\': \'Hechizo doble\', \'text\': \'Cuando lances tu próximo hechizo de instantáneo o de conjuro este turno, copia ese hechizo. Puedes elegir nuevos objetivos para la copia.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Primero el insulto, luego la repetición.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447835&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5a79d97f-d137-4914-8474-910e57274c81\', \'multiverseId\': 447835}, \'multiverseid\': 447835}, {\'name\': \'Double lancer\', \'text\': "Quand vous lancez votre prochain sort d\'éphémère ou de rituel ce tour-ci, copiez ce sort. Vous pouvez choisir de nouvelles cibles pour cette copie.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "D\'abord l\'insulte, puis le rappel.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448116&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47b57fe3-a050-4136-9af9-9779e72fe61c\', \'multiverseId\': 448116}, \'multiverseid\': 448116}, {\'name\': \'Lancio Duplicato\', \'text\': \'Quando lanci la tua prossima magia istantaneo o stregoneria in questo turno, copiala. Puoi scegliere nuovi bersagli per la copia.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Oltre al danno, il bis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448397&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d04102b7-4717-499c-a7b3-9135622059ec\', \'multiverseId\': 448397}, \'multiverseid\': 448397}, {\'name\': \'二倍詠唱\', \'text\': \'このターン、あなたが次にインスタントかソーサリーである呪文を唱えたとき、その呪文をコピーする。あなたはそのコピーの新しい対象を選んでもよい。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'まずは罵り、そしてもう一度。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448678&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'378e4f65-b771-4fbd-846d-09f05dc04d86\', \'multiverseId\': 448678}, \'multiverseid\': 448678}, {\'name\': \'이단발동\', \'text\': \'이 턴에 다음으로 당신이 순간마법이나 집중마법 주문을 발동할 때, 그 주문을 복사한다. 당신은 그 복사본의 목표를 새로 정할 수 있다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'처음에는 욕이 날아오고, 그 다음은 재청 공연이다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448959&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef19c6af-ffc8-405d-99db-c80f7c1046e7\', \'multiverseId\': 448959}, \'multiverseid\': 448959}, {\'name\': \'Conjuração Dobrada\', \'text\': \'Quando você conjurar sua próxima mágica instantânea ou feitiço neste turno, copie aquela mágica. Você pode escolher novos alvos para a cópia.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Primeiro, o insulto. Depois, o bis.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449240&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1f26ef14-e443-4431-9c0e-d3b751aec8f1\', \'multiverseId\': 449240}, \'multiverseid\': 449240}, {\'name\': \'Двойное Колдовство\', \'text\': \'Когда вы будете разыгрывать ваше следующее мгновенное заклинание или заклинание волшебства в этом ходу, скопируйте то заклинание. Вы можете выбрать новые цели для той копии.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Сначала оскорбление, потом оскорбление на бис.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449521&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'553f6039-9e70-4771-8d80-40d7a9681bc1\', \'multiverseId\': 449521}, \'multiverseid\': 449521}, {\'name\': \'连咒击\', \'text\': \'本回合中，当你施放你的下一个瞬间或法术咒语时，复制该咒语。你可以为该复制品选择新的目标。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'冲击先达，回响后至。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449802&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'32c434f8-8f54-4ea4-bbea-8e51e9c9fa5c\', \'multiverseId\': 449802}, \'multiverseid\': 449802}, {\'name\': \'連咒擊\', \'text\': \'本回合中，當你施放你的下一個瞬間或巫術咒語時，複製該咒語。你可以為該複製品選擇新的目標。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'衝擊先達，迴響後至。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450083&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e5bbab82-e5c9-4261-95cb-33419a2ee15f\', \'multiverseId\': 450083}, \'multiverseid\': 450083}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenfellwölfe\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Wolf\', \'flavor\': \'„Halana ließ ein Dornengestrüpp um unser Camp wachsen, als Barrikade gegen die Wölfe. Dieser Fehler wäre uns beinahe teuer zu stehen gekommen."\\n—Alena, Fallenstellerin aus Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447621&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df1fd337-97ca-4e79-a8df-543c33fcce3a\', \'multiverseId\': 447621}, \'multiverseid\': 447621}, {\'name\': \'Lobos erizados\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Halana cultivó zarzas para crear una barrera alrededor del campo y así mantener fuera a los lobos. Eso fue un error que estuvimos a punto de pagar muy caro".\\n—Alena, trampera de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447902&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8c9971b4-baad-488a-95bc-182fbe1362e4\', \'multiverseId\': 447902}, \'multiverseid\': 447902}, {\'name\': \'Loups au pelage épineux\', \'type\': \'Créature : loup\', \'flavor\': "« Halana a fait pousser des ronces autour de notre camp, en espérant qu\'elles empêcheraient les loups de passer. C\'était une erreur pour laquelle nous avons failli payer très cher. »\\n—Alena, trappeur de Kessig", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448183&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2773ee03-3b40-4c8a-8ac4-348c2b5839b8\', \'multiverseId\': 448183}, \'multiverseid\': 448183}, {\'name\': \'Lupi Pellerovo\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Lupo\', \'flavor\': \'"Halana coltivò dei rovi per creare una barricata intorno al nostro accampamento, sperando che tenesse i lupi alla larga. Per poco non la pagammo cara per quell\\\'errore."\\n—Alena, trappolatrice del Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448464&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dea023e0-e0de-49c6-b1a1-fae5dab19bce\', \'multiverseId\': 448464}, \'multiverseid\': 448464}, {\'name\': \'茨隠れの狼\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 狼\', \'flavor\': \'「ハラナは茨を育てて野営地の周りに垣を作ろうとしていたの。狼を遠ざけられると思ってね。あれは大失敗だったわ。ひどい犠牲が出るところだった。」\\n――ケッシグの罠師、アレイナ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448745&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'50bb5d00-44c4-4a87-a1a6-3535e195e772\', \'multiverseId\': 448745}, \'multiverseid\': 448745}, {\'name\': \'가시가죽 늑대\', \'type\': \'생물 — 늑대\', \'flavor\': \'"할라나는 늑대들의 접근을 막기 위해 야영지 주변에 검은딸기나무를 심어 방어벽을 쳤어. 하지만 그것은 막대한 대가를 치른 큰 실수였지."\\n—케시그의 덫사냥꾼 알레나\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449026&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4d26db8d-c5b9-4f75-be19-c95d902a077f\', \'multiverseId\': 449026}, \'multiverseid\': 449026}, {\'name\': \'Lobos Pelespinho\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Lobo\', \'flavor\': \'"Halana fez crescer espinheiros para criar uma barricada em torno do nosso acampamento na esperança de que aquilo contivesse os lobos. Foi um engano pelo qual quase pagamos muito caro."\\n— Alena, armadilheira de Kessig\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449307&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1af0379d-5e34-442e-8483-38d8f31ac754\', \'multiverseId\': 449307}, \'multiverseid\': 449307}, {\'name\': \'Колючие Волки\', \'type\': \'Существо — Волк\', \'flavor\': \'«Халана выращивала вокруг лагеря терновник и думала, что колючая стена защитит нас от волков. За эту ошибку мы чуть было не поплатились жизнью».\\n— Алена, капканщица из Кессига\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449588&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d7752a1-cda3-4a24-a482-bc527c95c8e1\', \'multiverseId\': 449588}, \'multiverseid\': 449588}, {\'name\': \'荆皮群狼\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「荷拉娜在我们的营地周围种下荆棘作为屏障，希望能藉此驱散狼群。这个错误的判断险些让我们付出致命的代价。」\\n～凯锡革布陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449869&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b38d6c2c-eaa5-4ef5-b269-2da586908e22\', \'multiverseId\': 449869}, \'multiverseid\': 449869}, {\'name\': \'荊皮群狼\', \'type\': \'生物 ～狼\', \'flavor\': \'「荷拉娜在我們的營地周圍種下荊棘作為屏障，希望能藉此驅散狼群。這個錯誤的判斷險些讓我們付出致命的代價。」\\n～凱錫革佈陷人阿雷娜\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450150&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25ead179-0c9d-4490-b4c3-8184e8bd39b4\', \'multiverseId\': 450150}, \'multiverseid\': 450150}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dornenleutnant\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn der Dornenleutnant das Ziel eines Zauberspruchs oder einer Fähigkeit wird, den bzw. die ein Gegner kontrolliert, erzeuge einen 1/1 grünen Elf-Krieger-Kreaturenspielstein.\\n{5}{G}: Der Dornenleutnant erhält +4/+4 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Krieger\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447620&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e737362c-3af5-4eab-9f97-27a68801095f\', \'multiverseId\': 447620}, \'multiverseid\': 447620}, {\'name\': \'Teniente de espinas\', \'text\': \'Siempre que el Teniente de espinas sea objetivo de un hechizo o habilidad que controla un oponente, crea una ficha de criatura Guerrero Elfo verde 1/1.\\n{5}{G}: El Teniente de espinas obtiene +4/+4 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Guerrero elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447901&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6022247-338e-41a7-beb5-2b0f1f3ad080\', \'multiverseId\': 447901}, \'multiverseid\': 447901}, {\'name\': "Lieutenant d\'épines", \'text\': "À chaque fois que le Lieutenant d\'épines devient la cible d\'un sort ou d\'une capacité qu\'un adversaire contrôle, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 verte Elfe et Guerrier.\\n{5}{G} : Le Lieutenant d\'épines gagne +4/+4 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et guerrier\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448182&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cac0f57-4f1e-4cb2-9673-009382318b58\', \'multiverseId\': 448182}, \'multiverseid\': 448182}, {\'name\': \'Tenente dei Rovi\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta il Tenente dei Rovi diventa bersaglio di una magia o abilità controllata da un avversario, crea una pedina creatura Guerriero Elfo 1/1 verde.\\n{5}{G}: Il Tenente dei Rovi prende +4/+4 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Guerriero Elfo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448463&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d427c570-36e8-4b22-8886-d38f960438a3\', \'multiverseId\': 448463}, \'multiverseid\': 448463}, {\'name\': \'茨の副官\', \'text\': \'茨の副官が、対戦相手がコントロールしている呪文や能力の対象になるたび、緑の１/１のエルフ・戦士・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\\n{5}{G}：ターン終了時まで、茨の副官は＋４/＋４の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・戦士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448744&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5e6951ad-d459-4af3-907e-ab96baa075ec\', \'multiverseId\': 448744}, \'multiverseid\': 448744}, {\'name\': \'가시 장교\', \'text\': \'가시 장교가 상대가 조종하는 주문이나 능력의 목표가 될 때마다, 1/1 녹색 엘프 전사 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\\n{5}{G}: 가시 장교는 턴종료까지 +4/+4를 받는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 전사\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449025&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3fe6f9f6-ace5-42cd-b35c-d12a6642ff4f\', \'multiverseId\': 449025}, \'multiverseid\': 449025}, {\'name\': \'Tenente dos Espinhos\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que Tenente dos Espinhos se tornar alvo de uma mágica ou habilidade que um oponente controla, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 1/1 do tipo Elfo Guerreiro.\\n{5}{G}: Tenente dos Espinhos recebe +4/+4 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Guerreiro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449306&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a50c470e-2b76-4de7-be33-b58b12aa62b1\', \'multiverseId\': 449306}, \'multiverseid\': 449306}, {\'name\': \'Шипастый Лейтенант\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда Шипастый Лейтенант становится целью заклинания или способности под контролем оппонента, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 зеленый Эльф Воин.\\n{5}{G}: Шипастый Лейтенант получает +4/+4 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Воин\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449587&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fff46b05-f67f-49ea-89f1-d5d0006f8713\', \'multiverseId\': 449587}, \'multiverseid\': 449587}, {\'name\': \'荆棘副官\', \'text\': \'每当荆棘副官成为由对手操控之咒语或异能的目标时，派出一个1/1绿色妖精／战士衍生生物。\\n{5}{G}：荆棘副官得+4/+4直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／战士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449868&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3225cd75-1685-4e06-a926-cef3d358b290\', \'multiverseId\': 449868}, \'multiverseid\': 449868}, {\'name\': \'荊棘尉官\', \'text\': \'每當荊棘副官成為由對手操控之咒語或異能的目標時，派出一個1/1綠色妖精／戰士衍生生物。\\n{5}{G}：荊棘尉官得+4/+4直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／戰士\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450149&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91d1f37b-4bad-4dcb-8f40-fe6ec5b00db9\', \'multiverseId\': 450149}, \'multiverseid\': 450149}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenei\', \'text\': \'Verteidiger (Diese Kreatur kann nicht angreifen.)\\nWenn das Drachenei stirbt, erzeuge einen 2/2 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit und „{R}: Diese Kreatur erhält +1/+0 bis zum Ende des Zuges."\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Drache, Ei\', \'flavor\': \'Die Geburtshöhlen von Drachen stecken voller Schätze, um den Drachenjungen einen Anreiz zum Schlüpfen zu bieten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447555&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4175276e-a1a2-4bbe-af01-e9bf86397737\', \'multiverseId\': 447555}, \'multiverseid\': 447555}, {\'name\': \'Huevo de dragón\', \'text\': \'Defensor. (Esta criatura no puede atacar.)\\nCuando el Huevo de dragón muera, crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 2/2 con la habilidad de volar y "{R}: Esta criatura obtiene +1/+0 hasta el final del turno".\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Huevo dragón\', \'flavor\': \'Las guaridas donde los dragones anidan están llenas de tesoros para atraer a las crías y hacerlas salir de sus huevos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447836&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3ee0a4-9a83-4ef0-bbb8-416509059b34\', \'multiverseId\': 447836}, \'multiverseid\': 447836}, {\'name\': \'Œuf de dragon\', \'text\': "Défenseur (Cette créature ne peut pas attaquer).\\nQuand l\'Œuf de dragon meurt, créez un jeton de créature 2/2 rouge Dragon avec le vol et « {R} : cette créature gagne +1/+0 jusqu\'à la fin du tour. »", \'type\': \'Créature : dragon et œuf\', \'flavor\': \'Les nids de dragon sont jonchés de trésors pour inciter les petits à sortir de leur coquille.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448117&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e0eeb909-5107-4eb0-947d-a10e2e3a2c02\', \'multiverseId\': 448117}, \'multiverseid\': 448117}, {\'name\': \'Uovo di Drago\', \'text\': \'Difensore (Questa creatura non può attaccare.)\\nQuando l\\\'Uovo di Drago muore, crea una pedina creatura Drago 2/2 rossa con volare e "{R}: Questa creatura prende +1/+0 fino alla fine del turno".\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Uovo Drago\', \'flavor\': "Le tane di schiusa dei draghi sono cosparse di tesori, per attirare i piccoli a uscire dall\'uovo.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448398&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9977ef34-2770-48e6-a8ed-9ea85861db59\', \'multiverseId\': 448398}, \'multiverseid\': 448398}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの卵\', \'text\': \'防衛（このクリーチャーでは攻撃できない。）\\nドラゴンの卵が死亡したとき、飛行と「{R}：ターン終了時まで、このクリーチャーは＋１/＋０の修整を受ける。」を持つ赤の２/２のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ドラゴン・卵\', \'flavor\': \'ドラゴンの巣穴には雛を卵から呼び出すための宝物が詰まっている。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448679&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9990d0d6-3b2b-430a-b35c-5e7d6484fb3e\', \'multiverseId\': 448679}, \'multiverseid\': 448679}, {\'name\': \'용의 알\', \'text\': \'수비태세 (이 생물은 공격할 수 없다.)\\n용의 알이 죽을 때, 비행과 "{R}: 이 생물은 턴종료까지 +1/+0을 받는다."를 가진 2/2 적색 용 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 용의 알\', \'flavor\': \'어미 용은 새끼 용이 알을 깨고 나오도록 둥지에 보물을 흩어 놓는다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448960&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'11a3ca87-b52a-42a3-9fa8-0f9e243e8def\', \'multiverseId\': 448960}, \'multiverseid\': 448960}, {\'name\': \'Ovo de Dragão\', \'text\': \'Defensor (Esta criatura não pode atacar.)\\nQuando Ovo de Dragão morrer, crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 2/2 do tipo Dragão com voar e "{R}: Esta criatura recebe +1/+0 até o final do turno."\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ovo de Dragão\', \'flavor\': \'Os ninhos dos dragões são cheios de tesouros para atrair os filhotes para fora dos ovos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449241&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ec8411a5-5fae-4064-94f2-1c38623297e9\', \'multiverseId\': 449241}, \'multiverseid\': 449241}, {\'name\': \'Яйцо Дракона\', \'text\': \'Защитник (Это существо не может атаковать.)\\nКогда Яйцо Дракона умирает, создайте одну фишку существа 2/2 красный Дракон с Полетом и способностью «{R}: это существо получает +1/+0 до конца хода».\', \'type\': \'Существо — Дракон Яйцо\', \'flavor\': \'Родители-драконы разбрасывают вокруг кладки яиц драгоценности, чтобы любопытство заставило детенышей скорее вылупиться.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449522&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b7dec0b4-584f-4e74-b97a-e49583954508\', \'multiverseId\': 449522}, \'multiverseid\': 449522}, {\'name\': \'龙卵\', \'text\': \'守军（此生物不能攻击。）\\n当龙卵死去时，派出一个2/2红色的龙衍生生物，且具有飞行异能与「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合结束。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龙／蛋\', \'flavor\': \'巨龙出生的巢穴里散落着宝物，用以诱使幼龙破卵而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449803&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a93442-be72-4964-8508-bd9b14528d9d\', \'multiverseId\': 449803}, \'multiverseid\': 449803}, {\'name\': \'龍卵\', \'text\': \'守軍（此生物不能攻擊。）\\n當龍卵死去時，派出一個2/2紅色的龍衍生生物，且具有飛行異能與「{R}：此生物得+1/+0直到回合結束。」\', \'type\': \'生物 ～龍／蛋\', \'flavor\': \'巨龍出生的巢穴裡散落著寶物，用以誘使幼龍破卵而出。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450084&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'95d2e7df-786d-4c51-a139-0cb912cea4cc\', \'multiverseId\': 450084}, \'multiverseid\': 450084}]', '[{\'name\': \'Drachenschülerin\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge ein Mana einer beliebigen Farbe.\\n{7}, {T}, opfere die Drachenschülerin: Erzeuge einen 5/5 roten Drache-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Schamane\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn ich schon sterben muss, dann will ich mein Leben in der Umarmung des Feuers aushauchen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447632&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d1105557-278d-418a-bbd1-2ad77209b410\', \'multiverseId\': 447632}, \'multiverseid\': 447632}, {\'name\': \'Discípula dracónica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega un maná de cualquier color.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrificar la Discípula dracónica: Crea una ficha de criatura Dragón roja 5/5 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Chamán humano\', \'flavor\': \'"Si tengo que morir, lo haré en el abrazo de las llamas inconmensurables".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a7d63d7-31ec-4bdb-adea-75b934a40a02\', \'multiverseId\': 447913}, \'multiverseid\': 447913}, {\'name\': \'Disciple draconique\', \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez un mana de la couleur de votre choix.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifiez la Disciple draconique : Créez un jeton de créature 5/5 rouge Dragon avec le vol.\', \'type\': \'Créature : humain et shamane\', \'flavor\': \'« Si je dois mourir, je veux mourir enlacée par une flamme incommensurable. »\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448194&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'08d533aa-4cec-4eba-a340-537d0e3b94bd\', \'multiverseId\': 448194}, \'multiverseid\': 448194}, {\'name\': \'Discepola Draconica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi un mana di un qualsiasi colore.\\n{7}, {T}, Sacrifica la Discepola Draconica: Crea una pedina creatura Drago 5/5 rossa con volare.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Sciamano Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Se devo morire, lo farò avvolta da fiamme incommensurabili."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3146754b-5b64-4402-aece-befebbec450c\', \'multiverseId\': 448475}, \'multiverseid\': 448475}, {\'name\': \'ドラゴンの信奉者\', \'text\': \'{T}：好きな色１色のマナ１点を加える。\\n{7}, {T}, ドラゴンの信奉者を生け贄に捧げる：飛行を持つ赤の５/５のドラゴン・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・シャーマン\', \'flavor\': \'「私が死ぬのなら、無限の炎に抱かれて死ぬだろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7edb9ea5-858d-47fd-97aa-1f8b8a310d49\', \'multiverseId\': 448756}, \'multiverseid\': 448756}, {\'name\': \'용의 사도\', \'text\': \'{T}: 원하는 색의 마나 한 개를 추가한다.\\n{7}, {T}, 용의 사도를 희생한다: 비행을 가진 5/5 적색 용 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 주술사\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 죽어야 한다면, 나는 헤아릴 수 없는 불길 속에서 죽겠다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'31124e44-61ff-48b1-a429-75974ba71af5\', \'multiverseId\': 449037}, \'multiverseid\': 449037}, {\'name\': \'Discípula Dracônica\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione um mana de qualquer cor.\\n{7}, {T}, sacrifique Discípula Dracônica: Crie uma ficha de criatura vermelha 5/5 do tipo Dragão com voar.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Xamã\', \'flavor\': \'"Se devo morrer, morrerei no abraço da chama imensurável."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449318&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0b121c5d-7384-410a-ab5e-bf3994ddc6db\', \'multiverseId\': 449318}, \'multiverseid\': 449318}, {\'name\': \'Ученица Драконов\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте одну ману любого цвета.\\n{7}, {T}, пожертвуйте Ученицу Драконов: создайте одну фишку существа 5/5 красный Дракон с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Шаман\', \'flavor\': \'«Если мне суждено погибнуть, то пусть я умру в объятьях неизмеримого пламени».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449599&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5eae5529-9511-426f-84bf-71ad4e057992\', \'multiverseId\': 449599}, \'multiverseid\': 449599}, {\'name\': \'巨龙信徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一点任意颜色的法术力。\\n{7}，{T}，牺牲巨龙信徒：派出一个5/5红色，具飞行异能的龙衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／祭师\', \'flavor\': \'「若我死期将至，我要死在无尽烈焰的拥抱之中。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449880&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4750fee4-9b89-4e03-b179-94e13e532350\', \'multiverseId\': 449880}, \'multiverseid\': 449880}, {\'name\': \'巨龍信徒\', \'text\': \'{T}：加一點任意顏色的魔法力。\\n{7}，{T}，犧牲巨龍信徒：派出一個5/5紅色，具飛行異能的龍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／祭師\', \'flavor\': \'「若我死期將至，我要死在無盡烈焰的擁抱之中。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450161&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'60d8f663-b6d2-4565-aeb3-1ab194463e7c\', \'multiverseId\': 450161}, \'multiverseid\': 450161}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druide der Hörner\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn du einen Aura-Zauberspruch wirkst, der den Druiden der Hörner als Ziel hat, erzeuge einen 3/3 grünen Bestie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Eindringlinge erwartet keine freudige Begrüßung. Nur Reißzähne, Hörner und Klauen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447593&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'567930ea-397f-4d75-8934-051a3c7418f1\', \'multiverseId\': 447593}, \'multiverseid\': 447593}, {\'name\': \'Druida con cuernos\', \'text\': \'Siempre que lances un hechizo de Aura que haga objetivo al Druida con cuernos, crea una ficha de criatura Bestia verde 3/3.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida humano\', \'flavor\': \'Que no esperen ninguna bienvenida aquellos que invaden nuestra tierra; serán recibidos con colmillos, cuernos y garras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447874&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'134944ef-3bbf-4c19-869b-208a6353fb57\', \'multiverseId\': 447874}, \'multiverseid\': 447874}, {\'name\': \'Druide de cornes\', \'text\': "À chaque fois que vous lancez un sort d\'aura qui cible le Druide de cornes, créez un jeton de créature 3/3 verte Bête.", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et druide\', \'flavor\': \'Les intrus ne méritent pas un bon accueil. Uniquement des crocs, des cornes et des griffes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448155&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a537d35f-2dac-41a4-90b5-ac1b11489044\', \'multiverseId\': 448155}, \'multiverseid\': 448155}, {\'name\': \'Druido dei Corni\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta lanci una magia Aura che bersaglia il Druido dei Corni, crea una pedina creatura Bestia 3/3 verde.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Umano\', \'flavor\': \'Gli intrusi non riceveranno alcun benvenuto, solo zanne, corna e artigli.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448436&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1bb89a6b-48d6-4e29-82e3-2a9bdc6b99f8\', \'multiverseId\': 448436}, \'multiverseid\': 448436}, {\'name\': \'角のドルイド\', \'text\': \'あなたが角のドルイドを対象としてオーラ・呪文を唱えるたび、緑の３/３のビースト・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'侵入者は歓迎されない。出迎えは牙と角と爪のみだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448717&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab8a6a63-9607-4d27-b1a7-39165456b2df\', \'multiverseId\': 448717}, \'multiverseid\': 448717}, {\'name\': \'뿔의 드루이드\', \'text\': \'당신이 뿔의 드루이드를 목표로 하는 마법진 주문을 발동할 때마다, 3/3 녹색 야수 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'침입자는 전혀 환영받지 않는다. 오직 이빨과 뿔과 발톱뿐.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448998&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0aa20fe6-59a3-4ac7-b88f-f955b7aa0d69\', \'multiverseId\': 448998}, \'multiverseid\': 448998}, {\'name\': \'Druida dos Chifres\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que você conjurar uma mágica de Aura que tenha Druida dos Chifres como alvo, crie uma ficha de criatura verde 3/3 do tipo Besta.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Sem boas-vindas para invasores. Somente presas, chifres e garras.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449279&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9bb3db4-6081-4766-ad6c-0d5262df4fec\', \'multiverseId\': 449279}, \'multiverseid\': 449279}, {\'name\': \'Друид-Рогач\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда вы разыгрываете заклинание Ауры, целью которого является Друид-Рогач, создайте одну фишку существа 3/3 зеленый Зверь.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Тем, кто пришел без приглашения, не дождаться гостеприимства. Для них — только клыки, рога и когти.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449560&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0bff17d0-ab81-4a68-a537-35086e3c24b0\', \'multiverseId\': 449560}, \'multiverseid\': 449560}, {\'name\': \'犄角德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'每当你施放一个以犄角德鲁伊为目标的灵气咒语时，派出一个3/3绿色野兽衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'侵入者不会受到欢迎。只会见到尖牙、长角和利爪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449841&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9f798bf7-2113-4a18-aa01-3c3dd24cec65\', \'multiverseId\': 449841}, \'multiverseid\': 449841}, {\'name\': \'犄角德魯伊\', \'text\': \'每當你施放一個以犄角德魯伊為目標的靈氣咒語時，派出一個3/3綠色野獸衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'侵入者不會受到歡迎。只會見到尖牙、長角和利爪。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450122&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b3f926da-7e19-4ad4-87d7-a5522a9761b1\', \'multiverseId\': 450122}, \'multiverseid\': 450122}]', '[{\'name\': \'Druidin des Kuttengrunds\', \'text\': \'{T}: Erzeuge {G}.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'„Das wilde Wirrwarr des Kuttengrunds ist den Lebewesen eine Zuflucht, die einst zusahen, wie die ersten Türme gen Himmel wuchsen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447594&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0ce30372-ad26-43ed-bf6d-0a7d8a98ee08\', \'multiverseId\': 447594}, \'multiverseid\': 447594}, {\'name\': \'Druida de Cogulla\', \'text\': \'{T}: Agrega {G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"La naturaleza salvaje de la Cogulla es un santuario a la vida que vio alzarse a los primeros edificios".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447875&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cec21aef-3ed6-4879-b615-1721b57d226b\', \'multiverseId\': 447875}, \'multiverseid\': 447875}, {\'name\': "Druidesse de l\'Auvent", \'text\': \'{T} : Ajoutez {G}.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "« La friche de l\'Auvent offre un sanctuaire aux êtres qui ont vu s\'élever les premiers bâtiments. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448156&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9eec6aa7-d021-4e91-b277-f1d134261616\', \'multiverseId\': 448156}, \'multiverseid\': 448156}, {\'name\': \'Druida della Cappa\', \'text\': \'{T}: Aggiungi {G}.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'"Il selvatico groviglio della Cappa offre rifugio alla fauna che vide sorgere i primi edifici."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448437&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b7f4e57-12ac-43f5-938d-dee659e01eeb\', \'multiverseId\': 448437}, \'multiverseid\': 448437}, {\'name\': \'僧帽地帯のドルイド\', \'text\': \'{T}：{G}を加える。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'「僧帽地帯の野生の茂みは、始めて建物が作られる様子を見ていた命の聖域になっている。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448718&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0d770a3b-04cb-4120-b1a0-db99ee9c2f90\', \'multiverseId\': 448718}, \'multiverseid\': 448718}, {\'name\': \'카울의 드루이드\', \'text\': \'{T}: {G}를 추가한다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'"카울의 얽히고설킨 야생 환경은 첫 건물들이 세워지는 것을 지켜본 생명의 보금자리였다."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448999&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dab71012-8d59-4eb6-a82f-6f84214ee68a\', \'multiverseId\': 448999}, \'multiverseid\': 448999}, {\'name\': \'Druida do Capote\', \'text\': \'{T}: Adicione {G}.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'"O matagal selvagem do Capote é um santuário para a vida que viu as primeiras construções se erguerem."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449280&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'164b4d8c-2723-4667-8a51-ce83102b7027\', \'multiverseId\': 449280}, \'multiverseid\': 449280}, {\'name\': \'Друид Покрова\', \'text\': \'{T}: добавьте {G}.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'«Буйные заросли Покрова стали убежищем для той жизни, что наблюдала за возведением первых зданий».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449561&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9cfa6c98-6c83-44ad-a092-ac1d7b7de8ea\', \'multiverseId\': 449561}, \'multiverseid\': 449561}, {\'name\': \'外沿区德鲁伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'「外沿区的野林地为那些见证过首批建筑物兴起的生物提供庇护所。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449842&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'607ce5f1-48cb-4de5-8e30-7565bcaea9f7\', \'multiverseId\': 449842}, \'multiverseid\': 449842}, {\'name\': \'外沿區德魯伊\', \'text\': \'{T}：加{G}。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'「外沿區的野林地為那些見證過首批建築物興起的生物提供庇護所。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450123&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'09c14518-a76a-4c4c-a1a8-d3f71fd55cac\', \'multiverseId\': 450123}, \'multiverseid\': 450123}]', "[{'name': 'Dschinn der Wünsche', 'text': 'Fliegend\\nDer Dschinn der Wünsche kommt mit drei Wunschmarken ins Spiel.\\n{2}{U}{U}, entferne eine Wunschmarke vom Dschinn der Wünsche: Zeige die oberste Karte deiner Bibliothek offen vor. Du kannst die Karte spielen, ohne ihre Manakosten zu bezahlen. Falls du dies nicht tust, schicke sie ins Exil.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Dschinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447469&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd1409816-7b2c-49b8-a2f8-5d47aaf50bf9', 'multiverseId': 447469}, 'multiverseid': 447469}, {'name': 'Djinn de los deseos', 'text': 'Vuela.\\nEl Djinn de los deseos entra al campo de batalla con tres contadores de deseo sobre él.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remover un contador de deseo del Djinn de los deseos: Muestra la primera carta de tu biblioteca. Puedes jugar esa carta sin pagar su coste de maná. Si no lo haces, exíliala.', 'type': 'Criatura — Djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447750&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d66d945-924a-446e-be46-fbec08f9c37e', 'multiverseId': 447750}, 'multiverseid': 447750}, {'name': 'Djinn aux souhaits', 'text': 'Vol\\nLe Djinn aux souhaits arrive sur le champ de bataille avec, sur lui, trois marqueurs « souhait ».\\n{2}{U}{U}, retirez un marqueur « souhait » du Djinn aux souhaits : Révélez la carte du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez jouer cette carte sans payer son coût de mana. Si vous ne le faites pas, exilez-la.', 'type': 'Créature : djinn', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448031&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '172dff6c-7ea8-4507-b7b6-9711f70d49d8', 'multiverseId': 448031}, 'multiverseid': 448031}, {'name': 'Genio dei Desideri', 'text': 'Volare\\nIl Genio dei Desideri entra nel campo di battaglia con tre segnalini desiderio.\\n{2}{U}{U}, Rimuovi un segnalino desiderio dal Genio dei Desideri: Rivela la prima carta del tuo grimorio. Puoi giocare quella carta senza pagare il suo costo di mana. Se non lo fai, esiliala.', 'type': 'Creatura — Genio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448312&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '6dae79b4-6687-4eed-9e58-a256234919cd', 'multiverseId': 448312}, 'multiverseid': 448312}, {'name': '願いのジン', 'text': '飛行\\n願いのジンは、願いカウンターが３個置かれた状態で戦場に出る。\\n{2}{U}{U}, 願いのジンの上から願いカウンターを１個取り除く：あなたのライブラリーの一番上のカードを公開する。あなたはそのカードをそれのマナ・コストを支払うことなくプレイしてもよい。そうしないなら、それを追放する。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — ジン', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448593&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cce33304-5c76-4749-bc72-602333f855f7', 'multiverseId': 448593}, 'multiverseid': 448593}, {'name': '소원의 지니', 'text': '비행\\n소원의 지니는 소원 카운터 세 개를 가진 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{2}{U}{U}, 소원의 지니에서 소원 카운터 한 개를 제거한다: 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드를 공개한다. 당신은 마나 비용을 지불하지 않고 그 카드를 플레이할 수 있다. 그러지 않는다면, 그 카드를 추방한다.', 'type': '생물 — 지니', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448874&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3a7f8bf1-a349-423e-ad90-b181831dbc27', 'multiverseId': 448874}, 'multiverseid': 448874}, {'name': 'Gênio dos Desejos', 'text': 'Voar\\nGênio dos Desejos entra no campo de batalha com três marcadores de desejo.\\n{2}{U}{U}, remova um marcador de desejo de Gênio dos Desejos: Revele o card do topo de seu grimório. Você pode jogar aquele card sem pagar seu custo de mana. Se não fizer isso, exile-o.', 'type': 'Criatura — Gênio', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449155&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a79c41ff-c861-4324-bee9-a4227828bd81', 'multiverseId': 449155}, 'multiverseid': 449155}, {'name': 'Джинн Желаний', 'text': 'Полет\\nДжинн Желаний выходит на поле битвы с тремя жетонами желания на нем.\\n{2}{U}{U}, удалите один жетон желания с Джинна Желаний: покажите верхнюю карту вашей библиотеки. Вы можете разыграть ту карту без уплаты ее мана-стоимости. Если вы этого не делаете, изгоните ее.', 'type': 'Существо — Джинн', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449436&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a261c7ea-6772-4a03-8839-d449858e3681', 'multiverseId': 449436}, 'multiverseid': 449436}, {'name': '祈愿巨灵', 'text': '飞行\\n祈愿巨灵进战场时上面有三个祈愿指示物。\\n{2}{U}{U}，从祈愿巨灵上移去一个祈愿指示物：展示你的牌库顶牌。你可以使用该牌，且不需支付其法术力费用。如果你未如此作，则将它放逐。', 'type': '生物 ～巨灵', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449717&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a423b111-deb1-46d2-ac84-79583123099a', 'multiverseId': 449717}, 'multiverseid': 449717}, {'name': '祈願巨靈', 'text': '飛行\\n祈願巨靈進戰場時上面有三個祈願指示物。\\n{2}{U}{U}，從祈願巨靈上移去一個祈願指示物：展示你的牌庫頂牌。你可以使用該牌，且不需支付其魔法力費用。如果你未如此作，則將它放逐。', 'type': '生物 ～巨靈', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449998&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7279f89c-6eec-4a0b-8615-ab38f6779fce', 'multiverseId': 449998}, 'multiverseid': 449998}]", '[{\'name\': \'Durchbrechen\', \'text\': \'Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, verursachen Trampelschaden bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Eine Kreatur, die Trampelschaden verursacht, kann beim Angreifen überschüssigen Kampfschaden dem verteidigenden Spieler oder Planeswalker zufügen.)\\nZiehe eine Karte.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447550&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4005d13b-7c09-4ca1-8e50-132452d9a727\', \'multiverseId\': 447550}, \'multiverseid\': 447550}, {\'name\': \'Salir por la fuerza\', \'text\': \'Las criaturas que controlas ganan la habilidad de arrollar hasta el final del turno. (Una criatura con la habilidad de arrollar puede hacer el daño de combate sobrante al jugador o planeswalker al que ataca.)\\nRoba una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447831&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'41cf615d-40d1-4c52-8816-7167d179c441\', \'multiverseId\': 447831}, \'multiverseid\': 447831}, {\'name\': \'Passer à travers\', \'text\': "Les créatures que vous contrôlez acquièrent le piétinement jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Une créature avec le piétinement peut infliger son surplus de blessures de combat au joueur ou au planeswalker qu\'elle attaque.)\\nPiochez une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448112&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8737759-d30b-44b3-bd61-3337b269253f\', \'multiverseId\': 448112}, \'multiverseid\': 448112}, {\'name\': \'Sfondare\', \'text\': \'Le creature che controlli hanno travolgere fino alla fine del turno. (Una creatura con travolgere può infliggere il danno da combattimento in eccesso al giocatore o al planeswalker che sta attaccando.)\\nPesca una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448393&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a04f72a5-6b48-436c-8e08-5ae95aa68849\', \'multiverseId\': 448393}, \'multiverseid\': 448393}, {\'name\': \'突破\', \'text\': \'ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーはトランプルを得る。（トランプルを持つクリーチャーは余剰の戦闘ダメージをそれが攻撃しているプレイヤーかプレインズウォーカーに与えることができる。）\\nカードを１枚引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448674&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e9071718-4986-4c77-aa87-ab7d9b18ded4\', \'multiverseId\': 448674}, \'multiverseid\': 448674}, {\'name\': \'돌파\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 돌진을 얻는다. (돌진을 가진 생물은 여분의 전투피해를 공격 중인 플레이어 또는 플레인즈워커에게 입힐 수 있다.)\\n카드 한 장을 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448955&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7bbcd282-a82a-4912-a68b-b83601e28d91\', \'multiverseId\': 448955}, \'multiverseid\': 448955}, {\'name\': \'Irromper\', \'text\': \'As criaturas que você controla ganham atropelar até o final do turno. (Uma criatura com atropelar pode causar seu dano de combate excedente ao jogador ou planeswalker que ela estiver atacando.)\\nCompre um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449236&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6d3ace16-9b99-4322-bf4c-3d2997860734\', \'multiverseId\': 449236}, \'multiverseid\': 449236}, {\'name\': \'Пробиться\', \'text\': \'Существа под вашим контролем получают Пробивной удар до конца хода. (Существо с Пробивным ударом может нанести избыточные боевые повреждения игроку или planeswalker-у, которого атакует.)\\nВозьмите карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449517&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'82d90fad-6203-470a-aaad-a8b21cd8e87f\', \'multiverseId\': 449517}, \'multiverseid\': 449517}, {\'name\': \'全力突破\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物获得践踏异能直到回合结束。（具践踏异能的生物造成之过量战斗伤害能对所攻击的牌手或鹏洛客造成之。）\\n抓一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449798&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6461da4e-acf1-4b17-b787-4a6898e51895\', \'multiverseId\': 449798}, \'multiverseid\': 449798}, {\'name\': \'全力突破\', \'text\': \'由你操控的生物獲得踐踏異能直到回合結束。（具踐踏異能的生物造成之過量戰鬥傷害能對所攻擊的玩家或鵬洛客造成之。）\\n抽一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450079&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0e45cca-1ba1-4fe8-9689-b133a784db89\', \'multiverseId\': 450079}, \'multiverseid\': 450079}]', '[{\'name\': \'Durchkämmen\', \'text\': \'Ziehe drei Karten und wirf dann eine Karte ab.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'Weile am längsten bei den Gedanken, die am hellsten leuchten.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447489&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da952a7b-8d86-4391-8a0a-1fec30e241ee\', \'multiverseId\': 447489}, \'multiverseid\': 447489}, {\'name\': \'Inspeccionar\', \'text\': \'Roba tres cartas, luego descarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'Medita más en los pensamientos que brillan más.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447770&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'25b7b51b-e116-43d0-800a-30445c05f981\', \'multiverseId\': 447770}, \'multiverseid\': 447770}, {\'name\': \'Tamis\', \'text\': "Piochez trois cartes, puis défaussez-vous d\'une carte.", \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': \'Attarde-toi sur les pensées qui sont les plus brillantes.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448051&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cf53a752-0a71-4c68-8c6a-36b2034ee202\', \'multiverseId\': 448051}, \'multiverseid\': 448051}, {\'name\': \'Setacciare\', \'text\': \'Pesca tre carte, poi scarta una carta.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'Indugia più a lungo sui pensieri che brillano maggiormente.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448332&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d508c0b9-5e2a-425d-9d89-8db87d9e2191\', \'multiverseId\': 448332}, \'multiverseid\': 448332}, {\'name\': \'ふるい分け\', \'text\': \'カードを３枚引き、その後カード１枚を捨てる。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'もっとも長く頭に残っていた考えがもっとも輝く。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448613&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'361c6f53-6b4c-4dd3-9725-8b34494a954e\', \'multiverseId\': 448613}, \'multiverseid\': 448613}, {\'name\': \'감정\', \'text\': \'카드 세 장을 뽑은 후, 카드 한 장을 버린다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'가장 빛나는 생각들을 가장 오래 숙고하라.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448894&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cd0ad9b2-e9f0-47db-8223-e1d2c6bea16e\', \'multiverseId\': 448894}, \'multiverseid\': 448894}, {\'name\': \'Peneirar\', \'text\': \'Compre três cards e depois descarte um card.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'Concentre-se por mais tempo nos pensamentos que brilham mais.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449175&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'487f3680-f139-4980-bcaa-df6387040612\', \'multiverseId\': 449175}, \'multiverseid\': 449175}, {\'name\': \'Исследование\', \'text\': \'Возьмите три карты, затем сбросьте карту.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'Подольше задерживайтесь над самыми яркими мыслями.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449456&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ae33c9b5-9177-400f-aeb8-d3d59ce02e79\', \'multiverseId\': 449456}, \'multiverseid\': 449456}, {\'name\': \'详查\', \'text\': \'抓三张牌，然后弃一张牌。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'愈有吸引力的念头愈需三思。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449737&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1647a93c-7cef-4d8c-8aec-b4ea8ae8f5cf\', \'multiverseId\': 449737}, \'multiverseid\': 449737}, {\'name\': \'詳查\', \'text\': \'抽三張牌，然後棄一張牌。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'愈有吸引力的念頭愈需三思。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450018&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c7cbe1bf-1acd-4e6f-8170-c06ddff3e5d6\', \'multiverseId\': 450018}, \'multiverseid\': 450018}]', '[{\'name\': \'Dämon des Unglücks\', \'text\': \'Opfere eine Kreatur als zusätzliche Kosten, um diesen Zauberspruch zu wirken.\\nFliegend, verursacht Trampelschaden\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Dämon\', \'flavor\': \'Ein Abgrund tat sich auf, schwefliger Rauch stieg auf und eine riesige Gestalt zischte „Ich akzeptiere dieses Angebot."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447508&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ab4d0bd3-ad7c-469a-a3b4-53da21409571\', \'multiverseId\': 447508}, \'multiverseid\': 447508}, {\'name\': \'Demonio de las catástrofes\', \'text\': \'Como coste adicional para lanzar este hechizo, sacrifica una criatura.\\nVuela, arrolla.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demonio\', \'flavor\': \'Un pozo se abrió, de él brotó una columna de humo untuoso y una forma gigantesca siseó: "Acepto la ofrenda".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447789&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f3efefe-455b-4ba5-9dad-4dcd2cfc5a10\', \'multiverseId\': 447789}, \'multiverseid\': 447789}, {\'name\': \'Démon des catastrophes\', \'text\': \'En tant que coût supplémentaire pour lancer ce sort, sacrifiez une créature.\\nVol, piétinement\', \'type\': \'Créature : démon\', \'flavor\': "Du gouffre béant qui s\'ouvrit s\'éleva une colonne de fumée, et une silhouette imposante siffla : « J\'accepte cette offrande. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448070&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'85a638fc-f1ba-44bb-9f74-f8fe4ba23d66\', \'multiverseId\': 448070}, \'multiverseid\': 448070}, {\'name\': \'Demone delle Catastrofi\', \'text\': \'Come costo addizionale per lanciare questa magia, sacrifica una creatura.\\nVolare, travolgere\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Demone\', \'flavor\': \'Un pozzo si spalancò come fauci, una colonna di fumo denso si innalzò e un\\\'apparizione imponente sibilò: "Accetto il sacrificio."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448351&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'56d63aad-5288-4da9-8438-b0b390d09508\', \'multiverseId\': 448351}, \'multiverseid\': 448351}, {\'name\': \'惨劇の悪魔\', \'text\': \'この呪文を唱えるための追加コストとして、クリーチャー１体を生け贄に捧げる。\\n飛行、トランプル\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — デーモン\', \'flavor\': \'穴が大きく開き、油煙が立ち上り、そびえ立つ影が囁いた。「この生け贄を受け取ろう。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448632&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'562852ee-3dfd-4da5-a788-547ed72d6816\', \'multiverseId\': 448632}, \'multiverseid\': 448632}, {\'name\': \'재앙의 악마\', \'text\': \'이 주문을 발동하기 위한 추가비용으로, 생물 한 개를 희생한다.\\n비행, 돌진\', \'type\': \'생물 — 악마\', \'flavor\': \'구덩이가 입을 벌렸고, 기름 냄새 나는 연기가 피어올랐으며, 거대한 형상이 쉭쉭댔다, "제물을 받았노라."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448913&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a7a911bf-5a97-4fa7-a8f1-92683ae5cf70\', \'multiverseId\': 448913}, \'multiverseid\': 448913}, {\'name\': \'Demônio das Catástrofes\', \'text\': \'Como custo adicional para conjurar esta mágica, sacrifique uma criatura.\\nVoar, atropelar\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Demônio\', \'flavor\': \'Abriu-se uma voragem exalando uma coluna de fumaça oleosa. Uma figura enorme sibilou: "Aceito esta oferenda."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449194&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4bb76a8c-94bd-4194-958c-b6933fbe13be\', \'multiverseId\': 449194}, \'multiverseid\': 449194}, {\'name\': \'Демон Катастроф\', \'text\': \'В качестве дополнительной стоимости разыгрывания этого заклинания пожертвуйте существо.\\nПолет, Пробивной удар\', \'type\': \'Существо — Демон\', \'flavor\': \'Яма широко раскрылась, вверх поднялся столб маслянистого дыма и гигантская фигура прошипела: «Я принимаю это подношение».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449475&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'252a96b7-aeb2-4a7d-a1f3-65d736d76fac\', \'multiverseId\': 449475}, \'multiverseid\': 449475}, {\'name\': \'灾变恶魔\', \'text\': \'牺牲一个生物，以作为施放此咒语的额外费用。\\n飞行，践踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～恶魔\', \'flavor\': \'暗渊打开，污烟升起，只闻一道巨影低语：「我收下这份祭礼。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449756&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b255e16f-d68a-4354-ad2d-30daf460761d\', \'multiverseId\': 449756}, \'multiverseid\': 449756}, {\'name\': \'災變惡魔\', \'text\': \'犧牲一個生物，以作為施放此咒語的額外費用。\\n飛行，踐踏\', \'type\': \'生物 ～惡魔\', \'flavor\': \'暗淵打開，污煙升起，只聞一道巨影低語：「我收下這份祭禮。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450037&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'239711e2-2036-4ea4-bd19-8c860b55755f\', \'multiverseId\': 450037}, \'multiverseid\': 450037}]', '[{\'name\': \'Düstergrab-Ghul\', \'text\': \'Der Düstergrab-Ghul kommt getappt ins Spiel.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'„Zumindest hat dieser hier noch Arme und Beine. Nun, die meisten seiner Beine."\\n—Enslow, Ghulrufer aus Nefalen\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447509&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7f9e055f-c573-48d2-91aa-3e590ef5a299\', \'multiverseId\': 447509}, \'multiverseid\': 447509}, {\'name\': \'Necrófaga de la tumbanefasta\', \'text\': \'La Necrófaga de la tumbanefasta entra al campo de batalla girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Al menos este todavía tiene brazos y piernas. Bueno, la mayoría de sus piernas".\\n—Enslow, llamamuertos de Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447790&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'067d9e00-8aac-41cc-ad71-72b226c87669\', \'multiverseId\': 447790}, \'multiverseid\': 447790}, {\'name\': \'Goule du diregraf\', \'text\': \'La Goule du diregraf arrive sur le champ de bataille engagée.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie\', \'flavor\': \'« Au moins, celle-là a encore tous ses membres. Enfin, presque. »\\n—Enslow, meneur de goule de Néphalie\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448071&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'00821ccd-a632-4b88-b0e0-d5cf420f271f\', \'multiverseId\': 448071}, \'multiverseid\': 448071}, {\'name\': \'Ghoul del Cimitero di Guerra\', \'text\': \'La Ghoul del Cimitero di Guerra entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Almeno questa ha ancora braccia e gambe. Beh, buona parte delle gambe."\\n—Enslow, evocaghoul di Nephalia\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448352&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'43938160-277b-4933-bebc-913d057ad4e7\', \'multiverseId\': 448352}, \'multiverseid\': 448352}, {\'name\': \'戦墓のグール\', \'text\': \'戦墓のグールはタップ状態で戦場に出る。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ\', \'flavor\': \'「少なくとも、こいつはまだ腕も脚もある。まあ、脚の大部分だがな。」\\n――ネファリアのグール呼び、エンスロウ\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448633&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'552e2849-7d2b-4b26-9f5e-39b56cf7083f\', \'multiverseId\': 448633}, \'multiverseid\': 448633}, {\'name\': \'전장묘지 악귀\', \'text\': \'전장묘지 악귀는 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비\', \'flavor\': \'"적어도 이건 팔다리라도 갖추고 있다고. 에, 적어도 다리의 대부분은 말이지."\\n—네팔리아의 악귀소환술사, 엔슬로우\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448914&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6f7ba8d-06cd-49df-89c6-01116d045186\', \'multiverseId\': 448914}, \'multiverseid\': 448914}, {\'name\': \'Carniçal do Cemitério do Terror\', \'text\': \'Carniçal do Cemitério do Terror entra no campo de batalha virado.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi\', \'flavor\': \'"Pelo menos esse aqui ainda tem braços e pernas. Quer dizer, uma boa parte das pernas."\\n— Enslow, invocador de carniçais de Nefália\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449195&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'649973b2-9152-4201-8bff-f3d8ea8e573b\', \'multiverseId\': 449195}, \'multiverseid\': 449195}, {\'name\': \'Упырь с Места Резни\', \'text\': \'Упырь с Места Резни выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби\', \'flavor\': \'«У этой хотя бы еще есть руки и ноги. По крайней мере, большая их часть».\\n— Энслоу, призыватель упырей из Нефалии\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449476&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1bf0b2c-cc86-488b-be99-71b3ee9739be\', \'multiverseId\': 449476}, \'multiverseid\': 449476}, {\'name\': \'战墓食尸鬼\', \'text\': \'战墓食尸鬼须横置进战场。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑\', \'flavor\': \'「至少这个还有手脚。嗯，大部份的脚。」\\n～涅非利亚尸鬼牧者恩斯洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449757&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'47fabbdc-18c5-4c0d-a953-a5d3b540a119\', \'multiverseId\': 449757}, \'multiverseid\': 449757}, {\'name\': \'戰墓食屍鬼\', \'text\': \'戰墓食屍鬼須橫置進戰場。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍\', \'flavor\': \'「至少這個還有手腳。嗯，大部份的腳。」\\n～涅非利亞屍鬼牧者恩斯洛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450038&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'52507548-610a-4317-a8e9-62d176f6ffbe\', \'multiverseId\': 450038}, \'multiverseid\': 450038}]', "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447679&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4188ad72-38f8-4296-8a3c-28afc7ea7cc2', 'multiverseId': 447679}, 'multiverseid': 447679}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447960&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0caec00-d5bc-4078-984c-d6e11678b79d', 'multiverseId': 447960}, 'multiverseid': 447960}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448241&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ae16ae20-dd80-48f8-bad9-dd3557a1cb72', 'multiverseId': 448241}, 'multiverseid': 448241}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448522&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b0328366-6e35-4465-9d7a-b8bd916687c6', 'multiverseId': 448522}, 'multiverseid': 448522}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448803&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0ff98dd-ae59-437f-96c0-39880aba1c3b', 'multiverseId': 448803}, 'multiverseid': 448803}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449084&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cbb6c7aa-b5f3-461a-aa00-7c1c25df4ab8', 'multiverseId': 449084}, 'multiverseid': 449084}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449365&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f09ecb95-603f-439f-8764-ad5ec687743e', 'multiverseId': 449365}, 'multiverseid': 449365}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449646&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9e85abac-f0d0-4a72-8d7a-c64364ab8d54', 'multiverseId': 449646}, 'multiverseid': 449646}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449927&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9cdebaa5-63d3-454a-abef-24911fc71c31', 'multiverseId': 449927}, 'multiverseid': 449927}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450208&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '37fac53c-6b89-4258-96cd-6096a3776440', 'multiverseId': 450208}, 'multiverseid': 450208}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447680&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '89952b2e-8c15-447f-a703-8869117e9b11', 'multiverseId': 447680}, 'multiverseid': 447680}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447961&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'dc93bcf2-1b4b-4825-9e0b-5329a712dde5', 'multiverseId': 447961}, 'multiverseid': 447961}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448242&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '278b5744-31b9-4ec3-bb79-c0109f56223b', 'multiverseId': 448242}, 'multiverseid': 448242}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448523&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ed80a3ff-2586-4241-a2c0-0c40a7a9374b', 'multiverseId': 448523}, 'multiverseid': 448523}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448804&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd4d61c4a-e5c4-4dc4-a737-29270d787a70', 'multiverseId': 448804}, 'multiverseid': 448804}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449085&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '72fb5c12-38c9-431f-b91e-31c6bd8b0a38', 'multiverseId': 449085}, 'multiverseid': 449085}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449366&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bce45dd5-0c25-4507-9ccc-95b15bd3feee', 'multiverseId': 449366}, 'multiverseid': 449366}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449647&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '483455c8-d78a-4ca3-a965-124327ea9aaf', 'multiverseId': 449647}, 'multiverseid': 449647}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449928&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '18205469-b077-4640-90a2-b1a439398d76', 'multiverseId': 449928}, 'multiverseid': 449928}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450209&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'b4592779-8f7e-40f2-b0f6-a584712e908c', 'multiverseId': 450209}, 'multiverseid': 450209}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447681&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'd6e508e1-f93c-4c57-8576-a92383c1d56a', 'multiverseId': 447681}, 'multiverseid': 447681}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447962&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bb263f6-2aca-4431-9535-35ef0f71c842', 'multiverseId': 447962}, 'multiverseid': 447962}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448243&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4718c41e-45f3-4e09-a53c-4e4b2ed6f0b4', 'multiverseId': 448243}, 'multiverseid': 448243}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448524&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '31199760-b337-47e7-b946-077a0266f569', 'multiverseId': 448524}, 'multiverseid': 448524}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448805&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0fc5327a-16ec-4b89-a8d0-94a91a1c05e7', 'multiverseId': 448805}, 'multiverseid': 448805}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449086&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '29a2cb0d-d750-4391-8ff7-ce5d4c4e8a34', 'multiverseId': 449086}, 'multiverseid': 449086}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449367&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a24997f3-212b-4efe-9525-1a5756886caf', 'multiverseId': 449367}, 'multiverseid': 449367}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449648&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '727a9983-a696-4e69-b3cb-407a881da598', 'multiverseId': 449648}, 'multiverseid': 449648}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449929&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '348c2f4d-cdcf-46d3-a159-5c7a7eaca0b8', 'multiverseId': 449929}, 'multiverseid': 449929}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450210&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7efba93d-4781-4162-90ad-82f5a068b451', 'multiverseId': 450210}, 'multiverseid': 450210}]", "[{'name': 'Ebene', 'type': 'Standardland — Ebene', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447682&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '7f45bb87-cbac-40a2-9d94-905239459a6b', 'multiverseId': 447682}, 'multiverseid': 447682}, {'name': 'Llanura', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Llanura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447963&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'de13cd54-f745-470d-8766-1abf16d50bb9', 'multiverseId': 447963}, 'multiverseid': 447963}, {'name': 'Plaine', 'type': 'Terrain de base : plaine', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448244&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1718e256-378d-45da-98fe-9b36eb0bbd28', 'multiverseId': 448244}, 'multiverseid': 448244}, {'name': 'Pianura', 'type': 'Terra Base — Pianura', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448525&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '3d5b7912-562c-486f-82ee-797210a44d04', 'multiverseId': 448525}, 'multiverseid': 448525}, {'name': '平地', 'type': '基本土地 — 平地', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448806&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ea201efd-7200-4fbc-8e0d-70799dd0094e', 'multiverseId': 448806}, 'multiverseid': 448806}, {'name': '들', 'type': '기본 대지 — 들', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449087&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41a28129-ea6c-4258-96a9-2bd9d2cbb6f4', 'multiverseId': 449087}, 'multiverseid': 449087}, {'name': 'Planície', 'type': 'Terreno Básico — Planície', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449368&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c619ea84-a94b-4a6e-977d-e38e8a1c403c', 'multiverseId': 449368}, 'multiverseid': 449368}, {'name': 'Равнина', 'type': 'Базовая Земля — Равнина', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449649&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5ea24067-94d8-4047-be88-704fd28a3c01', 'multiverseId': 449649}, 'multiverseid': 449649}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449930&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '744fd6b7-4ad2-42b7-9f7b-639da160e747', 'multiverseId': 449930}, 'multiverseid': 449930}, {'name': '平原', 'type': '基本地 ～平原', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450211&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fdd9f933-a51c-48fe-8bee-58dcbf4ec18e', 'multiverseId': 450211}, 'multiverseid': 450211}]", '[{\'name\': \'Eichengestalt\', \'text\': \'Verzaubert eine Kreatur\\nDie verzauberte Kreatur erhält +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Verzauberung — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'„Wenn eine Bestie sich in einer mächtigen Eiche versteckt, wofür benötigt man dann einen Bogen? Wenn sich die Eiche selbst um das knurrende Untier legt, wofür braucht man dann eine Axt?"\\n—Dionus, elfischer Erzdruide\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447608&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ea617ff9-2ad5-4b1f-8565-e1b38441099e\', \'multiverseId\': 447608}, \'multiverseid\': 447608}, {\'name\': \'Forma de roble\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura.\\nLa criatura encantada obtiene +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamiento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando la bestia se cubre con el poderoso roble, ¿de qué sirve un arco? Cuando el roble rodea a la bestia, ¿de qué sirve un hacha?".\\n —Dionus, archidruida élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447889&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0c48a3d6-b6e4-40af-b8a6-618b44eb3049\', \'multiverseId\': 447889}, \'multiverseid\': 447889}, {\'name\': \'Forme du chêne\', \'text\': \'Enchanter : créature\\nLa créature enchantée gagne +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Enchantement : aura\', \'flavor\': "« Quand la bête s\'enveloppe du puissant chêne, à quoi sert un arc ? Quand le chêne enveloppe la bête mugissante, à quoi sert une hachette ? »\\n—Dionus, archidruide elfe", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448170&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be0d5c7b-6b68-47e0-bae0-7b373b98b6cf\', \'multiverseId\': 448170}, \'multiverseid\': 448170}, {\'name\': \'Forma di Quercia\', \'text\': \'Incanta creatura\\nLa creatura incantata prende +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Incantesimo — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando la bestia si nasconde nella quercia possente, cosa te ne fai di un arco? Quando la quercia si avvolge attorno alla bestia ringhiosa, cosa te ne fai di un\\\'accetta?"\\n—Dionus, arcidruido elfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448451&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'bfd6fef0-725d-4347-850e-eb239a406c54\', \'multiverseId\': 448451}, \'multiverseid\': 448451}, {\'name\': \'樫変化\', \'text\': \'エンチャント（クリーチャー）\\nエンチャントされているクリーチャーは＋３/＋３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'エンチャント — オーラ\', \'flavor\': \'「獣が強き樫の中に身を潜めたとき、弓が何の役に立つのか？樫が自らの中に怒れる獣を囲ったとき、斧が何の役に立つのか？」\\n――エルフの大ドルイド、ダイオヌス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448732&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'823e3957-24d4-4d98-8215-b1bfe8ae3a49\', \'multiverseId\': 448732}, \'multiverseid\': 448732}, {\'name\': \'신록의 형상\', \'text\': \'생물에게 부여\\n부여된 생물은 +3/+3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'부여마법 — 마법진\', \'flavor\': \'"야수가 떡갈나무에 몸을 숨긴다면 활이 무슨 소용인가? 떡갈나무가 으르렁대는 야수를 감싸 버린다면 도끼가 무슨 소용인가?"\\n—엘프 대드루이드 디오너스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449013&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'668b1cc9-c5f2-49f2-94b0-08c3df680551\', \'multiverseId\': 449013}, \'multiverseid\': 449013}, {\'name\': \'Carvalhoforme\', \'text\': \'Encantar criatura\\nA criatura encantada recebe +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Encantamento — Aura\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando a besta se veste com o grande carvalho, de que serve uma flecha? Quando o carvalho recobre uma besta raivosa, de que serve um machado?"\\n— Dionus, arquidruida élfico\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449294&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'91f986b1-cbab-47b4-9879-dff580536f53\', \'multiverseId\': 449294}, \'multiverseid\': 449294}, {\'name\': \'Дубовый Облик\', \'text\': \'Зачаровать существо\\nЗачарованное существо получает +3/+3.\', \'type\': \'Чары — Аура\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда зверь укрывается могучим дубом, разве его сразит лук? Когда дуб оборачивается вокруг рычащего зверя, разве его взять топором?»\\n— Дионус, эльфийский архидруид\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449575&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'986d2407-54d2-4591-833e-585b027bb5dc\', \'multiverseId\': 449575}, \'multiverseid\': 449575}, {\'name\': \'橡树形体\', \'text\': \'结附于生物\\n所结附的生物得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'结界 ～灵气\', \'flavor\': \'「如果野兽藏身在雄伟橡树中，弓岂能奈他何？如果橡树有咆哮的野兽护身，斧头岂能奈他何？」\\n～妖精高位德鲁伊戴欧诺\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449856&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6b489be5-6534-48b6-94c2-8440547d5369\', \'multiverseId\': 449856}, \'multiverseid\': 449856}, {\'name\': \'橡樹形體\', \'text\': \'結附於生物\\n所結附的生物得+3/+3。\', \'type\': \'結界 ～靈氣\', \'flavor\': \'「如果野獸藏身在雄偉橡樹中，弓豈能奈他何？如果橡樹有咆哮的野獸護身，斧頭豈能奈他何？」\\n～妖精高位德魯伊戴歐諾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450137&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b23b6098-0ea3-400f-9067-eb0c2300036b\', \'multiverseId\': 450137}, \'multiverseid\': 450137}]', '[{\'name\': \'Eins mit der Maschine\', \'text\': \'Ziehe eine Anzahl Karten in Höhe der höchsten umgewandelten Manakosten unter den Artefakten, die du kontrollierst.\', \'type\': \'Hexerei\', \'flavor\': \'„Als ich die Weltenbrücke in meinen Körper integrierte, spürte ich, wie mein Planeswalker-Funke über mich hinaus entflammte. Das Multiversum war mein Spielzeug. Es fühlte sich … unglaublich an."\\n—Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447483&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d10439df-7765-4b88-aed1-6424bc2c730a\', \'multiverseId\': 447483}, \'multiverseid\': 447483}, {\'name\': \'Ser uno con la máquina\', \'text\': \'Roba una cantidad de cartas igual al mayor coste de maná convertido de entre los artefactos que controlas.\', \'type\': \'Conjuro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cuando me fusioné con el puente entre planos, sentí que mi chispa de Planeswalker brillaba más allá de mi cuerpo. El Multiverso era mi juguete. La sensación fue... increíble".\\n—Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7f93b59-e4d7-4f31-9aa0-1a4decd26f65\', \'multiverseId\': 447764}, \'multiverseid\': 447764}, {\'name\': \'Fusion avec la machine\', \'text\': \'Piochez un nombre de cartes égal au coût converti de mana le plus élevé parmi les artefacts que vous contrôlez.\', \'type\': \'Rituel\', \'flavor\': "« Lorsque je me suis greffé le Pont planaire, j\'ai senti mon étincelle de Planeswalker flamboyer au-delà de mon corps. Le Multivers était mon jouet. Je me sentais... incroyablement bien. »\\n—Tezzeret", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448045&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3364f50a-7062-4467-98f5-53922a9faaf1\', \'multiverseId\': 448045}, \'multiverseid\': 448045}, {\'name\': \'Comunione con la Macchina\', \'text\': \'Pesca un numero di carte pari al più alto costo di mana convertito tra gli artefatti che controlli.\', \'type\': \'Stregoneria\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando il Ponte Planare è diventato parte di me, la mia scintilla di Planeswalker è divampata al di fuori del mio corpo. L\\\'intero Multiverso era il mio giocattolo. È stato... incredibile."\\n—Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448326&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ad8fcc2a-84c0-4c2e-8398-de16878ad170\', \'multiverseId\': 448326}, \'multiverseid\': 448326}, {\'name\': \'機械と共に\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしているアーティファクトの点数で見たマナ・コストのうちで最も大きいものに等しい枚数のカードを引く。\', \'type\': \'ソーサリー\', \'flavor\': \'「次元橋を私の中へと移植したとき、プレインズウォーカーの灯が私の身体を越えて燃え上がるのを感じたのだ。多元宇宙は私の遊び道具だった。あれは……最高の気分だった。」\\n――テゼレット\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448607&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2059d983-f3c4-4437-8763-9e6e6889c24b\', \'multiverseId\': 448607}, \'multiverseid\': 448607}, {\'name\': \'기계가 함께하는 존재\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 마법물체의 전환마나비용 중 가장 높은 전환마나비용만큼 카드를 뽑는다.\', \'type\': \'집중마법\', \'flavor\': \'"내가 차원의 다리를 내게 이식하자 내 플레인즈워커 불꽃이 내 몸을 뛰어넘어 솟구치는 것이 느껴졌지. 다우주가 내 놀이감이었어. 그건 . . . 엄청났지."\\n—테제렛\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448888&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'03f358dd-af26-4f5b-b684-17412c5028d7\', \'multiverseId\': 448888}, \'multiverseid\': 448888}, {\'name\': \'Uno com a Máquina\', \'text\': \'Compre uma quantidade de cards igual ao maior custo de mana convertido dentre os dos artefatos que você controla.\', \'type\': \'Feitiço\', \'flavor\': \'"Quando implantei em mim mesmo a Ponte Planar, senti minha centelha de planeswalker arder para além do meu corpo. O Multiverso era o meu brinquedo. A sensação foi... inacreditável."\\n— Tezzeret\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449169&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'255a3775-0d69-473a-a325-a64932dca8b9\', \'multiverseId\': 449169}, \'multiverseid\': 449169}, {\'name\': \'Единство с Машиной\', \'text\': \'Возьмите количество карт, равное наибольшему значению конвертированной мана-стоимости среди артефактов под вашим контролем.\', \'type\': \'Волшебство\', \'flavor\': \'«Когда я встроил в себя Межмировой Мост, я почувствовал, как искра Planeswalker-а разгорается все ярче и ярче. Вся Мультивселенная стала моей игрушкой. Это было... невероятно».\\n— Теззерет\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449450&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f1b38977-c991-44d8-8d21-797f59bb3b64\', \'multiverseId\': 449450}, \'multiverseid\': 449450}, {\'name\': \'机械融合\', \'text\': \'抓若干牌，其数量等同于由你操控的神器间最高之总法术力费用。\', \'type\': \'法术\', \'flavor\': \'「在我把时空渡桥拼接到身上时，我感到自己的鹏洛客火花闪耀全身。整个多重宇宙都是我的玩物。这感觉. . .无与伦比。」\\n～泰兹瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449731&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3f58ef2e-8fe1-4655-a21a-268619431a0f\', \'multiverseId\': 449731}, \'multiverseid\': 449731}, {\'name\': \'機械融合\', \'text\': \'抽若干牌，其數量等同於由你操控的神器間最高之總魔法力費用。\', \'type\': \'巫術\', \'flavor\': \'「在我把時空渡橋拼接到身上時，我感到自己的鵬洛客火花閃耀全身。整個多重宇宙都是我的玩物。這感覺. . .無與倫比。」\\n～泰茲瑞\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450012&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7d4aecd5-a1c5-499c-89ad-5a9f5b9af729\', \'multiverseId\': 450012}, \'multiverseid\': 450012}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elektrifizieren\', \'text\': \'Elektrifizieren fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'„Viele flohen vor dem Sturm, ich habe ihn mit jeder Faser meines Körpers willkommen geheißen."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447556&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'375c0729-7980-41be-9006-bc6f6d15b792\', \'multiverseId\': 447556}, \'multiverseid\': 447556}, {\'name\': \'Electrificar\', \'text\': \'Electrificar hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Algunos se escondieron de la tormenta. Yo la acogí y aprendí su nombre".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447837&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'909e7565-f1fe-4c01-96d6-2b1a7f3b33ec\', \'multiverseId\': 447837}, \'multiverseid\': 447837}, {\'name\': \'Électrifier\', \'text\': \'Électrifier inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "« Certains s\'abritent de l\'orage. Moi, je l\'ai accepté dans mon giron et j\'ai appris son nom. »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448118&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'af8dda10-e95e-4bdd-9ba5-aa9148b38972\', \'multiverseId\': 448118}, \'multiverseid\': 448118}, {\'name\': \'Elettrificare\', \'text\': \'Elettrificare infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'"Alcuni rifuggono la tempesta. Io ho imparato a contemplarla e dominarla."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448399&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e7225f61-4eb3-4db9-b319-08f55fdb0df2\', \'multiverseId\': 448399}, \'multiverseid\': 448399}, {\'name\': \'感電\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。感電はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'「嵐から逃げた者もいたけれど、私はそれを受け入れてその名を学んだのよ。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448680&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c114bf36-2bc3-4888-a613-43c33df47e24\', \'multiverseId\': 448680}, \'multiverseid\': 448680}, {\'name\': \'전기 충격\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 전기 충격은 그 생물에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'"누군가는 폭풍을 피해 숨었지만, 난 폭풍을 받아들이고 그 이름을 알아냈지."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448961&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'64261b3c-3d3f-4717-a3f3-56eb4872aa60\', \'multiverseId\': 448961}, \'multiverseid\': 448961}, {\'name\': \'Eletrificar\', \'text\': \'Eletrificar causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'"Alguns se esconderam da tempestade. Eu a abracei e aprendi seu nome."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449242&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35d59554-83cb-4708-9b1f-1a2c77551f7b\', \'multiverseId\': 449242}, \'multiverseid\': 449242}, {\'name\': \'Электрический Заряд\', \'text\': \'Электрический Заряд наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'«Кто-то спрятался от бури. Я же радостно встретила ее, узнав ее имя».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449523&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5c306f72-205b-499f-84e6-97260e92e5f4\', \'multiverseId\': 449523}, \'multiverseid\': 449523}, {\'name\': \'电击\', \'text\': \'电击对目标生物造成4点伤害。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人对风暴避犹不及。而我却迎风而上，将其中奥妙为己所用。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449804&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9d02fb07-8228-4975-a1e0-82185419a831\', \'multiverseId\': 449804}, \'multiverseid\': 449804}, {\'name\': \'電擊\', \'text\': \'電擊對目標生物造成4點傷害。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'「有些人對風暴避猶不及。而我卻迎風而上，將其中奧妙為己所用。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450085&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'da3747d8-f9b7-46a2-a99d-b0afe2ba6fd5\', \'multiverseId\': 450085}, \'multiverseid\': 450085}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfenbein-Ritter\', \'text\': \'Wachsamkeit (Diese Kreatur wird beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Mensch, Ritter\', \'flavor\': \'„Pferde? Wer braucht schon Pferde?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447435&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b8c021ff-0f2a-442e-9a6e-39af4bb506c8\', \'multiverseId\': 447435}, \'multiverseid\': 447435}, {\'name\': \'Caballero del colmillo\', \'text\': \'Vigilancia. (Esta criatura no se gira al atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Caballero humano\', \'flavor\': \'"¿Caballos? ¿Quién necesita eso?".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447716&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'14b93e60-d8c7-46bd-963b-0632c6236418\', \'multiverseId\': 447716}, \'multiverseid\': 447716}, {\'name\': "Chevalier de l\'ivoire", \'text\': "Vigilance (Attaquer avec cette créature ne la fait pas s\'engager.)", \'type\': \'Créature : humain et chevalier\', \'flavor\': "« Un cheval ? Qui a besoin d\'un cheval ? »", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447997&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'228c6d8f-d39f-46ab-a767-1e463df540c0\', \'multiverseId\': 447997}, \'multiverseid\': 447997}, {\'name\': \'Cavaliere della Zanna\', \'text\': \'Cautela (Questa creatura attacca senza TAPpare.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Cavaliere Umano\', \'flavor\': \'"Un cavallo? Chi ha bisogno di un cavallo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448278&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ef1904e2-805a-4b4c-8f26-f768b36337db\', \'multiverseId\': 448278}, \'multiverseid\': 448278}, {\'name\': \'牙の騎士\', \'text\': \'警戒（このクリーチャーは攻撃してもタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 人間・騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「馬？そんなものは必要ない。」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448559&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d8dc5140-b1d3-42f3-accc-2505adb2a327\', \'multiverseId\': 448559}, \'multiverseid\': 448559}, {\'name\': \'상아의 기사\', \'text\': \'경계 (이 생물은 공격하면서 탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 인간 기사\', \'flavor\': \'"말? 누가 말이 필요하겠어?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448840&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'ccdfb19b-cdd7-49bf-9fea-4ce6af02e56d\', \'multiverseId\': 448840}, \'multiverseid\': 448840}, {\'name\': \'Cavaleiro da Presa\', \'text\': \'Vigilância (Esta criatura não é virada para atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Humano Cavaleiro\', \'flavor\': \'"Cavalo? Quem precisa de cavalo?"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449121&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6c3dbb57-c945-4c15-8ef2-a37c2976e81a\', \'multiverseId\': 449121}, \'multiverseid\': 449121}, {\'name\': \'Рыцарь Бивня\', \'text\': \'Бдительность (Атакуя, это существо не поворачивается.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Человек Рыцарь\', \'flavor\': \'«Конь? Зачем мне конь?»\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449402&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5b5df0fa-14a5-4b21-86cb-e582dc805e5f\', \'multiverseId\': 449402}, \'multiverseid\': 449402}, {\'name\': \'战象骑士\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻击时不需横置。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人类／骑士\', \'flavor\': \'「马？谁需要马？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449683&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a85f4e8-7df2-4a47-a687-d50c5f11e946\', \'multiverseId\': 449683}, \'multiverseid\': 449683}, {\'name\': \'戰象騎士\', \'text\': \'警戒（此生物攻擊時不需橫置。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～人類／騎士\', \'flavor\': \'「馬？誰需要馬？」\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449964&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a4f8cdfd-fa22-44e4-8641-8f32479f957b\', \'multiverseId\': 449964}, \'multiverseid\': 449964}]', '[{\'name\': \'Elfische Klanruferin\', \'text\': \'Andere Elfen, die du kontrollierst, erhalten +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: Durchsuche deine Bibliothek nach einer Karte namens Elfische Klanruferin, bringe sie ins Spiel und mische dann deine Bibliothek.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Elf, Druide\', \'flavor\': \'Eine Wurzel allein nährt keinen Wald.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447596&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'871eff12-2dae-4ed2-a5aa-25cee9ebd384\', \'multiverseId\': 447596}, \'multiverseid\': 447596}, {\'name\': \'Elfa llamaclanes\', \'text\': \'Los otros Elfos que controlas obtienen +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: Busca en tu biblioteca una carta llamada Elfa llamaclanes, ponla en el campo de batalla y luego baraja tu biblioteca.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Druida elfo\', \'flavor\': \'El bosque no se alimenta de una sola raíz.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447877&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'219f1bcf-faea-46d8-95cc-84ad012e6e93\', \'multiverseId\': 447877}, \'multiverseid\': 447877}, {\'name\': \'Meneuse de clan elfe\', \'text\': \'Les autres elfes que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T} : Cherchez dans votre bibliothèque une carte appelée Meneuse de clan elfe, mettez-la sur le champ de bataille, puis mélangez votre bibliothèque.\', \'type\': \'Créature : elfe et druide\', \'flavor\': "Il faut plus d\'une racine pour nourrir la forêt.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448158&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'223ec372-94a3-4956-b6d8-cd5d82d47fea\', \'multiverseId\': 448158}, \'multiverseid\': 448158}, {\'name\': \'Convocaclan Elfica\', \'text\': \'Gli altri Elfi che controlli prendono +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: Passa in rassegna il tuo grimorio per una carta chiamata Convocaclan Elfica, mettila sul campo di battaglia, poi rimescola il tuo grimorio.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Druido Elfo\', \'flavor\': \'La foresta non si nutre da una sola radice.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448439&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'279a554b-5142-4a87-98e2-b0f571882dcd\', \'multiverseId\': 448439}, \'multiverseid\': 448439}, {\'name\': \'エルフの部族呼び\', \'text\': \'あなたがコントロールしている他のエルフは＋１/＋１の修整を受ける。\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}：あなたのライブラリーから「エルフの部族呼び」という名前のカード１枚を探し、それを戦場に出す。その後あなたのライブラリーを切り直す。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド\', \'flavor\': \'森を養う根は一本ではない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448720&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'894a132a-bfb8-4aee-a2c9-e2170dfbfd73\', \'multiverseId\': 448720}, \'multiverseid\': 448720}, {\'name\': \'엘프 부족소환사\', \'text\': \'당신이 조종하는 다른 엘프들은 +1/+1을 받는다.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: 당신의 서고에서 이름이 엘프 부족소환사인 카드 한 장을 찾아, 전장에 놓은 후, 당신의 서고를 섞는다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 엘프 드루이드\', \'flavor\': \'숲에 양분을 공급하는 일은 뿌리 하나가 하는 일이 아니다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449001&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b6138c72-65b2-4ad3-b6a7-1d33fa347aec\', \'multiverseId\': 449001}, \'multiverseid\': 449001}, {\'name\': \'Convocadora do Clã Élfica\', \'text\': \'Os outros Elfos que você controla recebem +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: Procure em seu grimório um card com o nome Convocadora do Clã Élfica, coloque-o no campo de batalha e depois embaralhe seu grimório.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Elfo Druida\', \'flavor\': \'Nenhuma raiz alimenta a floresta sozinha.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449282&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9be50a3e-5300-4d24-8dc2-563aad200fd2\', \'multiverseId\': 449282}, \'multiverseid\': 449282}, {\'name\': \'Эльфийская Созывательница Клана\', \'text\': \'Другие Эльфы под вашим контролем получают +1/+1.\\n{4}{G}{G}, {T}: найдите в вашей библиотеке карту с именем Эльфийская Созывательница Клана, положите ее на поле битвы, затем перетасуйте вашу библиотеку.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Эльф Друид\', \'flavor\': \'Одному корню не прокормить лес.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449563&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc163a61-5914-46f9-939d-9f26e86d06b7\', \'multiverseId\': 449563}, \'multiverseid\': 449563}, {\'name\': \'唤族妖精\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他妖精得+1/+1。\\n{4}{G}{G}，{T}：从你的牌库中搜寻一张名称为唤族妖精的牌，将之放进战场，然后将你的牌库洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊\', \'flavor\': \'独木不成林。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449844&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'eb6ca1bc-33de-4870-a464-99201df7b2e4\', \'multiverseId\': 449844}, \'multiverseid\': 449844}, {\'name\': \'喚族妖精\', \'text\': \'由你操控的其他妖精得+1/+1。\\n{4}{G}{G}，{T}：從你的牌庫中搜尋一張名稱為喚族妖精的牌，將之放進戰場，然後將你的牌庫洗牌。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～妖精／德魯伊\', \'flavor\': \'獨木不成林。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450125&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'161715e8-768c-4c5a-8380-bf17bdef2ca2\', \'multiverseId\': 450125}, \'multiverseid\': 450125}]', "[{'name': 'Elfischer Verjüngerer', 'text': 'Wenn der Elfische Verjüngerer ins Spiel kommt, schaue dir die obersten fünf Karten deiner Bibliothek an. Du kannst davon eine Länderkarte getappt ins Spiel bringen. Lege den Rest in zufälliger Reihenfolge unter deine Bibliothek.', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elf, Druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447597&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bbe354a0-f00a-4153-82ab-df62c7bd1098', 'multiverseId': 447597}, 'multiverseid': 447597}, {'name': 'Elfo rejuvenecedor', 'text': 'Cuando el Elfo rejuvenecedor entre al campo de batalla, mira las cinco primeras cartas de tu biblioteca. Puedes poner en el campo de batalla girada una carta de tierra que se encuentre entre ellas. Pon el resto en el fondo de tu biblioteca en un orden aleatorio.', 'type': 'Criatura — Druida elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447878&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fb8692b4-17c1-4d97-ba5d-93221a069c3b', 'multiverseId': 447878}, 'multiverseid': 447878}, {'name': 'Rajeunisseur elfe', 'text': 'Quand le Rajeunisseur elfe arrive sur le champ de bataille, regardez les cinq cartes du dessus de votre bibliothèque. Vous pouvez mettre sur le champ de bataille, engagée, une carte de terrain parmi elles. Mettez le reste au-dessous de votre bibliothèque dans un ordre aléatoire.', 'type': 'Créature : elfe et druide', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448159&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c6192e06-cb60-4355-9178-78a6230c8d53', 'multiverseId': 448159}, 'multiverseid': 448159}, {'name': 'Rinvigoritore Elfico', 'text': 'Quando il Rinvigoritore Elfico entra nel campo di battaglia, guarda le prime cinque carte del tuo grimorio. Puoi mettere una carta terra scelta tra esse sul campo di battaglia TAPpata. Metti le altre in fondo al tuo grimorio in ordine casuale.', 'type': 'Creatura — Druido Elfo', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448440&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '789e4671-3260-49e8-9e18-9410a014bdba', 'multiverseId': 448440}, 'multiverseid': 448440}, {'name': 'エルフの再生者', 'text': 'エルフの再生者が戦場に出たとき、あなたのライブラリーの一番上からカードを５枚見る。あなたはその中から土地・カード１枚をタップ状態で戦場に出してもよい。残りをあなたのライブラリーの一番下に無作為の順番で置く。', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エルフ・ドルイド', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448721&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '51953e6a-40b7-468c-8d50-57b84c9c7f0d', 'multiverseId': 448721}, 'multiverseid': 448721}, {'name': '엘프 원기회복사', 'text': '엘프 원기회복사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신의 서고 맨 위 카드 다섯 장을 본다. 당신은 그중에서 대지 카드 한 장을 전장에 탭된 채로 놓을 수 있다. 나머지 카드들은 무작위 순서로 당신의 서고 맨 밑에 놓는다.', 'type': '생물 — 엘프 드루이드', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449002&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1d7a024f-8703-432a-8fb9-b76228f16347', 'multiverseId': 449002}, 'multiverseid': 449002}, {'name': 'Rejuvenescedor Élfico', 'text': 'Quando Rejuvenescedor Élfico entrar no campo de batalha, olhe os cinco cards do topo de seu grimório. Você pode colocar um card de terreno dentre eles no campo de batalha virado. Coloque o restante no fundo de seu grimório em ordem aleatória.', 'type': 'Criatura — Elfo Druida', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449283&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c935ebfe-3763-4fa1-9977-3bcec9571540', 'multiverseId': 449283}, 'multiverseid': 449283}, {'name': 'Эльфийский Омолодитель', 'text': 'Когда Эльфийский Омолодитель выходит на поле битвы, посмотрите пять верхних карт вашей библиотеки. Вы можете положить находящуюся среди них карту земли на поле битвы повернутой. Положите остальные карты в низ вашей библиотеки в случайном порядке.', 'type': 'Существо — Эльф Друид', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449564&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'f0c50107-ddcf-401f-b6ab-03769e259145', 'multiverseId': 449564}, 'multiverseid': 449564}, {'name': '回春妖精', 'text': '当回春妖精进战场时，检视你牌库顶的五张牌。你可以将其中一张地牌横置放进战场。将其余的牌以随机顺序置于你的牌库底。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／德鲁伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449845&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fae2cbdc-81f3-48ca-9a8e-12be9c098d63', 'multiverseId': 449845}, 'multiverseid': 449845}, {'name': '回春妖精', 'text': '當回春妖精進戰場時，檢視你牌庫頂的五張牌。你可以將其中一張地牌橫置放進戰場。將其餘的牌以隨機順序置於你的牌庫底。', 'type': '生物 ～妖精／德魯伊', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450126&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '5385738f-8854-4adc-9be2-ef2d4b7fb2be', 'multiverseId': 450126}, 'multiverseid': 450126}]", '[{\'name\': \'Engel der Morgenröte\', \'text\': \'Fliegend\\nWenn der Engel der Morgenröte ins Spiel kommt, erhalten Kreaturen, die du kontrollierst, +1/+1 und Wachsamkeit bis zum Ende des Zuges. (Sie werden beim Angreifen nicht getappt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Engel\', \'flavor\': \'Sie singt für alle, die zum Schweigen gebracht wurden.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447424&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'74a1d599-5753-4cbc-9e2d-d6db6c0b2754\', \'multiverseId\': 447424}, \'multiverseid\': 447424}, {\'name\': \'Ángel del alba\', \'text\': \'Vuela.\\nCuando el Ángel del alba entre al campo de batalla, las criaturas que controlas obtienen +1/+1 y ganan la habilidad de vigilancia hasta el final del turno. (Estas criaturas no se giran al atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Ángel\', \'flavor\': \'Canta por todas las voces que fueron silenciadas.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447705&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d40b0c87-9b89-403b-9f55-29561ee13765\', \'multiverseId\': 447705}, \'multiverseid\': 447705}, {\'name\': "Ange de l\'aube", \'text\': "Vol\\nQuand l\'Ange de l\'aube arrive sur le champ de bataille, les créatures que vous contrôlez gagnent +1/+1 et acquièrent la vigilance jusqu\'à la fin du tour. (Attaquer avec ces créatures ne les fait pas s\'engager.)", \'type\': \'Créature : ange\', \'flavor\': \'Elle chante pour tous ceux qui ont été réduits au silence.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447986&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4048ce87-f492-45fd-bc5b-6b8414495a69\', \'multiverseId\': 447986}, \'multiverseid\': 447986}, {\'name\': "Angelo dell\'Alba", \'text\': "Volare\\nQuando l\'Angelo dell\'Alba entra nel campo di battaglia, le creature che controlli prendono +1/+1 e hanno cautela fino alla fine del turno. (Attaccano senza TAPpare.)", \'type\': \'Creatura — Angelo\', \'flavor\': \'Canta per tutti coloro che sono stati messi a tacere.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448267&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'df556e6b-237f-49d3-bee1-16fff893724b\', \'multiverseId\': 448267}, \'multiverseid\': 448267}, {\'name\': \'暁の天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n暁の天使が戦場に出たとき、ターン終了時まで、あなたがコントロールしているクリーチャーは＋１/＋１の修整を受け、警戒を得る。（それらは攻撃してもタップしない。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — 天使\', \'flavor\': \'彼女は沈黙する者たちのために歌う。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448548&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'78324dff-bf2e-4628-bbf3-055f61893519\', \'multiverseId\': 448548}, \'multiverseid\': 448548}, {\'name\': \'동틀 녘의 천사\', \'text\': \'비행\\n동틀 녘의 천사가 전장에 들어올 때, 당신이 조종하는 생물들은 턴종료까지 +1/+1을 받고 경계를 얻는다. (그 생물들은 공격해도 탭되지 않는다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 천사\', \'flavor\': \'그녀는 침묵당했던 자들 모두를 위해 노래한다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448829&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0ace1bd-8e17-42b3-9697-7d05b172cf8d\', \'multiverseId\': 448829}, \'multiverseid\': 448829}, {\'name\': \'Anjo da Aurora\', \'text\': \'Voar\\nQuando Anjo da Aurora entra no campo de batalha, as criaturas que você controla recebem +1/+1 e ganham vigilância até o final do turno. (Elas não são viradas para atacar.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Anjo\', \'flavor\': \'Ela canta por todos os que foram silenciados.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449110&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'615c6af6-2aa7-42ce-9f7a-3e4e91589684\', \'multiverseId\': 449110}, \'multiverseid\': 449110}, {\'name\': \'Ангел Утренней Зари\', \'text\': \'Полет\\nКогда Ангел Утренней Зари выходит на поле битвы, существа под вашим контролем получают +1/+1 и Бдительность до конца хода. (Атакуя, они не поворачиваются.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Ангел\', \'flavor\': \'Она поет за всех тех, кого заставили замолчать.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449391&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7453b22c-eb69-4d10-a588-f281cf26f49b\', \'multiverseId\': 449391}, \'multiverseid\': 449391}, {\'name\': \'黎明天使\', \'text\': \'飞行\\n当黎明天使进战场时，直到回合结束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且获得警戒异能。（它们攻击时不需横置。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'她为被噤声者而歌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449672&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a1008a52-b5f5-4cae-a2cb-31cc8beeb10f\', \'multiverseId\': 449672}, \'multiverseid\': 449672}, {\'name\': \'黎明天使\', \'text\': \'飛行\\n當黎明天使進戰場時，直到回合結束，由你操控的生物得+1/+1且獲得警戒異能。（它們攻擊時不需橫置。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～天使\', \'flavor\': \'被噤聲者而歌。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449953&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'12a136de-c820-4832-aad8-711aeb8fbe63\', \'multiverseId\': 449953}, \'multiverseid\': 449953}]', '[{\'name\': \'Entweihte Gruft\', \'text\': \'Immer wenn eine oder mehrere Kreaturenkarten deinen Friedhof verlassen, erzeuge einen 1/1 schwarzen Fledermaus-Kreaturenspielstein mit Flugfähigkeit.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'Die Grabräuber waren verwundert, denn die Tür zum Mausoleum stand bereits offen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447648&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a10cbdc3-d604-44dd-b6fa-8c5512ce2ca1\', \'multiverseId\': 447648}, \'multiverseid\': 447648}, {\'name\': \'Sepulcro profanado\', \'text\': \'Siempre que una o más cartas de criatura dejen tu cementerio, crea una ficha de criatura Murciélago negra 1/1 con la habilidad de volar.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'Los ladrones de tumbas se quedaron perplejos; la puerta del mausoleo ya estaba abierta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447929&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'036018b1-336c-498f-b64a-1092746f8a3b\', \'multiverseId\': 447929}, \'multiverseid\': 447929}, {\'name\': \'Tombe profanée\', \'text\': "À chaque fois qu\'au moins une carte de créature quitte votre cimetière, créez un jeton de créature 1/1 noire Chauve-souris avec le vol.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'Les pilleurs de tombe furent surpris, car la porte du mausolée était déjà ouverte.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448210&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'1b6ca7bd-ae4f-4d8f-a988-58ae1e831f4f\', \'multiverseId\': 448210}, \'multiverseid\': 448210}, {\'name\': \'Tomba Profanata\', \'text\': \'Ogniqualvolta una o più carte creatura lasciano il tuo cimitero, crea una pedina creatura Pipistrello 1/1 nera con volare.\', \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'I ladri di tombe rimasero sorpresi, poiché la porta del mausoleo era già aperta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448491&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'704e1383-30f4-446e-a8d7-9617f9145e04\', \'multiverseId\': 448491}, \'multiverseid\': 448491}, {\'name\': \'冒涜された墓所\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・カードが１枚以上あなたの墓地を離れるたび、飛行を持つ黒の１/１のコウモリ・クリーチャー・トークンを１体生成する。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'墓荒らしたちは驚いた。霊廟への入り口が既に開いていたからだ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448772&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9113819c-1fc2-46ed-b2fe-eef2bd01e226\', \'multiverseId\': 448772}, \'multiverseid\': 448772}, {\'name\': \'훼손당한 무덤\', \'text\': \'한 개 이상의 생물 카드가 당신의 무덤을 떠날 때마다, 비행을 가진 1/1 흑색 박쥐 생물 토큰을 만든다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'무덤 도굴꾼들은 영묘의 문이 이미 열려 있는 것을 보고 깜짝 놀랐다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449053&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'cc65404d-c3ad-4b80-9a7a-479ff99fee57\', \'multiverseId\': 449053}, \'multiverseid\': 449053}, {\'name\': \'Tumba Profanada\', \'text\': \'Toda vez que um ou mais cards de criatura deixarem seu cemitério, crie uma ficha de criatura preta 1/1 do tipo Morcego com voar.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'Os saqueadores de tumbas se sobressaltaram. A porta do mausoléu já estava aberta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449334&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bc4e44d-fe9c-456d-a577-2f42a30764ee\', \'multiverseId\': 449334}, \'multiverseid\': 449334}, {\'name\': \'Оскверненная Могила\', \'text\': \'Каждый раз, когда одна или несколько карт существ покидают ваше кладбище, создайте одну фишку существа 1/1 черная Летучая_мышь с Полетом.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'Грабители могил испугались, ведь дверь в мавзолей была уже открыта.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449615&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0849774-6760-48e7-a71e-5ee7c5d40e4f\', \'multiverseId\': 449615}, \'multiverseid\': 449615}, {\'name\': \'受渎陵墓\', \'text\': \'每当一张或数张生物牌离开你的坟墓场时，派出一个1/1黑色，具飞行异能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'盗墓者看到陵墓大门早已洞开，自己也受惊不浅。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449896&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'934fb663-3e3d-48ad-9318-c28795b91863\', \'multiverseId\': 449896}, \'multiverseid\': 449896}, {\'name\': \'受瀆陵墓\', \'text\': \'每當一張或數張生物牌離開你的墳墓場時，派出一個1/1黑色，具飛行異能的蝙蝠衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'盜墓者看到陵墓大門早已洞開，自己也受驚不淺。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450177&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e8ab7687-0caa-4fd1-986c-5739b9b338e3\', \'multiverseId\': 450177}, \'multiverseid\': 450177}]', '[{\'name\': \'Erstickende Sporen\', \'text\': \'Eine Kreatur deiner Wahl erhält -3/-3 bis zum Ende des Zuges.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Stelle dir vor, wie tausend winzige Pilze deine Lungen füllen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447539&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a2583308-0834-40e9-878c-f79456783e14\', \'multiverseId\': 447539}, \'multiverseid\': 447539}, {\'name\': \'Esporas asfixiantes\', \'text\': \'La criatura objetivo obtiene -3/-3 hasta el final del turno.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Imagina miles de pequeños hongos creciéndote dentro de los pulmones.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447820&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e97378e7-571b-4578-84e1-cda8b50101ad\', \'multiverseId\': 447820}, \'multiverseid\': 447820}, {\'name\': \'Spores étrangleuses\', \'text\': "La créature ciblée gagne -3/-3 jusqu\'à la fin du tour.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Imaginez un millier de champignons microscopiques s\'installant dans vos poumons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448101&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d3b3a19-8940-4d79-b0eb-ac7fec04dd14\', \'multiverseId\': 448101}, \'multiverseid\': 448101}, {\'name\': \'Spore Soffocanti\', \'text\': \'Una creatura bersaglio prende -3/-3 fino alla fine del turno.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'È come se nei tuoi polmoni spuntassero migliaia di minuscoli funghi.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448382&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d78be134-e298-4045-bf50-dbbe005b1cae\', \'multiverseId\': 448382}, \'multiverseid\': 448382}, {\'name\': \'束縛の胞子\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。ターン終了時まで、それは－３/－３の修整を受ける。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'千の小さなキノコが肺の中で育つのを想像してみろ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448663&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8db81a27-9e64-4a9e-834c-29f0fe49c34b\', \'multiverseId\': 448663}, \'multiverseid\': 448663}, {\'name\': \'목을 죄는 포자\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 그 생물은 턴종료까지 -3/-3을 받는다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'수천 개의 작은 버섯들이 당신의 폐를 가득 메우는 것을 상상해 봐라.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448944&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'48273f06-91e0-4625-b348-28111345cbf2\', \'multiverseId\': 448944}, \'multiverseid\': 448944}, {\'name\': \'Esporos Estrangulantes\', \'text\': \'A criatura alvo recebe -3/-3 até o final do turno.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Imagine milhares de pequenos cogumelos brotando dentro de seus pulmões.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449225&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'80e077fd-6330-42a3-b148-c0a0d5ebc74c\', \'multiverseId\': 449225}, \'multiverseid\': 449225}, {\'name\': \'Удушливые Споры\', \'text\': \'Целевое существо получает -3/-3 до конца хода.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Представь, как тысячи крохотных грибов прорастают в твоих легких.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449506&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4a12d06c-f160-4019-81c6-6a71f6a6da2b\', \'multiverseId\': 449506}, \'multiverseid\': 449506}, {\'name\': \'窒息芽孢\', \'text\': \'目标生物得-3/-3直到回合结束。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'想象一下你的肺中冒出千朵蘑菇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449787&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b9d231f5-29c2-4dca-a637-3fe77d2d1769\', \'multiverseId\': 449787}, \'multiverseid\': 449787}, {\'name\': \'窒息芽孢\', \'text\': \'目標生物得-3/-3直到回合結束。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'想像一下你的肺中冒出千朵蘑菇。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450068&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'21fd37af-d1ec-4c0a-b53b-b227de3d9677\', \'multiverseId\': 450068}, \'multiverseid\': 450068}]', '[{\'name\': \'Essenzzerstäubung\', \'text\': \'Neutralisiere einen Kreaturenzauber deiner Wahl.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': \'Einfach auf Glück zu setzen, wäre eine Beleidigung von Kefnets Intellekt. Wer ihm entkommen will, muss seinen Verstand benutzen.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447471&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'65ef9526-8684-4d14-af04-2c190a5fcaa8\', \'multiverseId\': 447471}, \'multiverseid\': 447471}, {\'name\': \'Esparcir la esencia\', \'text\': \'Contrarresta el hechizo de criatura objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': \'Depender del azar es un ultraje a los rigurosos estudios de Kefnet. Quienes tengan la esperanza de escapar por suerte de su laberinto jamás lo lograrán.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447752&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59cfec7b-80f1-4178-b1b9-884c0a97b52e\', \'multiverseId\': 447752}, \'multiverseid\': 447752}, {\'name\': "Dispersion d\'essence", \'text\': \'Contrecarrez le sort de créature ciblé.\', \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': "Compter sur la chance est contraire à la rigueur des études de Kefnet. Ceux qui espèrent qu\'elle leur permettra de sortir de son labyrinthe n\'y parviennent jamais.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448033&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'565a3b6e-a4fc-4aa5-93fc-9f414d98e6f2\', \'multiverseId\': 448033}, \'multiverseid\': 448033}, {\'name\': \'Disperdere Essenza\', \'text\': \'Neutralizza una magia creatura bersaglio.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': \'Il culto della fortuna è condannato nei rigorosi studi di Kefnet. Coloro che sperano di superare il suo labirinto affidandosi alla sorte sono perduti.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448314&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'76c232d0-dfbb-4bbf-846a-3aeb57ad2a1e\', \'multiverseId\': 448314}, \'multiverseid\': 448314}, {\'name\': \'本質の散乱\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー・呪文１つを対象とし、それを打ち消す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': \'ケフネトの厳格な学徒たちは運に頼ることを嫌う。その迷路から運任せで抜け出そうとしても決して成功しない。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448595&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a0891c77-2f9d-435c-9870-5f6251395587\', \'multiverseId\': 448595}, \'multiverseid\': 448595}, {\'name\': \'정수 흩날리기\', \'text\': \'생물 주문을 목표로 정한다. 그 주문을 무효화한다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': \'케프넷의 왕성한 연구에서 운적 요소는 모두 배제된다. 운에 의지해 그의 미로를 탈출하려는 시도는 늘 실패로 끝난다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448876&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8d89e977-57fb-4268-915a-48f66e43ad2a\', \'multiverseId\': 448876}, \'multiverseid\': 448876}, {\'name\': \'Espalhar Essência\', \'text\': \'Anule a mágica de criatura alvo.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': \'Depender da sorte é um insulto aos estudos rigorosos de Kefnet. Aqueles que contam com ela para sair do seu labirinto jamais conseguem.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449157&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f7a886b4-e72b-44ea-939d-56d982753e36\', \'multiverseId\': 449157}, \'multiverseid\': 449157}, {\'name\': \'Разлет Эссенции\', \'text\': \'Отмените целевое заклинание существа.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': \'Нет ничего хуже, чем в скрупулезных исследованиях Кефнета полагаться на удачу. Везение еще никому не помогало выбраться из его лабиринта.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449438&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4acfd591-877b-4bc4-9b87-becd8126cbdf\', \'multiverseId\': 449438}, \'multiverseid\': 449438}, {\'name\': \'菁华离散\', \'text\': \'反击目标生物咒语。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': \'刻法涅的缜密研究中容不得半点投机取巧。希望靠运气走出他迷宫的人从未成功。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449719&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dbb453bb-fbd7-4893-aa89-e86023d035ec\', \'multiverseId\': 449719}, \'multiverseid\': 449719}, {\'name\': \'菁華離散\', \'text\': \'反擊目標生物咒語。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': \'刻法涅的縝密研究中容不得半點投機取巧。希望靠運氣走出他迷宮的人從未成功。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450000&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'be923a2f-8122-4e9c-907f-574d48600dc9\', \'multiverseId\': 450000}, \'multiverseid\': 450000}]', '[{\'name\': \'Explosiver Apparat\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, opfere den Explosiven Apparat: Er fügt einem Ziel deiner Wahl 2 Schadenspunkte zu.\', \'type\': \'Artefakt\', \'flavor\': \'„Seelen sind äußerst instabil. Hochverdichtet in einem kleinen Apparat ist ihr Zerstörungspotenzial ziemlich beeindruckend."\\n—Dierk, Geistermagier\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447651&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b1930d40-3a55-44cd-8911-463e89da233d\', \'multiverseId\': 447651}, \'multiverseid\': 447651}, {\'name\': \'Aparato explosivo\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, sacrificar el Aparato explosivo: Hace 2 puntos de daño a cualquier objetivo.\', \'type\': \'Artefacto\', \'flavor\': \'"Las almas son volátiles. Si se comprimen y cargan en un dispositivo manual, su potencial destructivo es realmente impresionante".\\n—Dierk, mago de geists\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447932&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6709da1f-24df-4724-9f50-4d85361199c0\', \'multiverseId\': 447932}, \'multiverseid\': 447932}, {\'name\': \'Dispositif explosif\', \'text\': "{3}, {T}, sacrifiez le Dispositif explosif : Il inflige 2 blessures à n\'importe quelle cible.", \'type\': \'Artefact\', \'flavor\': \'« Les âmes sont instables. Compressées et chargées dans un dispositif portatif, leur potentiel destructeur est très impressionnant. »\\n—Dierk, geistmage\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448213&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'4762a7ab-0e9d-456a-a729-55b4eb2f14f0\', \'multiverseId\': 448213}, \'multiverseid\': 448213}, {\'name\': \'Apparato Esplosivo\', \'text\': "{3}, {T}, Sacrifica l\'Apparato Esplosivo: Infligge 2 danni a un qualsiasi bersaglio.", \'type\': \'Artefatto\', \'flavor\': \'"Le anime sono altamente instabili. Se compresse e caricate in un congegno manuale, rivelano un potenziale distruttivo impressionante."\\n—Dierk, mago dei geist\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448494&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'992d218b-5aee-4778-a61a-8c28214155b3\', \'multiverseId\': 448494}, \'multiverseid\': 448494}, {\'name\': \'爆発性の機器\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, 爆発性の機器を生け贄に捧げる：クリーチャー１体かプレインズウォーカー１体かプレイヤー１人を対象とする。これはそれに２点のダメージを与える。\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト\', \'flavor\': \'「魂とは不安定なものだ。圧縮して手に持てるくらいの機器に充填すれば、その爆発力は目を見張るほどになる。」\\n――霊魔道士、ディールク\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448775&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b0877f83-1de6-44d7-a775-35dd2cf7f132\', \'multiverseId\': 448775}, \'multiverseid\': 448775}, {\'name\': \'폭발 장치\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, 폭발 장치를 희생한다: 원하는 목표를 정한다. 폭발 장치는 그 목표에게 피해 2점을 입힌다.\', \'type\': \'마법물체\', \'flavor\': \'"영혼은 불안정한 물질이야. 영혼을 압축해서 휴대용 장치에 넣으면 그 잠재 폭발력은 아주 엄청나지."\\n—심령술사 디어크\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449056&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63fcce77-c6f6-4f3f-bd99-777731718734\', \'multiverseId\': 449056}, \'multiverseid\': 449056}, {\'name\': \'Aparato Explosivo\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, sacrifique Aparato Explosivo: Ele causa 2 pontos de dano a qualquer alvo.\', \'type\': \'Artefato\', \'flavor\': \'"As almas são voláteis. Quando comprimidas e armazenadas em um dispositivo portátil, seu potencial destrutivo é bastante impressionante."\\n— Dierk, geisteomago\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449337&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7356ea11-9750-4252-a45a-b5585973134f\', \'multiverseId\': 449337}, \'multiverseid\': 449337}, {\'name\': \'Взрывоопасный Аппарат\', \'text\': \'{3}, {T}, пожертвуйте Взрывоопасный Аппарат: он наносит 2 повреждения любой цели.\', \'type\': \'Артефакт\', \'flavor\': \'«Души — очень летучий материал. Если сжать их посильнее и закачать в помещающийся в руке сосуд, его разрушительный потенциал будет сложно переоценить».\\n— Дьерк, маг привидений\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449618&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3e98fc09-341e-43e0-bf5b-9aa17ac72eab\', \'multiverseId\': 449618}, \'multiverseid\': 449618}, {\'name\': \'爆炸装置\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}，牺牲爆炸装置：它对任意一个目标造成2点伤害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「灵魂都是易爆的东西。压缩后装在手持装置中，它们的破坏能力令人惊叹。」\\n～游魂法师第尔克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449899&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f72bbd2d-f368-4a82-aa9a-ba5bf9ad6bb9\', \'multiverseId\': 449899}, \'multiverseid\': 449899}, {\'name\': \'爆炸裝置\', \'text\': \'{3}，{T}，犧牲爆炸裝置：它對任意一個目標造成2點傷害。\', \'type\': \'神器\', \'flavor\': \'「靈魂都是易爆的東西。壓縮後裝在手持裝置中，它們的破壞能力令人驚歎。」\\n～遊魂法師第爾克\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450180&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98e2f06a-d3cd-4a70-96a0-b352a0708142\', \'multiverseId\': 450180}, \'multiverseid\': 450180}]', "[{'name': 'Fauliger Obstgarten', 'text': 'Der Faulige Obstgarten kommt getappt ins Spiel.\\n{T}: Erzeuge {B} oder {G}.', 'type': 'Land', 'flavor': 'Der faulige Gestank lockt Fliegen, Goblins und junge Raptoren an.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447669&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0bd65683-24fc-41a5-adc9-80a3e5d0f6a6', 'multiverseId': 447669}, 'multiverseid': 447669}, {'name': 'Huerto repugnante', 'text': 'El Huerto repugnante entra al campo de batalla girado.\\n{T}: Agrega {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Tierra', 'flavor': 'El hedor de la carne podrida atrae moscas, trasgos y jóvenes ráptores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447950&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '900739e1-ed69-4339-ad15-51b0e3f084e3', 'multiverseId': 447950}, 'multiverseid': 447950}, {'name': 'Verger infâme', 'text': 'Le Verger infâme arrive sur le champ de bataille engagé.\\n{T} : Ajoutez {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terrain', 'flavor': 'La puanteur de la viande pourrissante attire les mouches, les gobelins et les jeunes raptors.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448231&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '339eb0d8-3886-4a66-85a8-ef8c143d7348', 'multiverseId': 448231}, 'multiverseid': 448231}, {'name': 'Frutteto Ripugnante', 'text': 'Il Frutteto Ripugnante entra nel campo di battaglia TAPpato.\\n{T}: Aggiungi {B} o {G}.', 'type': 'Terra', 'flavor': 'Il fetore di carne putrida attira mosche, goblin e giovani raptor.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448512&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0292b95a-f1d7-44b7-9cf1-3816ab37d19a', 'multiverseId': 448512}, 'multiverseid': 448512}, {'name': '穢れた果樹園', 'text': '穢れた果樹園はタップ状態で戦場に出る。\\n{T}：{B}か{G}を加える。', 'type': '土地', 'flavor': '肉の腐る臭いが、ハエやゴブリンや若い猛竜を引き寄せる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448793&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '09c624f4-a9f3-4096-b664-74df294b4689', 'multiverseId': 448793}, 'multiverseid': 448793}, {'name': '역겨운 과수원', 'text': '역겨운 과수원은 탭된 채로 전장에 들어온다.\\n{T}: {B} 또는 {G}를 추가한다.', 'type': '대지', 'flavor': '썩어 가는 시체의 악취가 파리와 고블린, 어린 랩터들을 끌어들인다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449074&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '73a1e59d-e919-4fdc-ab17-d1f547abc105', 'multiverseId': 449074}, 'multiverseid': 449074}, {'name': 'Pomar Hediondo', 'text': 'Pomar Hediondo entra no campo de batalha virado.\\n{T}: Adicione {B} ou {G}.', 'type': 'Terreno', 'flavor': 'O fedor da carne putrefata atrai moscas, goblins e jovens raptores.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449355&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c38ecaa3-6662-41bd-afd3-ec66637a22f3', 'multiverseId': 449355}, 'multiverseid': 449355}, {'name': 'Нечестивый Сад', 'text': 'Нечестивый Сад выходит на поле битвы повернутым.\\n{T}: добавьте {B} или {G}.', 'type': 'Земля', 'flavor': 'Смрад гниющего мяса привлекает мух, гоблинов и молодых рапторов.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449636&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ffae28fd-0ea0-4fa7-ae7f-7edb3954f9d4', 'multiverseId': 449636}, 'multiverseid': 449636}, {'name': '邪秽果园', 'text': '邪秽果园须横置进战场。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '腐肉恶臭引来了苍蝇、鬼怪和幼迅猛龙。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449917&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '16aafc5a-baa9-4567-aad5-d750c349d5fb', 'multiverseId': 449917}, 'multiverseid': 449917}, {'name': '邪穢果園', 'text': '邪穢果園須橫置進戰場。\\n{T}：加{B}或{G}。', 'type': '地', 'flavor': '腐肉惡臭引來了蒼蠅、鬼怪和幼迅猛龍。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450198&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0207ea42-2d9b-4b69-8620-7ba535540841', 'multiverseId': 450198}, 'multiverseid': 450198}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feindseliger Minotaurus\', \'text\': \'Eile (Diese Kreatur kann angreifen und {T}, sobald sie unter deine Kontrolle kommt.)\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Minotaurus\', \'flavor\': \'„Das Brüllen eines Minotaurus kündigt immer nur eines an: einen Angriff."\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447564&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2174fd2a-641d-4372-9649-7e76f1844ba5\', \'multiverseId\': 447564}, \'multiverseid\': 447564}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro hostil\', \'text\': \'Prisa. (Esta criatura puede atacar y {T} tan pronto como entra bajo tu control.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'El bramido de un minotauro siempre viene a decir: "¡Carguen!".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447845&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0af0b51f-1312-4a83-acdd-68c1361e8f4a\', \'multiverseId\': 447845}, \'multiverseid\': 447845}, {\'name\': \'Minotaure hostile\', \'text\': \'Célérité (Cette créature peut attaquer et {T} dès le tour où elle arrive sous votre contrôle.)\', \'type\': \'Créature : minotaure\', \'flavor\': "Le beuglement d\'un minotaure se traduit toujours par « À l\'attaque ! ».", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448126&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c15e6c46-3905-4260-849b-1c37a2a1cbe4\', \'multiverseId\': 448126}, \'multiverseid\': 448126}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro Ostile\', \'text\': \'Rapidità (Questa creatura può attaccare e {T} non appena entra sotto il tuo controllo.)\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'Ogni muggito di un minotauro si traduce nello stesso modo: "Carica!"\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448407&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'35e5c413-6c61-4a60-a536-d649a37f3006\', \'multiverseId\': 448407}, \'multiverseid\': 448407}, {\'name\': \'敵意あるミノタウルス\', \'text\': \'速攻（このクリーチャーは、あなたのコントロール下になってすぐに攻撃したり{T}したりできる。）\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ミノタウルス\', \'flavor\': \'ミノタウルスの怒鳴り声はいつでも「突撃」という意味だ。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448688&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'29380598-0367-42d4-9338-d40ddc95773b\', \'multiverseId\': 448688}, \'multiverseid\': 448688}, {\'name\': \'적대적인 미노타우로스\', \'text\': \'신속 (이 생물은 당신의 조종하에 들어오자마자 공격하거나 {T}할 수 있다.)\', \'type\': \'생물 — 미노타우로스\', \'flavor\': \'미노타우로스의 울음소리는 언제나 "돌격"으로 해석된다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448969&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3ea716ef-8f01-4ddc-9a49-4609fea919ee\', \'multiverseId\': 448969}, \'multiverseid\': 448969}, {\'name\': \'Minotauro Hostil\', \'text\': \'Ímpeto (Esta criatura pode atacar e {T} assim que entra sob seu controle.)\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Minotauro\', \'flavor\': \'A tradução do urro de um minotauro é sempre "atacar".\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449250&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2af6536a-1c84-42cf-97fe-673a21027e8b\', \'multiverseId\': 449250}, \'multiverseid\': 449250}, {\'name\': \'Злобный Минотавр\', \'text\': \'Ускорение (Это существо может атаковать и {T}, как только оно попадает под ваш контроль.)\', \'type\': \'Существо — Минотавр\', \'flavor\': \'Рев минотавра всегда переводится одинаково: «В бой!».\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449531&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'b04035d1-c626-4dd0-9c00-bda09e2efe9f\', \'multiverseId\': 449531}, \'multiverseid\': 449531}, {\'name\': \'敌意牛头怪\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控时便能攻击与{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛头怪\', \'flavor\': \'牛头怪的嚎吼永远都意味着「冲锋」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449812&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'500a9913-a4cf-4a9e-ae46-66fee173f1a7\', \'multiverseId\': 449812}, \'multiverseid\': 449812}, {\'name\': \'敵意牛頭怪\', \'text\': \'敏捷（此生物受你操控時便能攻擊與{T}。）\', \'type\': \'生物 ～牛頭怪\', \'flavor\': \'牛頭怪的嚎吼永遠都意味著「衝鋒」。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450093&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'8065a391-78d5-4a17-99f3-d98fc0d1d773\', \'multiverseId\': 450093}, \'multiverseid\': 450093}]', '[{\'name\': \'Feldkriecher\', \'type\': \'Artefaktkreatur — Vogelscheuche\', \'flavor\': \'Er läuft über brachliegende Felder und sein beschwingter Schritt erzeugt zusammen mit dem Klappern seines Kopfes einen Rhythmus, der einem das Mark in den Knochen gefrieren lässt.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447652&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e327fad2-9a7c-4ec9-9e5d-579a6aef265d\', \'multiverseId\': 447652}, \'multiverseid\': 447652}, {\'name\': \'Espanto de los campos\', \'type\': \'Criatura artefacto — Espantapájaros\', \'flavor\': \'Avanza por los campos en barbecho, dando largas y torpes zancadas acompasadas con el traqueteo de su cabeza; el espeluznante ritmo que crea pone los pelos de punta.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447933&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'27d8a036-60c6-4ebf-bb17-b3ecc0ba0ee0\', \'multiverseId\': 447933}, \'multiverseid\': 447933}, {\'name\': \'Fureteur des champs\', \'type\': \'Créature-artefact : épouvantail\', \'flavor\': "Alors qu\'il traverse les champs en jachère, son étrange démarche chaloupée s\'accorde avec le cliquetis de sa tête pour créer un rythme terrifiant qui donne des frissons.", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448214&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'5f509a26-583f-4630-9e56-cb54a5298722\', \'multiverseId\': 448214}, \'multiverseid\': 448214}, {\'name\': \'Strisciante dei Campi\', \'type\': \'Creatura Artefatto — Spaventapasseri\', \'flavor\': \'Mentre attraversa i campi incolti, la sua andatura bizzarra e cadenzata accompagna il brusio nella sua testa, creando un ritmo ossessivo che raggela le ossa.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448495&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c0c4b171-36d5-4a8f-8288-c46f19d8fbb5\', \'multiverseId\': 448495}, \'multiverseid\': 448495}, {\'name\': \'耕地這い\', \'type\': \'アーティファクト・クリーチャー — カカシ\', \'flavor\': \'それが休耕地を横切ると、ぎこちない足音と頭から響くカタカタという音が調和して、ぞっとするような恐ろしいリズムを奏でる。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448776&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'6bab7a96-1a0d-4f52-a65b-8e636555d237\', \'multiverseId\': 448776}, \'multiverseid\': 448776}, {\'name\': \'들판의 괴물\', \'type\': \'마법물체 생물 — 허수아비\', \'flavor\': \'그놈이 버려진 들판을 가로지를 때 사용하는 이상한 걸음걸이와 머리에서 나는 딸깍 소리가 한데 어울려 등골을 오싹하게 하는 괴이한 리듬을 만든다.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449057&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'320063ba-8ab4-47dc-b5d8-bd6f2e8ce0ec\', \'multiverseId\': 449057}, \'multiverseid\': 449057}, {\'name\': \'Rastejador dos Campos\', \'type\': \'Criatura Artefato — Espantalho\', \'flavor\': \'Conforme ele anda pelo campo inculto, seu passo desajeitado sincronizado com o chocalhar em sua cabeça cria um ritmo assombrado de gelar os ossos.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449338&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'10448e9e-ab8a-4e50-880f-400ecda9e35a\', \'multiverseId\': 449338}, \'multiverseid\': 449338}, {\'name\': \'Ужас Полей\', \'type\': \'Артефакт Существо — Пугало\', \'flavor\': \'Оно бредет по незасеянному полю, и его пустая голова гремит в такт нелепой, дерганой походке. Этот кошмарный ритм пробирает до костей.\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449619&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'59fcfabe-79e0-4059-80bc-99bcd4893851\', \'multiverseId\': 449619}, \'multiverseid\': 449619}, {\'name\': \'骇野草人\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'它行于休耕田地，步态笨拙跳跃，头部嘎啦作响，谱成的旋律令人不寒而栗。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449900&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'9af0612d-0da6-42bb-83ba-5ef5e5dc0735\', \'multiverseId\': 449900}, \'multiverseid\': 449900}, {\'name\': \'駭野草人\', \'type\': \'神器生物 ～稻草人\', \'flavor\': \'它行於休耕田地，步態笨拙跳躍，頭部嘎啦作響，譜成的旋律令人不寒而慄。\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450181&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f3a23482-00ab-4cb9-81f9-4265dd1c9237\', \'multiverseId\': 450181}, \'multiverseid\': 450181}]', "[{'name': 'Feuerelementar', 'type': 'Kreatur — Elementarwesen', 'flavor': 'Es schreitet auf Füßen aus Kohlen und schlägt mit der Kraft eines Vulkans zu.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447558&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '65d93a78-8ce8-4316-9536-b43fd2c58157', 'multiverseId': 447558}, 'multiverseid': 447558}, {'name': 'Elemental de fuego', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'Camina con pies de brasas y golpea con la fuerza de un volcán.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447839&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '28238d99-aa7d-4f62-9922-5182e1110029', 'multiverseId': 447839}, 'multiverseid': 447839}, {'name': 'Élémental de feu', 'type': 'Créature : élémental', 'flavor': 'Il marche sur les charbons ardents et frappe avec la force des volcans.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448120&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1c9e5051-9404-4038-af54-7d9c04bc3baa', 'multiverseId': 448120}, 'multiverseid': 448120}, {'name': 'Elementale del Fuoco', 'type': 'Creatura — Elementale', 'flavor': 'Cammina su piedi di carbone e colpisce con la forza di un vulcano.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448401&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c69c6104-a3b4-4a9f-a3df-f6770f951c65', 'multiverseId': 448401}, 'multiverseid': 448401}, {'name': '炎の精霊', 'type': 'クリーチャー — エレメンタル', 'flavor': '白熱した足で歩き、火山のような勢いで打ちかかる。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448682&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c5ccb258-4799-41b4-bc9f-13fb7a0f7525', 'multiverseId': 448682}, 'multiverseid': 448682}, {'name': '불의 정령', 'type': '생물 — 정령', 'flavor': '발은 석탄이요, 힘은 화산과 같다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448963&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '114fd3c1-467e-45aa-b585-b4d0e9690aeb', 'multiverseId': 448963}, 'multiverseid': 448963}, {'name': 'Elemental do Fogo', 'type': 'Criatura — Elemental', 'flavor': 'Ele caminha com pés de carvão e ataca com a força de um vulcão.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449244&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '0b3d0bcc-4690-4c04-9af5-060b76556921', 'multiverseId': 449244}, 'multiverseid': 449244}, {'name': 'Огненный Элементаль', 'type': 'Существо — Элементаль', 'flavor': 'Он ходит на ногах из углей и наносит удары с мощью вулкана.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449525&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '313f4a9f-835a-4662-9791-10f0430580c0', 'multiverseId': 449525}, 'multiverseid': 449525}, {'name': '火元素', 'type': '生物 ～元素', 'flavor': '它踏着煤炭的脚步，以火山的威力攻击。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449806&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'cb313361-bb62-4c98-8e4b-09bddb26379d', 'multiverseId': 449806}, 'multiverseid': 449806}, {'name': '火元素', 'type': '生物 ～元素', 'flavor': '它踏著煤炭的腳步，以火山的威力攻擊。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450087&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a08553d4-0f93-49da-9da7-26fb4f05a205', 'multiverseId': 450087}, 'multiverseid': 450087}]", '[{\'name\': \'Feuerspucken\', \'text\': \'Feuerspucken fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 4 Schadenspunkte zu.\\nImmer wenn ein Drache unter deiner Kontrolle ins Spiel kommt, kannst du {R} bezahlen. Falls du dies tust, bringe Feuerspucken aus deinem Friedhof auf deine Hand zurück.\', \'type\': \'Spontanzauber\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447577&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'c62938a2-b0bc-4144-9427-aeba0b47116f\', \'multiverseId\': 447577}, \'multiverseid\': 447577}, {\'name\': \'Escupir llamas\', \'text\': \'Escupir llamas hace 4 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.\\nSiempre que un Dragón entre al campo de batalla bajo tu control, puedes pagar {R}. Si lo haces, regresa Escupir llamas de tu cementerio a tu mano.\', \'type\': \'Instantáneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447858&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'e2167fd2-a6a2-4394-ad50-196304991e79\', \'multiverseId\': 447858}, \'multiverseid\': 447858}, {\'name\': \'Cracher des flammes\', \'text\': "Cracher des flammes inflige 4 blessures à une créature ciblée.\\nÀ chaque fois qu\'un dragon arrive sur le champ de bataille sous votre contrôle, vous pouvez payer {R}. Si vous faites ainsi, renvoyez Cracher des flammes depuis votre cimetière dans votre main.", \'type\': \'Éphémère\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448139&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'d808f435-3f23-4b1a-b3bf-bd438c60c065\', \'multiverseId\': 448139}, \'multiverseid\': 448139}, {\'name\': \'Respiro Bruciante\', \'text\': \'Il Respiro Bruciante infligge 4 danni a una creatura bersaglio.\\nOgniqualvolta un Drago entra nel campo di battaglia sotto il tuo controllo, puoi pagare {R}. Se lo fai, riprendi in mano il Respiro Bruciante dal tuo cimitero.\', \'type\': \'Istantaneo\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448420&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'3326f9c6-ac95-44e0-bf80-c37213db5f45\', \'multiverseId\': 448420}, \'multiverseid\': 448420}, {\'name\': \'吐炎\', \'text\': \'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。吐炎はそれに４点のダメージを与える。\\nドラゴンが１体あなたのコントロール下で戦場に出るたび、あなたは{R}を支払ってもよい。そうしたなら、あなたの墓地から吐炎をあなたの手札に戻す。\', \'type\': \'インスタント\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448701&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'fd860503-a6b7-4bf2-8aa3-3cb10244898c\', \'multiverseId\': 448701}, \'multiverseid\': 448701}, {\'name\': \'불길 뿜기\', \'text\': \'생물을 목표로 정한다. 불길 뿜기는 그 생물에게 피해 4점을 입힌다.\\n용이 당신의 조종하에 전장에 들어올 때마다, 당신은 {R}를 지불할 수 있다. 그렇게 한다면, 불길 뿜기를 당신의 무덤에서 당신의 손으로 되돌린다.\', \'type\': \'순간마법\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448982&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'439d4c01-466b-497b-a346-f580390f8a47\', \'multiverseId\': 448982}, \'multiverseid\': 448982}, {\'name\': \'Cuspir Chamas\', \'text\': \'Cuspir Chamas causa 4 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.\\nToda vez que um Dragão entra no campo de batalha sob o seu controle, você pode pagar {R}. Se fizer isso, devolva Cuspir Chamas de seu cemitério para sua mão.\', \'type\': \'Mágica Instantânea\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449263&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'7cade325-e9ed-4538-b21f-2296b0b1b095\', \'multiverseId\': 449263}, \'multiverseid\': 449263}, {\'name\': \'Изрыгание Пламени\', \'text\': \'Изрыгание Пламени наносит 4 повреждения целевому существу.\\nКаждый раз, когда Дракон выходит на поле битвы под вашим контролем, вы можете заплатить {R}. Если вы это делаете, верните Изрыгание Пламени из вашего кладбища в вашу руку.\', \'type\': \'Мгновенное заклинание\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449544&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'23c5ca9f-e367-43dd-95e3-ac5ea0d3b1c5\', \'multiverseId\': 449544}, \'multiverseid\': 449544}, {\'name\': \'吐焰\', \'text\': \'吐焰对目标生物造成4点伤害。\\n每当一个龙在你的操控下进战场时，你可以支付{R}。若你如此作，则将吐焰从你的坟墓场移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬间\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449825&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a9ef9621-18d4-43fe-a93d-786f471b8856\', \'multiverseId\': 449825}, \'multiverseid\': 449825}, {\'name\': \'吐焰\', \'text\': \'吐焰對目標生物造成4點傷害。\\n每當一個龍在你的操控下進戰場時，你可以支付{R}。若你如此作，則將吐焰從你的墳墓場移回你手上。\', \'type\': \'瞬間\', \'flavor\': None, \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450106&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2f1ced5b-abc9-455e-9696-49cfc596ddf4\', \'multiverseId\': 450106}, \'multiverseid\': 450106}]', "[{'name': 'Feuriges Finale', 'text': 'Das Feurige Finale fügt einer Kreatur deiner Wahl 7 Schadenspunkte zu.', 'type': 'Hexerei', 'flavor': 'Die Verhandlungen fanden ein abruptes Ende.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447557&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '4ce8c78d-10ea-49db-a0f2-45bf44d30984', 'multiverseId': 447557}, 'multiverseid': 447557}, {'name': 'Remate ardiente', 'text': 'El Remate ardiente hace 7 puntos de daño a la criatura objetivo.', 'type': 'Conjuro', 'flavor': 'Las negociaciones llegaron a una conclusión abrupta.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447838&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'a05c6649-97cb-4084-8982-d876e49ebabf', 'multiverseId': 447838}, 'multiverseid': 447838}, {'name': 'Fin ardente', 'text': 'La Fin ardente inflige 7 blessures à une créature ciblée.', 'type': 'Rituel', 'flavor': 'Les négociations connurent une conclusion abrupte.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448119&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c32ada65-30d3-41e0-9c79-d1df278fb1ca', 'multiverseId': 448119}, 'multiverseid': 448119}, {'name': 'Fine Fiammante', 'text': 'La Fine Fiammante infligge 7 danni a una creatura bersaglio.', 'type': 'Stregoneria', 'flavor': 'Le trattative giunsero a una brusca conclusione.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448400&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca93d743-60ac-4e87-9b06-11266acb1596', 'multiverseId': 448400}, 'multiverseid': 448400}, {'name': '焦熱の決着', 'text': 'クリーチャー１体を対象とする。焦熱の決着はそれに７点のダメージを与える。', 'type': 'ソーサリー', 'flavor': '交渉は唐突に決着した。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448681&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '88f606d3-47e3-451f-b157-02e2b4e663bc', 'multiverseId': 448681}, 'multiverseid': 448681}, {'name': '불타는 마무리', 'text': '생물을 목표로 정한다. 불타는 마무리는 그 생물에게 피해 7점을 입힌다.', 'type': '집중마법', 'flavor': '교섭이 급작스런 결말에 다다랐다.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448962&type=card', 'language': 'Korean', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '9191c0d3-081c-439c-aa39-d45775d55ed3', 'multiverseId': 448962}, 'multiverseid': 448962}, {'name': 'Finalização Flamejante', 'text': 'Finalização Flamejante causa 7 pontos de dano à criatura alvo.', 'type': 'Feitiço', 'flavor': 'As negociações foram concluídas abruptamente.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449243&type=card', 'language': 'Portuguese (Brazil)', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ca2ae8ad-85cc-4d96-ae4a-ed3fd1ffe5ce', 'multiverseId': 449243}, 'multiverseid': 449243}, {'name': 'Пламенное Завершение', 'text': 'Пламенное Завершение наносит 7 повреждений целевому существу.', 'type': 'Волшебство', 'flavor': 'У переговоров получился неожиданный конец.', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449524&type=card', 'language': 'Russian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '41669a0f-fd0e-493b-9de7-f30bcefe667a', 'multiverseId': 449524}, 'multiverseid': 449524}, {'name': '火热终局', 'text': '火热终局对目标生物造成7点伤害。', 'type': '法术', 'flavor': '协商戛然而止。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449805&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Simplified', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'e0aaac6a-036e-42ac-b94c-95eb43a34e15', 'multiverseId': 449805}, 'multiverseid': 449805}, {'name': '火熱終局', 'text': '火熱終局對目標生物造成7點傷害。', 'type': '巫術', 'flavor': '協商戛然而止。', 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450086&type=card', 'language': 'Chinese Traditional', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'ce6fb9b9-fb01-4394-8fc2-6406e731f083', 'multiverseId': 450086}, 'multiverseid': 450086}]", '[{\'name\': \'Friedhofsmarschall\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, schicke eine Kreaturenkarte aus deinem Friedhof ins Exil: Erzeuge einen getappten 2/2 schwarzen Zombie-Kreaturenspielstein.\', \'type\': \'Kreatur — Zombie, Soldat\', \'flavor\': \'„Zeit zum Aufstehen, meine Lieben. Es gibt viel zu tun."\\n—Isareth die Erweckerin\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447516&type=card\', \'language\': \'German\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0a8beb29-d90f-4c68-9a96-9113ac5ed9af\', \'multiverseId\': 447516}, \'multiverseid\': 447516}, {\'name\': \'Mariscal de cementerio\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, exiliar una carta de criatura de tu cementerio: Crea una ficha de criatura Zombie negra 2/2 girada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Soldado zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Álcense prestas, criaturas mías. Tenemos trabajo".\\n—Isareth, la Resucitadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447797&type=card\', \'language\': \'Spanish\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'a5a5b5a0-fb13-418b-a636-bcf002926630\', \'multiverseId\': 447797}, \'multiverseid\': 447797}, {\'name\': \'Maréchal de cimetière\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, exilez une carte de créature depuis votre cimetière : Créez, engagé, un jeton de créature 2/2 noire Zombie.\', \'type\': \'Créature : zombie et soldat\', \'flavor\': "« Debout mes petits. Nous avons du pain sur la planche. »\\n—Isareth l\'éveilleuse", \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448078&type=card\', \'language\': \'French\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'dd5485fd-e356-4de5-a19a-8b0d9037e649\', \'multiverseId\': 448078}, \'multiverseid\': 448078}, {\'name\': \'Maresciallo del Cimitero\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, Esilia una carta creatura dal tuo cimitero: Crea una pedina creatura Zombie 2/2 nera TAPpata.\', \'type\': \'Creatura — Soldato Zombie\', \'flavor\': \'"Forza, in piedi, miei cari. Abbiamo del lavoro da sbrigare."\\n—Isareth, la Risvegliatrice\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448359&type=card\', \'language\': \'Italian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'2942bd0c-c3c3-40c5-a811-4d954b21a3fe\', \'multiverseId\': 448359}, \'multiverseid\': 448359}, {\'name\': \'墓地の司令官\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, あなたの墓地からクリーチャー・カード１枚を追放する：黒の２/２のゾンビ・クリーチャー・トークン１体をタップ状態で生成する。\', \'type\': \'クリーチャー — ゾンビ・兵士\', \'flavor\': \'「立ち上がり輝きなさい、いい子たち。仕事の時間よ。」\\n――呼び覚ます者イザレス\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448640&type=card\', \'language\': \'Japanese\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'0fa272fe-7d28-413a-addd-bf81c33a77c2\', \'multiverseId\': 448640}, \'multiverseid\': 448640}, {\'name\': \'무덤 집행관\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, 당신의 무덤에서 생물 카드 한 장을 추방한다: 탭된 2/2 흑색 좀비 생물 토큰 한 개를 만든다.\', \'type\': \'생물 — 좀비 병사\', \'flavor\': \'"일어나 빛나거라, 내 아이들아. 할 일이 있구나."\\n—일깨우는 자 이자레스\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448921&type=card\', \'language\': \'Korean\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'98ec2b06-2183-4f6e-a663-365742064797\', \'multiverseId\': 448921}, \'multiverseid\': 448921}, {\'name\': \'Marechal do Cemitério\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, exile um card de criatura de seu cemitério: Crie uma ficha de criatura preta 2/2 do tipo Zumbi virada.\', \'type\': \'Criatura — Zumbi Soldado\', \'flavor\': \'"Acordem para a morte, queridos. Temos trabalho a fazer."\\n— Isareth, a Despertadora\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449202&type=card\', \'language\': \'Portuguese (Brazil)\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'63f0cb78-5b2f-4f02-9c82-8a4d2e475f71\', \'multiverseId\': 449202}, \'multiverseid\': 449202}, {\'name\': \'Кладбищенский Маршал\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}, изгоните карту существа из вашего кладбища: создайте одну повернутую фишку существа 2/2 черный Зомби.\', \'type\': \'Существо — Зомби Солдат\', \'flavor\': \'«Проснитесь и пойте, мои дорогие. У нас есть работа».\\n— Изарет Пробудительница\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449483&type=card\', \'language\': \'Russian\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'70236c78-2d1d-4395-a54a-a52dbaa68844\', \'multiverseId\': 449483}, \'multiverseid\': 449483}, {\'name\': \'坟场元帅\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}，从你的坟墓场放逐一张生物牌：派出一个横置的2/2黑色灵俑衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～灵俑／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「起来开工，伙计们。准备做事了。」\\n～唤尸依萨蕾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=449764&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Simplified\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'493d81a6-a749-488a-9f9a-4ea3f9e939e5\', \'multiverseId\': 449764}, \'multiverseid\': 449764}, {\'name\': \'墳場元帥\', \'text\': \'{2}{B}，從你的墳墓場放逐一張生物牌：派出一個橫置的2/2黑色殭屍衍生生物。\', \'type\': \'生物 ～殭屍／士兵\', \'flavor\': \'「起來開工，伙計們。準備做事了。」\\n～喚屍依薩蕾\', \'imageUrl\': \'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=450045&type=card\', \'language\': \'Chinese Traditional\', \'identifiers\': {\'scryfallId\': \'f6ba4d73-e77b-4ac8-9107-43cab0246ddd\', \'multiverseId\': 450045}, \'multiverseid\': 450045}]', "[{'name': 'Gebirge', 'type': 'Standardland — Gebirge', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447691&type=card', 'language': 'German', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'c64b0f7c-c986-4d42-afe4-a742306dfe59', 'multiverseId': 447691}, 'multiverseid': 447691}, {'name': 'Montaña', 'type': 'Tierra básica — Montaña', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=447972&type=card', 'language': 'Spanish', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'bd1c1d83-9b85-4283-97a1-455575994502', 'multiverseId': 447972}, 'multiverseid': 447972}, {'name': 'Montagne', 'type': 'Terrain de base : montagne', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448253&type=card', 'language': 'French', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '1049c558-9fe6-40fc-a8a8-2b82e6e970d4', 'multiverseId': 448253}, 'multiverseid': 448253}, {'name': 'Montagna', 'type': 'Terra Base — Montagna', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448534&type=card', 'language': 'Italian', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': '48045399-f9d9-4923-a87f-f3f31576b733', 'multiverseId': 448534}, 'multiverseid': 448534}, {'name': '山', 'type': '基本土地 — 山', 'flavor': None, 'imageUrl': 'http://gatherer.wizards.com/Handlers/Image.ashx?multiverseid=448815&type=card', 'language': 'Japanese', 'identifiers': {'scryfallId': 'fd46a445-1d6f-4f7a-a51c-c8dc724fbf3d', 'multiverseId': 448815}, 'multiverseid': 44881